window.__CH=window.__CH||{};window.__CH["ar18"]={"id": "ar18", "title": "温度变换与截断采样：分布偏差", "focus": "推导温度变换 p^{1/τ} 的熵与支撑变化，分析 top-k、top-p、典型采样对分布的截断偏差，给出偏差的精确表达式。", "claims": ["p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}}", "\\text{top-}k\\ \\text{截断后 } q(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}}{\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)}", "\\text{top-}p\\ \\text{集合 } S_p=\\text{最小集合使 }\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p"], "topics": ["温度变换：p_τ ∝ p^{1/τ}", "温度对熵与支撑的影响", "top-k 截断的分布", "top-p（nucleus）截断", "典型采样：熵约束下的截断", "截断造成的 KL 偏差", "低温退化的模式崩溃", "高温采样的方差", "重复惩罚的数学", "反例：top-p 在重尾分布下截掉高概率质量", "采样温度与校准", "截断与无偏采样的取舍", "代码：温度与 top-k/top-p 实现", "代码：截断偏差的数值测量", "与束搜索章的接口", "本章推导链：温度是分布的幂变换"], "html": "<h3 id=\"ar18--h-温度变换-p_τ-p-1-τ\">温度变换：p_τ ∝ p^{1/τ}<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-温度变换-p_τ-p-1-τ\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用第 17 章已固定的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 为有限词表，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=V&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal V}p(x)=1$</span>。记支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span>，并设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 Shannon 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>）。本节新引入温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，以及幂变换后的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>。为处理 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限，另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\max_x p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\min_{x\\in\\operatorname{supp}p}p(x)&gt;0$</span>（有限支撑下正质量最小值存在）。</p>\n<p>本节始终假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限，故一切求和均为有限和，无需可积性、控制收敛等测度论条件；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 有定义且为正；(A3) 当讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的极限时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 上唯一，即存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x^\\star)=M$</span>。假设 (A3) 在后续节讨论“低温模式崩溃”时将被放宽并单独处理；本节仅用它给出干净的极限陈述。若 (A3) 失效，极限分布不唯一，这一点在第 7 节展开。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 1（温度变换）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal V}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal V.$$</div>\n<p>称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为温度：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1=p$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span> 为低温（锐化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 为高温（平坦化）。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 称为幂配分函数。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的关系是逐点的幂变换后再归一化，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的某个函数复合；它与“在 logit 上除以温度再 softmax”是同一构造的两种坐标表述：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z)(x)=e^{z(x)}/\\sum_y e^{z(y)}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)(x)$</span>。这一恒等式是本节与工程实现对接的锚点，其验证见例 1。</p>\n<p><strong>与相邻概念的区别。</strong> 温度变换不是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的线性插值（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ (1-\\lambda)p+\\lambda u$</span>），也不是指数族意义上的自然参数平移；它是正函数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 次幂再归一化，属于“幂加权”族。它与后续节的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断有本质区别：温度变换保持支撑不变（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 上时），而截断改变支撑。这一区别是第 2 节“支撑影响”与第 3、4 节“截断分布”的分水岭。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-1-幂变换的支撑不变性与-softmax-恒等式\">命题 1（幂变换的支撑不变性与 softmax 恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-1-幂变换的支撑不变性与-softmax-恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：(i) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p_\\tau=\\operatorname{supp}p$</span>；(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=e^{z(x)}/\\sum_y e^{z(y)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 取有限实值，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span>，分母为有限个正数之和故为正，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0^{1/\\tau}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=0$</span>。两边互相包含，支撑相等。(ii) 直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{\\left(e^{z(x)}/\\sum_y e^{z(y)}\\right)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{w}\\left(e^{z(w)}/\\sum_y e^{z(y)}\\right)^{1/\\tau}}\n=\\frac{e^{z(x)/\\tau}\\left(\\sum_y e^{z(y)}\\right)^{-1/\\tau}}{\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}\\left(\\sum_y e^{z(y)}\\right)^{-1/\\tau}}\n=\\frac{e^{z(x)/\\tau}}{\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}},$$</div>\n<p>其中公共因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left(\\sum_y e^{z(y)}\\right)^{-1/\\tau}$</span> 在分子分母中约去。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1(ii) 说明：温度变换在 logit 坐标下就是“除以温度再 softmax”，这正是工程中 <code>logits / temperature</code> 的数学内容；它同时说明温度变换不改变 argmax 的位置（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 上严格单调），这一点在第 7 节会被用来刻画低温极限。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-2-归一化恒等式与温度的可逆性\">命题 2（归一化恒等式与温度的可逆性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-2-归一化恒等式与温度的可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：(i) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)=1$</span>；(ii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau,\\sigma&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_\\tau)_\\sigma=p_{\\tau\\sigma}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 由定义直接求和，分子之和等于分母，故为 1。(ii) 计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(p_\\tau)_\\sigma(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)^{1/\\sigma}}{\\sum_y p_\\tau(y)^{1/\\sigma}}\n=\\frac{\\left(p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau\\right)^{1/\\sigma}}{\\sum_y\\left(p(y)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau\\right)^{1/\\sigma}}\n=\\frac{p(x)^{1/(\\tau\\sigma)}/Z_\\tau^{1/\\sigma}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau\\sigma)}/Z_\\tau^{1/\\sigma}}\n=\\frac{p(x)^{1/(\\tau\\sigma)}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau\\sigma)}}=p_{\\tau\\sigma}(x),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau^{1/\\sigma}$</span> 在分子分母约去。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2(ii) 是一个可检验的恒等式：温度变换构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\times)$</span> 在分布单纯形上的作用，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 为单位元，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}$</span> 为逆元。它给出一个直接的工程推论：先按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 采样再按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span> 重加权，与一次性按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\sigma$</span> 采样在分布层面等价（但采样实现上不等价，因为中间采样引入了随机性；这一点属于第 12 节“无偏采样取舍”的范围，本节不展开）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-3-低温极限与高温极限\">命题 3（低温极限与高温极限）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-3-低温极限与高温极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立；对 (i) 另设 (A3) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>（按全变差，等价于逐点收敛）；(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=1/V$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的均匀分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 为唯一最大点。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^\\star$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/M&lt;1$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p_\\tau(x^\\star)}=\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{p(x^\\star)}\\right)^{1/\\tau}=\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{M}\\right)^{1/\\tau}\\xrightarrow[\\tau\\to0^+]{}0,$$</div>\n<p>因为底数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;1$</span> 而指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to+\\infty$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to1$</span>，其余分量趋于 0。逐点收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span> 即全变差收敛（有限支撑上逐点收敛与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell^1$</span> 收敛等价）。(ii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\operatorname{supp}p$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p_\\tau(y)}=\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{p(y)}\\right)^{1/\\tau}\\xrightarrow[\\tau\\to\\infty]{}1,$$</div>\n<p>因为正数的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 次幂当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 1。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在支撑上趋于常数；结合归一化，极限为支撑上的均匀分布。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=1/V$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 是本节的核心极限定理，它把“低温锐化、高温平坦”从直觉变成可证明的陈述。注意 (i) 中 (A3) 不可省：若最大值不唯一，比如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/2,0)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to(1/2,1/2,0)$</span> 而非某个点质量，极限依赖子列。这一失效模式在第 7 节作为“低温退化”的入口被系统处理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-例-1-具体数值验证\">例 1（具体数值验证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-例-1-具体数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.6,0.3,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}=p(x)^2=(0.36,0.09,0.01)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{0.5}=0.46$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{0.5}=(0.36/0.46,\\;0.09/0.46,\\;0.01/0.46)\\approx(0.7826,\\;0.1957,\\;0.0217).$$</div>\n<p>验证命题 2(i)：三项之和为 1。验证命题 3(i) 的方向：最大分量从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.6$</span> 升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7826$</span>，最小分量从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0217$</span>，符合锐化。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/2}=(\\sqrt{0.6},\\sqrt{0.3},\\sqrt{0.1})\\approx(0.7746,0.5477,0.3162)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2\\approx1.6385$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2\\approx(0.4728,0.3343,0.1930)$</span>，最大分量下降、最小分量上升，符合平坦化。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma=2$</span> 验证命题 2(ii)：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5\\cdot2}=p_1=p$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_{0.5})_2$</span> 按上式再取平方根归一化，数值上应回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>；直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.7826^{1/2},0.1957^{1/2},0.0217^{1/2})\\approx(0.8846,0.4424,0.1473)$</span>，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx(0.6000,0.3000,0.1000)$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在三位小数内一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-4-温度对熵的单调性\">命题 4（温度对熵的单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-4-温度对熵的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 上处处为正（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p=\\mathcal V$</span>，否则将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 替换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 后结论不变）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto H(p_\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上单调不减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_1)=H(p)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to\\log V$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明思路与关键步骤</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的函数并求导。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau=\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\tau)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)\n=-\\sum_x \\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{Z_\\tau}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-L_\\tau\\right)\n=-\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)+L_\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}p(x)^{1/\\tau}=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\cdot(-\\log p(x)/\\tau^2)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dL_\\tau}{d\\tau}=\\frac{1}{Z_\\tau}\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}\\left(-\\frac{\\log p(y)}{\\tau^2}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_y p_\\tau(y)\\log p(y).$$</div>\n<p>代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH(p_\\tau)}{d\\tau}=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)-\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)+ \\frac{dL_\\tau}{d\\tau}.$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的导数同样为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(\\log p(x))^2$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 的导数计算同构）。合并三项得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH(p_\\tau)}{d\\tau}=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\left(\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(\\log p(x))^2+\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)\\right)\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p)=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(\\log p(x))^2-\\left(\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)\\right)^2\\ge0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减。端点行为由命题 3 与熵的连续性给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to\\log V$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个推导的关键是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{d\\tau}$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的方差，从而非负性一目了然；它同时给出一个可检验的恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH(p_\\tau)}{d\\tau}\\big|_{\\tau=1}=\\operatorname{Var}_p(\\log p)$</span>，即温度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处对熵的边际效应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下对数概率的方差。这一恒等式在第 11 节“温度与校准”中会被用作局部线性化的系数。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-5-温度变换的-KL-表达\">命题 5（温度变换的 KL 表达）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-5-温度变换的-KL-表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]+\\log Z_\\tau\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\frac{1-\\tau}{\\tau}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时为 0。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau-\\log p(x)=\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1\\right)\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 取期望：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=1$</span>，系数为 0，故 KL 为 0。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的用途是：它把温度变换造成的分布偏差写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的一阶矩与配分函数的组合，从而在第 6 节“截断造成的 KL 偏差”中，截断偏差可以与温度偏差在同一坐标系下比较。本节只建立这个表达式，不展开比较。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-6-温度变换的梯度恒等式与配分函数的导数\">命题 6（温度变换的梯度恒等式与配分函数的导数）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-6-温度变换的梯度恒等式与配分函数的导数\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 由有限 logit 向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 给出，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=e^{z(x)}/\\sum_y e^{z(y)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>。则对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z(x)}\\,p_\\tau(y)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\,p_\\tau(y)\\bigl(\\mathbb 1_{y=x}-p_\\tau(x)\\bigr),$$</div>\n<p>且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial \\tau}\\log Z_\\tau=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[z],\n\\qquad\n\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(z).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：先证梯度恒等式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(y)=e^{z(y)/\\tau}/\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z(x)$</span> 求偏导，注意分母含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{z(x)/\\tau}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z(x)}p_\\tau(y)\n=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial z(x)}\\frac{e^{z(y)/\\tau}}{\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}}\n=\\frac{\\frac{1}{\\tau}e^{z(y)/\\tau}\\mathbb 1_{y=x}\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}-e^{z(y)/\\tau}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\tau}e^{z(x)/\\tau}}{\\left(\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}\\right)^2}.$$</div>\n<p>分子分母同除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left(\\sum_w e^{z(w)/\\tau}\\right)^2$</span>，第一项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p_\\tau(y)\\mathbb 1_{y=x}$</span>，第二项化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}p_\\tau(y)p_\\tau(x)$</span>，合并即得。此式即 softmax 的 Jacobian 结构，温度只以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的因子整体缩放。</p>\n<p>再证配分函数导数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y e^{z(y)/\\tau}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}Z_\\tau=\\sum_y e^{z(y)/\\tau}\\left(-\\frac{z(y)}{\\tau^2}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_y e^{z(y)/\\tau}z(y).$$</div>\n<p>两边除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 并用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(y)=e^{z(y)/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\log Z_\\tau=-\\tau^{-2}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[z]$</span>。</p>\n<p>最后证熵的导数。由命题 4 的推导，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH(p_\\tau)}{d\\tau}=\\tau^{-2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p)$</span>。在 logit 坐标下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(y)=z(y)-\\log\\sum_w e^{z(w)}$</span>，常数项在方差中消去，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p)=\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(z)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 把命题 4 的抽象方差表达式落到可计算的 logit 坐标上：温度对熵的边际效应等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>。这给出一个工程上可直接测量的量——在给定 logit 向量与温度时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(z)$</span> 可由一次前向传播后的加权方差算出，无需数值差分。同时它澄清了一个常见混淆：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau H$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 不是同一个量，前者是方差、后者是均值，二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$z$</span> 均值为零时才可能数值巧合，一般情况下不可互相替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-7-温度变换的凸性与-Jensen-型不等式\">命题 7（温度变换的凸性与 Jensen 型不等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-7-温度变换的凸性与-Jensen-型不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，有</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\tau)\\;\\ge\\; H(p)+\\frac{1-\\tau}{\\tau}\\,\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]+\\log Z_\\tau\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)\\ge0$</span> 等价于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\;\\ge\\;\\log Z_\\tau,$$</div>\n<p>且等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\left(\\tau^{-1}-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。KL 散度非负是 Gibbs 不等式的直接推论：对任意两个概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q,r$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|r)=\\sum_x q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{r(x)}\\ge0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 是凸函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x q(x)\\cdot 1=1$</span>，由 Jensen 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x q(x)(-\\log\\frac{r(x)}{q(x)})\\ge-\\log\\sum_x q(x)\\frac{r(x)}{q(x)}=-\\log 1=0$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=p$</span> 即得。等号条件为 Jensen 不等式的等号条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)/q(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>-正支撑上为常数。由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 支撑相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)/q(x)\\equiv c$</span>；又二者均为概率分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=q$</span>。由命题 2(ii) 的作用结构，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀时；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布，则任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 均给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>，此时等号对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，这是 Jensen 等号条件的一个退化情形）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的作用是把命题 5 的 KL 表达式“闭合”为一个不等式链：温度变换相对原分布的偏差非负，且只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀的退化情形）取零。这为第 6 节比较“温度偏差”与“截断偏差”提供了基准——截断偏差的 KL 也非负，但二者的零点结构不同：温度偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处为零而截断偏差在截断集合等于全支撑时为零。两个零点集合的交集是“既不调温也不截断”，这正是无偏采样的定义域。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-例-2-KL-偏差的数值验证与端点行为\">例 2（KL 偏差的数值验证与端点行为）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-例-2-KL-偏差的数值验证与端点行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.6,0.3,0.1)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>，由例 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}\\approx(0.7826,0.1957,0.0217)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{0.5}=0.46$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_{0.5}}[\\log p]$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_{0.5}}[\\log p]\\approx0.7826\\log0.6+0.1957\\log0.3+0.0217\\log0.1\\approx-0.6124.$$</div>\n<p>代入命题 5：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p_{0.5}\\|p)=\\left(\\frac{1}{0.5}-1\\right)(-0.6124)-\\log0.46\\approx1\\cdot(-0.6124)+0.7765\\approx0.1641.$$</div>\n<p>直接按定义计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_{0.5}\\|p)=\\sum_x p_{0.5}(x)\\log\\frac{p_{0.5}(x)}{p(x)}$</span>：三项分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7826\\log(0.7826/0.6)\\approx0.7826\\cdot0.2657\\approx0.2079$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1957\\log(0.1957/0.3)\\approx0.1957\\cdot(-0.4271)\\approx-0.0836$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0217\\log(0.0217/0.1)\\approx0.0217\\cdot(-1.527)\\approx-0.0331$</span>，合计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx0.0912$</span>。两次计算不一致，说明上式代入有算术错误；正确的代入应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=\\left(\\tau^{-1}-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}-1=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]$</span> 应重算。逐项重算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log0.6\\approx-0.5108$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log0.3\\approx-1.2040$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log0.1\\approx-2.3026$</span>，加权得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7826\\cdot(-0.5108)+0.1957\\cdot(-1.2040)+0.0217\\cdot(-2.3026)\\approx-0.3998-0.2356-0.0500\\approx-0.6854$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\approx1\\cdot(-0.6854)+0.7765\\approx0.0911$</span>，与直接计算一致（末位差异来自舍入）。这验证了命题 5 的表达式在数值上的自洽性。</p>\n<p>端点行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\to\\log M=\\log0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau\\to M^{1/\\tau}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\tau\\to\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log M$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\to\\left(\\tau^{-1}-1\\right)\\log M-\\tau^{-1}\\log M=-\\log M$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\delta_{x^\\star}\\|p)=-\\log p(x^\\star)$</span>，与定义一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_u[\\log p]=\\frac{1}{V}\\sum_x\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}\\to-\\frac{1}{V}\\sum_x\\log p(x)=\\log V-H(p)$</span>，即均匀分布相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL，亦与定义一致。两个端点都给出有限值，说明命题 5 的表达式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的两个极限处连续延拓。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-8-温度变换下的期望重加权恒等式\">命题 8（温度变换下的期望重加权恒等式）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-8-温度变换下的期望重加权恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为任意实值函数（有限支撑故有界）。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=\\frac{\\mathbb E_{p}\\!\\left[f\\,p^{1/\\tau-1}\\right]}{\\mathbb E_{p}\\!\\left[p^{1/\\tau-1}\\right]}.$$</div>\n<p>特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]=\\dfrac{\\mathbb E_p[\\log p\\cdot p^{1/\\tau-1}]}{\\mathbb E_p[p^{1/\\tau-1}]}$</span>，这是命题 5 中一阶矩的可计算形式。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=\\sum_x f(x)\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{Z_\\tau}=\\frac{1}{Z_\\tau}\\sum_x f(x)p(x)\\,p(x)^{1/\\tau-1}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_x p(x)^{1/\\tau}=\\sum_x p(x)\\,p(x)^{1/\\tau-1}=\\mathbb E_p[p^{1/\\tau-1}]$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span>）。代入即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 是一个重要性采样型的恒等式：温度变换下的期望等于原分布下以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1/\\tau-1}$</span> 为权重的加权期望。它的用途在于，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 已知但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 不易显式计算时（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 很大），可以用原分布下的样本估计分子与分母，从而估计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]$</span>。这为第 13、14 节的数值实现提供了理论依据：温度采样的偏差测量可以在原分布样本上做重加权，而不必真的从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 采样。同时它揭示了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span> 时权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1/\\tau-1}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 大的位置更大，故低温期望被高概率区域主导；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 小的位置相对更大，故高温期望被低概率区域拉平。这一权重结构是第 2 节“温度对支撑的影响”之外、温度对矩的影响的精确刻画。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-9-温度变换与对数似然的单调关系\">命题 9（温度变换与对数似然的单调关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-9-温度变换与对数似然的单调关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star=\\arg\\max_x p(x)$</span> 唯一。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max_x p_\\tau(x)=x^\\star$</span>；且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^\\star$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)/p_\\tau(x^\\star)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 严格单调递增（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&lt;p(x^\\star)$</span> 时），即低温使次优项相对最优项更小、高温使其更大。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：argmax 不变由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 上严格单调给出。比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho(\\tau)=\\left(p(x)/p(x^\\star)\\right)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，底数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c=p(x)/p(x^\\star)\\in(0,1)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\log\\rho=\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\left(\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log c\\right)=-\\frac{\\log c}{\\tau^2}&gt;0$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log c&lt;0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho$</span> 严格递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho$</span> 严格递增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 给出一个精确的单调性陈述：温度不改变排序（argmax 不变），但改变排序的“间距”。低温放大间距，高温压缩间距。这与命题 3 的极限行为一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时间距趋于无穷（次优项相对趋于 0），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时间距趋于 1（所有项相对相等）。该命题在第 7 节“低温模式崩溃”中会被用作出发点：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 足够小，次优项的相对质量低于任何给定阈值，采样在数值上退化为确定性 argmax。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-10-温度变换的坐标无关表述\">命题 10（温度变换的坐标无关表述）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-10-温度变换的坐标无关表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上处处为正。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi:\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 为严格单调的坐标变换（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t)=\\log t$</span>），则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 坐标下温度变换的作用为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(p_\\tau(x))=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\phi(p(x))-\\phi(Z_\\tau)$</span>。特别地，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\log$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，即对数概率在温度变换下是仿射的：斜率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>、截距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\log$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。对一般严格单调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi$</span> 与幂运算可交换（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi(t^a)=a\\phi(t)$</span> 对某类 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 成立），则同样得到仿射关系；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\phi=\\log$</span> 是满足此性质的标准选择。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 澄清了温度变换的几何意义：在对数概率坐标（即 logit 坐标减去常数）中，温度变换是一个仿射映射，斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>。这解释了为什么工程实现中“logits 除以温度”是精确的：logit 坐标就是对数概率坐标（差一个与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关的常数），除以温度正是仿射变换的斜率部分，softmax 的归一化则补上截距。该命题同时说明温度变换与“在概率单纯形上做线性插值”有本质区别：后者在概率坐标下是仿射的，在对数坐标下不是；前者在对数坐标下是仿射的，在概率坐标下是幂函数。这一坐标依赖性提醒我们，讨论“温度是否线性”必须先声明坐标。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span> 是正函数的幂变换再归一化，在 logit 坐标下等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{softmax}(z/\\tau)$</span>；它保持支撑不变（命题 1），构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathbb R_{&gt;0},\\times)$</span> 在单纯形上的作用（命题 2），并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时收敛到唯一最大点的点质量、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到均匀分布（命题 3，低温极限需最大点唯一）。</li>\n<li>温度对熵的边际效应有精确恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH(p_\\tau)}{d\\tau}=\\tau^{-2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p)\\ge0$</span>，故熵随温度单调不减，端点分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log V$</span>（命题 4）；温度变换相对原分布的 KL 偏差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\left(\\tau^{-1}-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>（命题 5）。</li>\n<li>本节只处理“幂变换 + 归一化”这一保持支撑的操作；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、典型采样等改变支撑的截断操作留待第 3、4、5 节，其偏差的 KL 表达在第 6 节与本节命题 5 对接。低温极限的唯一性假设 (A3) 在第 7 节被放宽为模式崩溃的分析对象。</li>\n<li>温度变换在 logit 坐标下是仿射映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau=\\tau^{-1}\\log p-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>（命题 10），其 Jacobian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^{-1}p_\\tau(y)(\\mathbb 1_{y=x}-p_\\tau(x))$</span>（命题 6），配分函数导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau\\log Z_\\tau=-\\tau^{-2}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[z]$</span> 与熵导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau H=\\tau^{-2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(z)$</span> 分别对应均值与方差，二者不可互相替代。</li>\n<li>温度变换相对原分布的 KL 偏差由命题 5 精确给出，且由 Gibbs 不等式非负，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀的退化情形）成立（命题 7）；该偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 两端分别连续延拓为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(x^\\star)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log V-H(p)$</span>（例 2）。</li>\n<li>温度变换下的期望可用原分布重加权表示，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=\\mathbb E_p[f\\,p^{1/\\tau-1}]/\\mathbb E_p[p^{1/\\tau-1}]$</span>（命题 8），这为第 13、14 节的数值偏差测量提供了不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 显式计算的可运行方案；温度不改变 argmax 但严格单调地改变次优项相对最优项的比值（命题 9），该单调性是第 7 节低温模式崩溃分析的起点。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-温度对熵与支撑的影响\">温度对熵与支撑的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-温度对熵与支撑的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：设词汇表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=N&lt;\\infty$</span>；基准分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立（此为正性假设，保证下文对数与幂运算逐点有定义）；温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。温度变换定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal V}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},\\qquad x\\in\\mathcal V.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_{y}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为配分函数。本节另引入两个符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}(p)=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}$</span> 为分布的支撑（在有限集上即正概率点集）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\cdot)$</span> 为 Shannon 熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=-\\sum_{x}q(x)\\log q(x)$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>。本节所有求和均为有限和，故无交换极限与积分的问题；所有命题的假设仅为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N&lt;\\infty$</span>，这些在本章情境下由词汇表有限与基准分布正性直接满足。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在某些点取零，则下文的支撑结论需按第 10 节的反例边界重新表述，本节不展开。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是精确刻画映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 对两个泛函——熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 与支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}(p_\\tau)$</span>——的影响，并给出可检验的恒等式。与相邻概念的区别须先澄清：温度变换是分布的<strong>幂变换后归一化</strong>，它不是加性平滑（如与均匀分布混合），也不是指数族中的自然参数重加权；后两者会改变支撑或引入非平凡的可逆性结构，而幂变换在正性假设下保持支撑不变（命题 2.1），这一区别是后续截断节讨论偏差的基点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-一-支撑的不变性\">一、支撑的不变性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-一-支撑的不变性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.1（支撑保持）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}(p_\\tau)=\\operatorname{supp}(p)=\\mathcal V$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span>（正数的任意实幂为正），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span> 为有限个正数之和。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau&gt;0$</span>。反之若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=0$</span>。两边互相包含，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}(p_\\tau)=\\{x:p(x)&gt;0\\}=\\operatorname{supp}(p)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.1 说明：在正性假设下，温度变换<strong>不改变支撑</strong>，只重新分配质量。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断形成鲜明对照——后者通过指示函数强制将某些点的质量置零，从而真正缩小支撑（见后续节）。因此“温度影响支撑”这一标题下的精确结论是：温度本身不缩小支撑，它只改变质量在支撑上的分布；真正改变支撑的是截断算子。这一区分是本节后续所有偏差分析的逻辑起点。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-二-熵的单调性与极限\">二、熵的单调性与极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-二-熵的单调性与极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2.2（熵随温度单调）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto H(p_\\tau)$</span>。则：</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>（均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u(x)=1/N$</span>），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to\\log N$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 argmax 上的均匀分布（若 argmax 唯一则为点质量），且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to\\log|\\arg\\max_y p(y)|$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\to 1$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>）。有限和下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau\\to N$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to 1/N$</span>。熵为有限集上的连续函数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to H(u)=\\log N$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\max_y p(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{y:p(y)=m\\}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}=m^{1/\\tau}$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&lt;m$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}/m^{1/\\tau}=(p(x)/m)^{1/\\tau}\\to 0$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=m^{1/\\tau}(|A|+o(1))$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to 1/|A|$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。熵极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|A|$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 单调性由幂变换的熵的已知恒等式给出。直接计算：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1/\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_a(x)=p(x)^a/Z_a$</span>。考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{da}H(p_a)$</span>。由 Leibniz 法则（有限和，逐项可导）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{da}H(p_a)=-\\sum_x \\frac{d}{da}\\big[p_a(x)\\log p_a(x)\\big].$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot q=\\frac{dq}{da}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{da}[q\\log q]=\\dot q(\\log q+1)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{da}=-\\sum_x \\dot q(x)(\\log q(x)+1).$$</div>\n<p>由归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x q(x)=1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x \\dot q(x)=0$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{da}=-\\sum_x \\dot q(x)\\log q(x).$$</div>\n<p>现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x)=a\\log p(x)-\\log Z_a$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dot q(x)=q(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]=\\sum_y q(y)\\log p(y)$</span>。代入：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{da}=-\\sum_x q(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]\\big)\\big(a\\log p(x)-\\log Z_a\\big).$$</div>\n<p>展开并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x q(x)(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p])=0$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{da}=-a\\sum_x q(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]\\big)\\log p(x).$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x q(x)(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p])\\log p(x)=\\operatorname{Var}_q(\\log p)\\ge 0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{da}=-a\\operatorname{Var}_q(\\log p)\\le 0$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1/\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{d\\tau}=\\frac{dH}{da}\\cdot(-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2})\\ge 0$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.2 的 (iii) 给出了一个可检验的恒等式：熵对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的导数等于负的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的方差乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>。这一恒等式在数值节可直接用于验证实现正确性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-三-具体例子-二点分布\">三、具体例子：二点分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-三-具体例子-二点分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=1-\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)=\\epsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\epsilon&lt;1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)=\\frac{\\epsilon^{1/\\tau}}{\\epsilon^{1/\\tau}+(1-\\epsilon)^{1/\\tau}}=\\sigma\\big(\\tfrac{1}{\\tau}\\log\\tfrac{\\epsilon}{1-\\epsilon}\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=1/(1+e^{-z})$</span> 为 logistic 函数。熵为二元熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau(1))$</span>。由命题 2.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)\\to 1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to\\log 2$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)\\to 0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;1/2$</span>，argmax 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to 0$</span>。中间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处熵单调上升。此例可直接代入数值验证恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{da}=-\\operatorname{Var}_{p_a}(\\log p)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 取值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-\\epsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\epsilon$</span>，方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_a(1)(1-p_a(1))(\\log\\frac{\\epsilon}{1-\\epsilon})^2$</span>，与直接对二元熵求导的结果一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-四-温度与支撑的联合刻画-有效支撑\">四、温度与支撑的联合刻画：有效支撑<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-四-温度与支撑的联合刻画-有效支撑\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>虽然命题 2.1 说明支撑不变，但工程语境中“支撑”常指<strong>有效支撑</strong>——质量集中到的点集。定义有效支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)=\\{x:p_\\tau(x)\\ge\\delta\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\ge\\delta$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\ge\\delta Z_\\tau$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)\\ge \\tau(\\log\\delta+\\log Z_\\tau)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)=\\{x:\\log p(x)\\ge \\tau(\\log\\delta+\\log Z_\\tau)\\}.$$</div>\n<p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span>，阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(\\log\\delta+\\log Z_\\tau)\\to 0^-$</span>（需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 有界，在有限集上成立），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)$</span> 收缩到 argmax 集；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，阈值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)$</span> 扩张到全支撑。这一表达式将温度对“有效支撑”的影响量化为对数概率的阈值，且阈值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 线性缩放（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span> 修正）。它与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的硬截断（阈值由排序决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关）在机制上不同：温度是<strong>软阈值</strong>，截断是<strong>硬阈值</strong>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-五-熵与支撑的联合推论\">五、熵与支撑的联合推论<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-五-熵与支撑的联合推论\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>推论 2.3（熵上界与有效支撑大小的关系）</strong> 假设命题 2.2 的条件成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_\\tau(\\delta)=|\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)|$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_\\tau)\\le \\log M_\\tau(\\delta)+M_\\tau(\\delta)\\cdot\\delta\\log\\tfrac{1}{\\delta}+(N-M_\\tau(\\delta))\\cdot\\max_{x\\notin\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\tfrac{1}{p_\\tau(x)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明思路</strong> 将熵拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)$</span> 内与外的两部分。对内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\ge\\delta$</span>，用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal S}q(x)\\log q(x)\\le \\log|\\mathcal S|$</span>（均匀分布最大化熵）；对外，逐项用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)\\log\\frac{1}{q(x)}\\le q(x)\\log\\frac{1}{\\delta'}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta'=\\max_{x\\notin\\mathcal S}p_\\tau(x)&lt;\\delta$</span>。合并即得。此推论给出熵与有效支撑大小的定量联系：有效支撑越小，熵上界越紧，这正是低温下模式崩溃的熵侧刻画（详见第 7 节）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在正性假设下，温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 保持支撑不变（命题 2.1），只重新分配质量；真正缩小支撑的是截断算子，二者机制不同。</li>\n<li>熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减，端点极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log N$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|\\arg\\max p|$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span>）；导数恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{dH}{da}=-\\operatorname{Var}_{p_a}(\\log p)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1/\\tau$</span>）给出可数值检验的精确关系（命题 2.2）。</li>\n<li>有效支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal S_\\tau(\\delta)=\\{x:\\log p(x)\\ge\\tau(\\log\\delta+\\log Z_\\tau)\\}$</span> 将温度对质量集中的影响量化为对数概率的线性阈值，推论 2.3 给出熵与有效支撑大小的联合上界，为后续截断偏差与模式崩溃节提供定量接口。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-六-温度变换的梯度结构-对数概率的仿射重参数化\">六、温度变换的梯度结构：对数概率的仿射重参数化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-六-温度变换的梯度结构-对数概率的仿射重参数化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前五小节刻画了熵与有效支撑的静态性质。本节补足一个在后续截断偏差与校准节中反复使用的结构事实：温度变换在对数概率坐标下是<strong>仿射映射</strong>。这一事实把温度对分布的影响与截断算子的影响放在同一坐标系中比较，是后续 KL 偏差精确表达式的代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.4（对数坐标下的仿射性）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\tau(x)=\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\ell(x)-\\log Z_\\tau,\\qquad \\log Z_\\tau=\\log\\sum_{y}e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}.$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的仿射函数，斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>，截距为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。配分函数的对数形式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}=\\sum_y e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}$</span> 直接给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.4 的意义在于：温度变换不改变对数概率的<strong>序关系</strong>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau&gt;0$</span> 是正斜率），只改变其<strong>间距</strong>。具体地，任意两点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y$</span> 的对数概率差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\ell_\\tau(x)-\\ell_\\tau(y)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\big(\\ell(x)-\\ell(y)\\big).$$</div>\n<p>这一恒等式是本节最重要的可检验推论之一：温度对对数概率差的缩放是<strong>精确的线性缩放</strong>，缩放因子恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>。它直接解释了为何低温放大排序差距、高温压缩排序差距，也为后续节中“温度是分布的幂变换”这一推导链的收束句提供代数依据。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.5（对数概率差的缩放恒等式）</strong> 在命题 2.4 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\ell_\\tau(x)-\\ell_\\tau(y)}{\\ell(x)-\\ell(y)}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\quad(\\ell(x)\\neq\\ell(y)).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)&gt;\\ell(y)$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 仍有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\tau(x)&gt;\\ell_\\tau(y)$</span>，即温度变换保序。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 2.4 两式相减，截距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 抵消，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_\\tau(x)-\\ell_\\tau(y)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}(\\ell(x)-\\ell(y))$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)\\neq\\ell(y)$</span> 时可除，得比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>。保序性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau&gt;0$</span> 直接推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2.5 的保序性说明：温度变换<strong>不改变词汇表上的概率排序</strong>。这一点与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断形成对照——top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 保留排序前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个点，因而在温度变换后其保留集合不变（因排序不变），但保留集合内的<strong>相对质量</strong>随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变。这一观察是第 3 节 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断分布与本节接口的关键：温度与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 在对数坐标下作用于不同的自由度——温度缩放间距，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断坐标。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-七-温度对-Renyi-熵与碰撞概率的影响\">七、温度对 Renyi 熵与碰撞概率的影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-七-温度对-Renyi-熵与碰撞概率的影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>Shannon 熵刻画了平均不确定性，但在截断偏差分析中还需要刻画质量的集中程度。本节引入碰撞概率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C(p)=\\sum_x p(x)^2$</span> 与二阶 Renyi 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2(p)=-\\log C(p)$</span>，并给出它们在温度变换下的精确行为。这两个量在后续 KL 偏差节中作为偏差的度量出现。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.6（碰撞概率在温度下的单调性）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)^2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}C_\\tau=\\frac{1}{N},\\qquad \\lim_{\\tau\\to 0^+}C_\\tau=\\frac{1}{|\\arg\\max p|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1/\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a(x)=p(x)^a/Z_a$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{da}C(q_a)$</span>。由 Leibniz 法则（有限和）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{da}C(q_a)=2\\sum_x q_a(x)\\dot q_a(x),\\qquad \\dot q_a(x)=q_a(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_{q_a}[\\log p]\\big).$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{da}C(q_a)=2\\sum_x q_a(x)^2\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_{q_a}[\\log p]\\big).$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=q_a(x)^2/C(q_a)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w$</span> 为概率权重，上式等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2C(q_a)\\cdot\\mathbb E_w[\\log p-\\mathbb E_{q_a}[\\log p]]$</span>。此期望的符号不由单调性直接决定，需另证。改用直接比较：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a'&gt;a$</span>，由 Hölder 不等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q_{a'}\\|_2\\le\\|q_a\\|_2$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{a'}$</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a$</span> 更“平坦”。事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a\\propto p^a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 越大越接近均匀分布（由命题 2.2 的极限行为），而均匀分布使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_2$</span> 范数最小。严格论证：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)=p(x)/\\max_y p(y)\\in(0,1]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a(x)=r(x)^a/\\sum_y r(y)^a$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a'&gt;a$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)^{a'}=r(x)^a\\cdot r(x)^{a'-a}$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)\\le 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r^{a'-a}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 单调（<span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 越大衰减越少），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{a'}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a$</span> 经单调变换后再归一化，由 Majorization 理论，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{a'}$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a$</span> majorize，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|q_{a'}\\|_2\\le\\|q_a\\|_2$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 单调不增，即关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减？需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=1/\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 减小对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 增大？）。逐项复核：<span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 增大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 减小）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a$</span> 更集中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 增大。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span> 单调不减，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增。极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a\\to u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\to 1/N$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_a\\to$</span> argmax 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C\\to 1/|\\arg\\max p|$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.6 给出温度对质量集中度的精确端点刻画。它与命题 2.2 的熵端点平行：低温使碰撞概率趋向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/|\\arg\\max p|$</span>（最大集中），高温使其趋向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span>（最小集中）。二阶 Renyi 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_2=-\\log C_\\tau$</span> 因此关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减，且端点与 Shannon 熵一致到常数因子。这一平行性在后续节中用于比较不同温度下的截断偏差量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-八-温度变换与-KL-散度的恒等式\">八、温度变换与 KL 散度的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-八-温度变换与-KL-散度的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后补足一个在截断偏差节直接使用的恒等式：温度变换相对于基准分布的 KL 散度可以写成配分函数与对数概率期望的显式表达式。这一恒等式是后续节中“截断造成的 KL 偏差”的基准项。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.7（KL 散度的温度表示）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau=\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1\\Big)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>等价地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}H(p_\\tau,p)-\\frac{1}{\\tau}H(p_\\tau)-\\log Z_\\tau,$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)=-\\sum_x q(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 为交叉熵。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}=\\Big(\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1\\Big)\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 取期望即得第一式。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q,p)=-\\mathbb E_q[\\log p]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=-\\mathbb E_q[\\log q]$</span> 直接改写。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.7 的关键在于：KL 散度被分解为<strong>交叉熵项</strong>与<strong>配分函数项</strong>，且系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau}-1$</span> 显式依赖温度。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>，第一项系数为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=-\\log Z_1=-\\log 1=0$</span>，与定义一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=\\sum_y p(y)=1$</span>）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(u\\|p)\\to -H(u)-\\mathbb E_u[\\log p]=\\log N-\\mathbb E_u[\\log p]$</span>，与均匀分布对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 散度一致。这一恒等式在后续截断偏差节中作为“无截断基准”出现：截断分布的 KL 偏差将写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 的组合，而后者由命题 2.7 精确给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-九-温度变换的复合律\">九、温度变换的复合律<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-九-温度变换的复合律\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>作为本节推导链的收束，给出温度变换的复合律：两次温度变换等价于一次温度变换，温度参数相乘。这一事实说明温度变换构成一个以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为参数的<strong>单参数半群</strong>，是“温度是分布的幂变换”这一推导链的代数核心。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 2.8（复合律）</strong> 假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 变换所得，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1,\\tau_2}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}$</span> 再经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 变换所得。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\tau_1,\\tau_2}=p_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\tau_1,\\tau_2}(x)=\\frac{p_{\\tau_1}(x)^{1/\\tau_2}}{\\sum_y p_{\\tau_1}(y)^{1/\\tau_2}}=\\frac{\\big(p(x)^{1/\\tau_1}/Z_{\\tau_1}\\big)^{1/\\tau_2}}{\\sum_y\\big(p(y)^{1/\\tau_1}/Z_{\\tau_1}\\big)^{1/\\tau_2}}.$$</div>\n<p>分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}Z_{\\tau_1}^{-1/\\tau_2}$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\tau_1}^{-1/\\tau_2}\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}$</span>，公因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{\\tau_1}^{-1/\\tau_2}$</span> 抵消，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\tau_1,\\tau_2}(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}}=p_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}(x).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2.8 的代数含义是：映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}\\circ p_{\\tau_2}=p_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}$</span>，即以乘法为群运算的半群同态。它在对数坐标下对应命题 2.4 的斜率相乘：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau_1\\tau_2}\\ell(x)-\\log Z_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}$</span>，与先除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 一致。复合律在工程上对应“先按温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1$</span> 采样再对结果按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_2$</span> 重加权”与“直接按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1\\tau_2$</span> 采样”的等价性，是后续代码节验证实现正确性的断言之一。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2.9（温度变换的逆）</strong> 在命题 2.8 的假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 经温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 变换回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,1/\\tau}=p_1=p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由复合律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,1/\\tau}=p_{\\tau\\cdot(1/\\tau)}=p_1$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_1(x)=p(x)^{1}/\\sum_y p(y)=p(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 2.9 说明温度变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 上构成群作用，单位元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>，逆元为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span>。这一群结构是“温度是分布的幂变换”的精确代数表述：幂变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在归一化后构成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}$</span> 上的单参数群，其无穷小生成元由命题 2.2(iii) 的导数恒等式给出。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-十-本节推导链的中间收束\">十、本节推导链的中间收束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-十-本节推导链的中间收束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节完成了温度变换在熵、支撑、碰撞概率、KL 散度与群结构五个方面的精确刻画。将这些结果串联，得到本节向后续节输出的三条接口：</p>\n<p>其一，<strong>支撑接口</strong>：命题 2.1 与有效支撑表达式说明温度不改变硬支撑、只改变软阈值，故后续截断节的偏差必须归因于指示函数而非温度本身；截断偏差的精确表达式将以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)$</span> 的形式出现，其中温度只进入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>，截断只进入指示函数。</p>\n<p>其二，<strong>熵接口</strong>：命题 2.2 的单调性与端点极限、命题 2.6 的碰撞概率端点，共同给出低温模式崩溃的熵侧与集中度侧刻画；后续第 7 节将把这一刻画与 argmax 集的稳定性联系起来。</p>\n<p>其三，<strong>KL 接口</strong>：命题 2.7 的恒等式给出无截断基准的 KL 散度精确表达式，后续第 6 节将把截断分布的 KL 偏差写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\tau)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\tau)$</span> 与命题 2.7 的组合，从而把“截断造成的偏差”分解为“温度造成的偏差”与“截断造成的额外偏差”两部分。</p>\n<p>这三条接口共同构成本节对本章推导链的贡献：温度是分布的幂变换，幂变换在对数坐标下是仿射缩放（命题 2.4），在熵与集中度上是单调重分配（命题 2.2、2.6），在 KL 散度上是可分解的基准项（命题 2.7），在参数复合上是乘法半群（命题 2.8）。后续各节将在此基准上叠加截断算子，并精确计算叠加后的偏差。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-top-k-截断的分布\">top-k 截断的分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-top-k-截断的分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前两节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的概率分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换后的分布（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>）。本节只处理 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断，不涉及 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与典型采样。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 3.1（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断算子）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的概率分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的值按降序排列为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}\\ge p_{(2)}\\ge\\cdots\\ge p_{(n)}$</span>，并取定一个确定性排序规则（例如以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的固定全序打破平局），使每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 对应唯一的名次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>。定义截断集合\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_k=\\{x\\in\\mathcal V: r(x)\\le k\\},$$</div>\n以及截断分布\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_k(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\,\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}}{\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)}.$$</div>\n记截断所保留的质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k=p\\,\\mathbb 1_{S_k}/Z_k$</span>。</p>\n<p>与温度变换的区别在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 是<strong>全局幂变换</strong>，支撑不变（只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 全支撑且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\infty$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 是<strong>支撑投影</strong>，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 外的质量置零并重新归一。二者可复合，但本节只讨论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 本身及其与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的关系，复合留到第 6 节 KL 偏差处处理。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限离散）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 良定义，且所有求和为有限和，无需交换极限。本节所有命题均在 A1 下陈述；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有零元，则排序与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的定义需先约定零元排在末尾，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 仍为正（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum p=1$</span>），结论不变，但下文熵的严格不等式需排除退化情形，故统一取 A1。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（无平局）</strong> 排序严格：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}&gt;p_{(2)}&gt;\\cdots&gt;p_{(n)}$</span>。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 唯一确定，避免平局规则影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span>。若存在平局，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 依赖打破规则，本节命题中涉及“唯一性”的部分需改为“对给定规则成立”，其余不等式结论不变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-定义与基本恒等式\">定义与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-定义与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3.2（截断分布的支撑与质量）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q_k)=S_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|=k$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)\\ge p(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=0&lt;p(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S_k$</span> 成立；</p>\n<p>(iii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\ge k\\,p_{(k)}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\le 1$</span>，等号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)&gt;0\\iff x\\in S_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，A1 保证后者恒真，故支撑即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>；由 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|=k$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span>，由 (iii) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\le 1$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)\\ge p(x)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S_k$</span>，分子为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=0&lt;p(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p>(iii) 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p_{(k)}$</span>（降序排列的直接推论），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)\\ge k\\,p_{(k)}$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\le\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal V}p(y)=1$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k=\\mathcal V$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.2(ii) 是截断偏差的根源：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内概率被<strong>放大</strong>因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 外被<strong>置零</strong>。这不是无偏操作，第 6 节将把这一偏差写成 KL 的精确表达式。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.3（截断前后的一阶矩恒等式）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，对任意实值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[f]=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)f(x),\\qquad \\mathbb E_{q_k}[f]-\\mathbb E_p[f]=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)f(x)-\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal V}p(x)f(x).$$</div>\n特别地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb 1_{S_k}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[\\mathbb 1_{S_k}]=1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\mathbb 1_{S_k}]=Z_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 定义直接得到；第二式相减即得。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb 1_{S_k}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 是全集故期望为 1，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下期望为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：截断把“<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内总质量”从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 强行提升到 1，差额 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_k$</span> 正是被丢弃的质量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-主定理-top--k-截断的熵恒等式\">主定理：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的熵恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-主定理-top--k-截断的熵恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu)=-\\sum_x\\mu(x)\\log\\mu(x)$</span> 为 Shannon 熵（自然对数）。本节的核心结论是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span> 精确分解为“<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的条件熵”与“截断放大带来的修正项”。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 3.4（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 熵分解）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=-\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}=H_{S_k}(p)+\\log Z_k,$$</div>\n其中\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{S_k}(p)=-\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)\\log p(x)$$</div>\n是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的<strong>未归一化部分熵</strong>（注意它不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上条件分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid S_k)$</span> 的熵）。等价地，若记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{S_k}(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的条件化，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=H(p_{S_k}),\\qquad H(p_{S_k})=H_{S_k}(p)+\\log Z_k.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=-\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}=-\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)\\big(\\log p(x)-\\log Z_k\\big).$$</div>\n将求和拆开：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=-\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)\\log p(x)+\\frac{\\log Z_k}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x).$$</div>\n第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)=Z_k$</span>，故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_k$</span>；第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)/Z_k$</span>。因此\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k}+\\log Z_k.$$</div>\n另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{S_k}(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span>，其熵为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(p_{S_k})=-\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}=\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k}+\\log Z_k,$$</div>\n与上式一致。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 3.4 的关键在于<strong>不要把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span> 误认为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)+\\log Z_k$</span> 而漏掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span> 因子</strong>：正确的分解是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)=H_{S_k}(p)/Z_k+\\log Z_k$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)+\\log Z_k$</span> 对应的是“把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的部分熵直接加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_k$</span>”这一错误写法。下面的推论给出可检验的恒等式，用于区分两种写法。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.5（熵差的精确表达式）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)-H(p)=\\Big(\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k}-H_{S_k}(p)\\Big)+\\log Z_k+\\Big(-H_{S_k^c}(p)\\Big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k^c}(p)=-\\sum_{x\\notin S_k}p(x)\\log p(x)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H_{S_k}(p)+H_{S_k^c}(p)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与补集不交且并为全集，熵按分块可加）。整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)-H(p)=H_{S_k}(p)\\Big(\\frac{1}{Z_k}-1\\Big)+\\log Z_k-H_{S_k^c}(p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=H_{S_k}(p)+H_{S_k^c}(p)$</span> 与定理 3.4 直接相减。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3.5 的三项各有含义：第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(\\tfrac{1}{Z_k}-1\\big)H_{S_k}(p)\\ge 0$</span> 是<strong>放大项</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\le 1$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k-1\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)\\ge 0$</span>）；第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_k\\le 0$</span> 是<strong>归一化项</strong>；第三项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-H_{S_k^c}(p)\\le 0$</span> 是<strong>丢弃项</strong>。净效应符号不固定，取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的形状——这正是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断“既可能增熵也可能减熵”的精确来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-具体例子-几何分布上的-top--k\">具体例子：几何分布上的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-具体例子-几何分布上的-top--k\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{1,2,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=(1-\\rho)\\rho^{x-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 充分大使得尾部质量可忽略（严格说 A1 要求有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho^{n}$</span> 足够小即可，下面公式对任意有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 精确成立）。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 严格降序，A2 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k=\\{1,\\dots,k\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>例 3.6</strong> 计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span>，并数值验证推论 3.5。</p>\n<p>由几何级数，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_k=(1-\\rho)\\sum_{x=1}^{k}\\rho^{x-1}=1-\\rho^{k}.$$</div>\n部分熵：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{S_k}(p)=-\\sum_{x=1}^{k}(1-\\rho)\\rho^{x-1}\\big(\\log(1-\\rho)+(x-1)\\log\\rho\\big).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=\\log(1-\\rho)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b=\\log\\rho&lt;0$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{S_k}(p)=-(1-\\rho)\\Big(a\\sum_{x=1}^{k}\\rho^{x-1}+b\\sum_{x=1}^{k}(x-1)\\rho^{x-1}\\Big).$$</div>\n第一和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\rho^k)/(1-\\rho)$</span>。第二和：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x=1}^{k}(x-1)\\rho^{x-1}=\\frac{d}{d\\rho}\\sum_{x=1}^{k}\\rho^{x-1}=\\frac{d}{d\\rho}\\frac{1-\\rho^k}{1-\\rho}$</span>，计算得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x=1}^{k}(x-1)\\rho^{x-1}=\\frac{1-\\rho^k}{(1-\\rho)^2}-\\frac{k\\rho^{k-1}}{1-\\rho}.$$</div>\n代入：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_{S_k}(p)=-\\Big(a(1-\\rho^k)+b\\Big(\\frac{1-\\rho^k}{1-\\rho}-k\\rho^{k-1}\\Big)\\Big).$$</div>\n由定理 3.4，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{1-\\rho^k}+\\log(1-\\rho^k).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\to 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)\\to H(p)$</span>，与直觉一致（截断趋于全集时无偏差）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=1-\\rho$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_1}(p)=-(1-\\rho)\\log(1-\\rho)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_1)=\\frac{-(1-\\rho)\\log(1-\\rho)}{1-\\rho}+\\log(1-\\rho)=-\\log(1-\\rho)+\\log(1-\\rho)=0,$$</div>\n即单点分布的熵为零，符合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 是退化分布的事实。这一端点检验同时验证了定理 3.4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span> 因子的必要性：若误写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)+\\log Z_k$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-\\rho)\\log(1-\\rho)+\\log(1-\\rho)\\ne 0$</span>，与退化分布熵为零矛盾。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断偏差的精确形式-预备\">截断偏差的精确形式（预备）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断偏差的精确形式-预备\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 6 节将系统推导 KL 偏差，此处只给出与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 直接相关的精确表达式，作为本节定理的应用，不重复第 6 节的完整推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.7（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 KL 偏差）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 绝对连续（A1 下自动成立，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 全支撑），则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\frac{p(x)}{Z_k}\\log\\frac{1}{Z_k}=\\log\\frac{1}{Z_k}=-\\log Z_k.$$</div>\n等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_k)=+\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^c$</span> 上为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为正），故 KL 的方向至关重要。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)/p(x)=1/Z_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q_k/p)=-\\log Z_k$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=-\\log Z_k\\sum_{x\\in S_k}q_k(x)=-\\log Z_k$</span>。反向 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k^c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_k)=+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.7 表明：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断对<strong>前向 KL</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)$</span> 的偏差只依赖保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内部形状无关；但反向 KL 发散。这一不对称性在第 6 节与第 12 节（无偏采样取舍）中会被反复使用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-代码验证\">代码验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-代码验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在有限离散分布上实现 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断，验证命题 3.2、定理 3.4、推论 3.5 与命题 3.7，并打印形状与预期结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef topk_truncate(p, k):\n    assert p.ndim == 1 and np.all(p &gt; 0)\n    n = p.shape[0]\n    assert 1 &lt;= k &lt;= n\n    order = np.argsort(-p, kind=&quot;stable&quot;)   # 降序，稳定排序打破平局\n    S_k = order[:k]\n    Z_k = p[S_k].sum()\n    q = np.zeros_like(p)\n    q[S_k] = p[S_k] / Z_k\n    return q, S_k, Z_k\n\ndef entropy(mu):\n    mu = mu[mu &gt; 0]\n    return -np.sum(mu * np.log(mu))\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nn = 12\np = rng.random(n); p /= p.sum()\nassert np.isclose(p.sum(), 1.0)\n\nfor k in [1, 3, 6, 12]:\n    q, S_k, Z_k = topk_truncate(p, k)\n    assert q.shape == (n,)\n    assert np.isclose(q.sum(), 1.0)\n    assert np.all(q[S_k] &gt;= p[S_k])          # 命题 3.2(ii)\n    assert np.all(q[np.setdiff1d(np.arange(n), S_k)] == 0.0)\n    H_q = entropy(q)\n    H_Sk = -np.sum(p[S_k] * np.log(p[S_k]))\n    lhs = H_q\n    rhs = H_Sk / Z_k + np.log(Z_k)           # 定理 3.4\n    assert np.isclose(lhs, rhs)\n    # 推论 3.5\n    H_p = entropy(p)\n    H_Skc = -np.sum(p[np.setdiff1d(np.arange(n), S_k)] *\n                    np.log(p[np.setdiff1d(np.arange(n), S_k)]))\n    delta = H_Sk * (1.0 / Z_k - 1.0) + np.log(Z_k) - H_Skc\n    assert np.isclose(H_q - H_p, delta)\n    # 命题 3.7\n    kl = np.sum(q[S_k] * np.log(q[S_k] / p[S_k]))\n    assert np.isclose(kl, -np.log(Z_k))\n    print(f&quot;k={k:2d}  |S_k|={len(S_k):2d}  Z_k={Z_k:.6f}  &quot;\n          f&quot;H(q_k)={H_q:.6f}  KL(q_k||p)={kl:.6f}  -log Z_k={-np.log(Z_k):.6f}&quot;)\n\n# 几何分布端点检验：k=1 时 H(q_1)=0\nrho = 0.6\np_geo = np.array([(1 - rho) * rho ** (x - 1) for x in range(1, 21)])\np_geo /= p_geo.sum()\nq1, _, Z1 = topk_truncate(p_geo, 1)\nassert np.isclose(entropy(q1), 0.0)\nassert np.isclose(Z1, p_geo.max())\nprint(&quot;几何分布 k=1: H(q_1) =&quot;, entropy(q1), &quot; Z_1 =&quot;, Z1)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出（数值随随机种子固定）：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 打印的 <code>KL(q_k||p)</code> 与 <code>-log Z_k</code> 相等，<code>H(q_k)</code> 与 <code>H_Sk/Z_k + log Z_k</code> 相等；几何分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=p_{\\max}$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过即验证了命题 3.2、定理 3.4、推论 3.5、命题 3.7 在有限离散情形下的正确性。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k=p\\,\\mathbb 1_{S_k}/Z_k$</span> 是支撑投影加重新归一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内概率被放大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span> 倍、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 外置零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{S_k}p$</span> 是唯一控制前向 KL 偏差的量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=-\\log Z_k$</span>，而反向 KL 发散。</li>\n<li>熵的精确分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)=H_{S_k}(p)/Z_k+\\log Z_k$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_{S_k}(p)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的未归一化部分熵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span> 因子不可省略，端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时该式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_1)=0$</span>，可作为公式自洽性的检验。</li>\n<li>熵差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)-H(p)$</span> 由放大项、归一化项与丢弃项三部分精确构成，符号不固定；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断既非保熵也非单调降熵，其净效应取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的尾部形状，这一分解是后续 KL 偏差节与模式崩溃节的出发点。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断质量的界与-k-的选取\">截断质量的界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的选取<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断质量的界与-k-的选取\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3.2(iii) 只给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 的粗略下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\,p_{(k)}$</span>。在实际中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的关系决定了截断偏差的量级，因此需要更精细的界。下面的命题把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 夹在“前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个质量”与“均匀分布假设下的质量”之间，并给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增长的单调性与凹性。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.8（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 的单调性与凹性）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{Z_k\\}_{k=1}^{n}$</span> 满足：</p>\n<p>(i) 严格递增：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1&lt;Z_2&lt;\\cdots&lt;Z_n=1$</span>，且增量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k-Z_{k-1}=p_{(k)}$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=0$</span>）；</p>\n<p>(ii) 凹性：增量序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_{(k)}\\}$</span> 严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的离散凹函数，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}-Z_k&lt;p_{(k)}$</span> 不成立的方向为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}-Z_k=p_{(k+1)}&lt;p_{(k)}=Z_k-Z_{k-1}$</span>；</p>\n<p>(iii) 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le j&lt;k\\le n$</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{Z_k}{k}\\le\\dfrac{Z_j}{j}\\cdot\\dfrac{j}{k}+\\dfrac{k-j}{k}$</span>，特别地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{Z_k}{k}\\le\\dfrac{Z_1}{1}=p_{(1)}$</span> 不成立时，正确的界是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{Z_k}{k}\\ge p_{(k)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\dfrac{Z_k}{k}\\le p_{(1)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{i=1}^{k}p_{(i)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k-Z_{k-1}=p_{(k)}&gt;0$</span>（A2），故严格递增；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_n=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}p_{(i)}=1$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 由 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span> 严格递减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}-Z_k=p_{(k+1)}&lt;p_{(k)}=Z_k-Z_{k-1}$</span>，这正是离散凹性的定义（二阶差分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}-2Z_k+Z_{k-1}=p_{(k+1)}-p_{(k)}&lt;0$</span>）。</p>\n<p>(iii) 由 (i)(ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k/k$</span> 是前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(i)}$</span> 的算术平均，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(i)}$</span> 递减，故平均值介于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span> 之间：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}\\le Z_k/k\\le p_{(1)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.8 的直接后果是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 的增长在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 较小时最快（头部质量集中），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 较大时趋缓（尾部质量稀薄）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的函数是<strong>递减且凸</strong>的（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 是凸函数复合凹函数不保凸，但此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 凹且递增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 的离散二阶差分需单独验证）：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3.9（KL 偏差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的单调性）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\mapsto D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=-\\log Z_k$</span> 严格递减，且离散二阶差分\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$-\\log Z_{k+1}+2\\log Z_k-\\log Z_{k-1}=\\log\\frac{Z_k^2}{Z_{k+1}Z_{k-1}}&gt;0,$$</div>\n故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的离散凸函数。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 严格递减由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 严格递增与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 严格递减复合得到。二阶差分：由命题 3.8(ii)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}Z_{k-1}&lt;Z_k^2$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 是对数凹的正序列当且仅当其离散二阶差分满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k+1}Z_{k-1}\\le Z_k^2$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 凹且正，凹性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\ge\\frac{Z_{k-1}+Z_{k+1}}{2}$</span>，由 AM-GM 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{Z_{k-1}+Z_{k+1}}{2}\\ge\\sqrt{Z_{k-1}Z_{k+1}}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^2\\ge Z_{k-1}Z_{k+1}$</span>，等号仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{k-1}=Z_{k+1}$</span> 时成立，而严格凹性排除此情形）。因此比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;1$</span>，对数为正。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3.9 说明：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 时 KL 偏差的<strong>边际改善递减</strong>——从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 增到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 消除的偏差远大于从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=100$</span> 增到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=101$</span>。这为“top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不宜取过大”提供了定量依据：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 已接近 1 时，继续增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的改善按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k+1)}/Z_k$</span> 量级衰减。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-与温度变换的复合-q_k-作用于-p_-tau\">与温度变换的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span><a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-与温度变换的复合-q_k-作用于-p_-tau\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>实际采样中 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 常与温度变换复合：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>，再在其上取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的降序为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,(1)}\\ge\\cdots\\ge p_{\\tau,(n)}$</span>，对应截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^\\tau$</span>、保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau=\\sum_{S_k^\\tau}p_\\tau$</span>、截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k^\\tau=p_\\tau\\mathbb 1_{S_k^\\tau}/Z_k^\\tau$</span>。关键问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^\\tau$</span> 是否等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>？下面的命题给出肯定答案，这是幂变换保序的直接推论。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.10（温度不改变 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的集合）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序名次相同，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_\\tau(x)=r(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^\\tau=S_k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/C_\\tau$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格递增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;p(y)\\iff p(x)^{1/\\tau}&gt;p(y)^{1/\\tau}\\iff p_\\tau(x)&gt;p_\\tau(y)$</span>。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的成对比较关系完全一致，降序排列相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^\\tau=S_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.10 的意义在于：<strong>温度只改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内部的相对权重与保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau$</span>，不改变哪些元素被保留</strong>。因此复合截断的偏差可分解为两步：温度造成的全局幂变换偏差（第 1、2 节已处理）与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 造成的支撑投影偏差（本节处理）。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>，其关系由下式给出。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.11（复合截断的保留质量）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal V}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_k^\\tau=\\frac{\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{C_\\tau}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau\\to 1$</span>（对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 1$</span>），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau\\to k/n$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^\\tau=S_k$</span> 直接得到。极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 由最大者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}^{1/\\tau}$</span> 支配，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_\\tau\\sim p_{(1)}^{1/\\tau}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span>，故分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sim p_{(1)}^{1/\\tau}$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\to 1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>），故分子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to k$</span>、分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to n$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to k/n$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.11 揭示了一个重要现象：<strong>低温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span>）下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断几乎不丢弃质量</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^\\tau\\to 1$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k^\\tau\\|p_\\tau)\\to 0$</span>；而<strong>高温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>）下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 趋于均匀，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断丢弃的质量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-k/n$</span></strong>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(k/n)=\\log(n/k)$</span> 达到最大。这与直觉相反——高温本应“更随机”，但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 在高温下反而造成最大的 KL 偏差，因为均匀分布下截断掉的是整整 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n-k)/n$</span> 的质量。这一现象在第 8 节（高温采样的方差）与第 10 节（反例）中会被进一步利用。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断分布的矩与支撑上的条件期望\">截断分布的矩与支撑上的条件期望<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断分布的矩与支撑上的条件期望\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3.2 与推论 3.3 给出一阶矩。下面给出二阶矩的精确表达式，它在第 8 节方差分析中直接使用。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.12（截断分布的二阶矩）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，对任意实值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[f^2]=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)f(x)^2,\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_{q_k}(f)=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)f(x)^2-\\Big(\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)f(x)\\Big)^2.$$</div>\n特别地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=-\\log p(x)$</span>（自信息），得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[-\\log p]=\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k},\\qquad \\mathrm{Var}_{q_k}(-\\log p)=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)(\\log p(x))^2-\\Big(\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k}\\Big)^2.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span> 直接求和得到；方差用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}=\\mathbb E[f^2]-\\mathbb E[f]^2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=-\\log p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[f]=\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{S_k}p(x)(-\\log p(x))=H_{S_k}(p)/Z_k$</span>，与定理 3.4 中第一项一致；二阶矩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{Z_k}\\sum_{S_k}p(x)(\\log p(x))^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[-\\log p]=H_{S_k}(p)/Z_k$</span> 恰好是定理 3.4 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span> 的第一项，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span> 本身是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的熵，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_k}[-\\log q_k]$</span>。二者之差正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_k$</span>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q_k)=\\mathbb E_{q_k}[-\\log q_k]=\\mathbb E_{q_k}[-\\log p]+\\mathbb E_{q_k}[\\log(p/q_k)]=\\frac{H_{S_k}(p)}{Z_k}+\\log Z_k,$$</div>\n因为对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p(x)/q_k(x))=\\log Z_k$</span> 是常数。这给出了定理 3.4 的<strong>另一条证明路径</strong>，且揭示了熵分解的统计含义：截断分布的熵 = 截断分布下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的平均自信息 + 截断造成的常数对数修正。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断的复合与幂等性\">截断的复合与幂等性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断的复合与幂等性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个结构性质：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断算子在“再截断”下是幂等的，即对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 再做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 截断（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le k$</span>）等价于对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 直接做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 截断。这一性质保证多次截断不会引入额外偏差，是第 12 节讨论采样流程正确性的基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.13（截断的幂等性）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le j\\le k$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 截断（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上排序）等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 截断，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{q_k\\,\\mathbb 1_{S_j^{(k)}}}{\\sum_{S_j^{(k)}}q_k}=\\frac{p\\,\\mathbb 1_{S_j}}{\\sum_{S_j}p}=q_j,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j^{(k)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 集合。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)/Z_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的排序与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的排序一致（同乘正常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_k$</span> 不改变比较）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j^{(k)}$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 名，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在全集上的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 名（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le k$</span>）也落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j^{(k)}=S_j$</span>。再算归一化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S_j}q_k=\\sum_{S_j}p/Z_k=Z_j/Z_k$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{q_k(x)}{Z_j/Z_k}=\\frac{p(x)/Z_k}{Z_j/Z_k}=\\frac{p(x)}{Z_j}=q_j(x)$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_j$</span> 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j$</span> 外两者均为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.13 说明 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断构成一个<strong>投影族</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j$</span> 上的条件化，也是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j$</span> 上的条件化。因此多次截断不累积偏差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_j\\|q_k)=-\\log(Z_j/Z_k)=\\log Z_k-\\log Z_j$</span>，恰好等于两步 KL 偏差之差，与命题 3.7 的可加性一致：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_j\\|p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_j\\|q_k)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p),$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_j=(\\log Z_k-\\log Z_j)+(-\\log Z_k)$</span>，恒等式成立。这为第 6 节 KL 偏差的链式分解提供了 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 情形下的具体验证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断与条件化的关系-q_k-不是-p-的条件化\">截断与条件化的关系：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的条件化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断与条件化的关系-q_k-不是-p-的条件化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 3.13 表明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_j$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j$</span> 上的条件化，但这容易引起一个误解：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 是否就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的条件化？答案是肯定的——由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)/Z_k=p(x\\mid S_k)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>。因此 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断<strong>就是</strong>对事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 取条件分布。这一点必须在符号层面写清楚，因为它决定了后续 KL 偏差的解读方式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.14（截断即条件化）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_k=\\sigma(S_k)$</span> 为由事件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma$</span>-代数（在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\emptyset,S_k,S_k^c,\\mathcal V\\}$</span>）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_k$</span> 下、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为条件事件的条件分布：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_k(x)=p(x\\mid S_k)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}}{p(S_k)},\\qquad p(S_k)=Z_k.$$</div>\n并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上的<strong>最小 KL 投影</strong>：在所有支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 唯一最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|p)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式即定义。最小 KL 投影：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\mu(x)\\log\\frac{\\mu(x)}{p(x)}=\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\mu(x)\\log\\frac{\\mu(x)}{q_k(x)}+\\sum_{x\\in S_k}\\mu(x)\\log\\frac{q_k(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|q_k)\\ge 0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=q_k$</span>。第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)/p(x)=1/Z_k$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span> 为常数，故第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\log(1/Z_k)\\sum_{S_k}\\mu(x)=\\log(1/Z_k)=-\\log Z_k$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 无关。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|q_k)-\\log Z_k\\ge -\\log Z_k$</span>，等号唯一在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=q_k$</span> 处取得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.14 的第二部分把命题 3.7 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=-\\log Z_k$</span> 提升为一个<strong>变分刻画</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 不是某个特定分布的偏差，而是“支撑限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内”这一约束下的<strong>最小可达 KL 偏差</strong>。任何支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的采样分布，其相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 恰好达到该下界。这解释了为什么 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断在给定支撑约束下是“最优”的——它没有在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内部引入任何额外偏差。</p>\n<p>这一变分刻画还给出一个可检验的推论：若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 再做任意扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\mu\\|q_k)-\\log Z_k$</span>，即扰动带来的额外偏差恰好是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的 KL。这为第 6 节讨论“截断后再温度变换”的复合偏差提供了分解基础：复合偏差 = 截断的最小偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> + 温度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内引入的相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 的偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-平局情形-A2-失效时的集合依赖\">平局情形：A2 失效时的集合依赖<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-平局情形-A2-失效时的集合依赖\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>A2（无平局）在本节所有命题中用于保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 唯一。若去掉 A2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 依赖打破规则，命题 3.2(i) 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|=k$</span> 仍成立（按规则取前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 名），但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的具体元素不唯一，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)$</span> 都随规则变化。下面量化这一依赖。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.15（平局下的偏差范围）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上，允许平局，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 大的值（按降序，平局时取同一值）。则对任意打破规则得到的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>：</p>\n<p>(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 的取值范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[Z_k^{\\min},Z_k^{\\max}]$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{\\min}$</span> 是取“尽可能少的平局元素”时的质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{\\max}$</span> 是取“尽可能多的平局元素”时的质量，二者之差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\,p_{(k)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 名处的平局重数；</p>\n<p>(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=-\\log Z_k$</span> 的取值范围为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[-\\log Z_k^{\\max},-\\log Z_k^{\\min}]$</span>，宽度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(Z_k^{\\max}/Z_k^{\\min})\\le \\log\\big(1+\\frac{m\\,p_{(k)}}{Z_k^{\\min}}\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> (i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 必含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;p_{(k)}$</span> 的元素，必不含所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;p_{(k)}$</span> 的元素，仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=p_{(k)}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个元素中选择若干以凑足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个。设已有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_0&lt;k$</span> 个严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span> 的元素，则需从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 个平局元素中选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-k_0$</span> 个。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 是这些选中元素质量之和，最小与最大分别对应选质量最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-k_0$</span> 个与最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-k_0$</span> 个平局元素，二者之差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(k-k_0)p_{(k)}\\le m\\,p_{(k)}$</span>。(ii) 由命题 3.7 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 的单调性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 越大则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 越小，故范围如所述；宽度用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(Z^{\\max}/Z^{\\min})=\\log(1+(Z^{\\max}-Z^{\\min})/Z^{\\min})\\le\\log(1+m\\,p_{(k)}/Z^{\\min})$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.15 说明：平局只影响 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 的<strong>边界元素选择</strong>，不影响严格大于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span> 的部分。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\,p_{(k)}\\ll Z_k^{\\min}$</span> 时，偏差对打破规则不敏感；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在头部有大量平局（如均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=n$</span>）时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 可在一个宽区间内变化，此时 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的偏差强烈依赖实现细节。这为第 10 节的反例提供了平局情形的边界，也提示工程实现中必须固定打破规则以保证可复现性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断集合的稳定性-k-扰动下的-S_k-变化\">截断集合的稳定性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 扰动下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 变化<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断集合的稳定性-k-扰动下的-S_k-变化\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>实际实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 是超参数，其微小扰动是否改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 决定了截断偏差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的敏感性。下面的命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增减一格时的变化量，它是命题 3.8 的集合版本。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3.16（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的嵌套与单元素增量）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，集合序列满足严格嵌套\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_1\\subset S_2\\subset\\cdots\\subset S_n=\\mathcal V,\\qquad S_k\\setminus S_{k-1}=\\{x_{(k)}\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{(k)}$</span> 是名次为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的元素。因此对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j&lt;k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_j\\subset S_k$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k\\setminus S_j|=k-j$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k=\\{x:r(x)\\le k\\}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 是双射到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 恰含名次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的元素。<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{k-1}$</span> 含名次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span>，故差集为名次 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的单元素集。嵌套由名次集合的包含关系直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3.16 与命题 3.8(i) 合起来给出一个精确的<strong>边际偏差</strong>公式：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k-1$</span> 增到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}$</span>，KL 偏差减少\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{k-1}\\|p)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=\\log\\frac{Z_k}{Z_{k-1}}=\\log\\Big(1+\\frac{p_{(k)}}{Z_{k-1}}\\Big).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}\\ll Z_{k-1}$</span> 时，该边际改善约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}/Z_{k-1}$</span>，即第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 名的相对质量。这给出一个<strong>停止准则</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(k)}/Z_{k-1}&lt;\\varepsilon$</span> 时，继续增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 对 KL 偏差的改善低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\varepsilon)\\approx\\varepsilon$</span>，可停止扩张 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>。该准则在第 12 节（无偏采样取舍）中作为“截断到何处为止”的定量依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-代码-平局与嵌套性的数值验证\">代码：平局与嵌套性的数值验证<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-代码-平局与嵌套性的数值验证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码验证命题 3.14 的最小 KL 投影刻画、命题 3.15 的平局偏差范围、命题 3.16 的嵌套性与边际偏差公式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef entropy(mu):\n    mu = mu[mu &gt; 0]\n    return -np.sum(mu * np.log(mu))\n\ndef kl(mu, p):\n    mask = mu &gt; 0\n    return np.sum(mu[mask] * np.log(mu[mask] / p[mask]))\n\n# 命题 3.14：q_k 是支撑含于 S_k 的最小 KL 投影\nrng = np.random.default_rng(1)\nn = 10\np = rng.random(n); p /= p.sum()\nk = 4\norder = np.argsort(-p, kind=&quot;stable&quot;)\nS_k = order[:k]\nZ_k = p[S_k].sum()\nq_k = np.zeros_like(p); q_k[S_k] = p[S_k] / Z_k\nassert np.isclose(kl(q_k, p), -np.log(Z_k))\n# 任意支撑含于 S_k 的 mu，KL(mu||p) &gt;= -log Z_k\nfor _ in range(50):\n    mu = np.zeros_like(p)\n    w = rng.random(k); w /= w.sum()\n    mu[S_k] = w\n    assert kl(mu, p) &gt;= -np.log(Z_k) - 1e-12\nprint(&quot;命题 3.14 通过: KL(q_k||p) =&quot;, kl(q_k, p), &quot; -log Z_k =&quot;, -np.log(Z_k))\n\n# 命题 3.15：平局下 Z_k 的范围\np_tie = np.array([0.3, 0.2, 0.2, 0.2, 0.1])\np_tie /= p_tie.sum()\nk = 3   # 第3名处有3个平局(0.2)，已含1个严格大于者(0.3)，需从3个平局中选2个\nstrict = p_tie &gt; 0.2\nk0 = strict.sum()\nm = (p_tie == 0.2).sum()\ntie_vals = np.sort(p_tie[p_tie == 0.2])\nZ_min = p_tie[strict].sum() + tie_vals[:k - k0].sum()\nZ_max = p_tie[strict].sum() + tie_vals[-(k - k0):].sum()\nassert Z_max - Z_min &lt;= m * 0.2 + 1e-12\nprint(f&quot;命题 3.15 通过: Z_min={Z_min:.4f}, Z_max={Z_max:.4f}, &quot;\n      f&quot;宽度上界={np.log(Z_max/Z_min):.4f}&quot;)\n\n# 命题 3.16：嵌套与边际偏差\np2 = rng.random(n); p2 /= p2.sum()\norder2 = np.argsort(-p2, kind=&quot;stable&quot;)\nS_prev = set(order2[:k-1].tolist())\nS_cur = set(order2[:k].tolist())\nassert S_prev.issubset(S_cur) and len(S_cur - S_prev) == 1\nZ_prev = p2[order2[:k-1]].sum()\nZ_cur = p2[order2[:k]].sum()\nmarginal = np.log(Z_cur / Z_prev)\nassert np.isclose(marginal, np.log1p(p2[order2[k-1]] / Z_prev))\nprint(&quot;命题 3.16 通过: 边际 KL 改善 =&quot;, marginal)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：命题 3.14 打印的 <code>KL(q_k||p)</code> 与 <code>-log Z_k</code> 相等，且 50 次随机 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu$</span> 的 KL 均不低于该下界；命题 3.15 打印的 <code>Z_max - Z_min</code> 不超过 <code>m*0.2</code>，宽度上界与公式一致；命题 3.16 打印的边际改善等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+p_{(k)}/Z_{k-1})$</span>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过即验证了三条命题在有限离散情形下的正确性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-top-p-nucleus-截断\">top-p（nucleus）截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-top-p-nucleus-截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑或可数支撑上的概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换后的分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}k$</span> 截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的定义如章首 canonical claims 所列。本节新引入如下符号，并在此一次性定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 为可数集合（词表），<span class=\"math-inline\">$p:X\\to[0,1]$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in X}p(x)=1$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的<strong>降序重排</strong>为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_{(1)},p_{(2)},\\dots)$</span>，即存在双射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma:\\mathbb N\\to X$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\sigma(1))\\ge p(\\sigma(2))\\ge\\cdots$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 有限时序列截断至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|X|$</span> 项。重排后的前缀和记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m=\\sum_{j=1}^m p_{(j)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_0=0$</span>。</li>\n<li>给定阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span>，<strong>nucleus 集合</strong>定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_p=\\text{最小集合使}\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p,$$</div>\n其精确含义为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=\\{\\sigma(1),\\dots,\\sigma(m_p)\\}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=\\min\\{m\\in\\mathbb N: P_m\\ge p\\}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=|X|$</span>（有限情形）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=\\infty$</span>（可数情形，此时约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=X$</span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>top-p 截断分布</strong>记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span>，定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_p(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_p}}{\\sum_{y\\in S_p}p(y)}=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_p}}{P_{m_p}},\\qquad x\\in X.$$</div>\n注意分母是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：截断后重新归一化到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上的总质量，这一点与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 定义在结构上同型，区别仅在集合的选取规则。</li>\n<li>记<strong>被截断质量</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_{m_p}\\in[0,1)$</span>，它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 相对于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 所丢弃的总概率质量。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 的最小性，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p\\ge 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p-1}&lt;p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_{m_p}\\le 1-p$</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}=p$</span> 时取等；一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p&lt;1-p+p_{(m_p)}$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的正则性假设统一列为：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1)</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对一切使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 进入重排前若干项的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 良定义）；允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2)</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 可数无限时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span> 绝对收敛，故重排 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_{(j)})$</span> 良定义且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\uparrow 1$</span>；由此对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3)</strong> 本节涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的扰动时（仅在推论 4.3 中），设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,p'$</span> 为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span> 上的两个概率质量函数，且二者诱导的降序重排满足：存在公共的有限前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p,S_{p'}\\subseteq\\{\\sigma(1),\\dots,\\sigma(M)\\}$</span>，且该前缀上无并列（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}&gt;p_{(j+1)}$</span>）。此假设排除阈值处的并列导致的集合不唯一，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的函数在局部常值。</p>\n<p>本节不使用任何关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的新假设；凡涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 之处，均只引用前序节已证的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 良定义性与支撑单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-1-nucleus-集合的构造与基本恒等式\">4.1 nucleus 集合的构造与基本恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-1-nucleus-集合的构造与基本恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 4.1（nucleus 集合的刻画与最小性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 存在唯一，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$S_p=\\{\\sigma(1),\\dots,\\sigma(m_p)\\},\\qquad P_{m_p-1}&lt;p\\le P_{m_p}\\ (\\text{当 }m_p\\ge 2),$$</div>\n<p>并且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的<strong>基数最小</strong>的集合；若另有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 满足同条件且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S'|=|S_p|$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'=S_p$</span>（在无并列时）。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：(A1)(A2)。<em>证明</em>：由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\uparrow 1&gt;p$</span>，故集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{m:P_m\\ge p\\}$</span> 非空，取最小元得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 存在唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 的最小性直接给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p-1}&lt;p$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p\\ge2$</span>），否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p-1$</span> 也满足条件，矛盾。下证基数最小性：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S'}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S'|=n$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_{(j)})$</span> 降序，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 元子集的质量和不超过前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 项之和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n$</span>（这是重排不等式的最简形式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S'}p(x)\\le\\sum_{j=1}^n p_{(j)}$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个元素在降序排列中的位置指标之集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(S')$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j\\in\\tau(S')}p_{(j)}\\le P_n$</span>，逐项比较即得）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n&lt;m_p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_n\\le P_{m_p-1}&lt;p$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 的条件矛盾。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S'|\\ge m_p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 基数最小。唯一性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S'|=m_p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S'}p\\ge p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S'}p\\le P_{m_p}$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'\\ne S_p$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau(S')$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,m_p\\}$</span> 不同，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S'}p&lt;P_{m_p}$</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le m_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&gt;m_p$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}&gt;p_{(k)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\tau(S')$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\notin\\tau(S')$</span>——在无并列时严格小于，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S'}p&lt;P_{m_p}$</span>，可能仍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 也基数最小但不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>。故唯一性需无并列假设；在 (A3) 的无并列前缀下成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4.1（与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的区别）</strong> top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 由基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 直接指定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的数值无关；nucleus 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 由累积质量阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 指定，其基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与整个分布形状的函数。二者仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=k$</span> 时集合相同。这一区别是本节全部偏差分析的根源：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的偏差只依赖被截掉的尾部质量，而 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差还依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的敏感性（见 4.3）。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.1（截断质量的精确表达式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_p=1-P_{m_p}=\\sum_{j&gt;m_p}p_{(j)},\\qquad q_p(\\sigma(j))=\\frac{p_{(j)}}{P_{m_p}}\\ (1\\le j\\le m_p),\\quad q_p(\\sigma(j))=0\\ (j&gt;m_p).$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)=\\sum_{j\\le m_p}p_{(j)}\\log\\frac{p_{(j)}}{p_{(j)}/P_{m_p}}+\\sum_{j&gt;m_p}p_{(j)}\\log\\frac{p_{(j)}}{0}$</span> 在第二项上发散（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 的 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外有正质量时恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；有限偏差须改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的方向或截断前分布的相对熵，留待第 6 节处理。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}=\\sum_{j\\le m_p}p_{(j)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_{(j)}=1$</span> 相减。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S_p}p(y)=P_{m_p}$</span> 直接得到。KL 断言由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)=\\sum_x p(x)\\log(p(x)/q(x))$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p|_{S_p^c}=0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{S_p^c}=\\delta_p&gt;0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p&gt;0$</span>）逐项看出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.1（具体数值验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.15,0.05)$</span>，降序即此顺序，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.5,P_2=0.8,P_3=0.95,P_4=1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{0.9}=3$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2=0.8&lt;0.9\\le P_3=0.95$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.9}=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3=0.95$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{0.9}=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.9}=(0.5/0.95,0.3/0.95,0.15/0.95,0)\\approx(0.5263,0.3158,0.1579,0)$</span>。验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum q_{0.9}=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.9}(d)=0$</span>。若改取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.8$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{0.8}=2$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.5&lt;0.8\\le P_2=0.8$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.8}=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{0.8}=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.8}=(0.625,0.375,0,0)$</span>。此例显示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span>，截断质量从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 是阶梯函数，跳跃点正是各 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-2-主定理-m_p-的阶梯结构与截断偏差的分解\">4.2 主定理：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 的阶梯结构与截断偏差的分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-2-主定理-m_p-的阶梯结构与截断偏差的分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 4.2（nucleus 截断的阶梯表示）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto m_p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上的右连续、单调不增的阶梯函数，其跳跃点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}_{m\\ge1}$</span>，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(P_{m-1},P_m]$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=m$</span>。于是对固定分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的函数在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(P_{m-1},P_m]$</span> 上恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{P_m}$</span>，即</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_p=q_{P_m}\\quad\\text{当 } p\\in(P_{m-1},P_m],$$</div>\n<p>从而截断偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_m$</span> 在同一区间上为常数。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：(A1)(A2)。<em>证明</em>：由命题 4.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p=m$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;p\\le P_m$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_0=0$</span>）。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 非降，区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(P_{m-1},P_m]$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 增大而右移，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 增大而不增；在每个区间内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 取常值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，在端点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{P_m}=m$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\ge P_m$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;P_m$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\downarrow P_m$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p\\to m$</span>，故右连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，在区间内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p\\equiv m$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p\\equiv q_{P_m}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p\\equiv 1-P_m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.2（截断偏差的分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=m_p$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q_p)=\\delta_p=\\sum_{j&gt;m}p_{(j)},\\qquad \\mathbb E_{q_p}[\\log p]-\\mathbb E_{p}[\\log p]=\\sum_{j\\le m}\\Big(\\frac{p_{(j)}}{P_m}-p_{(j)}\\Big)\\log p_{(j)}-\\sum_{j&gt;m}p_{(j)}\\log p_{(j)}.$$</div>\n<p>第一式是全变差距离的精确值；第二式是截断造成的对数似然期望偏移，右端两项分别对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内概率的<strong>放大</strong>（因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/P_m$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外概率的<strong>归零</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：全变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q)=\\frac12\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}-q_p(\\sigma(j))=p_{(j)}(1-1/P_m)=p_{(j)}(P_m-1)/P_m\\le0$</span>，其绝对值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}(1-P_m)/P_m$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|p-q|=p_{(j)}$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$2\\,\\mathrm{TV}=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}\\frac{1-P_m}{P_m}+\\sum_{j&gt;m}p_{(j)}=P_m\\cdot\\frac{1-P_m}{P_m}+(1-P_m)=2(1-P_m),$$</div>\n<p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}=\\delta_p$</span>。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_p}[\\log p]=\\sum_{j\\le m}\\frac{p_{(j)}}{P_m}\\log p_{(j)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]=\\sum_j p_{(j)}\\log p_{(j)}$</span> 相减，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外为零故不贡献。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}=\\delta_p$</span> 的意义）</strong> 该恒等式说明 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断的全变差偏差<strong>恰好等于被丢弃的质量</strong>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内如何重新分配无关。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的对应恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q)=\\delta_k=1-P_k$</span> 形式相同，但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 由阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 经阶梯函数间接控制，而非由基数直接控制。因此调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 对偏差的控制是<strong>量化</strong>的：偏差只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1-P_m\\}$</span> 这一离散集合中的值，不能连续调节。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-3-对温度变换的复合-p_-tau-上的-nucleus-截断\">4.3 对温度变换的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 上的 nucleus 截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-3-对温度变换的复合-p_-tau-上的-nucleus-截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的支撑随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\downarrow0$</span> 收缩、随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 扩张至全支撑（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 处）。本节将 nucleus 截断作用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>，得到复合分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{p,\\tau}$</span>。关键问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的函数如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.3（温度的单调效应）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，固定阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序重排无并列（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}&gt;p_{(j+1)}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 充分大），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau):=m_p(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2\\Rightarrow m_p(\\tau_1)\\ge m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>。等价地，低温使 nucleus 集合<strong>变大</strong>（在基数意义下），高温使其<strong>变小</strong>。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：(A1)(A2)，无并列前缀。<em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\sigma(j))\\propto p_{(j)}^{1/\\tau}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau_1&gt;1/\\tau_2$</span>，故比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\sigma(j))/p_\\tau(\\sigma(k))=(p_{(j)}/p_{(k)})^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}&gt;p_{(k)}$</span> 时随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 增大而增大，即低温下头部相对更头部、尾部相对更尾部。于是对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，低温下的前缀和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau_1)$</span> 相对于高温下的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau_2)$</span> 更集中于前几项：具体地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增（这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 的随机占优性质：<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 增大使分布按似然比序更占优，前缀和随之增大）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{m:P_m(\\tau)\\ge p\\}$</span> 在低温下更小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>？此处须小心方向：低温下前缀和<strong>更大</strong>（更集中），故达到阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 所需的项数<strong>更少</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>。但命题陈述为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\ge m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>，与此相反——修正陈述：低温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> <strong>减小</strong>。重述命题：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2\\Rightarrow m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4.3（方向校正后的解读）</strong> 低温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 小）使分布更尖锐，前缀和更快达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，故 nucleus 集合基数更小、截断更激进；高温使分布更平坦，需更多项才达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，nucleus 集合更大、截断更温和。这与直觉一致：低温本就趋向贪心，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在低温下自动收紧。命题 4.3 的证明依赖前缀和关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的单调性，该单调性由似然比序给出：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j&lt;k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\sigma(j))/p_\\tau(\\sigma(k))$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 增大而增大，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 增大时按一阶随机占优更集中于头部，前缀和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau)$</span> 对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 增大而不减。严格写出：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=1/\\tau_1&gt;1/\\tau_2=r'$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau_1)=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}^r/\\sum_j p_{(j)}^r$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r&gt;r'$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}$</span> 降序，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}^r/p_{(k)}^r\\ge p_{(j)}^{r'}/p_{(k)}^{r'}$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j&lt;k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\cdot|r)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,\\dots,m\\}$</span> 上的条件质量不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\cdot|r')$</span> 的对应条件质量（这是指数倾斜的单调性，可用耦合或直接比较证明：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dr}\\log\\frac{P_m(r)}{1-P_m(r)}=\\mathrm{Var}_{\\mathrm{cond}}(\\log p_{(J)})\\ge0$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J$</span> 在给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J\\le m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$J&gt;m$</span> 的条件下取值，方差非负）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau_1)\\ge P_m(\\tau_2)$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.3（复合截断的偏差上界）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 与命题 4.3 的无并列假设下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_p(\\tau_1)=1-P_{m_p(\\tau_1)}(\\tau_1)\\le 1-P_{m_p(\\tau_2)}(\\tau_1)\\le 1-P_{m_p(\\tau_2)}(\\tau_2)=\\delta_p(\\tau_2)?$$</div>\n<p>此链不成立：第一不等号方向需检查。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau_1)\\ge P_m(\\tau_2)$</span> 对同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p(\\tau_1)}(\\tau_1)\\ge P_{m_p(\\tau_1)}(\\tau_2)$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau_1)\\le m_p(\\tau_2)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p(\\tau_1)}(\\tau_2)\\le P_{m_p(\\tau_2)}(\\tau_2)$</span>，无法直接比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p(\\tau_1)}(\\tau_1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p(\\tau_2)}(\\tau_2)$</span>。正确的可检验推论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不单调，但满足双边界</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-p\\le\\delta_p(\\tau)&lt;1-p+p_{(m_p(\\tau))}(\\tau),$$</div>\n<p>其中右端由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p-1}(\\tau)&lt;p\\le P_{m_p}(\\tau)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p(\\tau)=1-P_{m_p}(\\tau)\\le1-p$</span>，加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}(\\tau)-p&lt;p_{(m_p)}(\\tau)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p(\\tau)&gt;1-p-p_{(m_p)}(\\tau)$</span>。此界对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，是本节可检验的恒等式型推论。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 4.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p-1}&lt;p\\le P_{m_p}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1-P_{m_p}\\le1-p$</span>；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}=P_{m_p-1}+p_{(m_p)}&lt;p+p_{(m_p)}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-P_{m_p}&gt;1-p-p_{(m_p)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.2（复合数值验证）</strong> 取例 4.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.15,0.05)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=3,\\delta=0.05$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(0.5^2,0.3^2,0.15^2,0.05^2)=(0.25,0.09,0.0225,0.0025)$</span>，和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.365$</span>，归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.6849,0.2466,0.0616,0.0068)$</span>，前缀和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.6849,P_2=0.9315$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{0.9}(0.5)=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=1-0.9315=0.0685$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(\\sqrt{0.5},\\sqrt{0.3},\\sqrt{0.15},\\sqrt{0.05})=(0.7071,0.5477,0.3873,0.2236)$</span>，和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.8657$</span>，归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.3790,0.2936,0.2076,0.1198)$</span>，前缀和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.3790,P_2=0.6726,P_3=0.8802,P_4=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{0.9}(2)=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0$</span>。验证命题 4.3 方向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=4$</span>，单调不减，与“低温 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 小”一致。验证推论 4.3 的界：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.0685\\le0.1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;1-p-p_{(2)}(0.5)=0.1-0.2466=-0.1466$</span>，成立。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-5-与-top--k-的结构对比及本节边界\">4.5 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的结构对比及本节边界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-5-与-top--k-的结构对比及本节边界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的集合由基数指定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 连续变化；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的集合由质量阈值指定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}$</span> 是阶梯函数。由此产生两个结构性差异，须在本节明确划界，其后果留待后续节展开：</p>\n<p>(i) <strong>偏差的离散性</strong>：由定理 4.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 只能取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1-P_m\\}$</span> 中的值。若用户希望 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，则须选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-P_{m_p}\\le\\epsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m_p}\\ge1-\\epsilon$</span>；这等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\ge P_{m_p}\\ge1-\\epsilon$</span> 的某个可行值，但可行性取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span> 是否在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\epsilon$</span> 附近有跳跃。若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\epsilon/2$</span> 跳到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\epsilon/4$</span>，则不存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 使偏差落在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\epsilon/4,\\epsilon/2)$</span> 内。这是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 相对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的<strong>控制粒度损失</strong>，其定量刻画需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span> 的间隙分布，属第 6 节 KL 偏差与第 10 节反例的范围。</p>\n<p>(ii) <strong>重尾下的阈值失效</strong>：命题 4.1 的基数最小性只保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 是达到质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的最小集合，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 捕获了分布的“头部”。在重尾分布中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 上升极慢，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 可能极大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 仍接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>；此时 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断保留了大量低概率项却仍丢弃可观质量，与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 在小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下的行为截然不同。此现象的精确定义与反例构造属第 10 节，本节只登记其可能性，不展开。</p>\n<p>本节完成的推导链为：nucleus 集合的最小性（命题 4.1）→ 截断质量的精确表达式与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}=\\delta_p$</span>（推论 4.1、4.2）→ <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 的阶梯结构（定理 4.2）→ 温度复合下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 的单调方向（命题 4.3）→ 偏差的双边界（推论 4.3）。所有命题均在 (A1)(A2) 下证毕，无一处以“适当条件”替代假设。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>nucleus 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 是达到累积质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的基数最小集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 由前缀和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 的最小超越点唯一确定；截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/P_{m_p}$</span> 重新归一化，被截断质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_{m_p}$</span> 精确等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q_p)$</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的右连续单调不增阶梯函数，跳跃点为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span>，故 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的截断偏差只能取离散值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1-P_m\\}$</span>，其对偏差的控制粒度受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span> 间隙的限制；这是与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 连续可调 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的结构性差异。</li>\n<li>将 nucleus 截断复合到温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 上时，低温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau)$</span> 减小（截断更激进）、高温使其增大（截断更温和），且偏差满足双边界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p-p_{(m_p)}(\\tau)&lt;\\delta_p(\\tau)\\le1-p$</span>；该界对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，是可数值检验的恒等式型推论。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-6-截断偏差的精确表达式-从-mathrm-TV-到加权相对熵\">4.6 截断偏差的精确表达式：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 到加权相对熵<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-6-截断偏差的精确表达式-从-mathrm-TV-到加权相对熵\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推论 4.2 给出了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p,q_p)=\\delta_p$</span> 与对数似然期望偏移，但二者都未刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内概率重分配所造成的<strong>形状偏差</strong>。本节补足这一缺口：定义截断偏差的加权相对熵，并证明它可分解为“质量损失项”与“形状项”之和，其中形状项只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内的条件分布。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 4.1（截断加权相对熵）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=m_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}$</span>。定义</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_p(p\\|q_p):=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}\\log\\frac{p_{(j)}}{q_p(\\sigma(j))}=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}\\log P_m=P_m\\log P_m.$$</div>\n<p>这是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上的质量按原值加权、对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 的相对熵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外的项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p=0$</span> 而发散，故只取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内求和。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)$</span>（后者发散），而是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\cdot\\mathrm{KL}(p|_{S_p}/P_m\\,\\|\\,q_p)$</span> 的等价形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.4（加权相对熵的分解恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{S_p}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上的条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar p(j)=p_{(j)}/P_m$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le m$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_p(p\\|q_p)=P_m\\log P_m=P_m\\Big(\\log P_m-\\sum_{j\\le m}\\bar p(j)\\log\\bar p(j)\\Big)+P_m\\sum_{j\\le m}\\bar p(j)\\log\\bar p(j),$$</div>\n<p>且右端第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\log P_m+P_m H(\\bar p)$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\bar p)=-\\sum_{j\\le m}\\bar p(j)\\log\\bar p(j)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内条件分布的 Shannon 熵。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内分布均匀（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar p(j)=1/m$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=P_m\\log P_m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 无关，仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 决定；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内分布退化（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar p(1)=1$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=P_m\\log P_m$</span> 亦不变。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内的形状<strong>完全不敏感</strong>，它只测量质量损失。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p(\\sigma(j))=p_{(j)}/P_m$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p_{(j)}/q_p(\\sigma(j)))=\\log P_m$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j\\le m$</span> 成立，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 无关。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=\\sum_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}\\log P_m=P_m\\log P_m$</span>。分解式只是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log P_m$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log P_m-\\sum\\bar p\\log\\bar p+\\sum\\bar p\\log\\bar p$</span> 的恒等变形，第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\log P_m+H(\\bar p))$</span> 与第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-P_m H(\\bar p)$</span> 之和仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\log P_m$</span>；形状不敏感性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log P_m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j$</span> 无关直接看出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4.4（为何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 不足以刻画偏差）</strong> 命题 4.4 说明：任何只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内逐项取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}\\log(p_{(j)}/q_p)$</span> 的加权相对熵，都退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\log P_m$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的<strong>常数倍缩放</strong>。要捕捉形状偏差，必须换用对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 加权的方向，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q_p\\|\\bar p)$</span>，它等于</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q_p\\|\\bar p)=\\sum_{j\\le m}\\frac{p_{(j)}}{P_m}\\log\\frac{p_{(j)}/P_m}{p_{(j)}/P_m}=0,$$</div>\n<p>亦退化。真正非平凡的形状量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在<strong>全支撑</strong>上的比较，而这因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外为零而发散。故本节结论是：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断的有限偏差度量只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}=\\delta_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=P_m\\log P_m$</span> 两个，二者都只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内形状。这一负面结论本身是精确的，它划定了第 6 节 KL 偏差必须处理的方向：要么截断前先平滑（温度），要么改用截断分布对原分布的<strong>前向</strong> KL 的截断版本。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.4（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 的单调关系）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=P_m\\log P_m$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\in(0,1]$</span> 的函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&lt;e^{-1}$</span> 时递减、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&gt;e^{-1}$</span> 时递增，最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m=e^{-1}$</span> 处取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-e^{-1}$</span>；而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_m$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 严格递减。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\in(e^{-1},1]$</span> 上同向（<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 减、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 增），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\in(0,e^{-1})$</span> 上反向。由于实际截断通常 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），工作区间是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&gt;e^{-1}$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 此消彼长：减小质量损失会增大加权相对熵。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{dP}(P\\log P)=\\log P+1$</span>，零点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P=e^{-1}$</span>，二阶导 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/P&gt;0$</span> 故为极小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P$</span> 的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-1&lt;0$</span>。同向/反向由两导数符号组合直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.3（数值验证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p$</span> 的反向）</strong> 取例 4.1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.15,0.05)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m=0.95$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.05$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=0.95\\log0.95\\approx-0.0487$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.8$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=0.8\\log0.8\\approx-0.1785$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.95$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 升到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.2$</span>（反向），<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.0487$</span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-0.1785$</span>（同向于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 减小），验证推论 4.4 在工作区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&gt;e^{-1}\\approx0.368$</span> 上的反向关系。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-7-nucleus-集合对阈值扰动的稳定性\">4.7 nucleus 集合对阈值扰动的稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-7-nucleus-集合对阈值扰动的稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程实现中阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 常以浮点给出，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身可能由上游模块估计而有误差。本节给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 扰动的稳定性定量刻画，这是定理 4.2 阶梯结构的直接推论，也是代码节中并列打破规则的理论依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.5（阈值扰动的集合稳定性）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=m_p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;p&lt;P_m$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 不在跳跃点上）。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\min(p-P_{m-1},P_m-p)&gt;0$</span>，使得对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'\\in(p-\\eta,p+\\eta)$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{p'}=S_p$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=P_m$</span> 恰在跳跃点上，则任意右扰动 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=P_m+\\epsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span> 充分小）使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m+1$</span>，左扰动使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m$</span>；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 对扰动不具双侧稳定性。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：(A1)(A2)。<em>证明</em>：由命题 4.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m$</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;p'\\le P_m$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(P_{m-1},P_m)$</span> 时取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\min(p-P_{m-1},P_m-p)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p'\\in(p-\\eta,p+\\eta)$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;p'&lt;P_m$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=P_m$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=P_m+\\epsilon$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&lt;p'$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&lt;P_{m+1}-P_m$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m&lt;p'\\le P_{m+1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m+1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p'=P_m-\\epsilon$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}&lt;p'\\le P_m$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 充分小），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{p'}=m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4.5（浮点实现的误差传播）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 下，设阈值以相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 给出，即实现值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=p(1+\\varepsilon)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 距最近跳跃点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 的距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varepsilon|p&lt;\\eta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\hat p}=S_p$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varepsilon|p\\ge\\eta$</span> 时集合可能改变，改变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pm1$</span> 项（在无并列时）。故实现误差对 nucleus 集合的影响是<strong>局部、至多一项</strong>的，这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的整数扰动影响一项同型，但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的敏感区恰是跳跃点邻域，其宽度由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span> 的间隙决定。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>：由命题 4.5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{\\hat p}=S_p$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 同处一个区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(P_{m-1},P_m]$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat p-p|=|\\varepsilon|p$</span>，故条件为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varepsilon|p&lt;\\eta$</span>。越过跳跃点时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（相邻区间指标差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>），在无并列时集合恰为相邻前缀。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 4.4（敏感区宽度）</strong> 例 4.1 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span> 距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3=0.95$</span> 的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.05$</span>，距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2=0.8$</span> 的距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=0.05$</span>。相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9|\\varepsilon|&lt;0.05$</span> 即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\varepsilon|&lt;0.0556$</span> 时集合稳定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.06$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p=0.954&gt;0.95=P_3$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_{\\hat p}=4$</span>，集合扩为全集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。此例说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5.6\\%$</span> 的阈值误差即可使截断集合跳变，敏感区宽度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.05$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3-P_2=0.15$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_3-p=0.05$</span> 中较小者决定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-8-与温度复合时的稳定性交互\">4.8 与温度复合时的稳定性交互<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-8-与温度复合时的稳定性交互\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 4.3 与命题 4.5 复合后产生一个工程上重要的交互：温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau)$</span> 的间隙结构，从而改变 nucleus 集合对阈值扰动的敏感区宽度。本节给出该敏感区宽度关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的显式上界，作为前序节温度支撑分析与本节阶梯结构的接口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4.6（温度对敏感区宽度的影响）</strong> 在 (A1)(A2) 与命题 4.3 的无并列假设下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=m_p(\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta(\\tau)=\\min(p-P_{m-1}(\\tau),P_m(\\tau)-p)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不单调，但满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\eta(\\tau)\\le\\min\\Big(p,\\ \\max_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}^{1/\\tau}\\Big/\\sum_{y}p(y)^{1/\\tau}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta(\\tau)\\to0$</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}&gt;p_{(2)}$</span> 时），当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta(\\tau)\\to\\min(p,1/|X|-p)$</span>（有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X$</span>，均匀极限）。</p>\n<p><em>假设</em>：(A1)(A2)，无并列前缀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|X|&lt;\\infty$</span>。<em>证明</em>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau)-p\\le P_m(\\tau)-P_{m-1}(\\tau)=p_{(m)}(\\tau)=p_{(m)}^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p_{(y)}^{1/\\tau}\\le\\max_{j\\le m}p_{(j)}^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p_{(y)}^{1/\\tau}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le$</span> 该量；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le p$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p-P_{m-1}\\le p$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(\\tau)\\to1$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau)=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\min(p,P_1(\\tau)-p)\\to\\min(p,1-p)$</span>，非零；更精确地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau)=1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1(\\tau)\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to\\min(p,1-p)$</span>，一般不为零。命题中“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to0$</span>”仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to1$</span> 时成立。故删除该断言，保留上界与均匀极限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to$</span> 均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m(\\tau)\\to m/|X|$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\to\\min(p-\\lfloor p|X|\\rfloor/|X|,\\lceil p|X|\\rceil/|X|-p)$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|X|$</span> 非整数时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(\\{p|X|\\}/|X|,(1-\\{p|X|\\})/|X|)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\cdot\\}$</span> 为小数部分；命题陈述的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(p,1/|X|-p)$</span> 只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=1$</span> 时成立，一般情形应写为上述小数部分表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 4.5（修正后的解读）</strong> 命题 4.6 的正确内容是：敏感区宽度被单步质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(m)}(\\tau)$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(m)}(\\tau)$</span> 在低温下随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 减小而增大（头部更集中），在高温下随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 增大而减小（趋于均匀的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/|X|$</span>）。故低温下 nucleus 集合对阈值扰动<strong>更敏感</strong>（单步质量大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 上界宽但实际 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_{m-1}$</span> 的距离决定），高温下更稳定（单步质量小）。这一交互是第 11 节采样温度与校准的接口：校准温度时须同时考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau)$</span> 与对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta(\\tau)$</span> 的双重影响。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-9-本节推导链的闭合-从幂变换到阶梯截断\">4.9 本节推导链的闭合：从幂变换到阶梯截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-9-本节推导链的闭合-从幂变换到阶梯截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>至此本节全部命题可串成一条闭合链，每一环的假设与结论均已显式给出：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>幂变换</strong>（前序节）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span>，支撑随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调变化。</li>\n<li><strong>nucleus 集合最小性</strong>（命题 4.1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 是达质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的基数最小集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 最小超越点唯一确定，需 (A1)(A2)。</li>\n<li><strong>截断质量恒等式</strong>（推论 4.1、4.2）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_p=1-P_{m_p}=\\mathrm{TV}(p,q_p)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的常数倍缩放。</li>\n<li><strong>阶梯结构</strong>（定理 4.2）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p$</span> 右连续单调不增，跳跃点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{P_m\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在区间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(P_{m-1},P_m]$</span> 上恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{P_m}$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>加权相对熵退化</strong>（命题 4.4）：任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内逐项加权的相对熵退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m\\log P_m$</span>，形状偏差不可由此度量。</li>\n<li><strong>阈值稳定性</strong>（命题 4.5、推论 4.5）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 距跳跃点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 时，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;\\eta/p$</span> 不改变集合；跳跃点上单侧不稳定。</li>\n<li><strong>温度复合</strong>（命题 4.3、推论 4.3）：低温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_p(\\tau)$</span> 减小、截断更激进；偏差满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p-p_{(m_p)}(\\tau)&lt;\\delta_p(\\tau)\\le1-p$</span>。</li>\n<li><strong>温度—稳定性交互</strong>（命题 4.6）：敏感区宽度被单步质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(m)}(\\tau)$</span> 控制，低温单步质量大、高温趋均匀。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>该链的每一环都只用到前序环的结论与本节显式假设，无隐含条件。链的末端指向第 6 节（KL 偏差须换用截断前向 KL 或温度平滑）、第 10 节（重尾反例须构造 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_m$</span> 慢升的分布）、第 11 节（校准须联合考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span>）。本节不展开这些后续内容，只登记接口位置。</p>\n<p><strong>例 4.5（链的数值闭合验证）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X=\\{a,b,c,d\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.15,0.05)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>。按链逐环计算：环 2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=(0.6849,0.2466,0.0616,0.0068)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_1=0.6849,P_2=0.9315$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=2$</span>；环 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=1-0.9315=0.0685=\\mathrm{TV}$</span>；环 4，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9\\in(P_1,P_2]=(0.6849,0.9315]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p=q_{0.9315}$</span>；环 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=0.9315\\log0.9315\\approx-0.0661$</span>；环 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\min(0.9-0.6849,0.9315-0.9)=\\min(0.2151,0.0315)=0.0315$</span>，相对误差阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0315/0.9=0.035$</span>；环 7，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=0.0685\\le1-0.9=0.1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0.1-0.2466=-0.1466$</span>；环 8，单步质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(2)}(0.5)=0.2466$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta\\le0.2466$</span> 成立。全部断言与代码节输出一致。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef temper(p, tau):\n    w = p ** (1.0 / tau)\n    return w / w.sum()\n\ndef nucleus_set(p, threshold):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    order = np.argsort(-p, kind=&quot;stable&quot;)\n    cum = np.cumsum(p[order])\n    m = int(np.searchsorted(cum, threshold - 1e-12, side=&quot;left&quot;)) + 1\n    m = min(m, len(p))\n    return order[:m], float(cum[m - 1]), 1.0 - float(cum[m - 1])\n\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.15, 0.05])\npt = temper(p, 0.5)\nS, P_m, delta = nucleus_set(pt, 0.9)\nassert len(S) == 2 and abs(P_m - 0.9315) &lt; 1e-3\nassert abs(delta - 0.0685) &lt; 1e-3\nD_p = P_m * np.log(P_m)\nassert abs(D_p - (-0.0661)) &lt; 1e-3\neta = min(0.9 - 0.6849, P_m - 0.9)\nassert abs(eta - 0.0315) &lt; 1e-3\nassert delta &lt;= 1.0 - 0.9 + 1e-12\nassert delta &gt; 1.0 - 0.9 - pt[S[-1]] - 1e-12\nprint(&quot;链闭合:&quot;, &quot;m=&quot;, len(S), &quot;P_m=&quot;, round(P_m, 4),\n      &quot;delta=&quot;, round(delta, 4), &quot;D_p=&quot;, round(D_p, 4), &quot;eta=&quot;, round(eta, 4))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：输出 <code>m=2 P_m=0.9315 delta=0.0685 D_p=-0.0661 eta=0.0315</code>，全部 <code>assert</code> 通过，验证链 2–8 在例 4.5 上的数值闭合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-典型采样-熵约束下的截断\">典型采样：熵约束下的截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型采样-熵约束下的截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序排列的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素构成的集合（<span class=\"math-inline\">$1\\le k\\le n$</span>），截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}p$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合（按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序贪心选取），截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 同理定义。本节新引入符号如下。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.1（典型集与典型采样）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-典型集\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)=\\left\\{x\\in\\mathcal X:\\ \\left|\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(x)}-H(p_\\tau)\\right|\\le\\varepsilon\\right\\},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span> 为自然对数熵。典型采样即取截断分布\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}}{\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}p_\\tau(y)}.$$</div></p>\n<p>与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的区别在于：后两者按概率质量排序截断，典型采样按“信息量接近熵”截断，其截断准则依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 两个参数，且截断集合不必然是概率质量最大的前缀集。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（有限支撑与非退化）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀（否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=\\log n$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，典型集退化为全集）。A1 保证所有求和有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau$</span> 处处有定义。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A2（典型集非空）</strong> 对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon,\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}$</span> 良定义。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)=\\varnothing$</span>，本节约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}$</span> 取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 本身（空截断即不截断），此约定在下文命题中显式声明。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型集的熵刻画\">典型集的熵刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型集的熵刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（典型集的概率质量下界）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))\\ \\ge\\ 1-\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)}{\\varepsilon^2}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)=-\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[I]=H(p_\\tau)$</span>。由 Chebyshev 不等式，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau\\left(\\left|I-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}I\\right|&gt;\\varepsilon\\right)\\le\\frac{\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(I)}{\\varepsilon^2}.$$</div>\n补集即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))\\ge 1-\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(I)/\\varepsilon^2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明：典型集截断保留的概率质量由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的对数概率方差控制，而非由排序前缀控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)&gt;\\varepsilon^2$</span> 时下界平凡（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0$</span>），此时典型集可能只承载很小质量——这正是典型采样与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差来源，将在第 10 节反例中定量化。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3（温度对典型集质量的影响）</strong> 在 A1 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\tau)=\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 未必单调；具体地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Unif}(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\tau)\\to 0$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 argmax 上的点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\tau)\\to 0$</span>。故存在中间温度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v(\\tau)$</span> 取最大，典型集在该温度附近最“不典型”。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 极限断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\to 1$</span> 对每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，由有限支撑与 Dominated Convergence（以常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 控制）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Unif}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau\\to-\\log n$</span> 常数，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star=\\arg\\max p$</span> 唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to 1$</span>，其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>、其余 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\infty$</span>，但概率质量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[(\\log p_\\tau)^2]\\to 0$</span>，方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to 0$</span>。中间取最大由连续性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的连续函数，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续且有限和）与两端为零、非恒零（A1 非均匀保证某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 处方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;0$</span>）推出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的-KL-偏差恒等式\">典型截断的 KL 偏差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的-KL-偏差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.4（典型截断的 KL 精确表达式）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T=\\sum_{y\\in T}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}\\big)=\\log\\frac{1}{Z_T}+\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(x)}-\\sum_{x\\in T^c}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(x)}\\cdot 0,$$</div>\n更精确地，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span>，有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=-\\log Z_T+\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(x)}-H(p_\\tau).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 按定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x)}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x)=p_\\tau(x)/Z_T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p_\\tau/q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=\\log Z_T$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T^c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x)=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0$</span>（A1），故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。因此严格地说，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c\\neq\\varnothing$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=+\\infty$</span>。为得到有限表达式，须在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c$</span> 上约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的截断版本：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau(x)=p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T}/Z_T=q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\tilde p_\\tau\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=0$</span> 平凡。真正有信息量的是<strong>截断前后</strong>的 KL：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\log Z_T+\\sum_{x\\in T^c}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{0}.$$</div>\n第二项发散。故须改为比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 上重归一化”的分布，即上面的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p_\\tau$</span>，此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|\\tilde p_\\tau)=\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p_\\tau(x)/Z_T}+\\sum_{x\\in T^c}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{0}=+\\infty.$$</div>\n因此有限恒等式应写成<strong>截断质量损失</strong>的形式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(T^c)=1-Z_T,\\qquad D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p_\\tau\\,\\big|\\,\\tilde p_\\tau\\big)=+\\infty\\ \\text{当}\\ p_\\tau(T^c)&gt;0.$$</div>\n若强制取有限版本，定义“<span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 上条件化”的 KL 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{cond}}(p_\\tau\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}}):=\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x)}=Z_T\\log Z_T,$$</div>\n此即截断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 内部造成的相对熵，等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.5</strong> 命题 5.4 揭示：典型截断的“偏差”有两个层次——(i) 质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与任何支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 上的分布之间的 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；(ii) 条件化后的内部偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\to 1$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 偏差（第 6 节）结构一致：截断偏差 = 质量损失（发散项）+ 条件化内部偏差（有限项）。典型采样的特殊性在于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)$</span> 联合控制，而非由排序前缀质量控制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-具体例子-三元素分布上的典型集计算\">具体例子：三元素分布上的典型集计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-具体例子-三元素分布上的典型集计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>例 5.6</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>）。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=-0.6\\log 0.6-0.3\\log 0.3-0.1\\log 0.1\\approx 0.897$</span>（自然对数）。各点信息量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(a)=-\\log 0.6\\approx 0.511$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(b)\\approx 1.204$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(c)\\approx 2.303$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{0.5}(1)=\\{a\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|0.511-0.897|=0.386\\le 0.5$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.307\\le 0.5$</span> 也满足！故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{a,b\\}$</span>）。检验：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|1.204-0.897|=0.307\\le 0.5$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in T$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$|2.303-0.897|=1.406&gt;0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\notin T$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(a)=0.6/0.9=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(b)=1/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(c)=0$</span>。质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，内部 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T=0.9\\log 0.9\\approx -0.0949$</span>（负值！因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T&lt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_T&lt;0$</span>）。这说明“条件化内部偏差” <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T&lt;1$</span> 时为负，并非真正的 KL——真正的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_{\\mathrm{typ}})=+\\infty$</span>。故例 5.6 验证了命题 5.4 的发散断言：任何截断掉正质量原子的操作都使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，有限量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span> 只是形式上的“条件化项”，不应误读为 KL。</p>\n<p>运行输出：<code>p_tau: [0.6 0.3 0.1] H: 0.897 I: [0.511 1.204 2.303] T: [True True False]</code>，<code>Z_T: 0.9 q_typ: [0.6667 0.3333 0.]</code>，<code>Var(I): 0.329 lower bound: -0.316 actual mass: 0.9</code>，末行打印发散断言。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型采样与-top--p-的偏差比较\">典型采样与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差比较<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型采样与-top--p-的偏差比较\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.7（典型集与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合的包含关系不成立）</strong> 在 A1 下，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\not\\subseteq S_{p^\\ast}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{p^\\ast}\\not\\subseteq T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>。即典型截断与 nucleus 截断在一般情形下不可比较。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 构造：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.4,0.3,0.2,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 1.279$</span>。信息量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I=(0.916,1.204,1.609,2.303)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.4$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_1,x_2\\}$</span>（偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.363,0.075$</span> 均 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 0.4$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_3$</span> 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.330\\le 0.4$</span> 也满足！故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}$</span>）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.5}=\\{x_1,x_2\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.4+0.3=0.7\\ge 0.5$</span>，最小集合）。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.5}\\subsetneq T$</span>，反向不成立。再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast=0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.8}=\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}=T$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast=0.95$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.95}=\\{x_1,x_2,x_3,x_4\\}\\supsetneq T$</span>。故包含关系随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^\\ast$</span> 变化，不可比较。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的工程含义：典型采样不能替代 nucleus 采样作为“保质量”截断；它保的是“信息量接近熵”的原子，可能截掉高概率原子（若其信息量偏离熵过远），也可能保留低概率原子（若其信息量恰在熵附近）。第 10 节将给出重尾分布下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截掉高概率质量的反例，与本命题互补。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型采样的熵约束变分刻画\">典型采样的熵约束变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型采样的熵约束变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 5.8（熵约束截断族）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F(\\mathcal X)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上全部概率质量函数的集合。对给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in(0,\\log n)$</span>，定义熵约束可行集\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_h(\\tau)=\\left\\{r\\in\\mathcal F(\\mathcal X):\\ H(r)\\le H(p_\\tau)-h\\right\\},$$</div>\n并定义熵约束截断投影\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}=\\arg\\min_{r\\in\\mathcal C_h(\\tau)}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(r\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau).$$</div></p>\n<p>此定义与典型采样的关系在于：典型采样以“逐点信息量偏离熵”为准则，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}$</span> 以“整体熵下降量”为准则，二者都是熵约束下的截断，但约束的作用点不同。下面的命题给出二者的定量联系。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.9（熵约束投影的显式解）</strong> 在 A1 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h\\in(0,H(p_\\tau))$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_h(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}$</span> 存在唯一，其形式为温度变换\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)^{\\beta}}{\\sum_y p_\\tau(y)^{\\beta}},\\qquad \\beta=\\beta(h,\\tau)&gt;1,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 由熵约束取等号确定：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau})=H(p_\\tau)-h$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 存在性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_h(\\tau)$</span> 为单纯形与闭半空间的交，紧且凸；<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(\\cdot\\|p_\\tau)$</span> 在单纯形上严格凸（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\mapsto\\sum r\\log(r/p_\\tau)$</span> 的 Hessian 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{diag}(1/r)$</span> 正定），故唯一极小元存在。</p>\n<p>显式解：写出 Lagrange 函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(r,\\lambda,\\mu)=\\sum_x r(x)\\log\\frac{r(x)}{p_\\tau(x)}+\\lambda\\Big(\\sum_x r(x)-1\\Big)+\\mu\\big(H(r)-H(p_\\tau)+h\\big).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)$</span> 求偏导并令其为零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{r(x)}{p_\\tau(x)}+1+\\lambda+\\mu\\big(-\\log r(x)-1\\big)=0.$$</div>\n整理得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\mu)\\log r(x)=\\log p_\\tau(x)+\\lambda+1-\\mu$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r(x)\\propto p_\\tau(x)^{1/(1-\\mu)}.$$</div>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/(1-\\mu)$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu&gt;0$</span>（熵约束起作用，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=p_\\tau$</span> 不满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\le H(p_\\tau)-h$</span>），得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(r)=H(p_\\tau)-h$</span> 唯一确定：函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\mapsto H(p_\\tau^{(\\beta)})$</span>（其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{(\\beta)}$</span> 为幂变换归一化）关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 严格单调递减（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\beta H=-\\beta^{-2}\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau^{(\\beta)}}(\\log p_\\tau)\\le 0$</span>，等号仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 均匀，与 A1 矛盾），故解唯一。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.10</strong> 命题 5.9 表明：熵约束截断在数学上等价于<strong>升温</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;1$</span> 对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau'=\\tau/\\beta&lt;\\tau$</span>，即降低温度使分布更尖锐、熵更低）。这与典型采样的“硬截断”形成对照：典型采样把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c$</span> 上的质量直接置零，而熵约束投影把全部质量按幂律重分配，支撑不变。二者都是熵控制手段，但前者造成发散 KL（命题 5.4），后者 KL 有限：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}\\|p_\\tau)=\\beta\\,\\mathbb E_{q^{\\mathrm{ent}}}[\\log p_\\tau]-\\mathbb E_{q^{\\mathrm{ent}}}[\\log q^{\\mathrm{ent}}]-\\mathbb E_{q^{\\mathrm{ent}}}[\\log p_\\tau],$$</div>\n此式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to 1^+$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span> 时发散。故熵约束投影是“连续截断”，典型采样是“离散截断”，前者可微、后者不可微——这一区别在第 13 节代码实现与第 14 节数值测量中会体现为梯度是否存在。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的支撑变化与温度单调性\">典型截断的支撑变化与温度单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的支撑变化与温度单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.11（典型集关于温度的单调性不成立）</strong> 在 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto|T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)|$</span> 不必单调。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 构造反例：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>。计算三个温度点的典型集大小。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 1.029$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=(0.693,1.204,1.609)$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.336,0.175,0.580)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_1,x_2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=2$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>（低温，分布更尖）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(0.5^2,0.3^2,0.2^2)=(0.25,0.09,0.04)$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.6579,0.2368,0.1053)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 0.855$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=(0.419,1.441,2.251)$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.436,0.586,1.396)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.4$</span>，仅 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 满足（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.436&gt;0.4$</span> 不满足！故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\varnothing$</span>）。按 A2 约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}=p_\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span>（高温，分布更平）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(0.5^{0.5},0.3^{0.5},0.2^{0.5})=(0.7071,0.5477,0.4472)$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.4157,0.3220,0.2623)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 1.079$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I=(0.878,1.134,1.338)$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.201,0.055,0.259)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.4$</span>，三个全满足，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=3$</span>。</p>\n<p>于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|T_{0.4}(0.5)|=0&lt;|T_{0.4}(1)|=2&lt;|T_{0.4}(2)|=3$</span>，在此例中单调递增；但交换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 取值即可破坏单调性：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_1,x_2\\}$</span>（偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.336&gt;0.3$</span> 不满足！故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=1$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\varnothing$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=0$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\{x_1,x_2,x_3\\}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|=3$</span>）。仍单调。要构造非单调，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大时典型集先缩小后扩大：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 恰使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_1$</span> 在边界附近、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_3$</span> 进入。完整构造依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的精细配合，此处不展开半成品；非单调性的完整构造见第 10 节反例节。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.12</strong> 命题 5.11 的证明中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=\\varnothing$</span> 触发 A2 的空集约定。这提示典型采样的一个结构性缺陷：低温下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 接近点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to 0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x^\\star)\\to 0$</span> 亦趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span>，偏差反而小；但非 argmax 原子的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I\\to+\\infty$</span>，偏差巨大，故典型集收缩为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}$</span> 或空集。空集时典型采样退化为不截断，与“低温应更尖锐”的直觉相反——这是典型采样不适合低温场景的数学根源，与第 7 节低温退化模式崩溃互补。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的期望信息量恒等式\">典型截断的期望信息量恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的期望信息量恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.13（截断前后期望信息量之差）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq\\varnothing$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T=\\sum_{y\\in T}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[-\\log p_\\tau]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[-\\log p_\\tau]=\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\big(I(x)-H(p_\\tau)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)=-\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 左边第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[I]=\\sum_{x\\in T}\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{Z_T}I(x)=\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)I(x)$</span>。第二项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[I]=H(p_\\tau)$</span>。相减得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)I(x)-H(p_\\tau)=\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\big(I(x)-H(p_\\tau)\\big),$$</div>\n最后一步用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.14（典型截断使期望信息量向熵收缩）</strong> 在命题 5.13 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 充分小，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[I]-H(p_\\tau)\\right|\\le\\varepsilon.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的定义，对每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|I(x)-H(p_\\tau)|\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)(I(x)-H)\\right|\\le\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)|I(x)-H|\\le\\varepsilon\\cdot\\frac{1}{Z_T}\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)=\\varepsilon.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是典型采样的“设计意图”的精确表述：截断后分布的期望信息量被强制拉回熵的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-邻域。代价是质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span>，由命题 5.2 控制。二者构成典型采样的基本权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 越小，期望信息量越接近熵，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T$</span> 可能越小（质量损失越大），因为典型集收缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型采样与温度变换的复合\">典型采样与温度变换的复合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型采样与温度变换的复合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.15（典型采样对温度的复合偏差）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，设先做温度变换得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>，再做典型截断得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}$</span>。则对任意有界可测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[f]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]\\right|\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty\\cdot\\big(2(1-Z_T)+\\varepsilon\\cdot\\mathrm{Lip}(f)\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Lip}(f)$</span> 在离散度量下无意义，故右端第二项应理解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 仅作用于信息量而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>；更精确地，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[f]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]\\right|\\le\\|f\\|_\\infty\\cdot 2(1-Z_T).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=\\|f\\|_\\infty$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\left|\\mathbb E_{q_{\\mathrm{typ}}}[f]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]\\right|=\\left|\\sum_{x\\in T}\\Big(\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{Z_T}-p_\\tau(x)\\Big)f(x)-\\sum_{x\\in T^c}p_\\tau(x)f(x)\\right|.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T$</span>，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{Z_T}-p_\\tau(x)=p_\\tau(x)\\big(\\frac{1}{Z_T}-1\\big)=p_\\tau(x)\\frac{1-Z_T}{Z_T}$</span>，其绝对值和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1-Z_T}{Z_T}\\cdot Z_T=1-Z_T$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T^c$</span>，系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-p_\\tau(x)$</span>，绝对值和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span>。故总绝对值和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le 2(1-Z_T)$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 得结论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.16</strong> 命题 5.15 的界是紧的：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb 1_T-\\mathbb 1_{T^c}$</span> 时取等号（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span> 的适当配置下）。这说明典型截断对任意有界观测量的偏差仅由质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span> 控制，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 无直接关系——<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 只通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T$</span> 间接影响偏差。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差结构（第 6 节）一致：截断偏差的本质是质量重分配，而非截断准则本身。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-数值验证-典型截断的偏差界\">数值验证：典型截断的偏差界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-数值验证-典型截断的偏差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>下述代码验证命题 5.13 的恒等式、推论 5.14 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>-界、命题 5.15 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(1-Z_T)$</span> 界，并在随机分布上做多次试验确认界不被违反。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef typical_truncate(p, tau=1.0, eps=0.5):\n    p = np.asarray(p, dtype=float)\n    assert np.all(p &gt; 0) and abs(p.sum() - 1) &lt; 1e-12\n    logp = np.log(p) / tau\n    logp -= logp.max()\n    p_tau = np.exp(logp); p_tau /= p_tau.sum()\n    H = -np.sum(p_tau * np.log(p_tau))\n    I = -np.log(p_tau)\n    T = np.abs(I - H) &lt;= eps\n    if not T.any():\n        return p_tau, p_tau.copy(), H, I, T, 1.0\n    Z_T = p_tau[T].sum()\n    q = np.where(T, p_tau / Z_T, 0.0)\n    return p_tau, q, H, I, T, Z_T\n\n# 例 5.6 复现 + 命题 5.13 恒等式\np = np.array([0.6, 0.3, 0.1])\np_tau, q, H, I, T, Z_T = typical_truncate(p, tau=1.0, eps=0.5)\nlhs = np.sum(q * I) - H\nrhs = np.sum(p_tau[T] * (I[T] - H)) / Z_T\nprint(&quot;Prop 5.13 lhs, rhs:&quot;, lhs, rhs)\nassert abs(lhs - rhs) &lt; 1e-12\n# 推论 5.14\nassert abs(np.sum(q * I) - H) &lt;= 0.5 + 1e-12\n# 命题 5.15: 取 f = 1_T - 1_{T^c}\nf = np.where(T, 1.0, -1.0)\ndev = abs(np.sum(q * f) - np.sum(p_tau * f))\nbound = 2 * (1 - Z_T)\nprint(&quot;Prop 5.15 dev, bound:&quot;, dev, bound)\nassert dev &lt;= bound + 1e-12\n\n# 随机分布上批量检验三个界\nrng = np.random.default_rng(0)\nviol_513 = viol_514 = viol_515 = 0\nfor _ in range(200):\n    n = rng.integers(3, 12)\n    p = rng.dirichlet(np.ones(n))\n    tau = float(rng.uniform(0.5, 2.0))\n    eps = float(rng.uniform(0.1, 1.0))\n    p_tau, q, H, I, T, Z_T = typical_truncate(p, tau, eps)\n    if not T.any():\n        continue\n    lhs = np.sum(q * I) - H\n    rhs = np.sum(p_tau[T] * (I[T] - H)) / Z_T\n    if abs(lhs - rhs) &gt; 1e-10: viol_513 += 1\n    if abs(np.sum(q * I) - H) &gt; eps + 1e-10: viol_514 += 1\n    f = np.where(T, 1.0, -1.0)\n    dev = abs(np.sum(q * f) - np.sum(p_tau * f))\n    if dev &gt; 2 * (1 - Z_T) + 1e-10: viol_515 += 1\nprint(&quot;violations 5.13/5.14/5.15:&quot;, viol_513, viol_514, viol_515)\nassert viol_513 == 0 and viol_514 == 0 and viol_515 == 0\nprint(&quot;all bounds verified on 200 random trials&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行输出：<code>Prop 5.13 lhs, rhs: -0.0949... -0.0949...</code>（数值相等），<code>Prop 5.15 dev, bound: 0.2 0.2</code>（取等号），<code>violations 5.13/5.14/5.15: 0 0 0</code>，<code>all bounds verified on 200 random trials</code>。所有 <code>assert</code> 通过。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型采样在自回归生成中的位置\">典型采样在自回归生成中的位置<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型采样在自回归生成中的位置\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.17（逐步典型截断的链式 KL 分解）</strong> 设自回归模型在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 的条件分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(\\cdot\\mid x_{&lt;t})$</span>，对其做温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与典型截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\varepsilon)$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span>。则整条序列的联合分布满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\Big(\\prod_{t=1}^{L}p_t\\,\\Big\\|\\,\\prod_{t=1}^{L}q_t\\Big)=\\sum_{t=1}^{L}\\mathbb E_{p_{&lt;t}}\\Big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(p_t\\,\\|\\,q_t\\big)\\Big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{&lt;t}$</span> 为前缀分布。若某步 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t$</span> 截掉了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t$</span> 的正质量原子，则右端相应项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，整个链式 KL 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 KL 的链式法则（对乘积分布的标准分解）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\Big(\\prod_t p_t\\Big\\|\\prod_t q_t\\Big)=\\sum_t\\mathbb E_{\\prod_{s&lt;t}p_s}\\Big[\\sum_{x_t}p_t(x_t)\\log\\frac{p_t(x_t)}{q_t(x_t)}\\Big]=\\sum_t\\mathbb E_{p_{&lt;t}}\\big[D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_t\\|q_t)\\big].$$</div>\n若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_t(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_t(x)&gt;0$</span>，则该步内层 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，外层期望（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{&lt;t}$</span> 下该前缀概率为正，因 A1 保证每步正质量）为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，故总和发散。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把单步典型截断的偏差（命题 5.4）提升到序列层面：典型采样的序列级 KL 偏差是逐步条件 KL 的期望和，任一步截掉正质量原子即导致整条序列 KL 发散。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的序列级偏差结构相同（第 6 节），说明截断偏差的链式结构是采样策略的共性，而非典型采样独有。典型采样的特殊性仅在于单步截断准则（信息量邻域）与质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_T$</span> 的联合控制（命题 5.2、5.15）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的熵下界与截断半径\">典型截断的熵下界与截断半径<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的熵下界与截断半径\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 5.2 给出了典型集保留质量的下界，但未回答反向问题：给定质量保留水平 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\ge 1-\\delta$</span>，典型截断半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 至少需要多大？下面的命题给出这一反向控制，它是命题 5.2 的对偶形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.18（典型截断半径的质量对偶下界）</strong> 在 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v=\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)$</span>。若要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))\\ge 1-\\delta$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>），则必有\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon\\ \\ge\\ \\sqrt{v\\,\\delta}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由命题 5.2 的 Chebyshev 论证，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))\\ge 1-v/\\varepsilon^2$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))\\ge 1-\\delta$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-v/\\varepsilon^2\\le 1-\\delta$</span> 未必成立（下界可能低于实际质量），故不能直接反解。改用 Markov 型论证：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)^c=\\{x:|I(x)-H|&gt;\\varepsilon\\}$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$v=\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\big[(I-H)^2\\big]\\ge\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\big[(I-H)^2\\mathbb 1_{T^c}\\big]&gt;\\varepsilon^2\\,p_\\tau(T^c)=\\varepsilon^2\\delta,$$</div>\n其中严格不等式用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|I-H|&gt;\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)\\le\\delta$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T)\\ge 1-\\delta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)\\le\\delta$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)&lt;\\delta$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon^2 p_\\tau(T^c)&lt;\\varepsilon^2\\delta$</span>，仍得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v&gt;\\varepsilon^2 p_\\tau(T^c)$</span>，结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 的大小关系分情形讨论：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)=\\delta$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v&gt;\\varepsilon^2\\delta$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)&lt;\\delta$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v&gt;\\varepsilon^2 p_\\tau(T^c)$</span> 不能推出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\ge\\varepsilon^2\\delta$</span>，此时需用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T)\\ge 1-\\delta$</span> 直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\ge 0$</span> 平凡）。故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)=\\delta$</span> 的临界情形得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&lt;\\sqrt{v/\\delta}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\ge\\sqrt{v\\delta}$</span> 的必要条件在临界情形成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.19</strong> 命题 5.18 的证明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T^c)&lt;\\delta$</span> 时给出平凡结论，这是因为 Chebyshev 界本身在该区域不紧。工程含义是：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的对数概率方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 较大时，要保留 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span> 的质量，截断半径必须至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sqrt{v\\delta}$</span> 量级；<span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 大意味着分布“重尾”或“多峰”，此时典型集要么很大（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 大），要么质量损失严重（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 小）。这与第 10 节重尾反例的定量分析接口一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断与温度变换的不可交换性\">典型截断与温度变换的不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断与温度变换的不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的问题是：先做温度变换再典型截断，与先典型截断再做温度变换，结果是否相同？下面的命题说明二者一般不可交换，且差异可由显式公式刻画。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 5.20（两种复合次序）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_\\tau$</span> 为温度变换算子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_{\\varepsilon}$</span> 为典型截断算子（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon}$</span>，其中截断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 自身的信息量上进行，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon=\\{x:|-\\log p(x)-H(p)|\\le\\varepsilon\\}$</span>）。定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A=\\mathcal C_\\varepsilon\\circ\\mathcal T_\\tau,\\qquad B=\\mathcal T_\\tau\\circ\\mathcal C_\\varepsilon.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.21（复合次序的差异公式）</strong> 在 A1、A2 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 均良定义（各自典型集非空）。则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$A(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}}{\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},\\qquad B(x)=\\frac{\\big(p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T_\\varepsilon}\\big)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_y\\big(p(y)\\mathbb 1_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon}\\big)^{1/\\tau}},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span>。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq T_\\varepsilon$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\neq B$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的表达式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_\\tau$</span> 后接 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_\\varepsilon$</span> 直接写出：先得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，再在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的信息量邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 上截断并重归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 在重归一化中约去，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的表达式：先对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 做典型截断得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T_\\varepsilon}/\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon}p(y)$</span>，再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 做温度变换。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 外为零，温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 外仍为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$0^{1/\\tau}=0$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)^{1/\\tau}\\propto p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span>（分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon}p(y)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 次幂为常数因子，在归一化中约去），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 式成立。支撑断言由指示函数位置直接读出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq T_\\varepsilon$</span> 的一般性由命题 5.11 的温度依赖性保证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时的典型集，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\neq 1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀即可使二者不同（例 5.6 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时二者相同，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 收缩而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 不变）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.22（不可交换性的质量损失差异）</strong> 在命题 5.21 的条件下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_A=\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}p_\\tau(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_B=\\sum_{y\\in T_\\varepsilon}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的质量损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的质量损失为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_B$</span>，且二者一般不等。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span>（低温）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 倾向于收缩（命题 5.11 例），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_A$</span> 可能小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_B$</span>，即“先升温后截断”比“先截断后升温”损失更多质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span>，其相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 保留的质量即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon(\\tau))=Z_A$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span>，保留质量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(T_\\varepsilon)=Z_B$</span>。二者不等由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)\\neq T_\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在差集上的正质量（A1）推出。低温收缩断言由命题 5.11 的构造例给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{0.4}(0.5)=\\varnothing$</span>（按 A2 约定退化为不截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_A=1$</span>），而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{0.4}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时）<span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\{x_1,x_2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_B=p_{0.5}(T_{0.4})=0.6579+0.2368=0.8947&lt;1$</span>，故此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_A&gt;Z_B$</span>，与“低温收缩”直觉相反——这正说明不可交换性的方向依赖具体分布与参数，不能一概而论。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.23</strong> 推论 5.22 的低温例子揭示了一个反直觉事实：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 为空时，A2 的空集约定使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 本身（不截断），质量损失为零，反而比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 损失更少。这说明“先温度后截断”与“先截断后温度”的优劣不能由温度高低单独判定，必须结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的信息量分布。工程上通常采用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的次序（先温度后截断），因为温度是全局缩放、截断是局部操作，先全局后局部符合计算图的自然顺序；但本节的分析表明这一选择并非无代价，其代价正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span> 的差异所导致的质量损失差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的梯度不存在性\">典型截断的梯度不存在性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的梯度不存在性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>典型采样作为“硬截断”，其截断指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1_{x\\in T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不连续，故典型截断分布关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的梯度在典型集边界处不存在。这一性质与第 13 节代码实现、第 14 节数值测量直接相关，在此给出精确陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.24（典型截断关于温度的分段光滑性）</strong> 在 A1 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau_0)$</span> 非空且对每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|I_{\\tau_0}(x)-H(p_{\\tau_0})|\\neq\\varepsilon$</span>（即无原子恰在典型集边界上）。则存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span>，使对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in U$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau_0)$</span> 为常集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 光滑（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 信息量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I_\\tau(x)=-\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span> 与熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的连续函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续，有限和与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 连续）。偏差函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_x(\\tau)=|I_\\tau(x)-H(p_\\tau)|$</span> 连续。由假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_x(\\tau_0)\\neq\\varepsilon$</span> 对每 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta=\\min_x|d_x(\\tau_0)-\\varepsilon|&gt;0$</span>（有限个正数取最小，正）。由连续性，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 的邻域 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|d_x(\\tau)-d_x(\\tau_0)|&lt;\\eta$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in U$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_x(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的大小关系在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$U$</span> 上不变，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 为常集。在此常集上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的光滑函数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 光滑，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}=\\exp(\\log p(x)/\\tau)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 光滑，归一化分母为正光滑），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}$</span> 光滑。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.25（边界处的梯度跳跃）</strong> 在命题 5.24 的假设下，若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}(\\tau_0)=\\varepsilon$</span>（边界原子），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ},\\varepsilon,\\tau}(x^\\ast)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 处不连续：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\tau_0^-$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\tau_0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 分别属于或不属于典型集，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x^\\ast)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 与正值之间跳跃。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}(\\tau_0)=\\varepsilon$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 两侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}(\\tau)$</span> 可大于或小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>（取决于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 的导数符号）。若左侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}&lt;\\varepsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast\\in T$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x^\\ast)=p_\\tau(x^\\ast)/Z_T&gt;0$</span>；右侧 <span class=\"math-inline\">$d_{x^\\ast}&gt;\\varepsilon$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast\\notin T$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\mathrm{typ}}(x^\\ast)=0$</span>。极限不等，故不连续。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.26</strong> 命题 5.24 与推论 5.25 共同刻画了典型采样的可微性结构：在“一般位置”（无原子恰在边界），典型截断关于温度分段光滑，可参与基于梯度的温度调节；在“边界位置”，梯度不存在，基于梯度的优化会失效或产生跳跃。这与第 13 节代码实现中“典型采样不可反向传播”的工程事实一致——硬截断的指示函数不可微，典型采样通常只用于推理阶段，不用于训练时的可微采样。相比之下，命题 5.9 的熵约束投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\mathrm{ent}}_{h,\\tau}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 光滑（幂变换光滑），可作为可微替代。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-典型截断的支撑基数上界\">典型截断的支撑基数上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-典型截断的支撑基数上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出典型集基数的一个组合上界，它把典型集大小与熵、截断半径联系起来，补足命题 5.2 只控制质量、不控制基数的缺口。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.27（典型集基数上界）</strong> 在 A1 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T=T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T=\\sum_{y\\in T}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$|T|\\ \\le\\ \\exp\\!\\Big(\\frac{H(p_\\tau)+\\varepsilon}{-\\log\\max_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)}\\Big),$$</div>\n更粗略地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|\\le\\exp\\big((H(p_\\tau)+\\varepsilon)/\\min_{x\\in T}I(x)\\big)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)=-\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)\\le H(p_\\tau)+\\varepsilon$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)-H\\le\\varepsilon$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=e^{-I(x)}\\ge e^{-(H+\\varepsilon)}$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_T=\\sum_{x\\in T}p_\\tau(x)\\ge|T|\\cdot e^{-(H+\\varepsilon)},$$</div>\n即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|T|\\le Z_T e^{H+\\varepsilon}\\le e^{H+\\varepsilon}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\le 1$</span>）。用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min_{x\\in T}I(x)$</span> 替代 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H+\\varepsilon$</span> 得第二式（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$I(x)\\le H+\\varepsilon$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in T$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-I(x)}\\ge e^{-(H+\\varepsilon)}$</span>，下界更强时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min I$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 5.28</strong> 命题 5.27 的上界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 大（高温、分布接近均匀）时宽松，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 小（低温、分布尖锐）时紧。它与命题 5.2 的质量下界互补：命题 5.2 说典型集至少承载 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-v/\\varepsilon^2$</span> 的质量，命题 5.27 说典型集至多有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{H+\\varepsilon}$</span> 个原子。二者联合给出典型截断的“质量—基数”权衡：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 增大时质量下界上升（命题 5.2）但基数上界指数上升（命题 5.27），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的选择需在保质量与控基数之间平衡。这一权衡在第 14 节数值测量中会以“典型集大小 vs 质量损失”的曲线形式呈现。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>典型集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的对数概率偏离熵的程度定义，其保留质量下界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p_\\tau)/\\varepsilon^2$</span>（命题 5.2），该下界由 Chebyshev 不等式给出，无需独立性假设。</li>\n<li>典型截断的 KL 偏差结构为“质量损失（发散）+ 条件化内部项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span>”（命题 5.4）；任何截掉正质量原子的截断都使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，有限量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_T\\log Z_T$</span> 仅为形式条件化项，不可误读为 KL。</li>\n<li>典型集与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合在一般分布下不可比较（命题 5.7），典型采样不保概率质量前缀，其截断准则依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 的联合作用；三元素例子（例 5.6）与可运行代码验证了上述恒等式与发散断言。</li>\n<li>典型截断的质量保留由命题 5.2 的下界与命题 5.18 的反向半径下界共同控制，二者构成 Chebyshev 型对偶；基数上界（命题 5.27）补足了质量控制不涉及支撑大小的缺口，三者的联合刻画了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 选择的“质量—基数”权衡。</li>\n<li>温度变换与典型截断不可交换（命题 5.21、推论 5.22），两种复合次序的支撑分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon(\\tau)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\varepsilon$</span>，质量损失差由差集上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 质量给出；低温下“先温度后截断”可能因空集约定退化为不截断而损失更少，方向依赖具体参数，不可一概而论。</li>\n<li>典型截断关于温度的分段光滑性（命题 5.24）与边界梯度跳跃（推论 5.25）精确刻画了硬截断的不可微结构：一般位置可微、边界处跳跃，这解释了典型采样只用于推理、不用于可微训练的工程事实，并与命题 5.9 的熵约束投影（光滑可微替代）形成对照。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-截断造成的-KL-偏差\">截断造成的 KL 偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断造成的-KL-偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 下的幂变换分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序排列的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素构成的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合（nucleus）。截断分布统一记为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)},\\qquad S\\in\\{S_k,S_p\\}.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span> 为保留质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S=\\mathcal X\\setminus S$</span> 为截断尾部，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\bar S}=\\sum_{y\\in\\bar S}p(y)=1-Z_S$</span>。本节需要以下正则性假设，逐条列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，故一切求和为有限和，无需可积性、控制收敛或 Fubini 条件；本节所有交换求和次序的操作均因有限性而合法。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 正性</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)$</span> 处处有定义，KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 不会因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，本节 A2 排除此情形在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的发生，但在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>——这正是本节要精确刻画的“支撑偏差”）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 排序良定</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的取值互不相同（无并列），故 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与 nucleus 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 唯一确定；若有并列，取任一确定的并列打破规则即可，结论不依赖于此。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 截断非平凡</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;Z_S&lt;1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 既非空集也非全集。<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>，KL 偏差为零，无讨论价值。</p>\n<p>本节的核心对象是 KL 偏差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{KL}}(S):=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>由 A2 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S$</span> 上为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{\\mathrm{KL}}(S)=+\\infty$</span> 对任何真截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span> 成立。因此“截断造成的 KL 偏差”必须区分为两个层次：(i) 支撑层面的无穷偏差；(ii) 在保留集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上条件化后的有限偏差。本节的主定理给出这两个层次的精确分解。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-1-截断-KL-的支撑分解\">1. 截断 KL 的支撑分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-1-截断-KL-的支撑分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（截断 KL 的支撑分解）</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span> 为非空真子集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的截断分布（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(S)=1$</span>）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty.$$</div>\n若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_S:=p\\mathbb 1_S/Z_S$</span>，发散来自尾部，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的有限部分为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}^{\\mathrm{fin}}(p\\|p_S):=\\sum_{x\\in S}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{p_S(x)}=Z_S\\log Z_S.$$</div>\n截断造成的总信息损失分解为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(S):=Z_S\\log Z_S+(1-Z_S)H(p_{\\bar S}),$$</div>\n其中第一项是保留集上的重标定代价，第二项是被丢弃尾部的条件熵；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 是可加诊断量，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 的有限部分。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\bar S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>（A2），故被加项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p(x)/0)=+\\infty$</span>，有限和中至少一项发散，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p>第二式：把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=Z_Sp_S+(1-Z_S)p_{\\bar S}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{p_S(x)}=Z_Sp_S(x)\\log Z_S,$$</div>\n求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S\\log Z_S$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_S=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p(x)/0)=+\\infty$</span>；因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_S)$</span> 整体发散，其有限部分只可能来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S\\log Z_S$</span>。</p>\n<p>第三式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 的两项分别对应两种不可逆操作。重标定把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的质量从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S$</span> 放大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内原子的对数密度增加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_S$</span>，按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 加权得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S\\log Z_S$</span>；丢弃把尾部质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-Z_S$</span> 归零，尾部自身的不确定性为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{\\bar S})$</span>，按被丢弃的质量加权得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-Z_S)H(p_{\\bar S})$</span>。两项量纲一致、可加，且都不含发散项。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注 1.1（为什么不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 当作 KL）</strong> 一个常见的误写是把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_S)$</span> 的有限部分写成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_S+(1-Z_S)H(p_{\\bar S})$</span>。这个表达式来自熵的分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=h(Z_S)+Z_SH(p_S)+(1-Z_S)H(p_{\\bar S})$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(Z_S)=-Z_S\\log Z_S-(1-Z_S)\\log(1-Z_S)$</span> 是二元熵；它与 KL 的有限部分相差一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-(1-Z_S)\\log(1-Z_S)$</span> 项，符号与量纲都不对。KL 的有限部分只计重标定代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S\\log Z_S$</span>，尾部熵属于另一个泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span>。把两者混同，会把“诊断量”误当成“变分目标”，从而在优化中错误地惩罚尾部熵而不是支撑缺失。</p>\n<p><strong>例 1.2（三点与四点分布）</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/4,1/4)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=3/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_S=(2/3,1/3,0)$</span>。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_S)=+\\infty$</span>，有限部分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(3/4)\\log(3/4)\\approx-0.2158$</span>；尾部是单点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{\\bar S})=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)\\approx-0.2158$</span>。若取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/4,1/8,1/8)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=3/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\bar S}=(1/2,1/2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{\\bar S})=\\log2\\approx0.6931$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)\\approx-0.2158+0.25\\cdot0.6931\\approx-0.0425$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 可以为负，因为它把重标定使密度变大的负对数代价与丢弃尾部熵的正代价相加；它不是 KL，KL 恒非负且此处为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>注 1.3（与相邻概念的区别）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 度量的是用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 时的期望对数损失比，因支撑缺失而为无穷；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 是有限的可加泛函，它把“重标定”与“丢弃”分开计价。二者不可混用：前者是变分目标，后者是诊断量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-2-top--k-截断的偏差精确表达式\">2. top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的偏差精确表达式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-2-top--k-截断的偏差精确表达式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 KL 有限部分与总信息损失）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{i=1}^k p_{(i)}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}\\ge\\cdots\\ge p_{(n)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序排列。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_k)=+\\infty,\\qquad \\mathcal L(S_k)=Z_k\\log Z_k+(1-Z_k)H\\big(p_{\\bar S_k}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{\\bar S_k})$</span> 可显式写为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H\\big(p_{\\bar S_k}\\big)=-\\sum_{i=k+1}^n\\frac{p_{(i)}}{1-Z_k}\\log\\frac{p_{(i)}}{1-Z_k}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一式由命题 1。第二式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\bar S_k}(i)=p_{(i)}/(1-Z_k)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$i&gt;k$</span>）直接代入熵定义，有限和（A1）保证无收敛问题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 偏差的单调性）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S_k)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不一定单调；但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\log Z_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\log t$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 上先减后增，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\ge e^{-1}$</span> 后递增）。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\ge e^{-1}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\log Z_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 递增。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调不减是定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$f(t)=t\\log t$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log t+1$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;e^{-1}$</span> 时为正。故当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\ge e^{-1}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(Z_k)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 递增，从而随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 递增。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>例 1（几何分布验证）</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,\\dots\\}$</span> 截断为有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(i)=(1-\\rho)\\rho^{i-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho\\in(0,1)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n=4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=1/2$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1/2,1/4,1/8,1/8)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2=3/4$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\bar S_2}=(1/2,1/2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_{\\bar S_2})=\\log 2$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(S_2)=\\frac34\\log\\frac34+\\frac14\\log 2.$$</div>\n<p>数值：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac34\\log\\frac34\\approx -0.2158$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac14\\log 2\\approx 0.1733$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L\\approx -0.0425$</span>。负值说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 不是非负泛函——它是“重标定代价 + 尾部熵”的代数和，重标定项可为负。这提醒我们 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 只能作为分解诊断，不能当作散度使用。验证：直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2\\log Z_2=\\frac34\\log\\frac34$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-Z_2)H=\\frac14\\log 2$</span>，相加得上述值。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-3-top--p-nucleus-截断的偏差\">3. top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（nucleus）截断的偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-3-top--p-nucleus-截断的偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（nucleus 的保留质量与偏差）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为最小集合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p=\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p\\ge p$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q_p)=+\\infty,\\qquad \\mathcal L(S_p)=Z_p\\log Z_p+(1-Z_p)H\\big(p_{\\bar S_p}\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p\\ge p$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 的定义。其余由命题 1 与命题 2 的同样计算，只需把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（nucleus 的过冲界）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span> 为最大概率质量，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p\\le Z_p\\le p+p_{(1)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n上界：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 的最小性意味着去掉其中任一元素后质量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&lt;p$</span>。特别地，去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 中质量最小的元素 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\ast$</span> 后，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p-p(x^\\ast)&lt;p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p&lt;p+p(x^\\ast)\\le p+p_{(1)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明 nucleus 的保留质量最多过冲一个最大原子，这是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 相对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 在重尾分布下可能截掉高概率质量的结构性原因（详见第 10 节反例）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-温度与截断的复合偏差\">4. 温度与截断的复合偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-温度与截断的复合偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>。若在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 上再做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_{\\tau,k}(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k^{(\\tau)}}}{\\sum_{y\\in S_k^{(\\tau)}}p_\\tau(y)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>：幂变换保序（<span class=\"math-inline\">$t\\mapsto t^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t&gt;0$</span> 上严格单调），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的排序完全一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}=S_k$</span>。这一点是幂变换的关键结构性质。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（温度不改变截断集合）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的排序相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}=S_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}=S_p$</span>（对同一阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，nucleus 集合可能因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 不同而不同，但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合不变）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\propto p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\mapsto u^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格递增（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;p(y)\\iff p_\\tau(x)&gt;p_\\tau(y)$</span>。由 A3 无并列，排序一致，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}=S_k$</span>。nucleus 集合依赖阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与累积和，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的累积和一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的累积和，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 可能不同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（复合截断的 KL 有限部分）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span>（与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关，由命题 4），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}=\\sum_{i=1}^k p_\\tau(i)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|q_{\\tau,k})=+\\infty,\\qquad \\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)=Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\log Z_k^{(\\tau)}+\\big(1-Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\big)H\\big(p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k}\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S_k$</span> 上的条件分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 应用命题 2，排序一致由命题 4 保证。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（低温下截断偏差的集中）</strong><br>\n在 (A1)–(A4) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 1$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\to 1$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}&gt;p_{(2)}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\log Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\to 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-Z_k^{(\\tau)})H(p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k})\\to 0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)\\to 0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span> 处的点质量（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}$</span> 严格最大，A3 保证），故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge 1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\to 1$</span>。连续性给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau\\to 0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论定量说明：低温下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的“额外偏差”消失，因为分布本身已近似点质量，截断不再丢弃有效质量；但这也正是第 7 节模式崩溃的机制来源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-6-截断偏差的全变差上界与-KL-的二次型展开\">6. 截断偏差的全变差上界与 KL 的二次型展开<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-6-截断偏差的全变差上界与-KL-的二次型展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 指出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)$</span> 因支撑缺失而发散，故任何有意义的“偏差”度量必须在支撑相同的分布对上定义。本节引入两个辅助量：全变差距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}(p\\|q)=\\frac12\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|$</span> 与截断后重新归一的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde q(x)=Z_S^{-1}p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 本身）。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 成比例，差异仅在于尾部质量的处理方式。下面的命题给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 的精确值与 KL 在“无支撑缺失”情形下的二次型展开，用于对照。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（截断的全变差距离）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为非空真子集，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的截断分布。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}(p\\|q)=1-Z_S=p_{\\bar S}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)/Z_S\\ge p(x)$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S&lt;1$</span>，由 A4）；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\bar S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0&lt;p(x)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x|p(x)-q(x)|=\\sum_{x\\in S}\\Big(\\frac{p(x)}{Z_S}-p(x)\\Big)+\\sum_{x\\in\\bar S}p(x).$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\sum_{x\\in S}p(x)\\big(Z_S^{-1}-1\\big)=Z_S\\big(Z_S^{-1}-1\\big)=1-Z_S$</span>。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1-Z_S$</span>。相加得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2(1-Z_S)$</span>，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明全变差距离恰等于被丢弃的质量，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的内部结构无关——这是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 作为截断偏差度量的一个优点：它对尾部形状不敏感，只对丢弃质量敏感。但其代价是丢失了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 中“尾部熵”这一项的信息。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（无支撑缺失时的 KL 二次型展开）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑相同（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的任意同支撑扰动，例如温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_x|q(x)/p(x)-1|=\\varepsilon&lt;1$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=\\frac12\\sum_x\\frac{(q(x)-p(x))^2}{p(x)}+O(\\varepsilon^3),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon^3)$</span> 的常数仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span>（A1）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(x)=q(x)/p(x)-1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta(x)|\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+\\delta)=\\delta-\\frac12\\delta^2+\\frac13\\delta^3-\\cdots$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p(1+\\delta)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p(x)}=-\\sum_x p(x)\\log(1+\\delta(x)).$$</div>\n<p>代入展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$=-\\sum_x p(x)\\Big(\\delta(x)-\\frac12\\delta(x)^2+\\frac13\\delta(x)^3-\\cdots\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>第一项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_x p(x)\\delta(x)=-\\sum_x(q(x)-p(x))=0$</span>（两边均为概率分布）。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac12\\sum_x p(x)\\delta(x)^2=\\frac12\\sum_x\\frac{(q(x)-p(x))^2}{p(x)}$</span>。第三项及更高阶由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta|\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span> 控制为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon^3)$</span>，常数含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 因有限和（A1）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此展开是本节与第 11 节“采样温度与校准”的接口：温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_\\tau)$</span> 有限且可由命题 7 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\approx 1$</span> 附近展开；而截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑不同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}$</span> 发散，只能用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}$</span> 度量。这一区分是本节的核心结构性结论。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（温度变换的 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处的二阶行为）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 为温度变换，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处取最小值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|p_\\tau)=\\frac{(\\tau-1)^2}{2}\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)+O\\big((\\tau-1)^3\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)=\\sum_x p(x)(\\log p(x))^2-\\big(\\sum_x p(x)\\log p(x)\\big)^2$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的方差。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n由命题 7，只需计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 附近的一阶、二阶变分。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=e^{L(x)/\\tau}/Z(\\tau)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\tau)=\\sum_y e^{L(y)/\\tau}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(1)=1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 已归一），且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\Big|_{\\tau=1}\\frac{L(x)}{\\tau}=-\\frac{L(x)}{\\tau^2}\\Big|_{\\tau=1}=-L(x),\\qquad \\frac{d^2}{d\\tau^2}\\Big|_{\\tau=1}\\frac{L(x)}{\\tau}=\\frac{2L(x)}{\\tau^3}\\Big|_{\\tau=1}=2L(x).$$</div>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z(\\tau)$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'(\\tau)=-\\tau^{-2}\\sum_y L(y)e^{L(y)/\\tau}$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'(1)=-\\sum_y p(y)L(y)=-E_p[L]$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\log Z\\big|_{\\tau=1}=-E_p[L]$</span>。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}\\Big|_{\\tau=1}\\log p_\\tau(x)=-L(x)+E_p[L]=-(L(x)-E_p[L]),$$</div>\n<p>即一阶变分为中心化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span>。二阶变分同理给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d^2}{d\\tau^2}\\big|_{\\tau=1}\\log p_\\tau(x)=2(L(x)-E_p[L])+\\text{常数}$</span>，常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 的二阶导数确定并使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)\\cdot$</span>（二阶变分）<span class=\"math-inline\">$=0$</span>（概率归一约束）。代入命题 7 的二次型：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_x p(x)\\big(\\delta(x)\\big)^2$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta(x)\\approx(\\tau-1)\\cdot\\big(-(L(x)-E_p[L])\\big)$</span>，故二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\frac{(\\tau-1)^2}{2}\\sum_x p(x)(L(x)-E_p[L])^2=\\frac{(\\tau-1)^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把温度变换的局部偏差与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的方差联系起来：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的方差越大（分布越“尖”），温度偏离 1 造成的 KL 代价越大。这与第 2 节“温度对熵与支撑的影响”中熵对温度的导数公式互为对偶。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-7-截断偏差的可加性与链式法则\">7. 截断偏差的可加性与链式法则<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-7-截断偏差的可加性与链式法则\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个结构性恒等式，把“先温度后截断”与“先截断后温度”的偏差联系起来，为第 12 节“截断与无偏采样的取舍”提供代数基础。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（截断与温度的交换代价）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span>（由命题 4 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关）。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\tau,k}$</span> 为“先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 再 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断”的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{k,\\tau}$</span> 为“先 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 再对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 做温度变换”的分布。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_{\\tau,k}(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},\\qquad q_{k,\\tau}(x)=\\frac{\\big(p(x)/Z_k\\big)^{1/\\tau}\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}\\big(p(y)/Z_k\\big)^{1/\\tau}}=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\tau,k}=q_{k,\\tau}$</span> 恒成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的定义与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}=S_k$</span>（命题 4）。第二式中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 在分子分母中同幂次出现，约去：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(p(x)/Z_k\\big)^{1/\\tau}=p(x)^{1/\\tau}Z_k^{-1/\\tau}$</span>，分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{1/\\tau}$</span> 即得与第一式相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明温度变换与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上可交换，代价为零；但二者与 nucleus 截断不可交换，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>（命题 4 已指出）。这一非交换性是第 10 节反例的代数根源：nucleus 的阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在温度变换下对应的累积和质量改变，导致截断集合漂移。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 5（复合截断偏差的链式分解）</strong><br>\n假设 (A1)–(A4)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)=\\underbrace{Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\log Z_k^{(\\tau)}}_{\\text{重标定}}+\\underbrace{\\big(1-Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\big)H\\big(p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k}\\big)}_{\\text{尾部熵}},$$</div>\n<p>且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\to k/n$</span>（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S_k$</span> 上的几何均值可比），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)$</span> 趋于一个由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k/n$</span> 与尾部均匀熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n-k)$</span> 决定的极限。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong><br>\n第一式即命题 5。极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to$</span> 均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/n$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\to 1$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}\\to k/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k}\\to$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S_k$</span> 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to\\log(n-k)$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau$</span> 得极限值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac kn\\log\\frac kn+\\big(1-\\frac kn\\big)\\log(n-k)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论与推论 3（低温极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau\\to 0$</span>）构成温度两端的行为对照：低温下截断偏差消失（分布已近似点质量），高温下截断偏差趋于一个仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k/n$</span> 决定的饱和值（分布已近似均匀，截断等价于随机丢弃 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-k$</span> 个原子）。两端之间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)$</span> 的行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的谱（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的分布）决定，这正是第 11 节校准讨论的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>例 2（均匀分布下的饱和值验证）</strong><br>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,8\\}$</span> 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=4$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>（均匀分布是幂变换的不动点），<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k^{(\\tau)}=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,\\bar S_k}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar S_k$</span> 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=\\log 4$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal L(S_4)=\\frac12\\log\\frac12+\\frac12\\log 4=-\\frac12\\log 2+\\log 2=\\frac12\\log 2\\approx 0.3466.$$</div>\n<p>与推论 5 的极限公式一致（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k/n=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n-k=4$</span>）。此例说明：即使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身均匀，截断仍造成正的重标定代价与正的尾部熵，二者相加为正——与例 1 中几何分布给出负值形成对照，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L$</span> 的符号依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的形状，不可作为散度使用。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>任何真截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在尾部为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为正；有限诊断量应取可加分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L(S)=Z_S\\log Z_S+(1-Z_S)H(p_{\\bar S})$</span>，它把“保留集重标定代价”与“丢弃尾部熵”分开计价，不可与 KL 混用。</li>\n<li>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 nucleus 的偏差由同一公式给出，仅保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S$</span> 不同；nucleus 的保留质量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\le Z_p\\le p+p_{(1)}$</span>，过冲至多一个最大原子，这是其在重尾下可能截掉高概率质量的结构根源。</li>\n<li>幂变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 严格保序，故温度不改变 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合；复合截断的有限偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时趋于零，定量刻画了低温下截断“无额外偏差”与模式崩溃的同源机制。</li>\n<li>截断偏差必须在两个层次上区分：支撑缺失使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\|q)=+\\infty$</span>，而同支撑扰动（如温度变换）的 KL 有限且由命题 7 的二次型 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac12\\sum_x(q-p)^2/p$</span> 在局部精确刻画；全变差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{TV}}(p\\|q)=1-Z_S$</span> 只度量丢弃质量，对尾部形状不敏感。</li>\n<li>温度变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处的 KL 二阶行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)$</span> 决定（推论 4），把“分布尖锐度”与“温度偏离代价”定量联系；温度与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上可交换（命题 8），但与 nucleus 截断不可交换，后者是重尾反例的代数根源。</li>\n<li>复合截断的有限偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal L_\\tau(S_k)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 趋于零、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 趋于由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k/n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n-k)$</span> 决定的饱和值（推论 5），两端行为分别对应模式崩溃与均匀化，中间行为由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的谱决定，构成第 11 节校准分析的代数基础。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-低温退化的模式崩溃\">低温退化的模式崩溃<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-低温退化的模式崩溃\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号，并在此集中列出本节所用记号及其含义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal F)$</span> 为有限或可数离散可测空间，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span> 成立（本节始终假设满支撑，若支撑不满则以下论证限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p$</span> 上）。</li>\n<li>温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，温度变换后的分布为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div></li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_{y}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为幂变换的配分函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\tfrac1\\tau\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。</li>\n<li>熵泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mu)=-\\sum_x \\mu(x)\\log\\mu(x)$</span>，KL 散度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\mu\\|\\nu)=\\sum_x\\mu(x)\\log\\frac{\\mu(x)}{\\nu(x)}$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star\\in\\arg\\max_{x}p(x)$</span> 为众数点，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=p(x^\\star)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=|\\mathcal X|$</span> 为状态数（有限情形）。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的极限，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M=\\arg\\max_x p(x)$</span> 为众数集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal M|=r$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需的正则性假设如下，后续每个命题将显式引用。</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限状态与满支撑。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m&lt;\\infty$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。此假设保证所有幂 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 有定义且配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 是良定义的概率分布；同时保证对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的求导可在有限和号下逐项进行（有限和号的求导无需 Dominated Convergence，只需 Leibniz 法则的有限版本）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 众数唯一性（用于定理 1 的精确极限）。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal M|=1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}$</span> 唯一取得。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal M|=r\\ge2$</span> 时，极限分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上的均匀分布，这一情形在推论 1 中单独陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 温度单调性（用于熵的单调性）。</strong> 无需额外假设，因 (A1) 已保证有限和号下的一切操作合法。</p>\n<p>下面先给出本节核心定义，再陈述并证明主定理。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-定义-低温退化与模式崩溃\">定义：低温退化与模式崩溃<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-定义-低温退化与模式崩溃\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 1（低温退化）。</strong> 称温度变换族 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{p_\\tau\\}_{\\tau&gt;0}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时发生低温退化，若存在概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在总变差距离下收敛于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span>，即\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\|p_\\tau-p_0\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\sup_{A\\in\\mathcal F}|p_\\tau(A)-p_0(A)|=0.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>定义 2（模式崩溃）。</strong> 称低温退化发生模式崩溃，若极限分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 的支撑严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p_0\\subsetneq\\operatorname{supp}p$</span>。等价地，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p>这两个定义的区别在于：低温退化只要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 有极限，而模式崩溃进一步要求极限分布丢失了原分布的正概率质量。一个分布族可以低温退化而不发生模式崩溃（例如当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身是均匀分布时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，极限仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，支撑不变）。模式崩溃是低温退化的一种特殊且极端的形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-主定理-低温极限的精确刻画\">主定理：低温极限的精确刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-主定理-低温极限的精确刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 1（低温极限的集中性）。</strong> 在假设 (A1)、(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\left(\\frac{p(y)}{p_{\\max}}\\right)^{1/\\tau}}\\cdot\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{p_{\\max}^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^\\star$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to0$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\|p_\\tau-\\delta_{x^\\star}\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 处的点质量。因此低温退化在 (A2) 下必然发生模式崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为有限正和。将分子分母同除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{\\left(\\frac{p(x)}{p_{\\max}}\\right)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y}\\left(\\frac{p(y)}{p_{\\max}}\\right)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y=x^\\star$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{p(x^\\star)}{p_{\\max}}=1$</span>，故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\ne x^\\star$</span>，由 (A2) 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{p(y)}{p_{\\max}}&lt;1$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_y=\\frac{p(y)}{p_{\\max}}\\in(0,1)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{\\rho_x^{1/\\tau}}{1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}},$$</div>\n其中约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_{x^\\star}=1$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^\\star$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to+\\infty$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\rho_x&lt;1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_x^{1/\\tau}\\to0$</span>（这是实数的标准极限：底数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1)$</span> 内，指数趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>）。同理每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\ne x^\\star$</span>）。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\to1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to0$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x=x^\\star$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，分母趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to1$</span>。</p>\n<p>总变差距离对离散分布有恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_\\tau-\\delta_{x^\\star}\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=\\frac12\\sum_x|p_\\tau(x)-\\delta_{x^\\star}(x)|=1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\le1$</span> 且其余项非负，绝对值和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)+p_\\tau(x^\\star)=1$</span> 的一半再减去…直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x|p_\\tau(x)-\\delta_{x^\\star}(x)|=|p_\\tau(x^\\star)-1|+\\sum_{x\\ne x^\\star}p_\\tau(x)=(1-p_\\tau(x^\\star))+(1-p_\\tau(x^\\star))=2(1-p_\\tau(x^\\star))$</span>，故 TV 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)$</span>）。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to1$</span> 得 TV 距离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>。极限分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}p=\\mathcal X$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m\\ge2$</span>（否则 (A2) 无意义），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span>，模式崩溃成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（众数不唯一的情形）。</strong> 在 (A1) 下若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal M|=r\\ge2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上趋于均匀分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1r\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal M}\\delta_x$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 外趋于零，TV 距离趋于零，模式崩溃同样发生（极限支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_x=1$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin\\mathcal M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_x&lt;1$</span>，分子趋于零。分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r+\\sum_{y\\notin\\mathcal M}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\to r$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to1/r$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal M$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to0$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin\\mathcal M$</span>。TV 距离计算同定理 1。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-熵的单调性与低温熵塌缩\">熵的单调性与低温熵塌缩<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-熵的单调性与低温熵塌缩\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（温度对熵的单调影响）。</strong> 在 (A1) 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto H(p_\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上单调不减；且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}H(p_\\tau)=\\log m,\\qquad \\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}H(p_\\tau)=H(p_0),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为定理 1 或推论 1 给出的极限分布，故低温极限熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（众数唯一时）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span>（众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 个时）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 首先计算熵对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的导数。由 (A1) 有限和号，可逐项求导。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac1\\tau L(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}\\log Z_\\tau=\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}\\log\\sum_y e^{L(y)/\\tau}=\\frac{\\sum_y e^{L(y)/\\tau}\\cdot(-\\frac{L(y)}{\\tau^2})}{Z_\\tau}=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_y p_\\tau(y)L(y)=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[L].$$</div>\n于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)=-\\frac{L(x)}{\\tau^2}+\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[L]=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\left(\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[L]-L(x)\\right).$$</div>\n熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>。对其求导，注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x \\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}p_\\tau(x)=0$</span>（概率归一化），故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=-\\sum_x\\frac{\\mathrm d p_\\tau}{\\mathrm d\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)-\\sum_x\\frac{\\mathrm d p_\\tau}{\\mathrm d\\tau}.$$</div>\n第二项为零。第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d p_\\tau}{\\mathrm d\\tau}=p_\\tau(x)\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>，代入得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\left(\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[L]-L(x)\\right)\\log p_\\tau(x).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[L]=\\bar L$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(L(x)-\\bar L)\\log p_\\tau(x).$$</div>\n另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac1\\tau L(x)-\\log Z_\\tau=\\frac1\\tau(L(x)-\\bar L)+\\frac1\\tau\\bar L-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1\\tau\\bar L-\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(L(x)-\\bar L)=0$</span>，故在求和中该项消失：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(L(x)-\\bar L)\\cdot\\frac1\\tau(L(x)-\\bar L)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^3}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(L(x)-\\bar L)^2=\\frac{1}{\\tau^3}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(L)\\ge0.$$</div>\n方差非负，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)\\ge0$</span>，熵关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不减。</p>\n<p>极限行为：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\to1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to$</span> 均匀分布，熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\log m$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时由定理 1 与推论 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to p_0$</span>，熵的连续性（有限状态上熵连续）给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to H(p_0)$</span>。众数唯一时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0=\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=0$</span>；众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 个时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_0$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal M$</span> 上均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H=\\log r$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注（一种常见的误算）。</strong> 常有人将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)$</span> 误算为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(L)$</span>（少一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子），原因是在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac1\\tau(L(x)-\\bar L)+\\text{常数}$</span> 中漏掉了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x)-\\bar L$</span> 的缩放。正确结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{\\tau^3}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(L)$</span>，量纲上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的三次方出现在分母，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时熵导数发散（熵塌缩加速）的直觉一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-模式崩溃的质量损失刻画\">模式崩溃的质量损失刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-模式崩溃的质量损失刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（低温下被丢弃质量的精确表达式）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，非众数点的总质量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)=\\frac{\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}}{1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_y=p(y)/p_{\\max}\\in(0,1)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时该质量以指数速率趋于零：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0&gt;0$</span> 使得对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\tau_0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\le (m-1)\\max_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\le (m-1)e^{-\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\min_{y\\ne x^\\star}|\\log\\rho_y|}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 第一式由定理 1 的证明直接得到（分母减分子）。指数界：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\ne x^\\star$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}=e^{\\frac1\\tau\\log\\rho_y}=e^{-\\frac1\\tau|\\log\\rho_y|}$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\rho_y&lt;0$</span>）。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min_{y\\ne x^\\star}|\\log\\rho_y|&gt;0$</span>（有限集合上的正最小值，由 (A2) 保证每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\rho_y|&gt;0$</span>）。则每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\le e^{-\\delta/\\tau}$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\le(m-1)e^{-\\delta/\\tau}$</span>。分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\le(m-1)e^{-\\delta/\\tau}$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(m-1)e^{-\\delta/\\tau_0}&lt;\\varepsilon$</span> 即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 给出了模式崩溃的定量速率：非众数质量以指数速度消失，速率常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 由最接近众数的次众数点决定。这解释了为什么低温采样在实践中迅速退化为几乎确定性的输出：即使次众数点的概率只比众数低一个很小的相对量，其质量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 足够小时也会被指数压制。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-具体例子-三状态分布的模式崩溃轨迹\">具体例子：三状态分布的模式崩溃轨迹<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-具体例子-三状态分布的模式崩溃轨迹\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=0.1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_a=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_b=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho_c=1/6$</span>。由定理 1，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(a)=\\frac{1}{1+0.5^{1/\\tau}+(1/6)^{1/\\tau}},\\quad p_\\tau(b)=\\frac{0.5^{1/\\tau}}{1+0.5^{1/\\tau}+(1/6)^{1/\\tau}},\\quad p_\\tau(c)=\\frac{(1/6)^{1/\\tau}}{1+0.5^{1/\\tau}+(1/6)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5^2=0.25$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/6)^2\\approx0.0278$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1.2778$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}(a)\\approx0.7826$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}(b)\\approx0.1957$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}(c)\\approx0.0217$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5^{10}\\approx9.77\\times10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1/6)^{10}\\approx1.65\\times10^{-8}$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx1.000977$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.1}(a)\\approx0.99902$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.1}(b)\\approx9.76\\times10^{-4}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.1}(c)\\approx1.65\\times10^{-8}$</span>。可见 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的质量在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.1$</span> 时已被压制到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-8}$</span> 量级，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 仍保留约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>。这与命题 3 的指数界一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min(|\\log0.5|,|\\log(1/6)|)=|\\log(1/6)|\\approx1.792$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的衰减速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta$</span> 控制，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的衰减速率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log0.5|\\approx0.693$</span> 控制，后者较慢，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 是最后被丢弃的非众数点。这正是模式崩溃的“最后幸存者”现象：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 逐步降低时，概率质量按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log\\rho_y|$</span> 从大到小的顺序依次被清除，次众数点最后消失。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-模式崩溃的-KL-散度刻画\">模式崩溃的 KL 散度刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-模式崩溃的-KL-散度刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立截断造成的 KL 偏差的一般表达式，此处将其专门化到低温极限，给出模式崩溃在信息几何意义下的精确度量。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为原分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 为温度变换后的分布，二者均满足 (A1)。定义低温偏差量\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau):=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\sum_{x}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n注意方向：我们度量的是采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 相对于目标分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差，这正是低温采样偏离原始模型的程度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（低温 KL 偏差的发散）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)$</span> 满足如下恒等式与极限行为：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}H(p_\\tau)-H(p_\\tau)-\\log Z_\\tau,$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)\\to+\\infty$</span>，发散速率满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\tau\\, D(\\tau)=\\log\\frac{1}{p_{\\max}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span> 取对数得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac1\\tau\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，移项得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}=\\frac1\\tau\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau-\\log p(x)=\\left(\\frac1\\tau-1\\right)\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 取期望：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=\\left(\\frac1\\tau-1\\right)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac1\\tau\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)=\\tau(\\log p_\\tau(x)+\\log Z_\\tau)$</span>，代入上式：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=\\left(\\frac1\\tau-1\\right)\\tau\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(\\log p_\\tau(x)+\\log Z_\\tau)-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n展开第一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left(\\frac1\\tau-1\\right)\\tau=1-\\tau$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=(1-\\tau)\\left(-H(p_\\tau)+\\log Z_\\tau\\right)-\\log Z_\\tau=(1-\\tau)(-H(p_\\tau))+(1-\\tau)\\log Z_\\tau-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=-(1-\\tau)H(p_\\tau)-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau=\\frac{1}{\\tau}H(p_\\tau)-H(p_\\tau)-\\log Z_\\tau\\cdot\\tau\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\cdot\\tau.$$</div>\n最后一项的系数按如下计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-\\tau)\\log Z_\\tau-\\log Z_\\tau=\\log Z_\\tau-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau-\\log Z_\\tau=-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=-(1-\\tau)H(p_\\tau)-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau=(\\tau-1)H(p_\\tau)-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n将其改写为便于取极限的形式。由定理 1 的证明，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=p_{\\max}^{1/\\tau}\\left(1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\right)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log Z_\\tau=\\frac1\\tau\\log p_{\\max}+\\log\\left(1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\right).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\log1=0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\log Z_\\tau\\to\\log p_{\\max}$</span>。又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to0$</span>（定理 1 与命题 2），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau-1)H(p_\\tau)\\to0$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}D(\\tau)=\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\left[(\\tau-1)H(p_\\tau)-\\tau\\log Z_\\tau\\right]=0-\\log p_{\\max}=\\log\\frac{1}{p_{\\max}}&gt;0.$$</div>\n注意，这个极限是有限正数，与命题陈述的“<span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)\\to+\\infty$</span>”矛盾。问题出在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau-1)H(p_\\tau)$</span> 这一项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to0$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau-1\\to-1$</span>，乘积趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，确实有限。然而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)$</span> 的原始表达式含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 因子，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 以何种速率趋于零时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1\\tau H(p_\\tau)$</span> 可能发散。重新审视恒等式：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau=\\frac1\\tau\\log p-\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 直接计算\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D(\\tau)=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\left[\\frac1\\tau\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau-\\log p(x)\\right]=\\frac1\\tau\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau.$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p(x)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\to\\log p(x^\\star)=\\log p_{\\max}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1\\tau\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\to\\frac{\\log p_{\\max}}{\\tau}\\to-\\infty$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_{\\max}&lt;0$</span>）。同时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\to-\\log p_{\\max}$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_\\tau\\sim-\\frac1\\tau\\log p_{\\max}\\to+\\infty$</span>。两项发散部分相消：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac1\\tau\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau=\\frac1\\tau\\left(\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log p_{\\max}\\right)-\\log\\left(1+\\sum_{y\\ne x^\\star}\\rho_y^{1/\\tau}\\right).$$</div>\n第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]-\\log p_{\\max}=\\sum_{x\\ne x^\\star}p_\\tau(x)(\\log p(x)-\\log p_{\\max})\\le0$</span>，其量级为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)$</span> 乘以有界对数差，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\sim\\rho_x^{1/\\tau}$</span> 指数小，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac1\\tau$</span> 乘指数小量仍趋于零。第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1+\\sum\\rho_y^{1/\\tau})\\to0$</span>。因此\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}D(\\tau)=\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\left[-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\log p]\\right]=-\\log p_{\\max}=\\log\\frac{1}{p_{\\max}}.$$</div>\n所以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)$</span> 收敛到有限正数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/p_{\\max})$</span>，而非发散。命题 4 的陈述需据此更正：正确的结论是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)\\to\\log(1/p_{\\max})$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau D(\\tau)\\to0$</span>。这说明低温 KL 偏差并不发散，而是稳定到一个由众数概率决定的正值；模式崩溃的信息代价是有限的，等于“把全部质量押在众数上”所损失的对数似然。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}D(\\tau)=\\log\\frac{1}{p_{\\max}},\\qquad \\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}\\tau D(\\tau)=0.$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(u\\|p)=\\log m-H(p)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 为均匀分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 低温极限已如上推导。高温极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to u$</span>（均匀分布），由 KL 对第一个变量的连续性（有限状态，<span class=\"math-inline\">$u$</span> 满支撑）得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D(\\tau)\\to\\mathrm{KL}(u\\|p)=\\sum_x\\frac1m\\log\\frac{1/m}{p(x)}=\\log m-\\frac1m\\sum_x\\log p(x)=\\log m-H(p)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一结果与命题 3 形成对照：命题 3 说非众数质量指数消失，而命题 4 说这种消失造成的信息代价是有限的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/p_{\\max})$</span>。二者的相容性在于，KL 偏差度量的是“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样”的对数似然损失，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 几乎确定地取众数时，损失就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_{\\max}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-模式崩溃的不可逆性与温度回退\">模式崩溃的不可逆性与温度回退<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-模式崩溃的不可逆性与温度回退\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>一个自然的问题是：低温退化造成的模式崩溃能否通过升温逆转？即在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小时采样得到众数后，再将温度调回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，能否恢复原分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>？答案取决于我们持有的是分布还是样本。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（分布层面的可逆性）。</strong> 在 (A1) 下，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_\\tau:p\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 是单射，其逆映射为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T_{1/\\tau}$</span> 的复合：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_\\tau)_{1/\\tau}=p$</span>。因此分布层面的低温变换是可逆的，模式崩溃在分布层面不丢失信息。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_\\tau)_{1/\\tau}(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)^{\\tau}}{\\sum_y p_\\tau(y)^{\\tau}}$</span>。代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，分子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/Z_\\tau^\\tau$</span>，分母为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_y p(y)/Z_\\tau^\\tau=1/Z_\\tau^\\tau$</span>，故结果为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（样本层面的不可逆性）。</strong> 设从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小）独立采样 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span>。以高概率这些样本全部等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span>，此时样本经验分布为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 TV 距离为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p(x^\\star)$</span>。无论后续如何升温，经验分布无法恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的非众数质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\ge1-(m-1)e^{-\\delta/\\tau}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 个样本全为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^\\star$</span> 的概率至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-(m-1)e^{-\\delta/\\tau})^n$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 足够小时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>。此时经验分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat p_n=\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|\\hat p_n-p\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=1-p(x^\\star)$</span>（离散分布 TV 距离等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 减去重叠质量）。升温只对分布做幂变换，不改变经验分布。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 与命题 6 的区别正是“分布偏差”与“采样偏差”的区别：低温变换在分布层面是双射，但在样本层面，一旦采样完成，非众数质量的信息已经丢失，无法通过任何后处理恢复。这解释了为什么低温采样的模式崩溃在实践中表现为不可逆的输出退化：模型本身没有改变，但采样过程丢弃了分布的尾部信息。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-模式崩溃与截断采样的耦合\">模式崩溃与截断采样的耦合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-模式崩溃与截断采样的耦合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已给出 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断的精确分布。本节最后考察低温与截断的耦合效应：当温度降低时，截断集合如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化，以及截断是否加速模式崩溃。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（低温下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合的稳定性）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k&gt;0$</span> 使得对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\tau_k$</span>，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k(\\tau)=\\arg\\max_{|S|=k}\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau(x)$</span> 等于原分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>。即低温不改变截断集合的排序，只放大排序的差距。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 排序由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span> 决定，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 严格单调递增（底数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau&gt;0$</span>）。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的排序与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的排序完全一致，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 成立。top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合由排序的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 名决定，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k(\\tau)=S_k$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 成立，无需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 说明 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断与温度变换可交换：先降温再取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与先取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 再降温得到相同的截断集合。但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断不同，因为其集合由累积质量阈值决定，而累积质量随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（低温下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合的收缩）。</strong> 在 (A1)、(A2) 下，对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下满足累积质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增（按包含关系），且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(\\tau)=\\{x^\\star\\}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 由定理 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\to1$</span>。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;1$</span>，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^\\star)\\ge p$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\tau_0$</span> 成立，此时最小集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}$</span>。单调性：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\tau_2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}$</span> 比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_2}$</span> 更集中（由命题 2 熵单调性，低温熵更小，质量更集中），故达到阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 所需的最小集合更小，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(\\tau_1)\\subseteq S_p(\\tau_2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 揭示了低温与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的耦合危险：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很小时，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断集合收缩为单点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}$</span>，此时截断后的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，与温度变换本身的极限一致。换言之，低温已经使分布退化，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断在此之上不再提供额外保护，反而可能因阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的设置而进一步丢弃本已微小的非众数质量。这与前序节“截断造成的 KL 偏差”一致：低温下截断的 KL 偏差趋于零（因为截断集合外的质量已指数小），但截断集合内的分布仍由温度变换主导。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>低温退化的极限分布由众数集合决定：众数唯一时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^\\star}$</span>，众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 个时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\mathcal M$</span> 上的均匀分布；两种情形下极限支撑都严格小于原支撑，故低温退化必然伴随模式崩溃（定理 1、推论 1）。</li>\n<li>熵关于温度单调不减，且导数有精确表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\mathrm d}{\\mathrm d\\tau}H(p_\\tau)=\\tau^{-3}\\operatorname{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\log p)$</span>；低温极限熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log r$</span>，高温极限熵为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m$</span>（命题 2）。</li>\n<li>非众数质量以指数速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(-\\delta/\\tau)$</span> 消失，速率常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta=\\min_{y\\ne x^\\star}|\\log(p(y)/p_{\\max})|$</span> 由次众数点决定；这给出了模式崩溃的定量刻画，并解释了低温采样中“最后幸存者”依次被清除的现象（命题 3）。</li>\n<li>低温 KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 收敛到有限值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/p_{\\max})$</span> 而非发散，模式崩溃的信息代价由众数概率决定；高温极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log m-H(p)$</span>（命题 4）。</li>\n<li>分布层面的温度变换可逆（<span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_\\tau)_{1/\\tau}=p$</span>），但样本层面的模式崩溃不可逆：低温采样一旦完成，非众数质量的信息已丢失，升温无法恢复（命题 5、命题 6）。</li>\n<li>低温与截断的耦合：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合在所有温度下与原分布排序一致，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合随温度降低单调收缩至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x^\\star\\}$</span>，低温下截断不再提供额外保护（命题 7、命题 8）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-高温采样的方差\">高温采样的方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-高温采样的方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑集 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span>；温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>；温度变换分布\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal V}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为配分函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/\\tau$</span> 为逆温度。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\cdot]=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)(\\cdot)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的期望，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\cdot)$</span> 为相应方差。对任意实值统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span>，记其在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下的均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu_f=\\sum_x p(x)f(x)$</span>、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_f^2=\\sum_x p(x)(f(x)-\\mu_f)^2$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节假设：\n(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，各阶矩有限。\n(A2) 当需要关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(\\tau_0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0&gt;0$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)$</span> 有界（有限支撑），配分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tau_0,\\infty)$</span> 上光滑且可逐项求导（有限和，无需交换极限）。\n(A3) 当陈述“<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限”时，指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 沿正实数，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to0^+$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节核心对象是统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在高温分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(f)$</span>，它与低温行为（第 7 节模式崩溃）形成对偶：低温使方差趋于零（分布坍缩到众数），高温使方差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 之下的方差并在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span> 的一个显式上界结构。本节要精确刻画这一极限速率与单调性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-定义-高温方差与参照方差\">定义：高温方差与参照方差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-定义-高温方差与参照方差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>对统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>，定义高温方差\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau):=\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(f)=\\mathbb E_\\tau[f^2]-\\big(\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]\\big)^2,$$</div>\n参照方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\infty):=\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)=\\sigma_f^2$</span>。这里“高温”指 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 小。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 与第 6 节 KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 是不同量：前者是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的离散程度，后者是分布间的信息散度；二者通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span> 时有恒等关系（见推论 2），但一般情形不可混同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-1-高温极限与一阶展开\">命题 1（高温极限与一阶展开）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-1-高温极限与一阶展开\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A3)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 任意，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g(x)=f(x)-\\mu_f$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)g(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\longrightarrow \\sigma_f^2,$$</div>\n且存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f&lt;\\infty$</span>（仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,f$</span>）使得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2\\big|\\le \\frac{C_f}{\\tau},\\qquad \\tau\\ge 1.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=1/\\tau$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 写为指数族形式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)e^{\\beta\\log p(x)}}{Z_\\tau},\\qquad Z_\\tau=\\sum_y p(y)e^{\\beta\\log p(y)}.$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=0$</span> 处，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_0=1$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_\\tau=1+\\beta\\,\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]+\\frac{\\beta^2}{2}\\mathbb E_p[(\\log p)^2]+O(\\beta^3),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta^3)$</span> 的常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_x|\\log p(x)|^3$</span> 控制（有限支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 有界）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)\\exp\\!\\big(\\beta\\log p(x)-\\log Z_\\tau\\big)\n=p(x)\\Big(1+\\beta\\big(\\log p(x)-\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]\\big)+O(\\beta^2)\\Big),$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta^2)$</span> 一致于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。对任意有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_\\tau[h]=\\mathbb E_p[h]+\\beta\\,\\operatorname{Cov}_p(h,\\log p)+O(\\beta^2),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(h,\\log p)=\\mathbb E_p[h\\log p]-\\mathbb E_p[h]\\mathbb E_p[\\log p]$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h=f^2$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]=\\mu_f+\\beta\\,\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)+O(\\beta^2),\\qquad\n\\mathbb E_\\tau[f^2]=\\mathbb E_p[f^2]+\\beta\\,\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)+O(\\beta^2).$$</div>\n相减：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)=\\sigma_f^2+\\beta\\Big(\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)-2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)\\Big)+O(\\beta^2).$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta^2)$</span> 的常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span> 可取为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\max_x|f(x)|^2\\max_x|\\log p(x)|^2$</span> 的倍数，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2|\\le C_f\\beta=C_f/\\tau$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge1$</span> 成立。极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to0^+$</span> 由上式直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（高温下方差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的单调性不普遍成立）</strong>：命题 1 只保证收敛与速率，不保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调。事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 的导数符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)-2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)$</span> 的符号决定，该量可正可负；故“温度越高方差越大”不是定理，只是当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span> 时的特例（见推论 2）。这一点与第 2 节熵的单调性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调增）形成对照：熵单调，但一般统计量的方差不必单调。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-2-f-log-p-时的方差恒等式与单调性\">命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span> 时的方差恒等式与单调性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-2-f-log-p-时的方差恒等式与单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{\\log p}(\\tau)=\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p]=\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p),$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\log p}(\\tau)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单调不减，从而关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增；并且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{\\log p}(\\tau)\\xrightarrow{\\tau\\to\\infty}\\operatorname{Var}_p(\\log p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>。由指数族标准恒等式，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[L]=\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\log Z_\\tau$</span>，且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d^2}{d\\beta^2}\\log Z_\\tau=\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(L).$$</div>\n由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的凸函数（有限和的对数配分函数为凸），其二阶导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(L)\\ge0$</span>，故关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单调不减，关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1/\\tau$</span> 单调不增。极限由命题 1 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=L$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 2 给出高温方差的一个可检验恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)$</span> 等于对数配分函数对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的二阶导数。这与第 2 节熵的恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=-\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p_\\tau]$</span> 相衔接：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to$</span> 均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)\\to\\log n$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)\\to\\operatorname{Var}_p(\\log p)$</span>，二者刻画不同的高温极限侧面。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-3-高温方差的显式上界与-n-依赖性\">命题 3（高温方差的显式上界与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 依赖性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-3-高温方差的显式上界与-n-依赖性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty&lt;a\\le b&lt;\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le \\frac{(b-a)^2}{4},$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时该上界被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span> 取代：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le \\operatorname{Var}_p(f)+\\frac{C_f}{\\tau},\\qquad \\tau\\ge1,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span> 如命题 1。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式是 Popoviciu 不等式在有限分布上的形式：对取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span> 的随机变量，方差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b-a)^2/4$</span>。第二式由命题 1 的展开直接得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（均匀极限下的方差退化）</strong>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为均匀分布，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)=\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。这说明高温方差的上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b-a)^2/4$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀时才可能被接近；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 越接近均匀，温度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 的调节能力越弱。该现象与第 2 节“温度对熵的影响”中对均匀分布熵不变的观察一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-4-高温方差的-KL-表示\">命题 4（高温方差的 KL 表示）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-4-高温方差的-KL-表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 为第 6 节定义的 KL 偏差，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]=\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,\\log p),$$</div>\n且\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=-\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式是指数族的标准协方差恒等式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]=\\mathbb E_\\tau[f\\log p]-\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p]=\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,\\log p)$</span>，其中求导与有限和交换无需额外条件（有限支撑）。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=\\beta\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p]-\\log Z_\\tau$</span>（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}=pe^{\\beta\\log p}$</span> 直接计算），对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 求导并用第一式取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathrm{KL}=\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p]+\\beta\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)-\\mathbb E_\\tau[\\log p]=-\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)\\le0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 4 说明高温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 减小）使 KL 偏差减小、方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)$</span> 减小，二者同向；这与第 6 节“截断造成 KL 偏差”中截断增大 KL 的方向相反。因此高温采样在 KL 意义下是“更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>”的方向，但代价是采样分布的集中度下降（熵增），这正是高温采样方差问题的核心张力。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-具体例子-二点分布\">具体例子：二点分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-具体例子-二点分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{0,1\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(0)=1-\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)=\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0&lt;\\varepsilon&lt;1/2$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(x)=x$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下为 Bernoulli 变量，参数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(1)=\\frac{\\varepsilon^{1/\\tau}}{(1-\\varepsilon)^{1/\\tau}+\\varepsilon^{1/\\tau}}=\\sigma\\!\\left(\\tfrac{1}{\\tau}\\log\\tfrac{\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}\\right),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma(z)=1/(1+e^{-z})$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)=p_\\tau(1)\\big(1-p_\\tau(1)\\big).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)\\to1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)\\to1/4$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)\\to0$</span>。参照方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)=\\varepsilon(1-\\varepsilon)$</span>。命题 1 的一阶展开给出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)=\\varepsilon(1-\\varepsilon)+\\frac{1}{\\tau}(1-2\\varepsilon)\\log\\frac{\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}\\cdot\\varepsilon(1-\\varepsilon)+O(\\tau^{-2}),$$</div>\n其中线性项系数符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1-2\\varepsilon)\\log\\frac{\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}$</span> 决定：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon&lt;1/2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{\\varepsilon}{1-\\varepsilon}&lt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-2\\varepsilon&gt;0$</span>，系数为负，故高温初期方差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大而增大（向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/4$</span> 靠近），与命题 2 的单调性方向一致（此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=x$</span> 非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span>，但该例中单调性恰好成立）。数值验证：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)=0.1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V=0.09$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=10$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)=\\sigma(0.1\\log 9)\\approx\\sigma(0.2197)\\approx0.5547$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\approx0.247$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=100$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(1)\\approx\\sigma(0.02197)\\approx0.5055$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\approx0.2499$</span>。与命题 1 的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.25$</span> 一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-5-高温方差对统计量尺度的二次齐次性\">命题 5（高温方差对统计量尺度的二次齐次性）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-5-高温方差对统计量尺度的二次齐次性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 任意，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b\\in\\mathbb R$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\neq0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{af+b}(\\tau)=a^2\\,V_f(\\tau),\\qquad V_{-f}(\\tau)=V_f(\\tau).$$</div>\n特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 取值于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[a,b]$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)\\le (b-a)^2/4$</span> 在高温下仍成立，且该上界关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的平移不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的期望线性性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[af+b]=a\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]+b$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{af+b}(\\tau)=\\mathbb E_\\tau[(af+b)^2]-\\big(a\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]+b\\big)^2\n=a^2\\big(\\mathbb E_\\tau[f^2]-\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]^2\\big)=a^2V_f(\\tau).$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=-1,b=0$</span> 得第二式。上界由 Popoviciu 不等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 上直接得到，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b-a)^2/4$</span> 在平移 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto f+c$</span> 下不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 5 说明高温方差不是温度变换的“绝对”性质，而是与统计量的尺度耦合。这一点在工程上对应一个常被忽视的事实：比较两个不同 logit 尺度下的采样方差没有意义，必须先固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的尺度。命题 1 的一阶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)-2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f\\mapsto af+b$</span> 下按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^2$</span> 缩放，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 同阶，故命题 1 的速率界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f/\\tau$</span> 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_f$</span> 也按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a^2$</span> 缩放。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-6-高温方差与温度变换熵的联合界\">命题 6（高温方差与温度变换熵的联合界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-6-高温方差与温度变换熵的联合界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_f=\\max_x|f(x)-\\mu_f|$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le M_f^2\\cdot 2\\big(1-\\exp(-\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p))\\big)^{1/2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}},$$</div>\n更精确地，有 Pinsker 型界\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le 2M_f^2\\,\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)^{1/2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=f-\\mu_f$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|g(x)|\\le M_f$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[g]=0$</span>。由定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)=\\mathbb E_\\tau[g^2]-\\mathbb E_\\tau[g]^2\\le\\mathbb E_\\tau[g^2].$$</div>\n另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[g^2]=\\mathbb E_p[g^2]+\\mathbb E_\\tau[g^2]-\\mathbb E_p[g^2]$</span>，而由测度变换\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\mathbb E_\\tau[g^2]-\\mathbb E_p[g^2]\\big|\\le M_f^2\\cdot 2\\,\\mathrm{TV}(p_\\tau,p),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}$</span> 为全变差距离。由 Pinsker 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{TV}(p_\\tau,p)\\le\\sqrt{\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)/2}$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le \\mathbb E_p[g^2]+M_f^2\\sqrt{2\\,\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)}.$$</div>\n再用命题 1 的极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[g^2]=\\sigma_f^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>）即得所述界；常数整理为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2M_f^2\\mathrm{KL}^{1/2}/\\sqrt2$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 6 把高温方差与第 6 节的 KL 偏差定量连接：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 小时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_f^2$</span> 加一个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\mathrm{KL}^{1/2})$</span> 的项控制。这与命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span> 界互补：命题 1 给出速率，命题 6 给出与 KL 的可比形式。注意此处未声称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 同阶；Pinsker 界只给上界，下界需另设条件（见命题 7）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-7-高温方差偏离的下界-非退化情形\">命题 7（高温方差偏离的下界：非退化情形）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-7-高温方差偏离的下界-非退化情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 非退化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)\\neq0$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)-2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)\\neq0$</span>。记该一阶系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1&lt;\\infty$</span>，使得对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge\\tau_1$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2\\big|\\ge\\frac{|\\kappa_f|}{2\\tau}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1 的展开，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2=\\frac{\\kappa_f}{\\tau}+R_f(\\tau),\\qquad |R_f(\\tau)|\\le C_f\\tau^{-2}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1=2C_f/|\\kappa_f|$</span>，则对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge\\tau_1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|R_f(\\tau)|\\le|\\kappa_f|/(2\\tau)$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|V_f(\\tau)-\\sigma_f^2\\big|\\ge\\frac{|\\kappa_f|}{\\tau}-\\frac{|\\kappa_f|}{2\\tau}=\\frac{|\\kappa_f|}{2\\tau}.$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 7 说明当一阶系数非零时，命题 1 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span> 速率是紧的（上下界同阶）。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f=0$</span>，则偏离可能以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\tau^{-2})$</span> 衰减，此时命题 7 不适用；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f=0$</span> 的典型情形是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下不相关且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的协方差恰被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)$</span> 抵消，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 对称且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 为奇函数时。这一退化情形与第 7 节低温模式崩溃中“对称分布下众数不唯一”的退化结构平行，但机制不同：此处是方差展开的一阶项消失，而非分布支撑坍缩。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-8-高温方差的可加性失效与协方差修正\">命题 8（高温方差的可加性失效与协方差修正）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-8-高温方差的可加性失效与协方差修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f,h:\\mathcal V\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_{f+h}(\\tau)=V_f(\\tau)+V_h(\\tau)+2\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)=\\mathbb E_\\tau[fh]-\\mathbb E_\\tau[f]\\mathbb E_\\tau[h]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)\\longrightarrow\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,h),$$</div>\n且收敛速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span>，一阶系数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(fh,\\log p)-\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(h,\\log p)-\\mu_h\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式是方差的双线性展开，直接由定义得到。第二式对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$fh$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$h$</span> 分别用命题 1 证明中的一阶展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[u]=\\mathbb E_p[u]+\\beta\\operatorname{Cov}_p(u,\\log p)+O(\\beta^2)$</span>，代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)$</span> 并整理，即得所述一阶系数；<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\beta^2)$</span> 的一致常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max|f|,\\max|h|,\\max|\\log p|$</span> 控制。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 8 是高温方差“不可加”的精确表述：只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)=0$</span> 时才有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{f+h}=V_f+V_h$</span>。在工程语境中，若把两个独立 logit 分量相加后观察其采样方差，交叉项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)$</span> 在高温下趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,h)$</span>，并不自动消失。这与第 6 节 KL 偏差的可加性失效（KL 对分布分解不满足链式可加）是同一类“非线性泛函不可加”现象的两个侧面。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-9-高温方差与温度变换支撑的关系\">命题 9（高温方差与温度变换支撑的关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-9-高温方差与温度变换支撑的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau=\\{x:p_\\tau(x)\\ge\\epsilon\\}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-高概率支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_f=\\max_x|f(x)-\\mu_f|$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)\\le M_f^2\\Big(1-\\sum_{x\\in S_\\tau}p_\\tau(x)\\Big)+V_f^{S_\\tau}(\\tau),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f^{S_\\tau}(\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 限制于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 并重新归一后的方差。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 趋于全支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to$</span> 均匀分布），尾部项趋于零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_\\tau[(f-\\mathbb E_\\tau[f])^2]$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V\\setminus S_\\tau$</span> 两部分。在补集上被积函数不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_f^2$</span>，其质量不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\sum_{x\\in S_\\tau}p_\\tau(x)$</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 上即为重新归一后的方差乘以该质量。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 9 把高温方差与第 2 节“温度对支撑的影响”衔接：低温时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 收缩到众数附近，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 被压小（第 7 节模式崩溃的方差侧表现）；高温时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_\\tau$</span> 扩张到全支撑，尾部项消失，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span>。命题 9 的界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 大时退化为命题 1 的极限陈述，但在中等温度下给出可计算的分解，便于数值诊断“方差主要来自支撑内离散还是支撑外尾部”。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-10-高温方差的对数尺度不变量\">命题 10（高温方差的对数尺度不变量）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-10-高温方差的对数尺度不变量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，考虑缩放后的参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}\\propto p^c$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 下的温度变换）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(c)}_{\\log p^{(c)}}(\\tau)$</span> 为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}$</span> 上用统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(c)}$</span> 计算的高温方差，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V^{(c)}_{\\log p^{(c)}}(\\tau)=c^2\\,V_{\\log p}(c\\tau).$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}(x)\\propto p(x)^c$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p^{(c)}(x)=c\\log p(x)-\\log Z_c$</span>。统计量平移不改变方差（命题 5），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(c)}_{\\log p^{(c)}}(\\tau)=c^2V^{(c)}_{\\log p}(\\tau)$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}$</span> 在温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的变换为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{(c)}(\\cdot)^{1/\\tau}\\propto p(\\cdot)^{c/\\tau}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau/c$</span> 下的变换，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(c)}_{\\log p}(\\tau)=V_{\\log p}(\\tau/c)$</span>。合并得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^2V_{\\log p}(\\tau/c)=c^2V_{\\log p}(c\\tau)$</span>（此处用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto\\tau/c$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\tau$</span> 的记号一致性，需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\log p}$</span> 的自变量为温度参数）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 10 说明高温方差在对数统计量下满足一个尺度协变律：先对分布做逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的幂变换，再在高温 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下测方差，等价于在原分布上以温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c\\tau$</span> 测方差并乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c^2$</span>。这与第 1 节温度变换的幂半群结构 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}\\circ p_{\\tau_2}=p_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}$</span> 一致，是同一半群在方差泛函上的诱导作用。工程含义：调节“基础温度”（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 先做幂变换）与调节“采样温度” <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 在方差上不可交换地简单相加，而是按上述协变律复合。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-11-高温方差的蒙特卡洛估计误差界\">命题 11（高温方差的蒙特卡洛估计误差界）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-11-高温方差的蒙特卡洛估计误差界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_m$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的独立样本，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat V_f^{(m)}(\\tau)=\\frac1m\\sum_{i=1}^m(f(X_i)-\\bar f)^2$</span> 为样本方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar f=\\frac1m\\sum_i f(X_i)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat V_f^{(m)}(\\tau)]=\\frac{m-1}{m}V_f(\\tau)$</span>，且若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f|\\le B$</span>），则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta\\in(0,1)$</span>，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\delta$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|\\hat V_f^{(m)}(\\tau)-V_f(\\tau)\\big|\\le \\frac{V_f(\\tau)}{m}+4B^2\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\log(2/\\delta)}{m}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：无偏性修正因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{m-1}{m}$</span> 是样本方差的标准结果。集中不等式由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_i)^2$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f(X_i)$</span> 的 Hoeffding 不等式及方差的有界性（<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f\\le B^2$</span>）组合得到；常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4B^2$</span> 来自对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat V_f$</span> 中两项分别应用 Hoeffding 并取并集界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 11 说明高温方差本身可用蒙特卡洛稳定估计，误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)/m$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B^2/\\sqrt m$</span> 控制。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 很大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span> 时，估计误差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 爆炸，这为后续“代码：截断偏差的数值测量”节中把高温方差作为基准量提供了可行性保证。注意此处未假设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的分布近似高斯，集中界只依赖有界性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-12-高温方差与低温方差的对称关系\">命题 12（高温方差与低温方差的对称关系）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-12-高温方差与低温方差的对称关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：(A1)、(A2)。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界。</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下方差，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(1/\\tau)$</span> 为逆温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下的方差（即低温方向）。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$V_f(\\tau)+V_f(1/\\tau)\\ \\text{不必等于常数},\\qquad\n\\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}V_f(\\tau)=\\operatorname{Var}_p(f),\\qquad\n\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}V_f(\\tau)=\\operatorname{Var}_{\\delta_{x^*}}(f)=0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^*$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的众数（若众数唯一）。若众数不唯一，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 收敛到众数集上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(0^+)$</span> 为该均匀分布下的方差，一般不为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：高温极限由命题 1。低温极限：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\propto p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在众数处取最大值且比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ (p(x)/p(x^*))^{1/\\tau}\\to0$</span> 对非众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^*}$</span>（众数唯一时）；众数不唯一时各众数等权。方差在点质量下为零，在众数集均匀分布下为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 在该集上的方差。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>：命题 12 明确本节标题“高温采样”的边界：高温方差趋于参照方差，低温方差趋于零或众数集方差，两端不对称——高温端有非零极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span>，低温端极限依赖众数结构。这一不对称正是第 7 节“低温退化的模式崩溃”与本节“高温方差”不能互相替代的原因：前者是支撑坍缩，后者是分布展宽，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto1/\\tau$</span> 变换下不互为镜像。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>高温方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)=\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(f)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时收敛到参照方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Var}_p(f)$</span>，收敛速率 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span>，一阶系数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f^2,\\log p)-2\\mu_f\\operatorname{Cov}_p(f,\\log p)$</span> 显式给出；一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 的方差不必关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调。</li>\n<li>当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\log p$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{\\log p}(\\tau)=\\frac{d^2}{d\\beta^2}\\log Z_\\tau=\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 单调不减、关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调不增，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\beta}\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|p)=-\\operatorname{Var}_\\tau(\\log p)$</span>，把高温方差与第 6 节 KL 偏差的导数方向联系起来。</li>\n<li>高温方差受 Popoviciu 上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(b-a)^2/4$</span> 约束，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 趋近均匀时温度对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f$</span> 的调节能力退化；这与低温模式崩溃（第 7 节）构成温度两端的行为对偶，为后续“采样温度与校准”节提供方差侧的定量接口。</li>\n<li>高温方差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_f(\\tau)$</span> 满足二次齐次性 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{af+b}=a^2V_f$</span>、双线性展开 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V_{f+h}=V_f+V_h+2\\operatorname{Cov}_\\tau(f,h)$</span>，并在对数统计量下满足尺度协变律 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V^{(c)}_{\\log p^{(c)}}(\\tau)=c^2V_{\\log p}(c\\tau)$</span>；这些恒等式把温度变换的幂半群结构诱导到方差泛函上，且与命题 1 的一阶展开系数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f$</span> 的缩放一致。</li>\n<li>命题 6 与命题 7 给出高温方差偏离参照方差的双侧刻画：上界由 Pinsker 型 KL 界控制，下界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f\\neq0$</span> 时以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\kappa_f|/(2\\tau)$</span> 为界，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span> 速率在非退化情形下是紧的；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa_f=0$</span> 的退化情形需单独处理，与低温众数不唯一的退化结构平行但机制不同。</li>\n<li>命题 9 与命题 12 把高温方差与第 2 节支撑变化、第 7 节低温模式崩溃衔接：高温时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>-支撑扩张至全支撑、尾部项消失，低温时支撑坍缩至众数集、方差趋于零或众数集方差；两端不对称，故高温方差不能由低温方差经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\mapsto1/\\tau$</span> 镜像得到，命题 11 进一步保证该量可由蒙特卡洛稳定估计，为后续截断偏差的数值测量提供基准。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-重复惩罚的数学\">重复惩罚的数学<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-重复惩罚的数学\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=V&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为 nucleus 集合。本节新引入如下符号。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.9.1（重复惩罚算子）</strong> 设上下文为长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 的序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:n}=(x_1,\\dots,x_n)\\in\\mathcal V^n$</span>。对每个词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 定义其近期出现计数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$c_n(v)=\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_{n-i}\\,\\mathbb 1_{x_i=v},$$</div>\n其中权重序列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w_j)_{j\\ge 0}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=0}^{n-1}w_j&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限窗情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=\\mathbb 1_{j&lt;L}$</span> 是特例）。给定惩罚强度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\ge 0$</span>，重复惩罚算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 作用于参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 上，输出\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=\\frac{p(v)\\,e^{-\\theta\\,c_n(v)}}{Z_\\theta(x_{1:n})},\\qquad Z_\\theta(x_{1:n})=\\sum_{u\\in\\mathcal V}p(u)\\,e^{-\\theta\\,c_n(u)}.$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_0 p=p$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 时，近期出现过的词的对数概率被减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta c_n(v)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设 A1（归一化可行性）</strong> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(v)&gt;0$</span>；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta$</span> 可能为零，算子无定义。<strong>假设 A2（有限性）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$V&lt;\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)&lt;\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的概率向量。<strong>假设 A3（可微性）</strong> 下文对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 无关，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的有限指数和，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上实解析，求导与求和可交换（有限和，无需 Dominated Convergence）。</p>\n<p>与相邻概念的区别须先说清：温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 是<strong>逐点幂变换后重归一化</strong>，它改变的是整个分布的“锐度”，且对每个词的变换指数相同；重复惩罚是<strong>逐点乘性重加权后重归一化</strong>，其指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta c_n(v)$</span> 依赖上下文，因而<strong>不是</strong>某个单一温度下的幂变换，除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在支撑上为常数（此时退化为温度变换，见推论 18.9.4）。截断算子（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）是<strong>支撑限制</strong>，重复惩罚是<strong>支撑内质量重分配</strong>，二者可复合但不可互换。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-一-主定理-重复惩罚的-KL-偏差恒等式\">一、主定理：重复惩罚的 KL 偏差恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-一-主定理-重复惩罚的-KL-偏差恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.2（惩罚的 KL 分解）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\ge 0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)=\\theta\\,\\mathbb E_{p}\\big[c_n\\big]+\\log Z_\\theta,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[c_n]=\\sum_v p(v)c_n(v)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由定义，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=\\sum_v p(v)\\log\\frac{p(v)}{(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)}.$$</div>\n代入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta$</span>，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p(v)}{(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)}=\\log\\frac{p(v)}{p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta}=\\theta c_n(v)+\\log Z_\\theta.$$</div>\n右端与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 无关的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta$</span> 项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 下求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v p(v)=1$</span>），其余项求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mathbb E_p[c_n]$</span>。有限和，逐项相加合法。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.3（非负性与零偏差刻画）</strong> 在命题 18.9.2 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)\\ge 0$</span>，且等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的支撑上为常数。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> KL 非负性由 Jensen 不等式（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 严格凹，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 非退化）给出。等号情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_0p=p$</span>，KL 为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\equiv \\bar c$</span> 于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{v:p(v)&gt;0\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=p(v)e^{-\\theta\\bar c}/Z_\\theta$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta=e^{-\\theta\\bar c}\\sum_u p(u)=e^{-\\theta\\bar c}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p=p$</span>。反之若 KL 为零则两分布相等，由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta\\equiv 1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在支撑上为常数。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的恒等式：<strong>惩罚不改变分布当且仅当近期计数在支撑上均一</strong>。这解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 很大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 稀疏（多数词计数为零、少数词计数为正）时，惩罚必然造成非零 KL 偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-二-惩罚对熵的单调影响\">二、惩罚对熵的单调影响<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-二-惩罚对熵的单调影响\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.4（熵的单调性）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\theta)=-\\sum_v (\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)\\log(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上非退化（至少两值不同），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处的右导数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H'(0^+)=-\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)\\Big|_{\\theta=0}\\text{ 的主阶}=-\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)\\le 0,$$</div>\n即惩罚在零强度附近<strong>不增熵</strong>；严格不等式当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta$</span> 代入熵定义，得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(\\theta)=-\\sum_v \\frac{p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}}{Z_\\theta}\\Big(\\log p(v)-\\theta c_n(v)-\\log Z_\\theta\\Big).$$</div>\n记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(v)=p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导（有限和，逐项求导合法）：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H'(\\theta)=-\\sum_v q_\\theta'(v)\\log q_\\theta(v)-\\sum_v q_\\theta'(v).$$</div>\n第二项为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v q_\\theta(v)=1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 求导）。第一项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta'(v)=q_\\theta(v)\\big(-c_n(v)-\\frac{Z_\\theta'}{Z_\\theta}\\big)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{Z_\\theta'}{Z_\\theta}=-\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]$</span>。故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H'(\\theta)=-\\sum_v q_\\theta(v)\\big(-c_n(v)+\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]\\big)\\log q_\\theta(v).$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=p$</span>，上式化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H'(0)=-\\sum_v p(v)\\big(-c_n(v)+\\mathbb E_p[c_n]\\big)\\log p(v)$</span>。利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v p(v)\\log p(v)=-H(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v p(v)\\big(-c_n(v)+\\mathbb E_p[c_n]\\big)=0$</span>，整理得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H'(0)=\\sum_v p(v)c_n(v)\\log p(v)-\\mathbb E_p[c_n]\\sum_v p(v)\\log p(v).$$</div>\n右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Cov}_p(c_n,\\log p)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的一阶展开中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q_\\theta(v)=\\log p(v)-\\theta(c_n(v)-\\mathbb E_p[c_n])+O(\\theta^2)$</span>，代回可得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H'(\\theta)$</span> 的主阶为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\theta\\,\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)+O(\\theta^2)$</span>，故在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0^+$</span> 附近熵以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)$</span> 的速率下降。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>注</strong> 命题 18.9.4 的结论方向与直觉一致：惩罚把质量从高频词移向低频词，若高频词原本承担主要概率质量，则移动后分布更均匀——但熵的<strong>一阶</strong>变化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 的协方差决定，未必恒负；上述展开表明在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 的邻域内主阶为负二次型，故局部不增熵。全局单调性不成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to\\infty$</span> 时质量集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 最小者，熵可回升），这与温度变换的全局单调熵形成对照。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-三-与温度变换的复合-不可交换性\">三、与温度变换的复合：不可交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-三-与温度变换的复合-不可交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.5（复合次序）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_\\tau$</span> 为温度算子。一般地\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal T_\\tau\\circ\\mathcal R_\\theta\\neq \\mathcal R_\\theta\\circ\\mathcal T_\\tau,$$</div>\n且二者的 KL 偏差满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)+\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big),$$</div>\n右端第二项即温度变换相对于其输入的偏差，由前序节温度 KL 公式给出（对输入分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一断言：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=p(b)=1/2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(a)=1,c_n(b)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=1,\\tau=2$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=e^{-1}+1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(a)=e^{-1}/(e^{-1}+1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(b)=1/(e^{-1}+1)$</span>。再作用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_2$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal T_2\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(a)\\propto (e^{-1}/(e^{-1}+1))^{1/2}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal T_2\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(b)\\propto (1/(e^{-1}+1))^{1/2}$</span>。反向：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_2 p=(1/2,1/2)$</span>（均匀分布对幂变换不变），再作用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta\\mathcal T_2 p)(a)=e^{-1}/(e^{-1}+1)$</span>，与前者不同。第二断言是 KL 的链式法则：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|r)=\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)+\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|r)$</span> 对任意概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p,q,r$</span> 成立（有限和展开即得）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的工程含义：在实现中先做重复惩罚再调温度，与先调温度再惩罚，得到的分布不同；代码节（第 13 节）将显式验证这一非交换性。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-四-具体例子-二词表上的精确计算\">四、具体例子：二词表上的精确计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-四-具体例子-二词表上的精确计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.9,0.1)$</span>，上下文使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(a)=2,c_n(b)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$Z_\\theta=0.9e^{-1}+0.1e^{0}=0.9\\times 0.3679+0.1=0.4311,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(a)=\\frac{0.9e^{-1}}{0.4311}=0.768,\\qquad (\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(b)=\\frac{0.1}{0.4311}=0.232.$$</div>\nKL 偏差由命题 18.9.2：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}=\\theta\\mathbb E_p[c_n]+\\log Z_\\theta=0.5\\times(0.9\\times 2+0.1\\times 0)+\\log 0.4311=0.9-0.8416=0.0584.$$</div>\n直接计算验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.9\\log(0.9/0.768)+0.1\\log(0.1/0.232)=0.9\\times 0.1587+0.1\\times(-0.8416)=0.1428-0.0842=0.0586$</span>，与恒等式一致（舍入误差内）。熵：<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)=0.325$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=0.768\\log(1/0.768)+0.232\\log(1/0.232)=0.203+0.339=0.542$</span>，熵<strong>上升</strong>，与命题 18.9.4 的“局部不增熵”不矛盾——该命题只断言 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 邻域的一阶主阶，此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span> 已非无穷小，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_p(c_n,\\log p)$</span> 的符号使一阶项为正。这正说明全局单调性不成立，须以命题 18.9.4 的局部陈述为准。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-六-惩罚强度-theta-的梯度与不动点结构\">六、惩罚强度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的梯度与不动点结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-六-惩罚强度-theta-的梯度与不动点结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前一小节把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 当作给定常数。实际系统中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 往往是超参数，需要理解分布如何随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 连续演化。本小节在假设 A1–A3 下考察映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 的几何。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.6（对数似然的仿射结构）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in\\mathcal V$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=\\log p(v)-\\theta\\,c_n(v)-\\log Z_\\theta,$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta$</span> 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的函数是凸的，其二阶导数为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d^2}{d\\theta^2}\\log Z_\\theta=\\mathrm{Var}_{q_\\theta}(c_n)\\ge 0,$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta=\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式由定义直接取对数。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta$</span> 求导：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta=\\sum_v p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}$</span> 是有限指数和，逐项求导合法，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\theta}\\log Z_\\theta=\\frac{Z_\\theta'}{Z_\\theta}=\\frac{\\sum_v p(v)(-c_n(v))e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}}{Z_\\theta}=-\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n].$$</div>\n再求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d^2}{d\\theta^2}\\log Z_\\theta=-\\frac{d}{d\\theta}\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n].$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]=\\sum_v q_\\theta(v)c_n(v)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\theta(v)=p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}/Z_\\theta$</span>，故\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\theta}q_\\theta(v)=q_\\theta(v)\\Big(-c_n(v)+\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]\\Big),$$</div>\n代回得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d^2}{d\\theta^2}\\log Z_\\theta=-\\sum_v q_\\theta(v)\\big(-c_n(v)+\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]\\big)c_n(v)=\\mathrm{Var}_{q_\\theta}(c_n).$$</div>\n<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.7（KL 偏差的凸性）</strong> 在命题 18.9.2 与 18.9.6 条件下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto \\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,\\infty)$</span> 上凸，且在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处取最小值零。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 18.9.2，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=\\theta\\mathbb E_p[c_n]+\\log Z_\\theta$</span>。第一项关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 线性，第二项由命题 18.9.6 凸，故和为凸。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_0=\\log 1=0$</span>，第一项为零，故 KL 为零；凸函数在最小值点处取零即得最小性。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可操作的判据：<strong>若在某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta^\\ast&gt;0$</span> 处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}$</span> 的导数仍为负，则增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 会继续增大偏差</strong>。导数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\theta}\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=\\mathbb E_p[c_n]-\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]$$</div>\n在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处为零（<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_0=p$</span>），在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 处符号由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[c_n]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]$</span> 的大小决定：惩罚把质量移向低计数词，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 单调下降（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{d}{d\\theta}\\mathbb E_{q_\\theta}[c_n]=-\\mathrm{Var}_{q_\\theta}(c_n)\\le 0$</span>），从而导数非负，KL 单调不减。这与推论 18.9.7 的凸性一致，并给出<strong>偏差随惩罚强度单调增长</strong>的精确陈述。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-七-惩罚与截断的复合-支撑限制下的重加权\">七、惩罚与截断的复合：支撑限制下的重加权<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-七-惩罚与截断的复合-支撑限制下的重加权\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已定义 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断算子。重复惩罚与截断的复合次序同样影响结果，且这里出现一个前序节未覆盖的现象：<strong>惩罚可以改变截断集合本身</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.9.8（惩罚后截断）</strong> 给定参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、计数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span>、强度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 与截断参数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>），定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{\\mathrm{post}}(v)=\\frac{(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)\\,\\mathbb 1_{v\\in S(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)}}{\\sum_{u\\in S(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)}(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(u)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)$</span> 是在<strong>惩罚后分布</strong>上按 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 或 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 规则选出的集合。对照的“先截断后惩罚”为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^{\\mathrm{pre}}(v)=\\frac{p(v)\\mathbb 1_{v\\in S(p)}\\,e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}}{\\sum_{u\\in S(p)}p(u)e^{-\\theta c_n(u)}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.9（截断集合的漂移）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)$</span> 上非均一，则一般地 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)\\neq S(p)$</span>；特别地，存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 使某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in S(p)$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)&lt;(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(u)$</span> 对某个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\notin S(p)$</span> 成立，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 被挤出 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 由命题 18.9.6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)-\\log(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(u)=\\log p(v)-\\log p(u)-\\theta(c_n(v)-c_n(u))$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v\\in S(p)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$u\\notin S(p)$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)&gt;c_n(u)$</span>，则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;(\\log p(v)-\\log p(u))/(c_n(v)-c_n(u))$</span> 时右端为负，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)&lt;(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(u)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 充分大即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的工程后果是：<strong>先惩罚后截断</strong>时，截断集合依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 增大可能把原本高概率但高频的词挤出集合，代之以低频词；<strong>先截断后惩罚</strong>时，集合固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)$</span>，惩罚只在集合内重分配质量，不会引入集合外的词。二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 时给出不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，且 KL 偏差不同。这与命题 18.9.5 的非交换性同源：截断是支撑投影，惩罚是乘性重加权，二者不交换。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.10（先截断后惩罚的 KL）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)$</span> 固定且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{v\\in S(p)}p(v)&gt;0$</span>，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,q^{\\mathrm{pre}}\\big)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,p_{S(p)}\\big)+\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_{S(p)}\\,\\|\\,q^{\\mathrm{pre}}\\big),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{S(p)}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)$</span> 上的条件化分布。右端第一项是截断偏差（前序节已给精确表达式），第二项是集合内惩罚偏差，形式同命题 18.9.2 但以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{S(p)}$</span> 为参考。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 链式法则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|r)=\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)+\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|r)$</span> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_{S(p)}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=q^{\\mathrm{pre}}$</span>。注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\mathrm{pre}}$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S(p)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_{S(p)}\\|q^{\\mathrm{pre}})$</span> 有限。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把复合偏差分解为<strong>截断项 + 惩罚项</strong>，两项可分别由前序节与本节的公式计算，无需重新推导。这是本节与前序节接口的精确形式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-八-惩罚强度的选取-一个变分刻画\">八、惩罚强度的选取：一个变分刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-八-惩罚强度的选取-一个变分刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>工程上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 常凭经验设定。本小节给出一个不依赖经验的变分刻画，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 成为某个目标泛函的驻点。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 18.9.11（惩罚正则化泛函）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda\\ge 0$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal F_\\lambda(q)=\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)+\\lambda\\,\\mathbb E_q[c_n],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 取遍 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的概率向量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.12（变分驻点即重复惩罚）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_\\lambda$</span> 在单纯形内部的唯一驻点为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q^\\ast(v)=\\frac{p(v)e^{-\\lambda c_n(v)}}{\\sum_u p(u)e^{-\\lambda c_n(u)}}=\\mathcal R_\\lambda p(v).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 用拉格朗日乘子处理约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v q(v)=1$</span>。拉格朗日函数\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L(q,\\mu)=\\sum_v q(v)\\log\\frac{q(v)}{p(v)}+\\lambda\\sum_v q(v)c_n(v)+\\mu\\Big(\\sum_v q(v)-1\\Big).$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(v)$</span> 求偏导并置零：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{q(v)}{p(v)}+1+\\lambda c_n(v)+\\mu=0,$$</div>\n解得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(v)=p(v)e^{-\\lambda c_n(v)}e^{-1-\\mu}$</span>。归一化确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1-\\mu}=1/Z_\\lambda$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^\\ast=\\mathcal R_\\lambda p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_\\lambda$</span> 在单纯形上严格凸（KL 严格凸，线性项不破坏凸性），故驻点唯一且为全局最小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题把重复惩罚从“启发式算子”提升为“正则化泛函的最小值点”：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 是偏差—计数的权衡系数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)$</span> 惩罚偏离参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[c_n]$</span> 惩罚高频词的质量。注意这里的 KL 方向是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)$</span>（变分方向），与命题 18.9.2 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q)$</span>（偏差方向）不同；两者数值不等，但驻点相同。这一区分在实现中容易混淆，须显式写明。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.13（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的等同）</strong> 命题 18.9.12 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 与定义 18.9.1 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 是同一参数：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\lambda p=\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\theta$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 两式逐点比较即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论的意义在于：<strong>惩罚强度不是自由超参数，而是正则化权衡的拉格朗日乘子</strong>。给定目标泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_\\lambda$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda$</span> 唯一确定；反之给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，可反解出对应的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lambda=\\theta$</span>。工程上调节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 等价于调节“偏离参考分布的代价”与“高频词质量的代价”之比。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-九-有限窗权重下的计数结构\">九、有限窗权重下的计数结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-九-有限窗权重下的计数结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定义 18.9.1 允许一般权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(w_j)$</span>。本小节说明有限窗 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=\\mathbb 1_{j&lt;L}$</span> 情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 的结构，以及它如何影响命题 18.9.2 的偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.14（有限窗计数的界）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j=\\mathbb 1_{j&lt;L}$</span>，则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le c_n(v)\\le L$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v c_n(v)=\\min(n,L)$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)=\\sum_{i=n-L+1}^{n}\\mathbb 1_{x_i=v}$</span>（下标越界时视为零），每个指示子非负且不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，求和至多 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 项，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)\\le L$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 求和，每个位置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 恰有一个词使指示子为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v c_n(v)$</span> 等于窗内位置数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min(n,L)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>由此，命题 18.9.2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[c_n]\\le L$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)\\le L^2/4$</span>（Popoviciu 不等式），故 KL 偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta L+\\log Z_\\theta$</span> 控制，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta\\le 0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\le\\sum_v p(v)=1$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n\\ge 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}\\le 1$</span>）。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)\\le \\theta L.$$</div>\n这是一个不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 的界：<strong>偏差随窗长 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 线性增长，随强度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 线性增长</strong>。工程上若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 而增大窗长，偏差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 放大；若固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 而增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span>，偏差按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 放大。这解释了为何长上下文模型需要更小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 才能保持偏差可控。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.15（无窗极限）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w_j\\equiv 1$</span>（无限窗，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L=n$</span>），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n(v)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$v$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{1:n}$</span> 中的出现次数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v c_n(v)=n$</span>，KL 偏差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta n$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L=n$</span> 代入命题 18.9.14。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个直观的量纲：<strong>偏差的量级是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\times$</span>（窗内词数）</strong>。若希望偏差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\le \\epsilon/n$</span>（无限窗）或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\le\\epsilon/L$</span>（有限窗）。这是本节唯一一个可直接用于超参数设定的定量结论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-十-与温度变换的联合偏差-一个可加分解\">十、与温度变换的联合偏差：一个可加分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-十-与温度变换的联合偏差-一个可加分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节给出了温度变换的 KL 偏差公式，本节给出了惩罚的 KL 偏差公式。当二者复合时，偏差是否可加？本小节回答此问题。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.16（联合偏差的链式分解）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\ge 0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)+\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big),$$</div>\n且第二项由前序节温度偏差公式以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span> 为输入分布给出：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\mathbb E_{\\mathcal R_\\theta p}\\big[\\log \\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big]-\\mathbb E_{\\mathcal R_\\theta p}\\big[\\log \\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big]-\\log Z_\\tau^{(\\theta)},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau^{(\\theta)}=\\sum_v (\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 第一式是 KL 链式法则，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p$</span>。第二式由温度变换定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)=(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau^{(\\theta)}$</span> 直接代入 KL 定义，逐项展开即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实用价值在于：<strong>联合偏差不是两项的简单相加，而是“惩罚偏差 + 以惩罚后分布为输入的温度偏差”</strong>。若先温度后惩罚，分解变为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal T_\\tau p)+\\mathrm{KL}(\\mathcal T_\\tau p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta\\mathcal T_\\tau p)$</span>，第二项的参考分布不同，数值不同。这与命题 18.9.5 的非交换性一致，并给出偏差层面的精确对照。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 18.9.17（小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 偏差的二阶展开）</strong> 在命题 18.9.16 条件下，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\to 0^+$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 1$</span> 时，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p\\,\\|\\,\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\big)=\\frac{\\theta^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)+\\frac{(\\tau-1)^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)+O(\\theta^3)+O((\\tau-1)^3),$$</div>\n交叉项为零（一阶）。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 惩罚偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 附近由命题 18.9.4 的展开给出主阶 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{\\theta^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)$</span>（因 KL 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 处为零且导数为零，二阶项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{2}\\theta^2\\cdot\\frac{d^2}{d\\theta^2}\\mathrm{KL}\\big|_{\\theta=0}=\\frac{\\theta^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)$</span>）。温度偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 附近的主阶由前序节公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{(\\tau-1)^2}{2}\\mathrm{Var}_p(\\log p)$</span>。交叉项因两参数的一阶导数在各自零点处为零而消失。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论给出一个可检验的定量预测：<strong>在小参数极限下，惩罚偏差与温度偏差按各自方差独立叠加，无交叉项</strong>。代码节可数值验证这一二阶展开的精度。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-十一-惩罚的不可逆性\">十一、惩罚的不可逆性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-十一-惩罚的不可逆性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个结构性观察：重复惩罚算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 时不可逆，即不存在算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{-\\theta}$</span> 使其复合为恒等。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 18.9.18（不可逆性）</strong> 在假设 A1–A3 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c_n$</span> 在支撑上非均一，则不存在概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{-\\theta}r=p$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 成立；等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 在概率单纯形上的像不是整个单纯形。</p>\n<p><em>证明</em> 假设存在这样的逆算子。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_{-\\theta}(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=p$</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)e^{+\\theta c_n(v)}/\\tilde Z=p(v)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}e^{+\\theta c_n(v)}/(Z_\\theta\\tilde Z)=p(v)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\tilde Z=1$</span>。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z=\\sum_v (\\mathcal R_\\theta p)(v)e^{+\\theta c_n(v)}$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/Z_\\theta$</span>。取二词表例子：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.9,0.1)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$c=(2,0)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0.5$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta=0.4311$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z=0.768e^{1}+0.232e^{0}=2.088+0.232=2.320$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\tilde Z=1.000$</span>（此例恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因二词表结构特殊）。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.5)$</span> 同 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c,\\theta$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta=0.5e^{-1}+0.5=0.684$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta p=(0.269,0.731)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z=0.269e^{1}+0.731=1.462$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\tilde Z=1.000$</span>（仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 只有两值且归一化强制）。一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V\\ge 3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde Z$</span> 依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的分布形状，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\theta\\tilde Z\\neq 1$</span>。故逆算子不存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的工程含义：<strong>惩罚是信息损失操作</strong>，无法通过反向惩罚恢复原分布。这与温度变换不同——温度变换在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 时可逆（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal T_{1/\\tau}\\mathcal T_\\tau=\\mathrm{id}$</span>），因幂变换是双射。重复惩罚的不可逆性源于其乘性因子依赖上下文计数，而计数在重加权后不可观测。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>重复惩罚算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 是逐点乘性重加权 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(v)e^{-\\theta c_n(v)}$</span> 后重归一化，其 KL 偏差有精确恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=\\theta\\mathbb E_p[c_n]+\\log Z_\\theta$</span>，且偏差为零当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 或近期计数在支撑上均一。</li>\n<li>惩罚对熵的影响由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Cov}_p(c_n,\\log p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)$</span> 控制：在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta=0$</span> 邻域熵以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathrm{Var}_p(c_n)$</span> 的主阶不增，但全局单调性不成立，与温度变换的全局单调熵形成对照。</li>\n<li>重复惩罚与温度变换不可交换，复合次序改变最终分布；实现中必须先明确算子次序，否则 KL 偏差的链式分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p)=\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)+\\mathrm{KL}(\\mathcal R_\\theta p\\|\\mathcal T_\\tau\\mathcal R_\\theta p)$</span> 中的第二项将对应错误的输入分布。</li>\n<li>惩罚强度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 的连续演化由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_\\theta$</span> 的凸性（二阶导为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{q_\\theta}(c_n)$</span>）控制，KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta\\mapsto\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|\\mathcal R_\\theta p)$</span> 凸且单调不减，偏差随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 单调增长。</li>\n<li>惩罚与截断复合时截断集合本身随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta$</span> 漂移（命题 18.9.9），先截断后惩罚的偏差可精确分解为截断项与集合内惩罚项之和（推论 18.9.10）；惩罚强度可由正则化泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal F_\\lambda(q)=\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p)+\\lambda\\mathbb E_q[c_n]$</span> 的驻点唯一确定（命题 18.9.12）。</li>\n<li>有限窗计数满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\le c_n(v)\\le L$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_v c_n(v)=\\min(n,L)$</span>，KL 偏差上界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta L$</span> 不依赖词表大小；联合温度—惩罚偏差按链式法则分解，小参数极限下两项按各自方差独立叠加无交叉项；惩罚算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal R_\\theta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\theta&gt;0$</span> 时不可逆，与可逆的温度变换形成结构对照。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-反例-top-p-在重尾分布下截掉高概率质量\">反例：top-p 在重尾分布下截掉高概率质量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-反例-top-p-在重尾分布下截掉高概率质量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限或可数支撑上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换后的分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}k$</span> 截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}p$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为最小集合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span>。本节新引入的符号如下。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,2,\\dots\\}$</span> 为可数支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的概率质量函数，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(1)}\\ge p_{(2)}\\ge\\cdots$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序排列，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{(j)}$</span> 为对应原子。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p=\\min\\{n:\\sum_{j=1}^n p_{(j)}\\ge p\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=\\{x_{(1)},\\dots,x_{(N_p)}\\}$</span>，截断分布记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_p}/\\sum_{y\\in S_p}p(y)$</span>。</li>\n<li>记截断保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p=\\sum_{j=1}^{N_p}p_{(j)}$</span>，截断丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-M_p$</span>。</li>\n<li>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_p(x)}$</span> 为截断造成的 KL 偏差（前序节已给出其表达式，本节只引用不重推）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节所需假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率质量函数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的尾部满足正则变化条件，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;0$</span> 与慢变函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j&gt;n}p_{(j)}\\sim n^{-\\alpha}L(n)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\to\\infty$</span>）；(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span> 固定。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 有限且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\ge p$</span>，截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 良定义。</p>\n<p>本节的核心反例断言：在重尾（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 较小）情形下，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断会丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span>，而该丢弃质量对应的原子在原始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 中可能具有比保留集合内某些原子更高的概率质量；更精确地，存在重尾分布使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 任意接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>，且被丢弃的原子中最大者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p+1)}$</span> 与保留集合中最小者 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}$</span> 之比不趋于零。这与“top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 保留高概率质量”的直觉相反。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-反例构造-Pareto-型重尾分布\">反例构造：Pareto 型重尾分布<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-反例构造-Pareto-型重尾分布\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（重尾下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 丢弃质量的定量下界）</strong> 设 (A1)–(A3) 成立，且尾部满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j&gt;n}p_{(j)}=c\\,n^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>。则对任意固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-M_p$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_p\\ge 1-p-\\frac{c}{1-\\alpha}N_p^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1)),$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span>。特别地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to 0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to 1-p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设验证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j p_{(j)}$</span> 收敛（概率质量有限），同时尾部衰减慢于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^{-1}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 增大。<span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 与慢变部分为常数是 Pareto 型构造的标准形式，满足 (A2)。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的定义，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j=1}^{N_p-1}p_{(j)}&lt;p\\le\\sum_{j=1}^{N_p}p_{(j)}=M_p$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-M_p\\le 1-p$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-M_p\\ge 1-p-p_{(N_p)}$</span>。另一方面，尾部假设给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j&gt;N_p}p_{(j)}=cN_p^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1))$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=\\sum_{j&gt;N_p}p_{(j)}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_p=cN_p^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1)).$$</div>\n<p>结合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\ge p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p=p+\\bigl(M_p-p\\bigr)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p-p\\le p_{(N_p)}$</span>，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-p-(M_p-p)\\ge 1-p-p_{(N_p)}$</span>。由 Pareto 尾部，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}\\sim c\\alpha N_p^{-\\alpha-1}$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}=c\\alpha j^{-\\alpha-1}$</span> 的精确形式求差分），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}=o(N_p^{-\\alpha})$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\ge 1-p-o(N_p^{-\\alpha})$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p^{-\\alpha}\\to 1$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 增长慢于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{1/\\alpha}$</span>，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\sim (c/(1-p))^{1/\\alpha}$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p^{-\\alpha}\\to (1-p)/c$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to 1-p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：上式最后一个极限需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的渐近形式。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\approx p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p=1-cN_p^{-\\alpha}$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\approx\\bigl(c/(1-p)\\bigr)^{1/\\alpha}$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p^{-\\alpha}\\to(1-p)/c$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to c\\cdot(1-p)/c=1-p$</span>。这里使用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\to p$</span> 的事实：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 时保留集合恰好覆盖质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，多余质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p-p$</span> 趋于零。该步骤依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}\\to0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span> 保证。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（被丢弃原子与保留原子的概率比不消失）</strong> 在上述构造下，存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa&gt;0$</span> 使沿一列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_n\\downarrow0$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p+1)}/p_{(N_p)}\\ge\\kappa$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对精确 Pareto 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}=C j^{-\\alpha-1}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为归一化常数），有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p+1)}/p_{(N_p)}=\\bigl(N_p/(N_p+1)\\bigr)^{\\alpha+1}\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 固定时）。沿 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span> 的序列，该比值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\kappa=1/2$</span> 即可。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论说明：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断边界两侧的原子概率质量相当，截断并非“切在概率悬崖上”，而是切在平缓的尾部上。这与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 在重尾下的行为一致，但 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的自适应集合大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 变化，使得丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 增大到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>，即截断丢弃了接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span> 的总质量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-拆掉假设-alpha-ge1-时结论失效\">拆掉假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge1$</span> 时结论失效<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-拆掉假设-alpha-ge1-时结论失效\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge1$</span> 时丢弃质量有上界）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A3) 成立，尾部满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j&gt;n}p_{(j)}=c n^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1))$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\le cN_p^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1))$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span>（指数尾）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由尾部表达式直接得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=cN_p^{-\\alpha}(1+o(1))$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-cN_p^{-\\alpha}\\ge p$</span> 确定，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\ge\\bigl(c/(1-p)\\bigr)^{1/\\alpha}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\le c\\cdot\\bigl(c/(1-p)\\bigr)^{-1}=1-p$</span>，但更强地，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p^{-\\alpha}\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 增长慢于任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{\\epsilon\\alpha}$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>假设失效的展示</strong>：若去掉 (A2) 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 而取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge1$</span>，命题 1 的结论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to1-p$</span> 不再成立；事实上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to0$</span>，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断几乎不丢质量。这说明重尾指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 是决定 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 偏差大小的关键参数，而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身。若进一步去掉 (A1) 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 的假设而允许原子质量为零，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的定义需改为“最小集合使质量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span>”，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 可能包含零质量原子，截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 的归一化因子不变但 KL 偏差表达式需排除零质量原子，前序节的 KL 公式在此边界下失效。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-定量估计-KL-偏差的下界\">定量估计：KL 偏差的下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-定量估计-KL-偏差的下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 3（重尾下 KL 偏差的下界）</strong> 在命题 1 的构造下，截断 KL 偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)\\ge D_p\\log\\frac{1}{M_p}+\\bigl(1-D_p\\bigr)\\log\\frac{1-D_p}{M_p}\\cdot\\frac{1}{1},$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，若记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p/M_p$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\log M_p=M_p\\log M_p.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p(x)=p(x)/M_p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_p(x)}=\\log M_p$</span>，求和得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)=M_p\\log M_p$</span>。由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p=1-D_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1-D_p)\\le -D_p$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)\\le -(1-D_p)D_p$</span>。下界方面，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to1-p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 固定时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\to p$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)\\to p\\log p&lt;0$</span>，即 KL 偏差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span>（负值表示截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 上比 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 更集中，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外的质量被丢弃，KL 作为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 的相对熵在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 外无定义，需约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log(p/0)=+\\infty$</span>；此处按前序节约定只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 内求和）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：KL 偏差的精确表达式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\log M_p$</span> 表明偏差只依赖保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p$</span>，与集合大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 无关。在重尾下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\to p$</span>，故偏差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span>，其绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\downarrow0$</span> 增大。这给出 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在重尾下的偏差量化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 越小，保留质量越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，KL 偏差越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span>，而丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\approx1-p$</span> 越大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-正确表述需补充的条件\">正确表述需补充的条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-正确表述需补充的条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上述反例表明，“top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 保留高概率质量”这一直觉需要补充条件才能成为定理。正确的表述应为：<strong>若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的尾部指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge1$</span>（中尾或指数尾），则 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\le cN_p^{-\\alpha}\\to0$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span>）；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>（重尾），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 可任意接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>，截断丢弃的质量与保留质量同阶。</strong> 因此，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的自适应集合大小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 在重尾下由尾部质量决定而非由头部质量决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的增长速度为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bigl(c/(1-p)\\bigr)^{1/\\alpha}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span> 时该速度超多项式，导致 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 极大而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p$</span> 仅略高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>边界情形</strong>：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to0$</span>，无论 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha$</span> 取值，截断趋于无截断，KL 偏差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 退化为最大原子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to1-p_{(1)}$</span>，此时 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 退化为 argmax 采样，偏差由最大原子质量决定。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>在 Pareto 型重尾分布（尾部指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span>）下，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断的丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=1-M_p$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to1-p$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span>），即截断丢弃了接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span> 的总概率质量，且被丢弃原子与保留原子的概率比不消失，截断边界不在概率悬崖上。</li>\n<li>拆掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1)$</span> 假设后结论失效：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\le cN_p^{-\\alpha}\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span>），top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 几乎不丢质量；这说明重尾指数而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 本身决定偏差大小。</li>\n<li>截断 KL 偏差的精确表达式为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p\\|q_p)=M_p\\log M_p$</span>，只依赖保留质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p$</span>；重尾下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p\\to p$</span>，偏差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span>，正确表述需补充尾部指数条件才能断言“top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 保留高概率质量”。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-4-截断边界处质量比的精确渐近\">命题 4：截断边界处质量比的精确渐近<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-4-截断边界处质量比的精确渐近\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与推论 1 只给出了比值不消失的定性结论。此处补足定量渐近，并显式验证其推导所依赖的假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（边界质量比的渐近展开）</strong> 设 (A1)、(A3) 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的降序质量满足精确 Pareto 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}=Cj^{-\\beta}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta=\\alpha+1&gt;1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 为归一化常数。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1)$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合大小。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\downarrow1$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\downarrow0$</span>）时，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_{(N_p+1)}}{p_{(N_p)}}=\\Bigl(\\frac{N_p}{N_p+1}\\Bigr)^{\\beta}\\longrightarrow 1,$$</div>\n<p>且收敛对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 一致，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{\\beta\\in(1,2]}\\bigl|p_{(N_p+1)}/p_{(N_p)}-1\\bigr|\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>假设验证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;1$</span> 保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_j j^{-\\beta}$</span> 收敛，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C$</span> 有限、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为概率质量函数，满足 (A1)。<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\downarrow1$</span> 时尾部质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{j&gt;n}j^{-\\beta}\\sim n^{1-\\beta}/(\\beta-1)$</span> 增大保证：为使保留质量达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n^{1-\\beta}/(\\beta-1)\\lesssim 1-p$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n\\gtrsim\\bigl((1-p)(\\beta-1)\\bigr)^{-1/(\\beta-1)}$</span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\downarrow1$</span> 时该下界超多项式增长。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由精确形式直接计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_{(N_p+1)}}{p_{(N_p)}}=\\frac{C(N_p+1)^{-\\beta}}{CN_p^{-\\beta}}=\\Bigl(\\frac{N_p}{N_p+1}\\Bigr)^{\\beta}.$$</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=N_p/(N_p+1)=1-1/(N_p+1)$</span>。对固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log u^{\\beta}=\\beta\\log(1-1/(N_p+1))\\to0$</span>，故比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to1$</span>。一致性：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\in(1,2]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\beta\\log u|\\le2/(N_p+1)\\to0$</span> 且与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 无关，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_\\beta|u^\\beta-1|\\le\\sup_\\beta|\\beta\\log u|\\,e^{|\\beta\\log u|}\\to0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>关键步骤说明</strong>：一致收敛性依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 的有界范围 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(1,2]$</span>。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\to\\infty$</span>（指数尾），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u^\\beta\\to0$</span>，比值趋于零，与重尾情形相反；这正是命题 2 中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to0$</span> 的边界机制。该命题因此精确刻画了“截断边界不在概率悬崖上”的数学含义：边界两侧质量比趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta$</span> 有界且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-5-丢弃质量与保留质量的比值\">命题 5：丢弃质量与保留质量的比值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-5-丢弃质量与保留质量的比值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p\\to1-p$</span>，但未给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p-p$</span>（保留集合超出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的多余质量）的相对大小。此比值决定截断的“浪费程度”：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p-p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p$</span> 同阶，则截断为了凑够 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 而多保留了与丢弃质量相当的质量，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 远非最小。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（多余质量与丢弃质量的比值）</strong> 在命题 4 的精确 Pareto 设定下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p=M_p-p$</span> 为多余质量。则当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta\\downarrow1$</span> 时</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\Delta_p}{D_p}\\longrightarrow 0,\\qquad \\frac{D_p}{p_{(N_p)}}\\longrightarrow\\infty.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p=1-D_p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=\\sum_{j&gt;N_p}Cj^{-\\beta}$</span>。对精确 Pareto 尾部，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=C\\sum_{j&gt;N_p}j^{-\\beta}\\sim C\\frac{N_p^{1-\\beta}}{\\beta-1}$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 大）。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}=CN_p^{-\\beta}$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{D_p}{p_{(N_p)}}\\sim\\frac{N_p^{1-\\beta}/(\\beta-1)}{N_p^{-\\beta}}=\\frac{N_p}{\\beta-1}\\to\\infty,$$</div>\n<p>因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p\\to\\infty$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta-1\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p/(\\beta-1)$</span> 发散更快。至于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p$</span>：由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的最小性，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p=M_p-p&lt;p_{(N_p)}$</span>（否则去掉第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 个原子仍有质量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span>，与最小性矛盾）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$0\\le\\frac{\\Delta_p}{D_p}&lt;\\frac{p_{(N_p)}}{D_p}\\sim\\frac{\\beta-1}{N_p}\\to0.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（截断集合的“浪费”上界）</strong> 在命题 5 的设定下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p\\le p_{(N_p)}$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p/D_p\\to0$</span>，即 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合几乎不浪费质量：多余质量远小于丢弃质量，截断边界紧贴 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的等值线。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p&lt;p_{(N_p)}$</span> 已证；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(N_p)}/D_p\\to0$</span> 由命题 5 的第二个极限给出。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>假设失效的展示</strong>：若去掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p$</span> 的最小性（即允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为任意满足质量和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge p$</span> 的集合而非最小集合），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p$</span> 可任意大，推论 2 失效。例如取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为全部支撑，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_p=1-p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p=0$</span>，比值无定义。这说明 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差分析必须锚定“最小集合”这一定义，前序节的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 定义在此不可省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-6-温度变换与-top--p-的复合偏差\">命题 6：温度变换与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的复合偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-6-温度变换与-top--p-的复合偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已建立温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断各自的性质。本节的反例需说明二者复合时的偏差放大机制：低温（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span>）锐化分布使尾部指数改变，从而改变 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的丢弃质量。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（温度对有效尾部指数的影响）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满足精确 Pareto 形式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{(j)}=Cj^{-\\beta}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta&gt;1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，温度变换后的降序质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,(j)}$</span> 满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\tau,(j)}\\propto j^{-\\beta/\\tau},$$</div>\n<p>即有效尾部指数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau=\\beta/\\tau$</span>。于是：</p>\n<p>(i) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span>（低温）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau&gt;\\beta$</span>，尾部更轻，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 丢弃质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\le D_p$</span>；</p>\n<p>(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span>（高温）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau&lt;\\beta$</span>，尾部更重，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau\\le1$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p$</span>（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau\\downarrow1$</span>）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。对降序原子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x_{(j)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x_{(j)})=C^{1/\\tau}j^{-\\beta/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_j C^{1/\\tau}j^{-\\beta/\\tau}$</span> 为归一化常数。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,(j)}\\propto j^{-\\beta/\\tau}$</span>，有效指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau=\\beta/\\tau$</span>。结论 (i)(ii) 直接由命题 2 与命题 1 应用于指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau$</span> 得出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\le cN_p^{-\\beta_\\tau}\\to0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau\\downarrow1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>假设验证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 有限当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta/\\tau&gt;1$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\beta$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ge\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\infty$</span>，温度变换后的分布不归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 无定义。这是本节反例的一个边界：高温采样在重尾分布上可使幂变换失去概率意义，前序节“高温采样的方差”只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\beta$</span> 成立。此边界需显式写入假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,\\beta)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（复合偏差的放大）</strong> 在命题 6 设定下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta/\\tau\\in(1,2]$</span>，则 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 上的丢弃质量满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\ge D_p$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau=\\beta/\\tau&lt;\\beta$</span>，尾部更重，故对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$N_p^{(\\tau)}\\ge N_p$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\le M_p$</span>（保留质量更接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>），于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}=1-M_p^{(\\tau)}\\ge1-M_p=D_p$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta_\\tau\\downarrow1$</span>，由命题 1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：推论 3 表明高温采样与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断复合时偏差被放大：高温使尾部更重，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为凑够 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 需保留更多原子，但保留质量仍仅略高于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，丢弃质量趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>。这与“高温增加多样性”的直觉一致，但代价是截断丢弃的质量比例更高，截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的 KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}\\to p\\log p$</span> 的绝对值随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\downarrow0$</span> 增大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-7-无截断采样的对照\">命题 7：无截断采样的对照<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-7-无截断采样的对照\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>为量化截断偏差，需与无截断采样对照。设从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 直接采样（无 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>），其期望与截断采样的期望之差给出偏差的可观测形式。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（截断期望偏差的精确表达式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f:\\mathcal X\\to\\mathbb R$</span> 有界，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|f|\\le B$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=\\sum_x f(x)p_\\tau(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]=\\sum_{x\\in S_p^{(\\tau)}}f(x)q_p^{(\\tau)}(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]-\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]\\bigr|\\le 2B\\,D_p^{(\\tau)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}=1-M_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 为丢弃质量。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 内与外的部分：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=M_p^{(\\tau)}q_p^{(\\tau)}+(1-M_p^{(\\tau)})r$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 外的条件分布。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=M_p^{(\\tau)}\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]+(1-M_p^{(\\tau)})\\mathbb E_r[f],$$</div>\n<p>故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]-\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]=(1-M_p^{(\\tau)})\\bigl(\\mathbb E_r[f]-\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]\\bigr).$$</div>\n<p>取绝对值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathbb E_r[f]-\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]|\\le2B$</span>，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\cdot|\\le2B(1-M_p^{(\\tau)})=2B\\,D_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>假设验证</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 有界保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_r[f]$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]$</span> 存在且绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，无需可积性以外的条件。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span> 无界，则需 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[|f|]&lt;\\infty$</span> 且截断期望存在，此时界改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[|f|\\mathbb 1_{S_p^{(\\tau)c}}]$</span>，即偏差由丢弃质量上的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|f|$</span> 期望控制。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（重尾下的偏差下界）</strong> 在命题 6 设定下取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\beta/\\tau\\in(1,2]$</span>，则存在有界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb 1_{S_p^{(\\tau)c}}$</span>）使</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\bigl|\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]-\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]\\bigr|=D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p\\quad(\\tau\\uparrow\\beta).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$f=\\mathbb 1_{S_p^{(\\tau)c}}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[f]=D_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q_p^{(\\tau)}}[f]=0$</span>，差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>。由推论 3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\uparrow\\beta$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_p^{(\\tau)}\\to1-p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：推论 4 给出偏差的可达下界：存在指示函数使截断期望与无截断期望之差恰为丢弃质量，且该差在高温重尾下趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p$</span>。这排除了“偏差可被有界函数平均掉”的可能：偏差不是符号相消的，而是单向丢失质量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-命题-8-截断偏差的变分表述\">命题 8：截断偏差的变分表述<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-命题-8-截断偏差的变分表述\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后补足偏差的变分刻画，使本节与前序节“截断造成的 KL 偏差”衔接而不重复其推导。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（截断分布的变分最优性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断分布。则在所有支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 的概率分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q)$</span>，且最小值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q)=\\sum_{x\\in S_p^{(\\tau)}}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q(x)}+D_p^{(\\tau)}\\log\\frac{D_p^{(\\tau)}}{0}$</span>，末项按约定为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)c}$</span> 的质量无法被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 解释）。故只需考虑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 内的项。在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p^{(\\tau)}}q(x)=1$</span> 下，Lagrange 乘子给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)\\propto p_\\tau(x)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>。代入得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q_p^{(\\tau)})=\\sum_{x\\in S_p^{(\\tau)}}p_\\tau(x)\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}=M_p^{(\\tau)}\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>假设验证</strong>：变分问题要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span>，这是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断的定义约束。若去掉该约束允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在全支撑上，则最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau$</span>、KL 为零，截断偏差消失；这说明偏差完全来自支撑限制而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的形状。<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\in(0,1]$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log M_p^{(\\tau)}\\le0$</span>，KL 非负性由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\le1$</span> 保证，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}=1$</span>（无截断）时为零。</p>\n<p><strong>说明</strong>：命题 8 与前序节的 KL 表达式一致，但此处强调变分结构：截断偏差是支撑约束下的最小 KL，而非任意分布间的 KL。这解释了为何偏差只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 而不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p^{(\\tau)}$</span> 的具体形状——只要保留质量相同，最小 KL 相同。重尾反例的实质是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M_p^{(\\tau)}\\to p$</span> 使该最小值趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\log p$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\downarrow0$</span> 绝对值增大，故小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在重尾下偏差最严重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-采样温度与校准\">采样温度与校准<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-采样温度与校准\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 下的幂变换分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序排列的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素构成的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合（nucleus 集合）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 表示截断后的采样分布。本节引入两个新符号并在此定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>校准映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C$</span>：对任意分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 与温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_\\tau(r)=r^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau(r)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau(r)=\\sum_y r(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=\\mathcal C_\\tau(p)$</span>。</li>\n<li>校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)$</span>：对参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,q_\\tau\\big),\\qquad q_\\tau=\\mathcal C_\\tau(q).$$</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau(p)\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>；(A3) 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)&gt;0$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S}q(x)=1$</span>。有限支撑使所有求和为有限和，无需交换极限；下文凡涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导，均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 内逐点进行，有限和保证 Leibniz 法则逐项适用。</p>\n<p>本节的核心问题是：温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto p_\\tau$</span> 与截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\mapsto q$</span> 是两个可交换性未知的操作，校准正是研究二者复合次序的偏差。区别在于：温度变换是<strong>满支撑</strong>的幂重加权，截断是<strong>支撑收缩</strong>的投影；前者改变形状不改变支撑，后者改变支撑不改变形状（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 比例重归一）。校准要回答的是：先截断再调温与先调温再截断，何时给出同一分布。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-温度变换与校准的交换性\">温度变换与校准的交换性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-温度变换与校准的交换性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 1（交换性判据）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 为截断集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的重归一化。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_\\tau(q)(x)=\\mathcal C_\\tau(p)(x)\\quad\\forall x\\in S$$</div>\n当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\mathcal X$</span>，或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上的对数质量比与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关，即存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)-\\log p(y)=c$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S,y\\in S^c$</span> 成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>。由定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)/Z_S$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_\\tau(q)(x)=\\frac{(p(x)/Z_S)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}(p(y)/Z_S)^{1/\\tau}}=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}},$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在分子分母同时约去。而\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_\\tau(p)(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上相等当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S^c}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=0$</span>。由 (A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)&gt;0$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c=\\varnothing$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\mathcal X$</span>。若允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上取零（放宽 (A1)），则条件退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{S^c}\\equiv 0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p$</span>，交换性平凡成立。第二种情形：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上非零但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 成比例，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{S^c}p^{1/\\tau}=c'\\sum_S p^{1/\\tau}$</span>，等式要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c'=0$</span>，仍回到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c=\\varnothing$</span>。故在 (A1) 下唯一交换情形是平凡截断。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 1 的推论是：<strong>任何非平凡截断都与温度变换不可交换</strong>，因此校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)$</span> 一般非零。这为后续定量估计奠定基础。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准误差的精确表达式\">校准误差的精确表达式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准误差的精确表达式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 2（校准误差分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的重归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span>。则对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}+p_\\tau(S)\\log\\frac{Z_\\tau(q)}{Z_\\tau(p)}+\\infty\\cdot\\mathbb 1\\big[p_\\tau(S^c)&gt;0\\big],$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau(q)=\\sum_{y\\in S}q(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，末项表示 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau&gt;0$</span> 造成的发散。更紧凑地，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的条件化，则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_\\tau^S\\,\\|\\,q_\\tau\\big)+p_\\tau(S^c)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(S^c)}{q_\\tau(S^c)},$$</div>\n且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(S^c)=0$</span>，故第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)&gt;0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由定义\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q_\\tau(x)}.$$</div>\n对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S^c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau(x)=0$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau(p)&gt;0$</span>（由 (A1)），故该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q_\\tau(x)}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}+\\log\\frac{Z_\\tau(q)}{Z_\\tau(p)}.$$</div>\n将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau(p)$</span> 代入并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span> 求和：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{q_\\tau(x)}=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}+p_\\tau(S)\\log\\frac{Z_\\tau(q)}{Z_\\tau(p)}.$$</div>\n合并 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 项即得第一式（将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 项写作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)\\log p_\\tau(S^c)/0$</span> 的极限形式）。第二式由 KL 的条件化分解恒等式直接得到：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q_\\tau)=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^S\\|q_\\tau^S)+p_\\tau(S^c)\\log(p_\\tau(S^c)/q_\\tau(S^c))$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau^S=q_\\tau$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 2 表明：只要截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 在温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下仍承载非零的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 质量（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)&gt;0$</span>），校准误差就是无穷大——这不是数值上的大，而是支撑不匹配导致的绝对偏差。有限偏差只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)=0$</span> 时出现，而这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p|_{S^c}\\equiv 0$</span>，与 (A1) 矛盾。因此<strong>在满支撑参考分布下，任何非平凡截断的校准误差都是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span></strong>。这一结论把“截断造成分布偏差”从数值问题提升为结构问题。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-有限温度下的校准修正\">有限温度下的校准修正<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-有限温度下的校准修正\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>既然 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau$</span> 在 (A1) 下恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，有意义的校准量应改为<strong>截断前后在同一支撑上的偏差</strong>。定义<strong>支撑内校准误差</strong>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau^S(p,q)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_\\tau^S\\,\\|\\,q_\\tau\\big),\\qquad p_\\tau^S(x)=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}}{p_\\tau(S)}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（支撑内校准误差的显式公式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau^S(p,q)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau^S(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}+\\log Z_\\tau(q)-\\log Z_\\tau(p)-\\log p_\\tau(S).$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 直接计算：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau^S=\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau^S(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^S(x)}{q_\\tau(x)}=\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau^S(x)\\Big[\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}-\\log\\frac{Z_\\tau(p)}{Z_\\tau(q)}+\\log\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(S)}\\Big].$$</div>\n利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S}p_\\tau^S(x)=1$</span> 整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 的关键结构是：第一项是<strong>对数似然比在截断后温度分布下的期望</strong>，度量截断集合内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的形状差异；后三项只依赖归一化常数与截断质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S)$</span>，度量截断造成的质量损失。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 都趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的均匀分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S\\to0$</span>：此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S)\\to|S|/n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau(p)\\to n$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau(q)\\to|S|$</span>，三项对数常数精确抵消，而第一项以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1/\\tau)$</span> 趋于零。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的众数，若众数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S\\to\\delta_{x^*}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S\\sim\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\log\\frac{p(x^*)}{q(x^*)}=\\frac{\\log Z_S}{\\tau}$</span> 发散（<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_S=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>；除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\mathcal X$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_S=0$</span>）。这解释了低温下截断偏差被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 放大的现象。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-具体例子-三元素分布上的校准误差\">具体例子：三元素分布上的校准误差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-具体例子-三元素分布上的校准误差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=0.1$</span>。取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(a)=0.6/0.9=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(b)=1/3$</span>。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S)=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S(a)=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S(b)=1/3$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=q$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_1^S=\\frac{2}{3}\\log\\frac{0.6}{2/3}+\\frac{1}{3}\\log\\frac{0.3}{1/3}+\\log 1-\\log 1-\\log 0.9.$$</div>\n逐项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{2}{3}\\log 0.9+\\frac{1}{3}\\log 0.9=\\log 0.9$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 0.9$</span> 抵消，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_1^S=0$</span>。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau^S$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时成立一致（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span> 正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的重归一化）。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p^{2}=(0.36,0.09,0.01)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{0.5}(p)=0.46$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}=(0.7826,0.1957,0.0217)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}(S)=0.9783$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}^S=(0.8,0.2)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{2}=(4/9,1/9)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_{0.5}(q)=5/9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.5}=(0.8,0.2)$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{0.5}^S=0$</span>。这并非巧合：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的重归一化时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=\\mathcal C_\\tau(q)$</span> 恰好等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，因为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathcal C_\\tau(q)(x)=\\frac{(p(x)/Z_S)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}(p(y)/Z_S)^{1/\\tau}}=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}=p_\\tau^S(x).$$</div>\n所以对<strong>重归一化型截断</strong>（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均属此类），支撑内校准误差恒为零。真正的校准偏差来自定理 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)$</span> 项，即被截掉的质量在温度变换下的残余。</p>\n<p>计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span> 时的被截质量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{0.5}(c)=0.0217$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_{0.5}(p,q)=+\\infty$</span>，但若用“截断前后总变差”度量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\|p_{0.5}-q_{0.5}\\|_{\\mathrm{TV}}=p_{0.5}(c)=0.0217$</span>。这说明校准误差的无穷大在数值上对应一个可测的有限质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)$</span>，后者随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)\\to 0$</span>（若众数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)\\to|S^c|/n=1/3$</span>。<strong>低温截断的校准偏差小，高温截断的校准偏差大</strong>，这与直觉相反：低温下分布尖锐，截断集合容易覆盖几乎全部质量；高温下分布平坦，截断集合丢失的质量比例上升。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准的操作定义与可检验恒等式\">校准的操作定义与可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准的操作定义与可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>将上述观察提炼为校准的操作定义：给定参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>、截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，<strong>校准质量损失</strong>定义为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{x\\in S^c}p_\\tau(x)=1-p_\\tau(S).$$</div>\n它是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=+\\infty$</span> 的有限代理量，且满足恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$L_\\tau(S)=\\frac{\\sum_{x\\in S^c}p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>推论 4（阈值截断下质量损失的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{x:p(x)\\ge\\lambda\\}$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 或 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断集合（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 恰为低概率尾部）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调递增；对一般集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，单调性不成立。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x=\\log p(x)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/\\tau}=e^{a_x/\\tau}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{S^c}e^{a_x/\\tau}/\\sum_{\\mathcal X}e^{a_x/\\tau}$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}L_\\tau(S)=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\Big[\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[a_X\\mathbb 1_{X\\in S^c}]-L_\\tau(S)\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[a_X]\\Big]=-\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\tau}(a_X,\\mathbb 1_{X\\in S^c}).$$</div>\n当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为阈值截断时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c=\\{p&lt;\\lambda\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x=\\log p(x)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上系统性低于全空间均值，故协方差为负，导数非负，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 单调递增。对一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 协方差符号不定：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{c\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c=\\{a,b\\}$</span> 集中了高概率原子，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上系统性偏大，协方差为正，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 严格递减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.8$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/3$</span>）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-代码验证-校准误差与质量损失\">代码验证：校准误差与质量损失<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-代码验证-校准误差与质量损失\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码在有限分布上计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span>、支撑内校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 与质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span>，并验证推论 3 的公式与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 的单调性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef temperature_transform(p, tau):\n    logits = np.log(p) / tau\n    logits -= logits.max()\n    w = np.exp(logits)\n    return w / w.sum()\n\ndef topk_truncate(p, k):\n    idx = np.argsort(-p)[:k]\n    q = np.zeros_like(p)\n    q[idx] = p[idx] / p[idx].sum()\n    return q, idx\n\ndef support_inner_kl(p, q, tau):\n    # 推论 3 公式，S 为 q 的支撑；Z_tau 必须用未归一化的幂和\n    S = q &gt; 0\n    p_tau = temperature_transform(p, tau)\n    p_tau_S = p_tau[S] / p_tau[S].sum()\n    Z_p = np.sum(p ** (1.0 / tau))\n    Z_q = np.sum(q[S] ** (1.0 / tau))\n    val = np.sum(p_tau_S * np.log(p[S] / q[S])) / tau\n    val += np.log(Z_q) - np.log(Z_p) - np.log(p_tau[S].sum())\n    return val\n\np = np.array([0.6, 0.3, 0.1])\nq, idx = topk_truncate(p, 2)\nassert np.allclose(q, np.array([2/3, 1/3, 0.0]))\n\nfor tau in [0.5, 1.0, 2.0]:\n    p_tau = temperature_transform(p, tau)\n    q_tau = temperature_transform(q, tau)\n    # 支撑内 KL 直接计算\n    S = q &gt; 0\n    p_tau_S = p_tau[S] / p_tau[S].sum()\n    kl_direct = np.sum(p_tau_S * np.log(p_tau_S / q_tau[S]))\n    kl_formula = support_inner_kl(p, q, tau)\n    assert abs(kl_direct - kl_formula) &lt; 1e-12, (tau, kl_direct, kl_formula)\n    L = 1.0 - p_tau[S].sum()\n    print(f&quot;tau={tau}: Delta_S={kl_direct:.3e}, L_tau={L:.4f}, p_tau(S^c)={p_tau[~S].sum():.4f}&quot;)\n\n# top-k 下质量损失单调性\ntaus = np.linspace(0.1, 5.0, 50)\nL_vals = []\nfor tau in taus:\n    p_tau = temperature_transform(p, tau)\n    L_vals.append(1.0 - p_tau[idx].sum())\nL_vals = np.array(L_vals)\nassert np.all(np.diff(L_vals) &gt;= -1e-12), &quot;L_tau 应在 top-k 下单调递增&quot;\nprint(&quot;shape of L_vals:&quot;, L_vals.shape)\nprint(&quot;monotone increasing:&quot;, bool(np.all(np.diff(L_vals) &gt;= -1e-12)))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_S^S$</span> 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（重归一化型截断的支撑内校准误差恒为零），<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大而增大；最后断言通过，打印 <code>shape of L_vals: (50,)</code> 与 <code>monotone increasing: True</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准的逆问题-给定温度反解截断阈值\">校准的逆问题：给定温度反解截断阈值<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准的逆问题-给定温度反解截断阈值\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前文把校准理解为“给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，计算偏差”。工程中更常见的是逆问题：给定目标温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 与可接受的质量损失上限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>，求最小的截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。这给出<strong>温度—截断联合校准</strong>的操作定义。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（逆问题的存在性与唯一性）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in(0,1)$</span>。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x_{(1)},\\dots,x_{(n)}\\}$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 降序排列的元素，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_m=\\{x_{(1)},\\dots,x_{(m)}\\}$</span>。则存在唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*\\in\\{1,\\dots,n\\}$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_{m^*})\\le\\varepsilon$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_{m^*-1})&gt;\\varepsilon$</span>（约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_0)=1$</span>）。若进一步要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 型（按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 排序），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span> 可能不存在。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 满支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_m)=1-\\sum_{i\\le m}p_\\tau(x_{(i)})$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 严格递减，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_0)=1&gt;\\varepsilon$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_n)=0\\le\\varepsilon$</span>。由离散介值性，存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span> 使首次跌破 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>。对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 型：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的排序在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ne 1$</span> 时一般不同（幂变换保序但当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span> 时放大差距、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时压缩差距，均不改变严格序，故排序其实相同——此处需注意：<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格单调，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的降序排列完全一致）。因此 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 型与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 型给出同一族集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span> 总存在。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>一种常见的误算是认为“高温下应截更多元素以保住质量”，从而把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span> 当作 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的增函数。实际上由推论 4（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 递增），固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m$</span> 时高温的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S_m)$</span> 更大，故为达到同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，高温需要更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span>。这与“高温截更多”方向一致，但机制是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 平坦化使固定集合外的质量占比上升，而非排序变化。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准误差的可加分解与温度极限\">校准误差的可加分解与温度极限<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准误差的可加分解与温度极限\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 6（温度两端极限）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空。</p>\n<p>(i) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 0^+$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的唯一众数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^*\\in S$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\to 0$</span>，且对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span> 存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;\\tau_0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)&lt;\\delta$</span>。</p>\n<p>(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\to|S^c|/n$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> (i) 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x=\\log p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a^*=\\max_x a_x$</span> 且唯一。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=e^{a_x/\\tau}/\\sum_y e^{a_y/\\tau}$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x/\\tau\\to-\\infty$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\ne x^*$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_{x^*}/\\tau\\to-\\infty$</span> 但相对差距 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(a^*-a_x)/\\tau\\to+\\infty$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x^*)\\to1$</span>，其余趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^*\\in S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)=1-p_\\tau(S)\\to0$</span>。(ii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x/\\tau\\to0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\to1/n$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\to|S^c|/n$</span>。两极限均为有限和下的逐点收敛，无需 Dominated Convergence。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 给出校准的<strong>温度标定曲线</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 从低温端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（众数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内）单调升至高温端的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S^c|/n$</span>。这条曲线是校准的核心对象——它把“温度”与“截断偏差”定量绑定，使得给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 可反解出允许的最高温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}(\\varepsilon,S)$</span>。由命题 5 与命题 6，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}$</span> 存在且由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)=\\varepsilon$</span> 唯一确定（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 严格单调的区间内）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准与熵的联合约束\">校准与熵的联合约束<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准与熵的联合约束\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>温度变换改变熵，截断也改变熵，校准必须同时约束二者。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\tau(p)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=-\\sum_{x\\in S}q(x)\\log q(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 7（熵—质量损失的联合恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的重归一化。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q)=H\\big(p_\\tau^S\\big)+\\log p_\\tau(S)-H_\\tau(p)+H_\\tau(p)-H\\big(p_\\tau^S\\big)+\\log p_\\tau(S),$$</div>\n更简洁地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=H(p_\\tau^S)+\\log p_\\tau(S)-H_\\tau(p)+H_\\tau(p)$</span> 中消去同项后得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q)-H(p_\\tau^S)=\\log p_\\tau(S)-H_\\tau(p)+H_\\tau(p)=0\\ \\text{（当且仅当 }q=p_\\tau^S\\text{）}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau^S$</span>（重归一化型截断的支撑内分布恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的条件化，见前文例子），<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=H(p_\\tau^S)$</span> 直接成立。一般地，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q)=-\\sum_{x\\in S}q(x)\\log q(x)=-\\sum_{x\\in S}q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p_\\tau^S(x)}-\\sum_{x\\in S}q(x)\\log p_\\tau^S(x)=\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p_\\tau^S)+H(p_\\tau^S),$$</div>\n其中第二项用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_S q=1$</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)-H(p_\\tau^S)=\\mathrm{KL}(q\\|p_\\tau^S)\\ge0$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau^S$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>一种常见的误算是在推论 7 中把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\tau(p)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau^S)$</span> 混同。二者关系是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H_\\tau(p)=p_\\tau(S)H(p_\\tau^S)+p_\\tau(S^c)H(p_\\tau^{S^c})+h(p_\\tau(S)),$$</div>\n其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$h(s)=-s\\log s-(1-s)\\log(1-s)$</span> 为二元熵，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{S^c}$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上的条件化。这是熵的条件化分解恒等式，对任意分割 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{S,S^c\\}$</span> 成立。它表明：截断后熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=H(p_\\tau^S)$</span> 只是总熵的一个条件化分量，总熵与截断熵之差恰为被截质量的条件熵与二元熵之和。校准若只匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)$</span> 而忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(S^c)$</span> 的贡献，就会系统性低估高温下的偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准的可检验恒等式-温度-截断对偶\">校准的可检验恒等式：温度—截断对偶<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准的可检验恒等式-温度-截断对偶\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把命题 1 的不可交换性、定理 2 的无穷偏差、推论 3 的支撑内零偏差、命题 6 的两端极限放在一起，得到本节的核心恒等式。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 8（温度—截断对偶恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，对任意非平凡截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subsetneq\\mathcal X$</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=+\\infty,\\qquad \\Delta_\\tau^S(p,q)=0,\\qquad L_\\tau(S)=1-p_\\tau(S),$$</div>\n且三者满足\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}L_\\tau(S)=0\\ \\text{（众数在 }S\\text{ 内）},\\qquad \\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}L_\\tau(S)=\\frac{|S^c|}{n}.$$</div></p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 第一式由定理 2；第二式由前文例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_\\tau(q)=p_\\tau^S$</span> 的恒等式；第三式为定义。两端极限由命题 6。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 8 的校准含义是：<strong>截断偏差的全部信息被压缩进一个标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span></strong>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 分别取两个极端值（<span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>），不携带关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的连续信息。因此工程上谈“温度校准”时，真正可调、可测、可反解的量是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span>，而非 KL 散度本身。这也解释了为何实践中用“被截概率质量”而非“KL”作为截断阈值的选择依据：前者有限、单调、可逆，后者在满支撑下恒为无穷。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准曲线的可逆性与温度上界\">校准曲线的可逆性与温度上界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准曲线的可逆性与温度上界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>定理 8 把校准信息压缩为标量函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span>，但尚未回答一个操作性问题：给定质量损失上限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span>，是否存在唯一温度使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)=\\varepsilon$</span>，从而把“允许的最高温度”定义为一个良定的函数而非集合？这需要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 上的严格单调性，而前文对推论 4 的讨论已指出该单调性只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 型时成立。下面把这个条件写成命题，并给出可逆性的精确陈述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（校准曲线的严格单调与可逆）</strong> 在 (A1) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;n$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 上严格单调递增且连续，从而对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\in\\big(0,\\,|S^c|/n\\big)$</span> 存在唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^*\\in(0,\\infty)$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\tau^*}(S)=\\varepsilon$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 连续性由有限和直接得到。严格单调性用前文推论 4 证明中的协方差表达式：记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x=\\log p(x)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}L_\\tau(S)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\,\\mathrm{Cov}_{p_\\tau}\\big(a_X,\\ \\mathbb 1_{X\\in S^c}\\big).$$</div>\n因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序选取，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-k$</span> 个元素，故对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S^c$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\in S$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_x&lt;a_y$</span>。于是指示函数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb 1_{X\\in S^c}$</span> 关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_X$</span> 单调递减，由协方差的 Chebyshev 型不等式，单调递减函数与单调递增变量的协方差非正；又因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a_X$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上均取非常数（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$n-k\\ge1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内不全相等），协方差严格为负。故导数严格为正。值域由命题 6：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)\\to|S^c|/n$</span>，连续严格递增函数把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,\\infty)$</span> 映到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\big(0,|S^c|/n\\big)$</span> 上，介值性给出唯一原像。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 的意义在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}(\\varepsilon,S)$</span> 从一个“存在某个温度”的模糊陈述升级为<strong>良定义的校准函数</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}(\\varepsilon,S)=L_\\tau(S)^{-1}(\\varepsilon)$</span>。它同时说明为什么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 必须严格小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S^c|/n$</span>——若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon\\ge|S^c|/n$</span>，则任意温度都满足约束，温度上界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，校准失去约束力；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0$</span>，则只有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 的极限满足，温度上界退化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。这两个边界正是校准曲线两端极限的直接推论。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-校准误差的变分表示\">校准误差的变分表示<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-校准误差的变分表示\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>支撑内校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 对重归一化型截断恒为零，但这只是因为在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=p_\\tau^S$</span>。若截断不是重归一化型（例如带重复惩罚的截断，或人为修改了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内概率的截断），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 就不再为零，需要一般表达式。下面用变分恒等式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 之间的精确联系，把两个看似独立的量绑定。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 10（支撑内偏差的变分恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上但不必等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span>。则\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_\\tau^S(p,q)=\\sup_{g:S\\to\\mathbb R}\\Big\\{\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau^S}[g]-\\log\\mathbb E_{q_\\tau}\\big[e^{g}\\big]\\Big\\},$$</div>\n且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=p_\\tau^S$</span> 时上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 处取到，值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</p>\n<p><em>证明.</em> 这是 KL 散度的 Donsker–Varadhan 变分表示，对有限支撑上的任意两个分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r,s$</span> 成立：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(r\\|s)=\\sup_g\\big\\{\\mathbb E_r[g]-\\log\\mathbb E_s[e^g]\\big\\}.$$</div>\n取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=p_\\tau^S$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$s=q_\\tau$</span>，即得。上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g=\\log(r/s)$</span> 处取到（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s$</span> 的支撑上），此时值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(r\\|s)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=p_\\tau^S$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=s$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，且由 Jensen 不等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_r[g]-\\log\\mathbb E_r[e^g]\\le0$</span> 对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$g$</span> 成立，故上确界确为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 10 的校准含义是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 度量的是“用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 的指数矩去拟合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^S$</span> 的线性泛函”时能达到的最好精度。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau=p_\\tau^S$</span> 时这一拟合是精确的（<span class=\"math-inline\">$g\\equiv0$</span>），偏差为零；一旦 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内被扰动（如重复惩罚压低高概率 token），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 就以变分下界的形式量化扰动幅度。结合定理 8，完整的校准偏差由两部分组成：支撑内的变分偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span>（有限，由命题 10 给出）与支撑外的质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span>（有限标量，由命题 9 可逆）。二者之和才是截断对参考分布的全部偏离，而定理 2 中的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 正是支撑外部分在 KL 意义下的极限表现。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-温度标定的数值不变量\">温度标定的数值不变量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-温度标定的数值不变量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可直接在代码中检验的不变量，把命题 9 与命题 10 串起来：对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S\\equiv0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 的严格单调性同时成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}(\\varepsilon,S)$</span> 可由二分法唯一求出。这个不变量是校准实现正确性的判据——若数值实现中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 非零或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau$</span> 非单调，则说明截断未按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序选取，或温度变换的归一化有误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\ndef temperature_transform(p, tau):\n    a = np.log(p) / tau\n    e = np.exp(a - a.max())\n    return e / e.sum()\n\ndef topk_truncate(p, k):\n    order = np.argsort(-p)[:k]\n    out = np.zeros_like(p)\n    out[order] = p[order] / p[order].sum()\n    return out, order\n\ndef L_tau(p, idx, tau):\n    return 1.0 - temperature_transform(p, tau)[idx].sum()\n\ndef tau_max(p, idx, eps, lo=1e-6, hi=1e3, iters=200):\n    for _ in range(iters):\n        mid = 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n        if L_tau(p, idx, mid) &lt; eps:\n            lo = mid\n        else:\n            hi = mid\n    return 0.5 * (lo + hi)\n\np = np.array([0.5, 0.25, 0.15, 0.07, 0.03])\nq, idx = topk_truncate(p, 3)\nassert np.allclose(q[idx], p[idx] / p[idx].sum())\n\n# 不变量 1：支撑内校准误差恒为零\nfor tau in [0.3, 1.0, 3.0]:\n    p_tau = temperature_transform(p, tau)\n    q_tau = temperature_transform(q, tau)\n    p_tau_S = p_tau[idx] / p_tau[idx].sum()\n    kl = np.sum(p_tau_S * np.log(p_tau_S / q_tau[idx]))\n    assert abs(kl) &lt; 1e-12, (tau, kl)\n\n# 不变量 2：L_tau 严格单调\ntaus = np.linspace(0.1, 10.0, 200)\nLv = np.array([L_tau(p, idx, t) for t in taus])\nassert np.all(np.diff(Lv) &gt; 0), &quot;L_tau 应严格递增&quot;\n\n# 不变量 3：tau_max 可逆\neps = 0.2\nt_star = tau_max(p, idx, eps)\nassert abs(L_tau(p, idx, t_star) - eps) &lt; 1e-6\nprint(&quot;shape of Lv:&quot;, Lv.shape)\nprint(&quot;tau_max(eps=0.2) =&quot;, round(t_star, 6))\nprint(&quot;L_tau at tau_max =&quot;, round(L_tau(p, idx, t_star), 8))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行预期：三个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下支撑内 KL 均为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>；单调性断言通过；二分法给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^*$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_{\\tau^*}(S)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=0.2$</span> 相差小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，打印 <code>shape of Lv: (200,)</code>、<code>tau_max(eps=0.2) = ...</code> 与 <code>L_tau at tau_max = 0.2</code>。该不变量把命题 9 的可逆性与命题 10 的零偏差同时编码为可执行断言，构成校准实现的最小验证集。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal C_\\tau$</span> 与截断投影在满支撑参考分布下不可交换：任何非平凡截断都使校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau(p,q)=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q_\\tau)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S^c$</span> 上为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 恒正。</li>\n<li>支撑内校准误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta_\\tau^S$</span> 对重归一化型截断（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）恒为零，真正的校准偏差由被截质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)=p_\\tau(S^c)$</span> 承担；<span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 在 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断下关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 单调递增，低温截断丢失的质量比例小于高温截断。</li>\n<li>校准的操作含义是：截断偏差不是形状偏差而是支撑偏差，其有限代理量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 随温度升高而增大，故高温采样下截断的分布偏差比低温采样更严重，这与“高温更随机”的直觉方向一致但机制不同——高温下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 平坦化使尾部质量占比上升，截断丢失的比例随之上升。</li>\n<li>校准的逆问题是给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 反解最小截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span>；因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto x^{1/\\tau}$</span> 严格单调，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 排序一致，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 型与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 型给出同一族集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span> 总存在，且高温需要更大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m^*$</span>。</li>\n<li>质量损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span> 在低温端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>（众数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内）、高温端趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S^c|/n$</span>，构成温度标定曲线；给定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 可反解允许的最高温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_{\\max}(\\varepsilon,S)$</span>。</li>\n<li>熵的条件化分解 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H_\\tau(p)=p_\\tau(S)H(p_\\tau^S)+p_\\tau(S^c)H(p_\\tau^{S^c})+h(p_\\tau(S))$</span> 表明截断熵只是总熵的一个分量；温度—截断对偶恒等式把校准信息压缩为标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L_\\tau(S)$</span>，KL 偏差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 两个极端值，不携带连续温度信息。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-截断与无偏采样的取舍\">截断与无偏采样的取舍<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断与无偏采样的取舍\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为模型在有限词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=N&lt;\\infty$</span>）上的原始下一词分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 为温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 下的幂变换分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（nucleus）集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为截断后重新归一化的采样分布。本节新引入的符号如下，并在此集中定义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上全体概率向量构成的单纯形，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立（本节默认满支撑，若某坐标为零则相应项按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 约定处理）。</li>\n<li>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)$</span>，并记截断算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_A:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)\\to\\mathcal P(A)$</span> 为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Pi_A p(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in A}}{p(A)},\\qquad p(A)&gt;0.$$</div></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal V}q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p(x)}$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时该项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。</li>\n<li>熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)=-\\sum_x q(x)\\log q(x)$</span>，底数取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e$</span>（自然对数），故所有 KL 与熵均以 nat 计。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>本节的核心假设（H1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 满支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>。有限性保证所有求和有限、所有极值可达，从而避免测度论层面的收敛性讨论；满支撑保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p(x)$</span> 处处有限，KL 表达式无奇异项。凡命题需要额外条件（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 或 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的特定结构），将在该命题的假设条目中单独列出。</p>\n<p>本节要回答的问题是：截断采样以“牺牲无偏性”换取“可控的支撑与熵”，这一取舍的精确代价是什么？我们将把“代价”定义为截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span> 相对原始分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL 偏差，并证明该偏差有精确的分解式，进而说明在何种意义下截断是“最小偏差”的，以及在何种意义下它不是。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-1-截断偏差的精确分解\">1. 截断偏差的精确分解<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-1-截断偏差的精确分解\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>先给出与相邻概念的区别。温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 是<strong>满支撑</strong>的幂重加权：它改变每个坐标的概率值但不删除任何坐标，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_\\tau)=\\mathrm{supp}(p)=\\mathcal V$</span>。截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span> 则相反：它<strong>保持概率值比例不变</strong>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)\\propto p(x)$</span>），但把支撑收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>。二者是两种正交的分布改造手段：一个动值不动支撑，一个动支撑不动值。这一区别是本节全部结论的出发点。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 1（截断 KL 的精确分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p(x)}=-\\log p(A).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p(x)/p(A)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q(x)/p(x))=-\\log p(A)$</span>，该值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)\\bigl(-\\log p(A)\\bigr)=-\\log p(A)\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)=-\\log p(A),$$</div>\n最后一步用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上归一化，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)=1$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span>，按约定贡献为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这个恒等式是本节的主定理，它把“截断偏差”这一看似需要逐坐标计算的对象，压缩为一个标量：<strong>被截掉的总概率质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p(A)$</span> 的对数</strong>。其可检验推论立即给出：</p>\n<p><strong>推论 1（偏差的单调性与界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>同命题 1。<strong>结论</strong>：\n(i) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)\\ge 0$</span>，等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=1$</span>；\n(ii) 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq B$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_A p\\,\\|\\,p)\\ge \\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_B p\\,\\|\\,p)$</span>；\n(iii) 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)\\to 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)\\to 0$</span>，且一阶展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=(1-p(A))+O\\bigl((1-p(A))^2\\bigr)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：(i) 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)\\ge 0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)\\le 1$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=1$</span>。(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq B\\Rightarrow p(A)\\le p(B)\\Rightarrow -\\log p(A)\\ge -\\log p(B)$</span>。(iii) 令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=1-p(A)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(1-\\epsilon)=\\epsilon+\\epsilon^2/2+O(\\epsilon^3)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 1(iii) 给出一个工程上可直接测量的结论：<strong>截断偏差的一阶近似就是被丢弃的质量本身</strong>。这解释了为何 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 时“几乎无偏”，而在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 较小时偏差迅速上升。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.6,0.3,0.1)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=(2/3,1/3,0)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log 0.9\\approx 0.10536$</span> nat。直接计算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tfrac23\\log\\tfrac{2/3}{0.6}+\\tfrac13\\log\\tfrac{1/3}{0.3}=\\tfrac23\\log\\tfrac{10}{9}+\\tfrac13\\log\\tfrac{10}{9}=\\log\\tfrac{10}{9}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 0.9$</span> 一致。一阶近似 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=0.1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，与精确值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.10536$</span> 的相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$5\\%$</span>，验证了推论 1(iii)。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-2-无偏采样的不可能性与-最小偏差-刻画\">2. 无偏采样的不可能性与“最小偏差”刻画<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-2-无偏采样的不可能性与-最小偏差-刻画\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>截断采样必然有偏（推论 1(i)），那么是否存在一种截断方式使偏差“最小”？答案取决于我们允许何种截断。这里必须把两类截断严格区分：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬截断</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 给定，支撑被强制收缩，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外严格为零。</li>\n<li><strong>软截断（无偏重加权）</strong>：不删除坐标，而是对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 作重加权使某目标泛函（如熵）达到指定值，典型代表即温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>命题 2（硬截断的最小偏差集合）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，固定基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,N\\}$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：在所有满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|=k$</span> 的集合中，使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_A p\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 恰为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 值最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个坐标构成的集合，平局任取）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_A p\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log p(A)$</span> 仅依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>，且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span> 单调递减。故最小化 KL 等价于最大化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|=k$</span> 的约束下，和的最大值由取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 值最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个坐标达到，这正是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的定义。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 2 说明：<strong>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断在“固定支撑大小”这一约束下是最优的</strong>——它丢弃的质量最少。但请注意，这个“最优”是在硬截断类内、以支撑基数为约束的优化；它并不意味着 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 是“无偏”的，恰恰相反，命题 1 已表明只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)&lt;1$</span> 就有正偏差。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 3（软截断可实现零 KL 但非零支撑收缩）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 如本章第 1 节定义。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_\\tau)=\\mathcal V$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 一般不为零；但存在唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=H(p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：满支撑由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0\\Rightarrow p(x)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span> 得到。<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_\\tau)=H(p)$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>（由严格凸性，熵相等不直接蕴含分布相等，但此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的幂变换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ne 1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的严格单调重排，熵严格不同——这一点由本章第 2 节已证，此处仅引用其结论，不重复展开）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 3 的要点是：<strong>软截断不删除支撑，因此不存在“被截掉的质量”意义上的偏差</strong>；它的偏差是重加权偏差，量级由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的程度控制。这与硬截断的偏差（由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-p(A)$</span> 控制）是两种不同的量。工程上把二者混为一谈（例如认为“温度也是截断”）是常见的符号错误。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-3-取舍的定量表述-偏差-支撑-熵三角\">3. 取舍的定量表述：偏差—支撑—熵三角<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-3-取舍的定量表述-偏差-支撑-熵三角\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>现在把上述两条路径放在同一坐标系中。对硬截断，定义三元组 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(|\\mathrm{supp}(q)|,\\,H(q),\\,\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p))$</span>；对软截断，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(N,\\,H(p_\\tau),\\,\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p))$</span>。下面的命题给出硬截断三元组之间的一个精确恒等式，它把“支撑大小”与“偏差”直接挂钩。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 4（硬截断的偏差—质量恒等式）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q)=-\\sum_{x\\in A}\\frac{p(x)}{p(A)}\\log\\frac{p(x)}{p(A)}=\\frac{1}{p(A)}\\Bigl(-\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)\\log p(x)\\Bigr)-\\log p(A).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log q(x)=\\log p(x)-\\log p(A)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$H(q)=-\\sum_{x\\in A}\\frac{p(x)}{p(A)}\\bigl(\\log p(x)-\\log p(A)\\bigr)=\\frac{1}{p(A)}\\Bigl(-\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)\\log p(x)\\Bigr)+\\log p(A)\\cdot\\frac{p(A)}{p(A)},$$</div>\n整理即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 4 的右端第一项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上“未归一化熵”除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>，第二项是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span> 的相反数。结合命题 1，得到恒等式\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log p(A)=H(q)-\\frac{1}{p(A)}\\Bigl(-\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)\\log p(x)\\Bigr).$$</div>\n这个恒等式说明：<strong>截断偏差恰好等于截断后熵与“<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内条件熵”之差</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 近似均匀时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum_{x\\in A}p(x)\\log p(x)\\approx p(A)\\log|A|$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)\\approx H(q)-\\log|A|$</span>，即偏差近似等于“截断分布熵与均匀分布熵之差”。这给出了一个可操作的诊断量：若测得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q)$</span> 明显低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log|A|$</span>，则截断偏差主要来自 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内分布的不均匀，而非来自被丢弃的质量。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 2（top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的 KL 上界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_{S_k}p$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log p(S_k)\\le\\log\\frac{N}{k}\\quad\\text{（当 }k&lt;N\\text{ 时）}.$$</div></p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个最大坐标的平均值不小于全空间平均值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/N$</span>（删去最小的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N-k$</span> 个坐标只会提高平均值），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)\\ge k/N$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(S_k)\\le\\log(N/k)$</span>。紧性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 均匀时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)=k/N$</span>，等号成立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-无偏采样的代价-为什么不能-既要又要\">4. 无偏采样的代价：为什么不能“既要又要”<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-无偏采样的代价-为什么不能-既要又要\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后回答标题中的“取舍”。设我们希望采样分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 满足两个目标：(T1) 支撑收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|&lt;N$</span>）；(T2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无偏，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=0$</span>。命题 1 立即给出矛盾：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&lt;1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log p(A)&gt;0$</span>。因此 (T1) 与 (T2) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&lt;1$</span> 时<strong>不可同时满足</strong>。这不是技术困难，而是信息论层面的硬约束：把正概率质量强制置零，必然产生正的 KL 偏差，且偏差量恰为被置零质量的对数。</p>\n<p>那么“无偏采样”在什么意义上可能？只有放弃 (T1)，即不收缩支撑，改用软重加权。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=p_\\tau$</span> 满支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 可以任意小（当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to 1$</span>），但支撑始终是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span>。这就是取舍的精确表述：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬截断</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}=-\\log p(A)$</span> 的偏差换取支撑从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$N$</span> 收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|$</span>，偏差由被丢弃质量唯一决定（命题 1），且在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|$</span> 下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 最小化该偏差（命题 2）。</li>\n<li><strong>软重加权</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ne 1$</span> 的重加权偏差换取熵的调整，支撑不变（命题 3），偏差不由“丢弃质量”刻画。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上的混合策略（先温度再 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）因此是两种偏差的叠加：温度改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的值分布，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 再在其上丢弃质量。设先做温度得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>，再取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=S_p(p_\\tau)$</span>，则最终偏差为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\bigl(\\Pi_A p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p\\bigr)=\\underbrace{\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)}_{\\text{重加权偏差}}+\\underbrace{\\bigl(-\\log p_\\tau(A)\\bigr)}_{\\text{截断偏差}},$$</div>\n其中第二项由命题 1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 得到。两项之和一般不等于任一单项，且第二项依赖于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>——这解释了为何调温度会间接改变 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的有效截断偏差：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 越小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 越尖锐，同样的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阈值下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)$</span> 越接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，截断偏差越小，但重加权偏差越大。二者的权衡点由具体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 决定，不存在与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 无关的最优 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-5-截断偏差的变分刻画-硬截断是约束-KL-投影\">5. 截断偏差的变分刻画：硬截断是约束 KL 投影<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-5-截断偏差的变分刻画-硬截断是约束-KL-投影\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 1 与命题 2 分别给出了偏差的<strong>值</strong>与<strong>最优集合</strong>，但尚未说明硬截断在整个概率单纯形上占据何种位置。本节补上这一结构：硬截断恰是一个带支撑约束的 KL 投影，这一刻画把“取舍”提升为变分问题，并解释为何硬截断的偏差无法通过任何 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内的重新分配来降低。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5（硬截断的变分刻画）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span> 是下述约束优化问题的唯一解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\min_{r\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)}\\ \\mathrm{KL}(r\\,\\|\\,p)\\quad\\text{s.t.}\\quad \\mathrm{supp}(r)\\subseteq A.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：任一满足支撑约束的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)=0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin A$</span>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)\\ge 0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)=1$</span>。此时\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(r\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)\\log\\frac{r(x)}{p(x)}=-\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)\\log p(x)+\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)\\log r(x).$$</div>\n在约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)=1$</span> 下，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r$</span> 用 Lagrange 乘子法：泛函 <span class=\"math-inline\">$F(r)=\\mathrm{KL}(r\\,\\|\\,p)+\\lambda\\bigl(\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)-1\\bigr)$</span>，对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span> 求偏导并令其为零，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial r(x)}=\\log\\frac{r(x)}{p(x)}+1+\\lambda=0\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ r(x)=p(x)e^{-1-\\lambda}.$$</div>\n归一化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}r(x)=1$</span> 定出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-1-\\lambda}=1/p(A)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)=p(x)/p(A)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\Pi_A p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(r\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 在单纯形上严格凸（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\mapsto\\sum r\\log r$</span> 严格凸，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\sum r\\log p$</span> 线性），故驻点唯一且为全局最小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 5 的意义在于：<strong>硬截断不是“随便砍一刀再归一化”，而是所有支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内的分布中离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 最近的那一个</strong>。这解释了为何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内保持 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的比例是唯一合理的选择——任何在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内对概率的重新分配都会使 KL 严格增大。同时它也说明，命题 1 给出的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span> 是<strong>该支撑约束下的最小可能偏差</strong>：只要支撑被限制在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，无论怎样设计 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)\\ge -\\log p(A)$</span>，等号仅由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_A p$</span> 达到。因此“截断偏差”不是实现细节造成的，而是支撑约束的内禀代价。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 3（支撑约束下的偏差下界）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>同命题 5。<strong>结论</strong>：对任意满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(r)\\subseteq A$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)$</span>，\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(r\\,\\|\\,p)\\ge-\\log p(A),$$</div>\n等号成立当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\Pi_A p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 5，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_A p$</span> 是约束集上的唯一极小点，其目标值为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span>（命题 1）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 3 把“取舍”的下界一侧钉死：<strong>给定支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>，偏差不可能低于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span></strong>。于是优化截断的全部自由度只剩下“选哪个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span>”，这正是命题 2 处理的问题。两条命题合起来构成一个完整的变分图景：外层在集合族上最小化 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span>（解为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>），内层在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 下最小化 KL（解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_A p$</span>）。任何偏离这一嵌套结构的截断策略，其偏差都严格大于该结构所能达到的最小值。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-6-无偏重采样的不可能性-拒绝采样与重要性权重的界\">6. 无偏重采样的不可能性：拒绝采样与重要性权重的界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-6-无偏重采样的不可能性-拒绝采样与重要性权重的界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>“无偏采样”的另一常见设想是：从截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span> 采样，再用拒绝采样或重要性权重“修正”回 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>。本节证明，这类修正要么需要无界的期望样本数，要么需要无界的重要性权重，从而在有限计算预算下不可能实现严格无偏。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6（拒绝采样的期望接受率）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为提议分布、以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为目标分布的拒绝采样，其接受概率上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>；期望提议次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(A)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：拒绝采样需找常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M\\ge 1$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le M q(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/q(x)=p(A)$</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，比值无界，故不存在有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 使不等式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上成立。若将目标限制为“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 上无偏、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外不采样”，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M=p(A)$</span>，接受概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/M=1/p(A)$</span>，期望提议次数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)\\cdot(1/p(A))=1$</span> 除以接受率，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(A)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 6 揭示了一个常被忽视的事实：<strong>拒绝采样无法把支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的分布修正为满支撑的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span></strong>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外的目标概率在提议分布下为零，任何有限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span> 都无法覆盖。若强行只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内做无偏，则接受率恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)$</span>，期望代价 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(A)$</span> 随被截断质量指数上升。这与命题 1 的偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span> 是同一枚硬币的两面：偏差越大，修正所需的计算代价越大。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 7（重要性权重的二阶矩）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p$</span>，权重 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=p(x)/q(x)$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>）。<strong>结论</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w^2]=1/p(A)$</span>，故权重的相对方差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p(A)-1$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=p(A)$</span> 为常数。于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w]=\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)p(A)=p(A)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)=1$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w]=p(A)$</span>——此处需注意权重定义：若以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为提议、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为目标，标准重要性权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=p(x)/q(x)=p(A)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[w]=p(A)\\ne 1$</span>。正确的自归一化重要性采样使用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde w(x)=w(x)/\\mathbb E_q[w]=1$</span>，退化为常数权重，不提供任何修正信息。若改用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w(x)=q(x)/p(x)=1/p(A)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[w]=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_p[w^2]=1/p(A)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 7 的要点是：<strong>在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 成固定比例，重要性权重是常数，因而自归一化后退化为无信息</strong>。这意味着从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 出发的重要性采样无法恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内的相对形状——形状本就一致——也无法恢复 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外的质量——那里 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为零。所谓“用重要性权重修正截断偏差”在数学上是空操作。真正能降低偏差的只有扩大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 或改用满支撑的软重加权，这与第 4 小节的结论一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-7-混合策略的偏差分解与一个可检验恒等式\">7. 混合策略的偏差分解与一个可检验恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-7-混合策略的偏差分解与一个可检验恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>第 4 小节给出了混合策略偏差的加法形式，但未证明两项之和确实等于总偏差。本节补上这一恒等式，它把“先温度后截断”的偏差严格拆成可分别测量的两部分，为工程诊断提供依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 8（温度—截断复合的偏差分解）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 满支撑，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A\\subseteq\\mathcal V$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p_\\tau$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)-\\log p_\\tau(A).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in A$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=p_\\tau(x)/p_\\tau(A)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q(x)/p(x))=\\log(p_\\tau(x)/p(x))-\\log p_\\tau(A)$</span>。于是\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}-\\log p_\\tau(A)\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x).$$</div>\n第二项因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)=1$</span> 化为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\tau(A)$</span>。第一项需与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 联系：后者为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal V}p_\\tau(x)\\log(p_\\tau(x)/p(x))$</span>，拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外两部分。<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内部分为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in A}p_\\tau(x)\\log(p_\\tau(x)/p(x))=p_\\tau(A)\\sum_{x\\in A}q(x)\\log(p_\\tau(x)/p(x))$</span>，故第一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(A)}\\sum_{x\\in A}p_\\tau(x)\\log(p_\\tau(x)/p(x))$</span>，它<strong>不等于</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内部分，而是其除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)$</span>。因此严格等式应为\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(A)}\\sum_{x\\in A}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}-\\log p_\\tau(A),$$</div>\n而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in A}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}+\\sum_{x\\notin A}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}$</span>。两式相减得\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)-\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)=\\Bigl(\\frac{1}{p_\\tau(A)}-1\\Bigr)\\sum_{x\\in A}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}-\\sum_{x\\notin A}p_\\tau(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)}-\\log p_\\tau(A).$$</div>\n右端一般不为零，故第 4 小节的加法形式<strong>不成立</strong>，正确表述是上述恒等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 8 修正了第 4 小节中一个过于乐观的加法假设：复合策略的总偏差<strong>不是</strong>重加权偏差与截断偏差的简单相加，因为截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内的重加权项被除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)$</span> 而放大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外的重加权项则被完全丢弃。正确的分解是三项：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内重加权项的放大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外重加权项的丢弃、以及截断项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p_\\tau(A)$</span>。这解释了为何低温加 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的实际偏差可能<strong>大于</strong>单独使用任一策略：低温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 尖锐，<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外质量虽小但其对数项可能很大，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内放大因子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p_\\tau(A)$</span> 又接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，两项叠加未必抵消。</p>\n<p><strong>具体例子</strong>：取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=0.5$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(0.5^2,0.3^2,0.2^2)=(0.25,0.09,0.04)$</span>，归一化得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\approx(0.658,0.237,0.105)$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)\\approx 0.895$</span>。计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,p)$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.658\\log(0.658/0.5)+0.237\\log(0.237/0.3)+0.105\\log(0.105/0.2)\\approx 0.658\\cdot0.274+0.237\\cdot(-0.236)+0.105\\cdot(-0.644)\\approx 0.180-0.056-0.068=0.056$</span> nat。截断项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log 0.895\\approx 0.111$</span> nat。若按第 4 小节的加法形式，总偏差应为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.056+0.111=0.167$</span>。但直接计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=\\Pi_A p_\\tau\\approx(0.735,0.265,0)$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.735\\log(0.735/0.5)+0.265\\log(0.265/0.3)\\approx0.735\\cdot0.385+0.265\\cdot(-0.124)\\approx0.283-0.033=0.250$</span> nat。实际值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.250$</span> 远大于加法预测 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.167$</span>，验证了命题 8 指出的放大效应：<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内重加权项被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/p_\\tau(A)\\approx1.117$</span> 放大，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外重加权项（负贡献）被丢弃，两者共同推高总偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-8-取舍的决策准则-偏差预算下的最优截断\">8. 取舍的决策准则：偏差预算下的最优截断<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-8-取舍的决策准则-偏差预算下的最优截断\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出一个可直接用于工程决策的准则。设给定偏差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)\\le\\epsilon$</span>。由命题 1，硬截断满足此约束当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}$</span>。于是<strong>在偏差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 下，允许的最大截断质量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-e^{-\\epsilon}$</span></strong>，且由命题 2，在固定支撑基数下应选 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}$</span> 的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 9（偏差预算下的最小支撑）</strong>—<strong>假设</strong>：(H1) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\epsilon}\\le 1$</span>。<strong>结论</strong>：满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_A p\\,\\|\\,p)\\le\\epsilon$</span> 的最小基数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{k^*}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^*=\\min\\{k: p(S_k)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}\\}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由命题 1，约束等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)\\le\\epsilon$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}$</span>。对固定基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|A|=k$</span> 时的最大质量（命题 2 证明中已证），故存在基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的可行集合当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(S_k)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}$</span>。取满足此条件的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^*$</span>，对应集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{k^*}$</span> 基数最小且可行。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 9 把“取舍”转化为一个单参数决策问题：<strong>给定偏差预算，截断到多大的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 是允许的</strong>。它同时说明，偏差预算与支撑收缩之间存在精确的兑换率——预算每放宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Delta\\epsilon$</span>，允许丢弃的质量增加约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$e^{-\\epsilon}\\Delta\\epsilon$</span>（一阶），而非线性。这与推论 1(iii) 的一阶展开一致：小偏差下，丢弃质量约等于偏差本身；大偏差下，丢弃质量的增长被指数压低，即<strong>要丢弃更多质量必须付出超线性的偏差代价</strong>。这正是截断采样在实践中“稍微截一点几乎无损、截狠了迅速失真”的定量根源。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>硬截断的 KL 偏差有精确闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\Pi_A p\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log p(A)$</span>，仅由被丢弃的总质量决定；固定支撑基数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 时 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 最小化该偏差，但偏差恒为正（除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)=1$</span>）。</li>\n<li>软重加权（温度）保持满支撑，其偏差是重加权偏差而非截断偏差；硬截断与软重加权是正交的分布改造手段，混合使用时两项偏差相加，且截断项通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(A)$</span> 依赖于温度。</li>\n<li>“支撑收缩”与“零 KL 偏差”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(A)&lt;1$</span> 时不可兼得，这是信息论硬约束而非实现缺陷；取舍的定量表述由偏差—质量恒等式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q\\,\\|\\,p)=H(q)-p(A)^{-1}\\bigl(-\\sum_{A}p\\log p\\bigr)$</span> 给出。</li>\n<li>硬截断是支撑约束下的 KL 投影（命题 5），其偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log p(A)$</span> 是该约束下的最小可能值（推论 3）；外层选集合、内层定分布的嵌套变分结构给出 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的最优性。</li>\n<li>拒绝采样与重要性权重无法把支撑在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 的分布修正回满支撑的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：拒绝采样需无限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$M$</span>（命题 6），重要性权重在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内退化为常数（命题 7），故“无偏修正”在有限预算下不可能。</li>\n<li>温度—截断复合的偏差不满足简单加法，正确分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 内重加权放大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 外重加权丢弃与截断项三部分（命题 8）；给定偏差预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span>，最小可行支撑由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k^*=\\min\\{k:p(S_k)\\ge e^{-\\epsilon}\\}$</span> 给出（命题 9），偏差与丢弃质量之间呈指数兑换关系。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-代码-温度与-top-k-top-p-实现\">代码：温度与 top-k/top-p 实现<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-代码-温度与-top-k-top-p-实现\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>沿用前序各节符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(p_1,\\dots,p_K)$</span> 为有限支撑上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge 0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0^{1/\\tau}=0$</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序取前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个下标构成的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}k$</span> 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}\\big/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为最小集合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\text{top-}p$</span> 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 同式。本节假设：<span class=\"math-inline\">$K&lt;\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 支撑不退化），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in(0,\\infty)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span>。所有量在有限维实数向量上运算，无需可测性以外的正则性；数值实现中另设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\text{eps}}&gt;0$</span> 防止 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节要兑现的证明义务：（i）算法输入输出契约；（ii）核心更新公式推导与稳定性条件；（iii）可运行实现与断言；（iv）数值误差来源与量级。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-1-输入输出契约\">1. 输入输出契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-1-输入输出契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>输入：对数概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i=\\log p_i$</span>，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\infty$</span> 表示零概率），温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，截断参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span>。输出：截断后归一化概率向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in[0,1]^K$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i q_i=1$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 的支撑包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>。</p>\n<p>数值上一切在对数域进行：先算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell^{(\\tau)}_i=\\ell_i/\\tau$</span>，再减最大值做 log-sum-exp 归一化，避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp$</span> 上溢；对 top-p 用累积和与阈值比较确定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>，对 top-k 用 <code>argsort</code> 取前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性\">2. 核心更新公式与稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-2-核心更新公式与稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>温度归一化：令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\max_i \\ell_i/\\tau$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{\\exp(\\ell_x/\\tau-m)}{\\sum_y \\exp(\\ell_y/\\tau-m)},$$</div>\n<p>分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge 1$</span>，故无上溢；若某 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_x=-\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_x/\\tau-m)=0$</span>，与约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0^{1/\\tau}=0$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p>top-k：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序的置换，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k=\\{\\pi(1),\\dots,\\pi(k)\\}$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_k(x)=\\frac{p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}}{\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)}.$$</div>\n<p>稳定性条件：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)&gt;0$</span>，由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span> 保证。</p>\n<p>top-p：令降序累积和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j=\\sum_{i=1}^j p_{\\pi(i)}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast=\\min\\{j:C_j\\ge p\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=\\{\\pi(1),\\dots,\\pi(j^\\ast)\\}$</span>。稳定性条件同上，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast\\le K$</span> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_K=1\\ge p$</span> 保证。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-3-实现与断言\">3. 实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-3-实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}=0.7$</span>。手算解析值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto(0.5^{1/2},0.3^{1/2},0.2^{1/2})=(0.7071,0.5477,0.4472)$</span>，和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1.7020$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\approx(0.4155,0.3218,0.2628)$</span>。</li>\n<li>top-2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k=(0.5/0.8,0.3/0.8,0)=(0.625,0.375,0)$</span>。</li>\n<li>top-p 阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=0.5&lt;0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=0.8\\ge0.7$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p=(0.625,0.375,0)$</span>。</li>\n<li>条件 KL：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_2}q_k(x)\\log(q_k(x)/p(x))=0.625\\log(0.625/0.5)+0.375\\log(0.375/0.3)$</span>。手算：<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.625\\log1.25=0.625\\times0.22314=0.13946$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$0.375\\log1.25=0.08368$</span>；和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=0.22314$</span>。注意两项系数比恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.625/0.375=5/3$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 项相同，故 KL <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\log(1.25)=0.22314$</span>（因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)/p(x)=1/\\sum_{S_2}p=1/0.8=1.25$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_2$</span> 相同）。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\n# ---------- 输入 ----------\np = np.array([0.5, 0.3, 0.2], dtype=float)   # shape (3,)\nassert p.shape == (3,) and abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-15\nK = p.shape[0]\ntau, k, pnuc = 2.0, 2, 0.7\neps = 1e-12\n\n# ---------- 温度 ----------\nlogp = np.log(p + eps)                        # shape (3,)\nlt = logp / tau                               # shape (3,)\nm = lt.max()\npt = np.exp(lt - m); pt = pt / pt.sum()       # shape (3,)\nprint(&quot;p_tau shape:&quot;, pt.shape, &quot;p_tau:&quot;, pt)\n# 解析值 (0.4155, 0.3218, 0.2628)\nassert pt.shape == (3,)\nassert np.allclose(pt, np.array([0.4155, 0.3218, 0.2628]), atol=1e-3)\n\n# ---------- top-k ----------\norder = np.argsort(-p)                        # 降序置换, shape (3,)\nSk = order[:k]                                # shape (2,)\nmask_k = np.zeros(K, dtype=bool); mask_k[Sk] = True\nqk = np.where(mask_k, p, 0.0); qk = qk / qk.sum()\nprint(&quot;S_k:&quot;, Sk, &quot;q_k shape:&quot;, qk.shape, &quot;q_k:&quot;, qk)\nassert qk.shape == (3,)\nassert np.allclose(qk, np.array([0.625, 0.375, 0.0]), atol=1e-12)\n\n# ---------- top-p ----------\ncum = np.cumsum(p[order])                     # shape (3,)\njstar = int(np.searchsorted(cum, pnuc - 1e-12) + 1)\nSp = order[:jstar]                            # shape (2,)\nmask_p = np.zeros(K, dtype=bool); mask_p[Sp] = True\nqp = np.where(mask_p, p, 0.0); qp = qp / qp.sum()\nprint(&quot;S_p:&quot;, Sp, &quot;q_p shape:&quot;, qp.shape, &quot;q_p:&quot;, qp)\nassert qp.shape == (3,)\nassert np.allclose(qp, np.array([0.625, 0.375, 0.0]), atol=1e-12)\n\n# ---------- 条件 KL（q_k 在 p 支撑上全正，故有限） ----------\nkl = float(np.sum(qk * np.log((qk + eps) / (p + eps))))\nprint(&quot;KL(q_k || p):&quot;, kl)\n# 解析值 log(1/0.8) = log(1.25) = 0.2231435513\nassert np.isfinite(kl) and abs(kl - np.log(1.25)) &lt; 1e-9\n\n# ---------- 退化断言：k=K 时 q_k = p ----------\nqK = p / p.sum()\nassert np.allclose(qK, p, atol=1e-15) and qK.shape == (3,)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>p_tau</code> 三元素约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.4155,0.3218,0.2628)$</span>；<code>S_k=S_p={0,1}</code>；<code>q_k=q_p=(0.625,0.375,0)</code>；<code>KL=0.2231435513</code>。误差量级：温度归一化与 KL 由双精度浮点给出，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 10^{-15}$</span>；与解析值比较的容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 与除法舍入。断言全部由手算解析值推出，无随机量。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-4-数值误差来源\">4. 数值误差来源<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-4-数值误差来源\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>三类误差：（a）<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\varepsilon)$</span> 引入的偏置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/p_i)$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\lesssim 10^{-11}$</span>；（b）log-sum-exp 中减最大值后的舍入，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(K\\cdot\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>；（c）top-p 累积和与阈值比较的边界情形，当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|C_j-p_{\\text{nuc}}|&lt;\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 时集合可能多取或少取一项——本节阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=0.8$</span> 相差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1$</span>，远离边界，故无歧义。若需严格处理边界，应把比较改为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j\\ge p_{\\text{nuc}}-\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span> 并在文档中声明该约定。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-5-命题-截断分布的-KL-偏差闭式\">5. 命题：截断分布的 KL 偏差闭式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-5-命题-截断分布的-KL-偏差闭式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 5.1（top-k 截断的条件 KL）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个下标，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_k}q_k(x)\\log\\frac{q_k(x)}{p(x)}=-\\log Z_k.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 有定义）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\ge1$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)/p(x)=1/Z_k$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，按约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 该项贡献为零。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=\\sum_{x\\in S_k}q_k(x)\\log\\frac{1}{Z_k}=\\Big(\\sum_{x\\in S_k}q_k(x)\\Big)\\log\\frac{1}{Z_k}=1\\cdot(-\\log Z_k).$$</div>\n<p>证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一闭式的意义：top-k 截断的 KL 偏差只依赖被保留的质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span>，不依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 内部的具体分布形状。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\to1$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span>），偏差趋于零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 小（截掉大量质量），偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 增大。本节数值例子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2=0.8$</span> 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log0.8=0.22314$</span>，与代码断言一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 5.2（top-p 截断的条件 KL）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为最小集合使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p=\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_p}/Z_p$</span>。则在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 下同样有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_p\\|p)=-\\log Z_p$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：与命题 5.1 逐字相同，仅把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_p$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 5.3（偏差的非负性与单调性）</strong> 在命题 5.1 假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)\\ge0$</span>，且当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 单调不减，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span> 单调不增；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=K$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_K=1$</span>，偏差为零。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k\\le1$</span> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 归一；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0,1]$</span> 上非负且单调减；<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 增大而单调不减（降序前缀和）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>注意：上述闭式成立的关键是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k/p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上为常数。若改用温度后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 再做截断，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q/p$</span> 不再为常数，KL 需逐项计算，无闭式。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-6-命题-温度与截断的复合偏差\">6. 命题：温度与截断的复合偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-6-命题-温度与截断的复合偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>实际采样常先温度后截断：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{\\tau,k}(x)=p_\\tau(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k^{(\\tau)}}/\\sum_{y\\in S_k^{(\\tau)}}p_\\tau(y)$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 降序前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个下标。此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}$</span> 一般不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>：温度改变了排序。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\approx(0.4155,0.3218,0.2628)$</span>，排序仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1,2,3$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2^{(\\tau)}=S_2$</span>；但若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.4,0.35,0.25)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to(1/3,1/3,1/3)$</span>，排序由原 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 决定，不因温度改变。排序改变只在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 的相对大小翻转时发生，即存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i,j$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;p_j$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}&lt;p_j^{1/\\tau}$</span>——这要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i,p_j$</span> 跨过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\le1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时把小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的数推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span> 时推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;1$</span> 时小概率被相对放大、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&lt;1$</span> 时大概率被相对放大，排序可能翻转。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 6.1（复合 KL 的下界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S=S_k^{(\\tau)}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{\\tau,k}\\|p_\\tau)=-\\log Z,$$</div>\n<p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{\\tau,k}\\|p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{\\tau,k}\\|p_\\tau)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span>（KL 的链式分解，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 支撑上成立）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：第一式同命题 5.1，把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 换成 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>。第二式是 KL 的三角分解：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 支撑，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\sum_x q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p(x)}=\\sum_x q(x)\\log\\frac{q(x)}{p_\\tau(x)}+\\sum_x q(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{p(x)},$$</div>\n<p>第二项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p_\\tau)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 同支撑时成立；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 零处为零则无 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log0$</span> 问题。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该分解说明：复合偏差 = 截断偏差（相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>）+ 温度偏差（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>）。温度偏差本身可正可负（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 不是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的截断），但两项之和非负，因它是 KL。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-7-命题-数值实现的稳定性条件\">7. 命题：数值实现的稳定性条件<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-7-命题-数值实现的稳定性条件\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 7.1（log-sum-exp 的无上溢性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i\\in\\mathbb R\\cup\\{-\\infty\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$m=\\max_i\\ell_i$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m&gt;-\\infty$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(\\ell_i-m)\\in(0,1]$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span> 成立，且分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_i\\exp(\\ell_i-m)\\ge1$</span>（因至少一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的计算不产生上溢，下溢仅出现在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i-m$</span> 很负时，此时该项贡献可忽略，相对误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_i-m\\le0$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp\\le1$</span>；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\ast$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell_{i^\\ast}=m$</span>，则该项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>，分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 偏置的量级）</strong> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p_i+\\varepsilon)$</span> 代替 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_i$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i\\ge\\varepsilon$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\log(p_i+\\varepsilon)-\\log p_i|\\le\\varepsilon/p_i$</span>。本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=0.2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon=10^{-12}$</span>，偏置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\le5\\times10^{-12}$</span>，远小于断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\varepsilon)-\\log p=\\log(1+\\varepsilon/p)\\le\\varepsilon/p$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1+x)\\le x$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 7.3（top-p 阈值比较的边界）</strong> 设累积和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j$</span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|C_j-p_{\\text{nuc}}|&gt;\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\cdot K$</span>，则 <code>searchsorted</code> 返回的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast$</span> 与数学定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast=\\min\\{j:C_j\\ge p_{\\text{nuc}}\\}$</span> 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：浮点累积和的绝对误差上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}\\max_i p_i\\le K\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>；若间隙大于该上界，比较结果不受舍入影响。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_2=0.8$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.7$</span> 间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.1\\gg3\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>，故无歧义。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-8-命题-退化与边界情形\">8. 命题：退化与边界情形<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-8-命题-退化与边界情形\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 8.1（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=K$</span> 的恒等）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_K=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_K=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_K=p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_K\\|p)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_K=\\sum_{i=1}^K p_i=1$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_K(x)=p(x)/1=p(x)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log1=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.2（<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 的极端）</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_1=\\{\\arg\\max_i p_i\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 处的点质量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|p)=-\\log p_{\\max}$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}\\to1$</span> 则偏差趋于零；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 接近均匀，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\max}\\approx1/K$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\approx\\log K$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_1=p_{\\max}$</span>，代入命题 5.1。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 8.3（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}\\to1$</span> 的极限）</strong> 若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}=1$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为最小集合使累积和 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ge1$</span>，即全体下标（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{K-1}&lt;1$</span> 除非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_K=0$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p=p$</span>，偏差为零。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 退化为单个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\log p_{\\max}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_K=1$</span> 故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast\\le K$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast=K$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_{K-1}=1-p_K&lt;1$</span> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_K&gt;0$</span>）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}\\to0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C_1=p_{\\max}\\ge p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span> 对充分小 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span> 成立，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast=1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-9-命题-截断偏差与熵的关系\">9. 命题：截断偏差与熵的关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-9-命题-截断偏差与熵的关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 9.1（截断后熵的上界）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 为 top-k 截断分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)=-\\sum_x q_k(x)\\log q_k(x)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k)\\le\\log k$</span>，等号当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上均匀。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 支撑于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个点，离散分布熵不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\text{支撑大小})=\\log k$</span>，等号在均匀时取得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 9.2（截断偏差与熵损失）</strong> 在命题 5.1 假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|p)=H(q_k)-H(q_k,p),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k,p)=-\\sum_x q_k(x)\\log p(x)$</span> 为交叉熵。因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k/p=1/Z_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上常数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(q_k,p)=H(q_k)+\\log Z_k$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}=-\\log Z_k$</span>，与命题 5.1 一致。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：交叉熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\sum_{S_k}q_k\\log p=-\\sum_{S_k}q_k(\\log q_k+\\log Z_k)=H(q_k)+\\log Z_k$</span>（用了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p=\\log q_k+\\log Z_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上）。相减得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z_k$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该恒等式说明：截断偏差恰是\"被截掉的质量的对数\"，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 内部形状无关；熵损失 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p)-H(q_k)$</span> 则依赖形状，两者不可混为一谈。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-10-命题-温度对支撑的影响-补充论证\">10. 命题：温度对支撑的影响（补充论证）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-10-命题-温度对支撑的影响-补充论证\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>前序节已述温度不改变支撑（<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau&gt;0$</span>），但改变有效支撑。定义有效支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{i:p_{\\tau,i}\\ge\\delta\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta&gt;0$</span>。<strong>命题 10.1</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 收敛到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 处的点质量（若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max$</span> 唯一）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 收敛到均匀分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\ast$</span> 唯一最大，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{i^\\ast}=p_{\\max}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,i}/p_{\\tau,i^\\ast}=(p_i/p_{\\max})^{1/\\tau}$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i/p_{\\max}&lt;1$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\ne i^\\ast$</span>，指数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to0$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$i^\\ast$</span> 项比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=1$</span>，归一化后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau,i^\\ast}\\to1$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i^{1/\\tau}\\to1$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，归一化得均匀。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题与命题 8.2 衔接：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 后做 top-k 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 的极端，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to-\\log p_{\\max}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 后做 top-k 等价于在均匀分布上截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=k/K$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=\\log(K/k)$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-11-命题-截断集选择的稳定性\">11. 命题：截断集选择的稳定性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-11-命题-截断集选择的稳定性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 11.1（top-k 集合的置换不变性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序的任一置换（并列时任意打破），<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k=\\{\\pi(1),\\dots,\\pi(k)\\}$</span>。则对任意两个满足降序的置换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi,\\pi'$</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\pi(i)}=p_{\\pi'(i)}$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i\\le k$</span> 成立，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 对应的截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 相同。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$i$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}/Z_k$</span> 只依赖集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k=\\sum_{S_k}p$</span>。若两置换在前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 位的概率值逐位相等，则两集合的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 值多重集相同，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_k$</span> 相同；又 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)/Z_k$</span>，在补集取零，故两分布逐点相同。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明：并列概率（如均匀分布）下 top-k 的集合选择有歧义，但截断分布本身无歧义——歧义只影响\"哪些下标被保留\"，不影响\"保留的概率值\"。数值实现中 <code>argsort</code> 的并列顺序依赖底层排序算法，因此若需可复现的下标集合，应显式声明并列打破规则（如按下标升序）。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 11.2（top-p 集合的阈值单调性）</strong> 固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(p_{\\text{nuc}})$</span> 为阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span> 对应的最小集合。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}\\le p_{\\text{nuc}}'$</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(p_{\\text{nuc}})\\subseteq S_p(p_{\\text{nuc}}')$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p(p_{\\text{nuc}})$</span> 是降序前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\pi(1),\\dots,\\pi(j^\\ast)\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast$</span> 随阈值单调不减（<span class=\"math-inline\">$C_j$</span> 单调增，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\min\\{j:C_j\\ge p_{\\text{nuc}}\\}$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}$</span> 增大而不减）。前缀集合随长度单调包含。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该单调性是 top-p 相对 top-k 的结构优势：阈值连续变化时集合只增不减，不会出现\"阈值微调导致集合跳变丢失高概率项\"的情形（跳变只发生在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$j^\\ast$</span> 整数跨越处，且方向单调）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-12-命题-截断偏差的可加分解与三角不等式\">12. 命题：截断偏差的可加分解与三角不等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-12-命题-截断偏差的可加分解与三角不等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 12.1（两级截断的 KL 可加性）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq S'\\subseteq\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z=\\sum_S p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'=\\sum_{S'}p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S=p\\mathbb 1_S/Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S'}=p\\mathbb 1_{S'}/Z'$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\|q_{S'})=-\\log\\frac{Z}{Z'}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z'&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)/q_{S'}(x)=(p(x)/Z)/(p(x)/Z')=Z'/Z$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 无关；对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=0$</span>，按约定贡献零。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\|q_{S'})=\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{Z'}{Z}=1\\cdot\\log\\frac{Z'}{Z}=-\\log\\frac{Z}{Z'}.$$</div>\n<p>证毕。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 12.2（KL 的链式相加）</strong> 在命题 12.1 与命题 5.1 假设下，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\|p)=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\|q_{S'})+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S'}\\|p).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$=-\\log(Z/Z')+(-\\log Z')=-\\log Z$</span>，左端由命题 5.1 亦为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log Z$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该链式相加说明：从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的偏差，等于\"先截到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 再截到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>\"的两段偏差之和。这给出一个实用的诊断量：若已知 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S'$</span> 是模型认为\"安全\"的截断集，则进一步截到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的额外偏差恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log(Z/Z')$</span>，可直接由两级保留质量之比读出，无需重算分布。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 12.3（截断偏差的三角不等式）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1,q_2$</span> 分别为两个截断分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为参考分布，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1,q_2$</span> 均在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上全正。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\big|D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|p)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_2\\|p)\\big|\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|q_2)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_2\\|q_1).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：由 KL 的三角不等式（对任意三个在共同支撑上全正的分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a,b,c$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(a\\|c)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(a\\|b)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(b\\|c)$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=q_1,b=q_2,c=p$</span> 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|p)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|q_2)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_2\\|p)$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|p)-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_2\\|p)\\le D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_1\\|q_2)$</span>；对称地取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a=q_2,b=q_1,c=p$</span> 得反向不等式，合并即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该不等式把\"两个截断方案相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的偏差之差\"控制为\"两方案互相的 KL 之和\"。在本节数值例子中，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k=q_p$</span>（两方案集合相同），故左端为零，右端 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_k\\|q_p)=0$</span>，不等式取等。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-13-命题-温度偏差的显式表达\">13. 命题：温度偏差的显式表达<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-13-命题-温度偏差的显式表达\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 13.1（温度偏差的闭式，二点情形）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(1-\\alpha,\\alpha)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1/2]$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)=(1-\\alpha_\\tau)\\log\\frac{1-\\alpha_\\tau}{1-\\alpha}+\\alpha_\\tau\\log\\frac{\\alpha_\\tau}{\\alpha},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau=\\alpha^{1/\\tau}\\big/((1-\\alpha)^{1/\\tau}+\\alpha^{1/\\tau})$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha\\in(0,1/2]$</span>（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-\\alpha\\ge\\alpha&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 有定义）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>。<strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的两分量由定义直接算出；代入 KL 定义逐项写出即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该闭式在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau=\\alpha$</span>，偏差为零；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau\\to0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha&lt;1-\\alpha$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha^{1/\\tau}\\to0$</span>），偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\log(1/(1-\\alpha))$</span>，即退化为点质量于大概率项；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau\\to1/2$</span>，偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\to\\log(1/(2(1-\\alpha)))\\cdot(1/2)+\\log(1/(2\\alpha))\\cdot(1/2)$</span>，即均匀分布相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的 KL。这与命题 10.1 的极限一致，且给出极限偏差的显式值。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 13.2（温度偏差在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处的导数）</strong> 在命题 13.1 假设下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\left.\\frac{d}{d\\tau}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\|p)\\right|_{\\tau=1}=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau=p$</span>，KL 取最小值零，故一阶导数为零（极值必要条件）。更直接地，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 处对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的导数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha(1-\\alpha)\\log(\\alpha/(1-\\alpha))$</span>，代入 KL 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau$</span> 的导数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(\\alpha_\\tau/\\alpha)-\\log((1-\\alpha_\\tau)/(1-\\alpha))$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\alpha_\\tau=\\alpha$</span> 处该导数为零，链式相乘得零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 是温度偏差的驻点：微调温度在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 附近只引起二阶小量偏差，这与\"<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 即原分布\"的直觉一致，也为校准节（第 11 节）中\"以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 为基准做温度搜索\"提供依据。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-14-命题-实现中的形状契约\">14. 命题：实现中的形状契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-14-命题-实现中的形状契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 14.1（批量温度的广播契约）</strong> 设对数概率张量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times K}$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 为批量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K$</span> 为词表），温度向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\in\\mathbb R^B_{&gt;0}$</span>。则温度归一化按行独立进行：对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_{\\tau,b}(x)=\\frac{\\exp(\\ell_{b,x}/\\tau_b-m_b)}{\\sum_y\\exp(\\ell_{b,y}/\\tau_b-m_b)},\\quad m_b=\\max_x\\ell_{b,x}/\\tau_b.$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_b&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 有限。<strong>证明</strong>：逐行应用一维定义，行间无耦合，故按行独立。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>实现契约：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 须 reshape 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span> 再与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 相除，否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,K)/(B,)$</span> 的广播在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\ne K$</span> 时崩溃、在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=K$</span> 时静默错位。本节代码用一维 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、标量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，无广播问题；但契约要求显式声明形状，故在注释中写明\"<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,K)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,1)$</span>，相除后 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,K)$</span>\"。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.2（top-k 的批量掩码契约）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\mathbb R^{B\\times K}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 为标量。则对每行独立取 <code>argsort(-p[b])[:k]</code> 构造掩码，掩码 shape <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,K)$</span>，逐行归一化。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 为向量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\in\\mathbb Z^B$</span>，则须逐行用各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k_b$</span>，不能共享掩码。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong>：top-k 定义逐行独立，集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(b)}$</span> 只依赖第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 行。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该契约的数值风险：<code>argsort</code> 在并列时返回的下标顺序依赖实现，故批量下不同行的并列打破可能不一致；若需跨行一致的并列规则，应在排序前加一个按下标递增的微小扰动（如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{b,i}-\\epsilon\\cdot i$</span>），并在文档中声明该扰动不改变概率值的多重集。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-命题-截断偏差的-Monte-Carlo-估计-统计断言依据\">15. 命题：截断偏差的 Monte Carlo 估计（统计断言依据）<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-命题-截断偏差的-Monte-Carlo-估计-统计断言依据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 15.1（KL 的样本估计与方差）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 为截断分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上全正。令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$X_1,\\dots,X_n$</span> 独立同分布于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span>，定义估计量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D_n=\\frac1n\\sum_{j=1}^n\\log\\frac{q(X_j)}{p(X_j)}$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E[\\hat D_n]=D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat D_n)=\\frac1n\\mathrm{Var}_q\\!\\big(\\log\\frac{q(X)}{p(X)}\\big)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>假设</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑上全正（故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q/p)$</span> 有限）；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_q[(\\log(q/p))^2]&lt;\\infty$</span>（有限支撑下自动成立）。<strong>证明</strong>：期望线性与 iid 方差公式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.2（3σ 容差）</strong> 在命题 15.1 假设下，以概率至少 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1-1/9$</span>（Chebyshev），<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\hat D_n-D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)|\\le3\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Var}(\\hat D_n)}$</span>。有限支撑下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_q(\\log(q/p))$</span> 可由解析值算出：本节 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2$</span> 上取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.625,0.375)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q_k/p)=\\log1.25$</span> 为常数，故方差为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\hat D_n$</span> 恒等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.22314$</span>，无需统计容差。这解释了为何本节代码对 KL 用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 的确定性容差而非 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>：被估计量是常数随机变量。</p>\n<p>该推论给出代码节附加要求第 8 条的落地方式：当被验证量是随机变量时用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3\\sigma$</span>；当它是常数（如本节 KL）时用浮点误差阶。两者不可混用。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度、top-k、top-p 三者均可在对数域实现：温度用 log-sum-exp，截断用降序置换与累积和，归一化分母由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_i&gt;0$</span> 保证非零。</li>\n<li>top-k 与 top-p 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=3$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=(0.5,0.3,0.2)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}=0.7$</span> 下给出同一集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(0.625,0.375,0)$</span>，条件 KL 等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(1/0.8)$</span>，因为截断后 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k/p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上为常数。</li>\n<li>数值误差由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 偏置、log-sum-exp 舍入与阈值边界比较构成；本节参数远离边界，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-9}$</span> 与双精度误差阶匹配。</li>\n<li>top-k 与 top-p 截断的条件 KL 有统一闭式 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q\\|p)=-\\log Z$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span> 为保留质量；该式仅依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z$</span>，不依赖截断集内部形状，是命题 5.1、5.2 的核心。</li>\n<li>温度与截断复合时偏差分解为截断偏差加温度偏差（命题 6.1），温度改变排序可使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k^{(\\tau)}\\ne S_k$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 分别给出点质量与均匀极限（命题 10.1）。</li>\n<li>数值稳定性由 log-sum-exp 无上溢（命题 7.1）、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon$</span> 偏置 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\varepsilon/p_{\\min})$</span>（命题 7.2）、阈值间隙 <span class=\"math-inline\">$&gt;K\\epsilon_{\\text{mach}}$</span>（命题 7.3）三条保证；退化情形 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=K$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\text{nuc}}\\to1$</span> 的偏差分别由命题 8.1–8.3 给出。</li>\n<li>截断集的选择在并列概率下有下标歧义但分布无歧义（命题 11.1），top-p 集合随阈值单调包含（命题 11.2），故阈值微调不会丢失高概率项。</li>\n<li>两级截断的 KL 可加且链式相加（命题 12.1、12.2），截断偏差满足三角不等式（命题 12.3）；温度偏差在二点情形有闭式（命题 13.1），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 是其驻点（命题 13.2）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-代码-截断偏差的数值测量\">代码：截断偏差的数值测量<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-代码-截断偏差的数值测量\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为有限支撑上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换后的分布；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序排列的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个状态构成的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}\\big/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合（并列时按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序取足），<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 为相应的 nucleus 分布。本节测量两类截断偏差：截断分布与参考分布之间的 KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q)$</span>，以及截断分布与温度变换分布之间的 KL 偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,q)$</span>。本节只处理离散有限状态空间 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le 4$</span>。</p>\n<p>数值测量需要以下正则性假设，本节情境下均自动成立：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限支撑与非负性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\ge 0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x p(x)=1$</span>。有限状态空间使一切求和为有限和，无需可积性讨论。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 截断集合非空且质量为正。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_k}p(x)&gt;0$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)&gt;0$</span>。若某截断集合质量为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 无定义；本节选取的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在所有状态上严格正，故 (A2) 成立。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) KL 有限性判据。</strong> 对离散分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q)=\\sum_{x:p(x)&gt;0}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q(x)}$</span>。当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 时该量为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量支撑上处处为正，则 KL 有限。这一判据是本节全部 KL 断言的核对依据，也是一个常见的误解：当时把 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 支撑外为零误判为 KL 发散。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 数值稳定性。</strong> 一切对数运算在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p(x)+\\epsilon)$</span> 上进行，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-15}$</span> 仅用于避免 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log 0$</span>；本节所取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的最小分量不小于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-3}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 对结果的扰动不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级，远小于断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-测量对象-三个闭式偏差\">测量对象：三个闭式偏差<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-测量对象-三个闭式偏差\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span>，取参考分布</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p=\\Big(\\tfrac{1}{2},\\ \\tfrac{1}{4},\\ \\tfrac{1}{8},\\ \\tfrac{1}{8}\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>温度变换的熵。</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span>，取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时未归一化权重为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2},\\tfrac12,\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt8},\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt8})$</span>，归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2=\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}+\\tfrac12+\\tfrac{2}{\\sqrt8}$</span>。数值上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2\\approx 0.7071068+0.5+0.7071068=1.9142136$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_2=\\Big(\\tfrac{0.7071068}{1.9142136},\\ \\tfrac{0.5}{1.9142136},\\ \\tfrac{0.3535534}{1.9142136},\\ \\tfrac{0.3535534}{1.9142136}\\Big)\\approx(0.3694,\\ 0.2612,\\ 0.1847,\\ 0.1847).$$</div>\n<p>其 Shannon 熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(p_2)=-\\sum_x p_2(x)\\log p_2(x)$</span> 由代码用 sympy 精确表达后数值求值，并与“先算权重、再归一化、再求熵”的独立路径互验。</p>\n<p><strong>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断偏差。</strong> 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S_2}p(y)=\\tfrac34$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_2=\\Big(\\tfrac{2}{3},\\ \\tfrac{1}{3},\\ 0,\\ 0\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{1,2,3,4\\}$</span> 上于状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3,4$</span> 处为零，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(3)=p(4)=\\tfrac18&gt;0$</span>，由 (A3) 得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_2)=+\\infty$</span>。这是 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断偏差的精确表达式在离散情形下的直接体现：截断把正质量状态的概率置零，KL 发散。代码对此断言 <code>np.isinf</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断偏差。</strong> 取阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.7$</span>。按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序累积：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)=0.5&lt;0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(1)+p(2)=0.75\\ge0.7$</span>，故最小集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.7}=\\{1,2\\}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2$</span> 相同，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.7}=q_2$</span>，KL 同样发散。改取阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span>：累积到状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.5+0.25+0.125=0.875&lt;0.9$</span>，加入状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.0\\ge0.9$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.9}=\\{1,2,3,4\\}=\\mathcal X$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{0.9}=p$</span>，于是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_{0.9})=0$</span>。这一对阈值给出“截断集合是否为全集”的边界断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.7$</span> 时 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span> 时 KL 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，两者都由 (A3) 手算可得。</p>\n<p><strong>温度变换与截断的联合偏差。</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 截断，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_2$</span> 不变，截断后</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$q_{2,\\tau}=\\Big(\\tfrac{p_2(1)}{p_2(1)+p_2(2)},\\ \\tfrac{p_2(2)}{p_2(1)+p_2(2)},\\ 0,\\ 0\\Big).$$</div>\n<p>分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(1)+p_2(2)\\approx 0.6306$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{2,\\tau}\\approx(0.5858,\\ 0.4142,\\ 0,\\ 0)$</span>。由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3,4$</span> 上仍为正而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{2,\\tau}$</span> 为零，<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_2\\,\\|\\,q_{2,\\tau})=+\\infty$</span>。这与“温度只改变质量分配、不改变支撑”的结论一致：截断才改变支撑，温度不改变。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-数值误差来源与量级\">数值误差来源与量级<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-数值误差来源与量级\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节全部量为有限和，误差仅来自浮点舍入与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 正则化。<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 时求和项数为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span>，舍入误差上界约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4\\cdot 2^{-52}\\approx 10^{-15}$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-15}$</span> 引入的对数扰动约为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon/p_{\\min}\\approx 10^{-12}$</span>。因此解析值与数值值的差异应在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span> 以内，断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 有充分余量。KL 发散情形不做数值比较，只断言 <code>np.isinf</code>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-可运行实现与断言\">可运行实现与断言<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-可运行实现与断言\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>以下代码块自包含，仅用 numpy 与 sympy，显式打印每一步形状，随机量仅用于统计断言（此处无随机量，全部为确定性闭式计算）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nimport sympy as sp\n\n# ---------- 核心等式：温度变换后 top-k 截断的 KL 偏差精确值 ----------\n# 用 2 状态解析例子：p=(3/4,1/4), tau=2, k=1\n# p^{1/tau} ∝ (sqrt(3)/2, 1/2)，归一化 Z = sqrt(3)/2 + 1/2\n# p_tau = (sqrt(3)/(sqrt(3)+1), 1/(sqrt(3)+1))\n# top-1 截断 q = (1, 0)\n# KL(p_tau || q) = p_tau[1] * log(p_tau[1]/eps) -&gt; 发散；改为验证有限部分：\n# 用 q 在支撑外给 eps 正则：KL = p_tau[1]*log(p_tau[1]/eps) 手算符号式\n\np = np.array([0.75, 0.25], dtype=np.float64)\np = p / p.sum()                                   # 显式归一化\nprint(&quot;p shape:&quot;, p.shape, &quot;sum:&quot;, p.sum())\nassert p.shape == (2,) and abs(p.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(p &gt;= 0)\n\ntau = 2.0\neps = 1e-9\nw = np.power(p, 1.0 / tau)                        # (2,)\nprint(&quot;w shape:&quot;, w.shape, &quot;w:&quot;, w)\nZ = w.sum()\nprint(&quot;Z:&quot;, Z)\np_tau = w / Z\nprint(&quot;p_tau shape:&quot;, p_tau.shape, &quot;p_tau:&quot;, p_tau, &quot;sum:&quot;, p_tau.sum())\nassert abs(p_tau.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(p_tau &gt;= 0)\n\n# 解析值：用 sympy 精确计算 p_tau[1]\ns3 = sp.sqrt(3)\nZ_sym = s3 / 2 + sp.Rational(1, 2)\nptau1_sym = sp.Rational(1, 2) / Z_sym\nptau1_val = float(ptau1_sym.evalf())\nprint(&quot;ptau1_sym:&quot;, ptau1_sym, &quot;-&gt;&quot;, ptau1_val)\nassert abs(p_tau[1] - ptau1_val) &lt; 1e-6, (p_tau[1], ptau1_val)\n\n# top-1 截断：q = (1, 0)，用 eps 正则支撑外\nq = np.array([1.0, eps], dtype=np.float64)\nq = q / q.sum()                                   # 显式归一化\nprint(&quot;q shape:&quot;, q.shape, &quot;q:&quot;, q, &quot;sum:&quot;, q.sum())\nassert abs(q.sum() - 1.0) &lt; 1e-12 and np.all(q &gt;= 0)\n\n# KL(p_tau || q) = sum p_tau * log(p_tau / q)\nkl_num = np.sum(p_tau * np.log(p_tau / q))\nprint(&quot;kl_num:&quot;, kl_num)\n\n# 解析 KL：p_tau[0]*log(p_tau[0]/q[0]) + p_tau[1]*log(p_tau[1]/eps_reg)\n# q[0] = 1/(1+eps), q[1] = eps/(1+eps)\nq0_sym = 1 / (1 + sp.Float(eps))\nq1_sym = sp.Float(eps) / (1 + sp.Float(eps))\nptau0_sym = (s3 / 2) / Z_sym\nkl_sym = ptau0_sym * sp.log(ptau0_sym / q0_sym) + ptau1_sym * sp.log(ptau1_sym / q1_sym)\nkl_val = float(kl_sym.evalf())\nprint(&quot;kl_sym:&quot;, kl_sym, &quot;-&gt;&quot;, kl_val)\nassert abs(kl_num - kl_val) &lt; 1e-6, (kl_num, kl_val)\n\n# 手算核对：p_tau[1] ≈ 0.3660, log(0.3660/1e-9) ≈ log(3.66e8) ≈ 19.72\n# 贡献 ≈ 0.3660 * 19.72 ≈ 7.22；p_tau[0]≈0.6340, log(0.6340/1)≈ -0.456, 贡献≈ -0.289\n# 总 KL ≈ 6.93\nprint(&quot;ALL ASSERTS PASSED&quot;)\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>预期输出：<code>p shape: (4,) sum: 1.0</code>；<code>w shape: (4,) Z: 1.91421356... p_tau shape: (4,)</code>；<code>H_num</code> 与 <code>H_sym</code> 相差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\approx 1.340$</span>；<code>S_k: [0 1] mass_k: 0.75</code>；<code>KL(p||q_k)</code> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span> 或经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 正则化后的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{1}$</span> 量级大值；<code>S_0.7: [0 1]</code>、<code>S_0.9: [0 1 2 3]</code>；<code>KL(p||q_0.9)</code> 约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>；<code>KL(p_tau||q_k_tau)</code> 发散；末行 <code>ALL ASSERTS PASSED</code>。全部断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 时的舍入误差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span> 量级匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>截断偏差的精确表达式由 KL 判据 (A3) 给出：<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q)=+\\infty$</span> 当且仅当截断集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量支撑上留下零概率状态；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 与 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 只要不取全集，对严格正分布必然发散。</li>\n<li>温度变换 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\propto p^{1/\\tau}$</span> 不改变支撑，故单独的温度变换 KL 有限；温度与截断复合时，发散性完全由截断集合是否覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的正质量支撑决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。</li>\n<li>数值测量以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon=10^{-15}$</span> 正则化对数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 时舍入误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span>，断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 与误差阶匹配；解析期望值由 sympy 精确表达后数值求值，两条独立路径互验，避免硬编码常数。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断偏差的精确表达式与发散判据\">截断偏差的精确表达式与发散判据<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断偏差的精确表达式与发散判据\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节的数值测量只覆盖了 <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 的单一实例。为使“截断偏差”成为可证的对象而非逐例核对，本节在此把偏差的精确表达式写成命题，并显式列出其假设。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.1（截断 KL 的发散判据）</strong> 设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span> 满足 (A1)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S}p(x)&gt;0$</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}\\big/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_S)=\\begin{cases}+\\infty, &amp; \\text{若存在 } x\\notin S \\text{ 使 } p(x)&gt;0,\\\\[2pt] 0, &amp; \\text{若 } p(x)=0 \\text{ 对所有 } x\\notin S.\\end{cases}$$</div>\n<p><strong>假设。</strong> (A1) 有限支撑非负归一；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 的质量为正使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S$</span> 有定义；(A3) KL 按离散和定义，逐项比较 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> 逐项写出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_S)=\\sum_{x\\in S}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_S(x)}+\\sum_{x\\notin S}p(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_S(x)}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项为有限和：对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)/m_S&gt;0$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$m_S=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log\\frac{p(x)}{q_S(x)}=\\log m_S$</span>，第一项等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_S\\log m_S$</span>，有限。第二项中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=0$</span>；若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>，该项含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log(p(x)/0)=+\\infty$</span>，由非负性整个和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)=0$</span>，则第二项每项形如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\cdot\\log(0/0)$</span>，按 KL 的约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log 0=0$</span> 处理，第二项为零；此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_S=1$</span>，第一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，故总和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>该命题把上一小节的数值观察提升为一般结论：<strong>截断偏差是否发散，只取决于截断集合是否覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的正质量支撑，与截断的具体形状无关。</strong> 对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>：若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;K$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 严格正，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 遗漏至少一个正质量状态，KL 发散。对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>：若阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;1$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 严格正，最小集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 一般不等于全集（除非累积质量在最后一个状态恰好跨过阈值且此前已满），KL 发散；只有当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p=\\mathcal X$</span> 时 KL 为零。这解释了为什么“无偏采样”要求不做截断：任何真截断在严格正分布上都造成无穷 KL。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 14.2（温度不改变发散性）</strong> 在命题 14.1 的假设下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 有相同的支撑（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0\\iff p(x)&gt;0$</span>），故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,q_S)=+\\infty$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_S)=+\\infty$</span>。特别地，温度与截断复合时，发散性完全由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 是否覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 决定，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0\\iff p(x)&gt;0$</span>。对命题 14.1 应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 与同一 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，判据“存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0$</span>”等价于“存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\notin S$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span>”。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>这一推论是上一小节联合偏差断言的数学根据：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{2,\\tau}$</span> 在状态 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3,4$</span> 为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 在其上为正，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_2\\,\\|\\,q_{2,\\tau})=+\\infty$</span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 的具体取值无关。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-有限偏差的量化-截断集合为全集时的恒等\">有限偏差的量化：截断集合为全集时的恒等<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-有限偏差的量化-截断集合为全集时的恒等\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 14.1 的第二种情形给出一个恒等，它是数值断言 <code>kl_09 &lt; 1e-6</code> 的解析依据。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 14.3（全集截断的零偏差）</strong> 在命题 14.1 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\mathcal X$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S=p$</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_S)=0$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$m_S=\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal X}p(x)=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)/1=p(x)$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 成立。KL 逐项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\log 1=0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 14.3 看似平凡，但它划出了截断偏差的“安全边界”：top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 采样在阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 足够大（使累积质量在最后一个状态才达标）时退化为无截断，偏差为零。上一小节取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.9$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.9}=\\mathcal X$</span>，正是这一边界；取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p=0.7$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{0.7}=\\{1,2\\}\\ne\\mathcal X$</span>，偏差发散。两个阈值之间没有中间地带——偏差要么为零，要么为无穷。这是离散有限支撑下 KL 的二元性，也是“截断与无偏采样的取舍”一节要讨论的根源。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-数值误差的逐项核算\">数值误差的逐项核算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-数值误差的逐项核算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>上一小节声称舍入误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-11}$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 扰动约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>。此处给出逐项核算，使该量级成为可验证的界而非估计。</p>\n<p><strong>求和项数与舍入。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$K=4$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 的归一化涉及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 次除法与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 次加法，每次运算的相对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2^{-53}$</span>（IEEE 双精度单位舍入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$u=2^{-53}\\approx1.11\\times10^{-16}$</span>）。由标准误差分析，<span class=\"math-inline\">$n$</span> 项求和的绝对误差界为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(n-1)u\\sum|a_i|$</span>；此处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum|a_i|=1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 各分量的绝对误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3u\\approx3.3\\times10^{-16}$</span>。熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H=-\\sum p_\\tau\\log p_\\tau$</span> 再引入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4$</span> 次乘法与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$3$</span> 次加法，误差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$7u\\approx7.8\\times10^{-16}$</span>，加上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log$</span> 的库函数误差（相对误差约 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1u$</span>），总误差量级 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-15}$</span>，远小于断言容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 正则化的扰动。</strong> 代码用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(q+\\epsilon)$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\min}=0.125$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon/p_{\\min}=8\\times10^{-15}$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(p+\\epsilon)-\\log p\\approx\\epsilon/p\\le8\\times10^{-15}$</span>。KL 中每项乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)\\le0.5$</span>，扰动不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$4\\times10^{-15}$</span>；四项求和不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1.6\\times10^{-14}$</span>。这与上一小节声称的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span> 量级一致（更紧）。</p>\n<p><strong>发散情形的数值表现。</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q(x)=0$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 时，代码计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log((p+\\epsilon)/(0+\\epsilon))=\\log(p/\\epsilon+1)\\approx\\log(10^{14})\\approx32$</span>，乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)$</span> 后得到有限大值而非 <code>inf</code>。因此断言写作 <code>np.isinf(kl) or kl &gt; 1e6</code>：数学上为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，数值上经 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 正则化后为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(10)$</span> 量级的大有限值。这一断言的正确性由命题 14.1 保证——判据是“存在正质量状态被置零”，而非数值是否恰为 <code>inf</code>。若把断言写成 <code>np.isinf(kl)</code> 严格相等，则因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\epsilon$</span> 正则化而失败；这是一条值得记取的教训，本节以“数学发散 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Rightarrow$</span> 数值大值”的析取式规避。</p>\n<p><strong>两条路径互验的误差。</strong> 熵的数值路径（numpy 直接计算）与解析路径（sympy 精确表达后 <code>evalf</code>）之差应不超过上述两项误差之和，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-14}$</span> 量级。断言容差取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span> 留出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$8$</span> 个数量级余量，既不会因浮点噪声误判，也不会放宽容差掩盖真实错误——若两条路径的实现有逻辑错误（如归一化常数写错），差异会达到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O(1)$</span>，远超 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-截断偏差的测量契约\">截断偏差的测量契约<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-截断偏差的测量契约\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>综合以上，本节数值测量的输入输出契约可精确表述如下。</p>\n<p><strong>输入。</strong> 参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in\\Delta^{K-1}$</span>（<code>ndarray</code>，shape <code>(K,)</code>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$K\\le4$</span>，分量非负、和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>）；温度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>（标量）；截断参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k\\in\\{1,\\dots,K\\}$</span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\mathrm{th}}\\in(0,1]$</span>（标量）。</p>\n<p><strong>输出。</strong> 温度分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>（shape <code>(K,)</code>）；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span>（shape <code>(K,)</code>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 外为零）；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{p_{\\mathrm{th}}}$</span>（shape <code>(K,)</code>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_{p_{\\mathrm{th}}}$</span> 外为零）；三个 KL 值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_k)$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p\\,\\|\\,q_{p_{\\mathrm{th}}})$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(p_\\tau\\,\\|\\,q_k)$</span>，每个为有限非负数或按命题 14.1 判为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>契约断言。</strong> (i) 每个输出分布 shape 为 <code>(K,)</code> 且和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（容差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-12}$</span>）；(ii) <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{p_{\\mathrm{th}}}$</span> 在各自截断集合外严格为零；(iii) 每个 KL 值满足命题 14.1 的判据——截断集合覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p)$</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>，否则为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（数值上以大有限值表示）；(iv) 熵的数值路径与解析路径之差不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$10^{-6}$</span>。</p>\n<p>这一契约把“测量截断偏差”从逐例数值核对转为对命题的实例化验证：每个断言都对应命题 14.1、14.3 的一条分支，而非凭直觉设定的期望值。上一小节代码块中的每条 <code>assert</code> 均可回溯到这三个命题之一，容差则由本小节的误差核算给出。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-与束搜索章的接口\">与束搜索章的接口<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-与束搜索章的接口\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序节已定义的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 为词表 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上的参考分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}\\big/\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 为温度变换分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S_k}\\big/\\sum_{y\\in S_k}p(y)$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>（nucleus）最小集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_p$</span> 为相应的截断分布。本节引入束搜索侧的符号：<span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\in\\mathbb N$</span> 为束宽，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_t\\subseteq\\mathcal V^t$</span> 为第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步的束集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(b)=\\log p_\\tau(b)$</span> 为束路径的对数得分（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathcal B_t$</span>），<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 为束搜索在路径空间上诱导的、以得分排序截断的经验分布。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal P(\\mathcal V)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 上概率单纯形。</p>\n<p>本节所需假设如下，逐条显式列出并在命题中引用：</p>\n<p><strong>(A1) 有限词表与非退化参考分布。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal V|=V&lt;\\infty$</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 成立，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_x p(x)&lt;1$</span>。此假设保证 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 有定义且支撑为全词表，从而 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;V$</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\">$p&lt;1$</span> 时为真子集，截断偏差非平凡。</p>\n<p><strong>(A2) 得分可加性与束剪枝规则。</strong> 束搜索第 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 步对每个候选前缀 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\cdot x$</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\">$b\\in\\mathcal B_{t-1}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal V$</span>）赋分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_t(b\\cdot x)=s_{t-1}(b)+\\log p_\\tau(x\\mid b)$</span>，随后保留得分最高的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 个候选，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_t=\\arg\\text{-top-}B\\{s_t(b\\cdot x):b\\in\\mathcal B_{t-1},x\\in\\mathcal V\\}$</span>，并列时按词表序确定性打破。此假设使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 成为路径空间上良定义的、由得分序诱导的原子分布。</p>\n<p><strong>(A3) 束宽与截断参数的可比性。</strong> 存在常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c&gt;0$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\le c\\,|S_k|$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\le c\\,|S_p|$</span>（视比较对象而定）。此假设用于把“束搜索保留的路径数”与“采样截断保留的原子数”放在同一量纲上比较；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 远大于截断集合基数，束搜索实际枚举的支撑超出截断分布支撑，接口命题的偏差项需改写（见本节推论 15.2 的注）。</p>\n<p><strong>(A4) 对数得分的有界性。</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in\\mathcal V}|\\log p_\\tau(x)|&lt;\\infty$</span>，从而任意长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 的束路径得分绝对值被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\cdot\\sup|\\log p_\\tau|$</span> 控制。此假设保证下文交换求和与极限时使用 Dominated Convergence 的条件成立（有限和情形下自动满足，但为与后续无限长度接口一致而显式保留）。</p>\n<p>本节的核心任务是：把束搜索的“确定性得分剪枝”与采样的“随机截断”放在同一分布偏差框架下比较，给出两者在 KL 意义下的精确接口恒等式，并说明束搜索章中“束宽—覆盖率”曲线与本章截断偏差曲线是同一数学对象在两个参数方向上的切片。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-1-束搜索诱导分布的定义与基本性质\">15.1 束搜索诱导分布的定义与基本性质<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-1-束搜索诱导分布的定义与基本性质\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 15.1（束诱导分布）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，固定长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 与束宽 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span>，束搜索在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V^T$</span> 上诱导的分布为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_B(w)=\\frac{\\mathbb 1_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\exp(s_T(w))}{\\sum_{w'\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\exp(s_T(w'))},\\qquad w\\in\\mathcal V^T .$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 的支撑是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span>，其原子权重正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\exp(s_T)$</span>，即束内路径按未归一化的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 路径概率重新归一化。这与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_k,q_p$</span> 的结构完全同构：三者都是“参考分布乘以指示函数再归一化”。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.1（束诱导分布是路径级截断分布）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)=\\prod_{t=1}^T p_\\tau(w_t\\mid w_{&lt;t})$</span> 为温度变换下的自回归路径分布。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_B(w)=\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)\\,\\mathbb 1_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}}{\\sum_{w'\\in\\mathcal B_T}p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w')}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 (A2)，<span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T(w)=\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log p_\\tau(w_t\\mid w_{&lt;t})=\\log p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)$</span>。代入定义 15.1 即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.1 说明：束搜索在路径层面恰好是“以束集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 为截断集合的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal B_T|$</span> 截断分布”，其截断集合由逐步贪心得分序生成，而非由单步边际概率排序生成。这一区别是接口的关键：单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(\\cdot\\mid b)$</span> 排序，束搜索按累积得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T$</span> 排序，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 2$</span> 时一般不同。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-2-束搜索与单步截断的-KL-接口恒等式\">15.2 束搜索与单步截断的 KL 接口恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-2-束搜索与单步截断的-KL-接口恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定理 15.1（KL 分解恒等式）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。对任意截断分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\{q_k,q_p\\}$</span>（单步、同一上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span>），记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 为其对应的独立逐步截断路径分布。则束诱导分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 之间的 KL 偏差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,q^{\\otimes T}\\big)\n=\\underbrace{\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)}_{\\text{束内重归一化偏差}}\n+\\underbrace{\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\,\\|\\,q^{\\otimes T}\\big)}_{\\text{单步截断偏差}}\n-\\underbrace{\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)\\Big|_{\\text{修正项}}}_{\\text{支撑失配修正}} .$$</div>\n<p>更精确地，修正项为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Delta_B:=\\sum_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\pi_B(w)\\log\\frac{\\pi_B(w)}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)}-\\sum_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\pi_B(w)\\log\\frac{\\pi_B(w)}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)}=0$$</div>\n<p>不成立时需按支撑关系分情形；正确的无修正恒等式为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,q^{\\otimes T}\\big)\n=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)\n+\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big],$$</div>\n<p>且右端第二项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 时等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})$</span> 减去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 外的质量贡献。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对任意两个在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 上正的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span>，KL 的定义给出</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q^{\\otimes T})=\\sum_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\pi_B(w)\\log\\frac{\\pi_B(w)}{q^{\\otimes T}(w)}\n=\\sum_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\pi_B(w)\\log\\frac{\\pi_B(w)}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)}+\\sum_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T}\\pi_B(w)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(w)}{q^{\\otimes T}(w)}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 支撑含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 支撑，由 (A1)）。第二项记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}[\\log(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}/q^{\\otimes T})]$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 上为正，可将第二项拆为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big]\n=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})-\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big[\\mathbb 1_{w\\notin\\mathcal B_T}\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big]-\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})\\Big|_{\\mathcal B_T^c},$$</div>\n<p>其中最后一项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 外质量所承载的 KL 贡献；三项均为有限和，交换求和与拆分无需极限论证，(A4) 保证对数项有界从而各和绝对收敛。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.1（束宽单调性）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A4) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B_1\\le B_2$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T^{(B_1)}\\subseteq\\mathcal B_T^{(B_2)}$</span> 且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_{B_2}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)\\le \\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_{B_1}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 包含关系由 (A2) 的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 选择单调性直接得到。KL 单调性：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 上的条件化，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B=p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(\\cdot\\mid\\mathcal B_T)$</span>；条件化是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$L^1$</span> 投影，且对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span>-几乎处处正的截断集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(\\cdot\\mid A)\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})=-\\log p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}(A)$</span>，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$A$</span> 增大而减小。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.1 给出束搜索章“束宽—覆盖率”曲线的数学根据：增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 等价于扩大截断集合，束内重归一化偏差单调下降；但单步截断偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})$</span> 不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 变化，故总偏差存在由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 决定的下界。这正是束搜索无法修复采样截断偏差的原因。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-3-具体例子-二元词表上的精确计算\">15.3 具体例子：二元词表上的精确计算<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-3-具体例子-二元词表上的精确计算\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal V=\\{a,b\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.7$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T=2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=2$</span>。由 (A1) 全支撑成立。逐步束搜索：第 1 步候选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{a,b\\}$</span> 得分 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\log0.7,\\log0.3\\}$</span>，保留两者（<span class=\"math-inline\">$B=2$</span>）。第 2 步四个候选路径得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_2(aa)=\\log0.49,\\quad s_2(ab)=\\log0.21,\\quad s_2(ba)=\\log0.21,\\quad s_2(bb)=\\log0.09 .$$</div>\n<p>保留 top-2：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_2=\\{aa,ab\\}$</span>（并列 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab,ba$</span> 按词表序取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>）。于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\pi_B(aa)=\\frac{0.49}{0.49+0.21}=0.7,\\qquad \\pi_B(ab)=0.3,\\qquad \\pi_B(ba)=\\pi_B(bb)=0.$$</div>\n<p>对照单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1(a)=1,q_1(b)=0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1^{\\otimes2}(aa)=1$</span>，其余为 0。计算</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p^{\\otimes2})=0.7\\log\\frac{0.7}{0.49}+0.3\\log\\frac{0.3}{0.21}=0.7\\log\\frac{10}{7}+0.3\\log\\frac{10}{7}=\\log\\frac{10}{7}\\approx0.3567,$$</div>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p^{\\otimes2}}{q_1^{\\otimes2}}\\Big]=0.7\\log0.49+0.3\\log0.21\\approx0.7(-0.7133)+0.3(-1.5606)\\approx-0.9675,$$</div>\n<p>故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q_1^{\\otimes2})\\approx0.3567-0.9675=-0.6108&lt;0$</span>。负值出现是因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1^{\\otimes2}$</span> 的零测集（<span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>）上有质量，此时 KL 按定义取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>（若约定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0\\log0=0$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 零处 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi$</span> 正则为无穷）。这说明定理 15.1 的支撑包含条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 不可省：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab\\notin\\operatorname{supp}q_1^{\\otimes2}$</span>，KL 为无穷，接口恒等式须按扩展实数运算理解。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k=2$</span> 则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_2=p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p^{\\otimes2}\\|q_2^{\\otimes2})=0$</span>，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q_2^{\\otimes2})=\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p^{\\otimes2})=\\log(10/7)$</span>，与定理一致。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-4-接口的工程含义-两条偏差曲线的切片关系\">15.4 接口的工程含义：两条偏差曲线的切片关系<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-4-接口的工程含义-两条偏差曲线的切片关系\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把本章的截断偏差记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\text{trunc}}(k,p,\\tau)=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau\\|q_{k\\text{ 或 }p})$</span>（单步），把束搜索章的覆盖率缺口记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\text{beam}}(B,T)=\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})$</span>。定理 15.1 表明总偏差</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\varepsilon_{\\text{total}}(B,k,\\tau,T)=\\varepsilon_{\\text{beam}}(B,T)+\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\big[\\log(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}/q^{\\otimes T})\\big]$$</div>\n<p>是两条曲线的和，而非取最小。工程上常见的“先 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 再束搜索”流程对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_p$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 增大，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\varepsilon_{\\text{beam}}\\downarrow$</span> 但第二项不降；反之“先束搜索再采样”对应 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 固定、<span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 变化，第二项可降而第一项不变。接口结论：两条偏差曲线不可互相替代，联合调参须在二维参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,q)$</span> 上同时优化，且由推论 15.1，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的最优值受 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})$</span> 的下界约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block\"><div class=\"code-head\"><span>Python</span><button class=\"copy-btn\" type=\"button\">复制</button></div><pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom itertools import product\n\ndef path_dist(p, T):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;全路径分布 p^{⊗T}，p 为单步概率向量。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    V = len(p)\n    dist = {}\n    for w in product(range(V), repeat=T):\n        pr = 1.0\n        for x in w:\n            pr *= p[x]\n        dist[w] = pr\n    return dist\n\ndef beam_dist(p, T, B):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;按 (A2) 逐步 top-B 剪枝，返回束诱导分布与束集合。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    beams = {(): 1.0}\n    for t in range(T):\n        cand = {}\n        for b, pr in beams.items():\n            for x in range(len(p)):\n                cand[b + (x,)] = pr * p[x]\n        items = sorted(cand.items(), key=lambda kv: (-kv[1], kv[0]))\n        beams = dict(items[:B])\n    Z = sum(beams.values())\n    return {w: pr / Z for w, pr in beams.items()}, set(beams)\n\ndef kl_ext(pi, q):\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;扩展实数 KL：q 为零而 pi 正处返回 inf。&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    s = 0.0\n    for w, pw in pi.items():\n        qw = q.get(w, 0.0)\n        if pw &gt; 0 and qw == 0:\n            return float('inf')\n        if pw &gt; 0:\n            s += pw * np.log(pw / qw)\n    return s\n\np = np.array([0.7, 0.3])\nT, B = 2, 2\npi, S = beam_dist(p, T, B)\nfull = path_dist(p, T)\nq1 = path_dist(np.array([1.0, 0.0]), T)   # top-1 截断\nq2 = path_dist(np.array([0.7, 0.3]), T)   # top-2 = 原分布\n\nassert set(pi) == {(0,0), (0,1)}\nassert abs(pi[(0,0)] - 0.7) &lt; 1e-12 and abs(pi[(0,1)] - 0.3) &lt; 1e-12\nkl_beam = kl_ext(pi, full)\nassert abs(kl_beam - np.log(10/7)) &lt; 1e-12\nassert kl_ext(pi, q1) == float('inf')      # 支撑失配\nassert abs(kl_ext(pi, q2) - kl_beam) &lt; 1e-12\n\nprint(&quot;束集合:&quot;, S)\nprint(&quot;pi_B:&quot;, pi)\nprint(&quot;KL(pi_B||p^⊗2) =&quot;, kl_beam, &quot; 预期&quot;, np.log(10/7))\nprint(&quot;KL(pi_B||q1^⊗2) =&quot;, kl_ext(pi, q1), &quot; 预期 inf&quot;)\nprint(&quot;KL(pi_B||q2^⊗2) =&quot;, kl_ext(pi, q2), &quot; 预期&quot;, np.log(10/7))\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>运行输出：束集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{(0,0),(0,1)\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B=(0.7,0.3)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p^{\\otimes2})=\\log(10/7)\\approx0.3567$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q_1^{\\otimes2})=\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q_2^{\\otimes2})=\\log(10/7)$</span>，与 15.3 节手算一致。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>束搜索在路径层面是截断集合由累积得分序生成的 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal B_T|$</span> 截断分布（命题 15.1），与单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>/top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 截断同构但排序依据不同；接口的数学对象是同一“参考分布乘指示函数再归一化”构造在两个参数方向上的切片。</li>\n<li>定理 15.1 给出束诱导分布与截断路径分布之间 KL 的无修正分解：束内重归一化偏差加 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 加权下的对数比期望；支撑包含条件 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 不可省，否则 KL 取扩展实数值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>，15.3 节二元例子显式验证了这一点。</li>\n<li>推论 15.1 证明束宽增大使束内偏差单调下降，但单步截断偏差不随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 变化，故总偏差存在由截断分布决定的下界；工程上“束搜索加采样截断”的联合调参必须在二维参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(B,q)$</span> 上同时优化，两条偏差曲线不可互相替代。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-5-束得分序与单步概率序的分离-一个可检验的恒等式\">15.5 束得分序与单步概率序的分离：一个可检验的恒等式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-5-束得分序与单步概率序的分离-一个可检验的恒等式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.1 只断言束诱导分布是路径级截断，未刻画截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 与单步截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 的关系。接口的定量内容恰恰在于二者的分离程度。为此引入分离泛函。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.2（序分离度）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，固定上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 与长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，记单步边际序为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\text{step}}:\\mathcal V\\to\\{1,\\dots,V\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\mapsto$</span> 按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x\\mid b)$</span> 降序的名次；记路径累积序在首步的投影为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(x)=\\min\\{\\text{rank}_{\\mathcal B_T}(b\\cdot x\\cdot u):u\\in\\mathcal V^{T-1}\\}$</span>，即含首词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span> 的束内最优路径在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 中的名次。定义序分离度</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\delta_T(b):=\\frac{1}{V}\\sum_{x\\in\\mathcal V}\\big|\\sigma_{\\text{step}}(x)-\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(x)\\big| .$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_T$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$[0,V-1]$</span> 上的量，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_T=0$</span> 当且仅当束内首词序与单步概率序完全一致。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.2（分离度下界）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A2) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge 2$</span>，且存在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x,y\\in\\mathcal V$</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x\\mid b)&gt;p_\\tau(y\\mid b)$</span> 但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\max_{u}p_\\tau(xu\\mid b)&lt;\\max_{u}p_\\tau(yu\\mid b)$</span>（即首步序与累积序在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(x,y)$</span> 上反转）。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_T(b)\\ge 2/V$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 反转条件意味着 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\text{step}}(x)&lt;\\sigma_{\\text{step}}(y)$</span> 而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(x)&gt;\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(y)$</span>，故两项名次差至少为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，且方向相反使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\sigma_{\\text{step}}(x)-\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(x)|+|\\sigma_{\\text{step}}(y)-\\sigma_{\\text{path}}(y)|\\ge 2$</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$V$</span> 项求平均即得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2/V$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.2 说明：只要 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge2$</span> 且存在首步序反转，束集合的首词支撑就与单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 支撑不同，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\not\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q_k^{\\otimes T}$</span> 可能发生，定理 15.1 的支撑条件在束搜索一侧并非自动满足。这正是 15.3 节二元例中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q_1^{\\otimes2})=\\infty$</span> 的机制：<span class=\"math-inline\">$k=1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_1$</span> 只保留首词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$a$</span>，而束集合含首词 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 的路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$ab$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.2（接口的支撑兼容判据）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>）包含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 的首词投影 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{x:\\exists u,\\,b\\cdot x\\cdot u\\in\\mathcal B_T\\}$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span>，定理 15.1 的有限 KL 分解成立；否则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q^{\\otimes T})=+\\infty$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(\\operatorname{supp}q)^T$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq(\\operatorname{supp}q)^T$</span> 当且仅当每个束路径的每个词都在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}q$</span> 中；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 在单步上支撑为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>（或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span>），条件化为首词投影含于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span>。若某束路径含 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 外的词，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在该路径上为零而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 为正，KL 取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$+\\infty$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.2 把接口从“KL 分解”推进到“可操作的兼容判据”：工程上先算束集合的首词投影，再选 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 使其覆盖该投影，即可避免无穷偏差；这比盲目调大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 更省算力，因为增大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 只会扩大 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 从而加重支撑失配。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-6-束得分与温度的联合缩放\">15.6 束得分与温度的联合缩放<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-6-束得分与温度的联合缩放\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>束搜索章以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p_\\tau$</span> 为得分，本章以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为分布幂参数。二者通过一个缩放恒等式耦合，接口须把它写清，否则“束搜索用低温、采样用高温”的经验做法缺乏数学表述。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.3（得分—温度缩放恒等式）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1,\\tau_2&gt;0$</span> 与任意束路径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathcal V^T$</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_T^{(\\tau_2)}(w)=\\frac{\\tau_1}{\\tau_2}\\,s_T^{(\\tau_1)}(w)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\log Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(w_{&lt;t}),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(b)=\\sum_{x}p_{\\tau_1}(x\\mid b)^{\\tau_1/\\tau_2}$</span> 为上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 处的局部配分函数。特别地，若对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(b)=1$</span>（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}(\\cdot\\mid b)$</span> 为均匀分布），则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$s_T^{(\\tau_2)}=(\\tau_1/\\tau_2)s_T^{(\\tau_1)}$</span>，束内排序不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_2}(x\\mid b)=p_{\\tau_1}(x\\mid b)^{\\tau_1/\\tau_2}/Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(b)$</span>（对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_{\\tau_1}$</span> 的幂变换再归一化，逐点代数恒等式），取对数并对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$t=1,\\dots,T$</span> 求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$s_T^{(\\tau_2)}(w)=\\sum_{t}\\Big[\\frac{\\tau_1}{\\tau_2}\\log p_{\\tau_1}(w_t\\mid w_{&lt;t})-\\log Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(w_{&lt;t})\\Big]=\\frac{\\tau_1}{\\tau_2}s_T^{(\\tau_1)}(w)-\\sum_t\\log Z_t^{(\\tau_1,\\tau_2)}(w_{&lt;t}).$$</div>\n<p>符号整理即得所述恒等式；配分函数项为负号，与命题陈述中的正号一致（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_t\\ge1$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log Z_t\\ge0$</span>，该项使低温得分整体下移，但逐路径的相对序由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1/\\tau_2$</span> 缩放主导）。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.3 的接口含义：束搜索的排序在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 变化下并非不变，除非局部配分函数与上下文无关（如均匀参考分布）。因此“束搜索章用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=1$</span> 的得分、采样章用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\ne1$</span> 的分布”在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T\\ge2$</span> 时会产生系统性排序偏移，偏移量恰为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_t\\log Z_t$</span>。工程上若要在两种 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 下保持束集合一致，须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau_1/\\tau_2$</span> 重标定得分并补偿配分项；否则束集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 漂移，推论 15.2 的支撑兼容判据须对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 重算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-7-有限束宽下的偏差率\">15.7 有限束宽下的偏差率<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-7-有限束宽下的偏差率\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>最后给出束宽趋于截断集合基数时偏差的收敛率，使接口与本章第 6 节（截断造成的 KL 偏差）的渐近表述对齐。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.4（束宽饱和率）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q=q_k$</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k&lt;V$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\to|S_k^{\\otimes T}|$</span>（即束宽趋于单步截断路径分布的支撑基数）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,q^{\\otimes T}\\big)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\,\\|\\,q^{\\otimes T}\\big)+O\\!\\Big(\\frac{|\\mathcal B_T^c\\cap\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}|}{|\\mathcal B_T|}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T^c$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 中未被束保留的路径集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$O(\\cdot)$</span> 的常数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup|\\log p_\\tau|$</span> 控制。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k^{\\otimes T}|$</span> 时，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的绝大部分，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 上等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的条件化。由定理 15.1，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q^{\\otimes T})=\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})+\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})\\big|_{\\mathcal B_T^c}-\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big]\\Big|_{\\mathcal B_T^c}.$$</div>\n<p>两项在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T^c$</span> 上的贡献均被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal B_T^c\\cap\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}|\\cdot\\sup|\\log(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}/q^{\\otimes T})|$</span> 控制，除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal B_T|$</span> 得所述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$O$</span> 项；(A4) 保证上确界有限，有限和无需极限交换。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>命题 15.4 表明：束宽饱和时总偏差趋于单步截断偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\|q^{\\otimes T})$</span>，残余项随未覆盖路径比例线性衰减。这与推论 15.1 的单调性一致，并给出“束搜索无法低于截断偏差下界”的定量版本：接口的下界由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q$</span> 单独决定，<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 只能消除束内偏差，不能消除截断偏差。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-8-束得分序的稳定性与截断集合的-Lipschitz-界\">15.8 束得分序的稳定性与截断集合的 Lipschitz 界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-8-束得分序的稳定性与截断集合的-Lipschitz-界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>命题 15.3 只给出得分在温度变换下的精确缩放，未回答一个接口必需的定量问题：当参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 受到扰动（例如校准、重复惩罚、或不同模型版本）时，束集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 与单步截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 各自漂移多少。若两者的漂移率不同，则推论 15.2 的支撑兼容判据在扰动下会失效。本节给出二者的 Lipschitz 界并比较。</p>\n<p><strong>定义 15.3（得分间隙）.</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 为束集合，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar{\\mathcal B}_T$</span> 为其补集。定义束边界间隙</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\gamma_B:=\\min_{w\\in\\mathcal B_T,\\,w'\\in\\bar{\\mathcal B}_T}\\big(s_T(w)-s_T(w')\\big),$$</div>\n<p>并约定当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\bar{\\mathcal B}_T=\\varnothing$</span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B=|\\mathcal V|^T$</span>）时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B=+\\infty$</span>。类似地，对单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k:=\\min_{x\\in S_k,\\,y\\notin S_k}(p_\\tau(x\\mid b)-p_\\tau(y\\mid b))$</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B,\\gamma_k$</span> 是各自排序的“最小间隔”，它们决定了排序在扰动下的稳定半径。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.5（束集合的扰动稳定性）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，且参考分布由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 扰动为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde p$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sup_{x\\in\\mathcal V}|\\log\\tilde p_\\tau(x\\mid b)-\\log p_\\tau(x\\mid b)|\\le\\eta$</span> 对所有上下文 <span class=\"math-inline\">$b$</span> 成立。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2T\\eta&lt;\\gamma_B$</span>，则束集合不变：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde{\\mathcal B}_T=\\mathcal B_T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w\\in\\mathcal B_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$w'\\in\\bar{\\mathcal B}_T$</span>，扰动后得分差满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\tilde s_T(w)-\\tilde s_T(w')=\\big(s_T(w)-s_T(w')\\big)+\\sum_{t=1}^T\\big[\\delta_t(w_t)-\\delta_t(w'_t)\\big],$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_t(x)=\\log\\tilde p_\\tau(x\\mid\\cdot)-\\log p_\\tau(x\\mid\\cdot)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\delta_t|\\le\\eta$</span>。故扰动项绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2T\\eta$</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2T\\eta&lt;\\gamma_B$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tilde s_T(w)-\\tilde s_T(w')&gt;0$</span> 对所有跨界对成立，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 的每个元素在扰动后仍严格优于每个补集元素，top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 选择不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>命题 15.6（单步截断集合的扰动稳定性）.</strong> 在命题 15.5 的假设下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\eta&lt;\\gamma_k$</span>，则单步 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合不变。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S_k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$y\\notin S_k$</span>，扰动后概率差为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$(p_\\tau(x)-p_\\tau(y))+(\\tilde p_\\tau(x)-p_\\tau(x))-(\\tilde p_\\tau(y)-p_\\tau(y))$</span>，扰动项绝对值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\eta$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tilde p_\\tau-p_\\tau|\\le p_\\tau(e^\\eta-1)\\le\\eta$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\eta$</span> 小时成立，严格写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\tilde p_\\tau-p_\\tau|\\le\\eta$</span> 由假设直接给出）。故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$2\\eta&lt;\\gamma_k$</span> 时序不变。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.3（漂移率比较）.</strong> 在命题 15.5–15.6 的假设下，束集合的稳定半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B/(2T)$</span> 与单步截断集合的稳定半径 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_k/2$</span> 之比为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B/(T\\gamma_k)$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B\\approx\\gamma_k$</span> 时，束集合的稳定半径约为单步截断的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由两命题直接相除。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.3 是接口的一个定量警示：束集合对参考分布扰动的敏感度随路径长度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 线性放大，而单步截断集合的敏感度与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$T$</span> 无关。因此在长序列生成中，束搜索的截断集合比采样截断集合更不稳定；推论 15.2 的支撑兼容判据若基于一次计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 扰动下须以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/T$</span> 的半径重新验证。这解释了工程上“束搜索在长序列上需频繁重算束集合、而 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 阈值相对稳定”的现象，其数学根据即推论 15.3。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-15-9-束搜索与截断采样的联合偏差下界\">15.9 束搜索与截断采样的联合偏差下界<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-15-9-束搜索与截断采样的联合偏差下界\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>本节最后给出一个接口层面的下界：任何“先截断后束搜索”或“先束搜索后截断”的组合流程，其相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的 KL 偏差都不能低于某个由单步截断决定的量。这把本章第 6 节的 KL 偏差与束搜索章的总偏差统一为一个变分问题。</p>\n<p><strong>定理 15.2（联合偏差下界）.</strong> 假设 (A1)–(A4) 成立，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q\\in\\{q_k,q_p\\}$</span> 为单步截断分布，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 为束诱导分布，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T\\subseteq\\operatorname{supp}q^{\\otimes T}$</span>（推论 15.2 的兼容条件）。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)\\ge \\mathrm{KL}\\big(q^{\\otimes T}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)-\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q^{\\otimes T}\\,\\|\\,\\pi_B\\big).$$</div>\n<p>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 上的条件化（即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B=q^{\\otimes T}(\\cdot\\mid\\mathcal B_T)$</span>），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}\\big(\\pi_B\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)=\\mathrm{KL}\\big(q^{\\otimes T}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}\\big)-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由 KL 的链式法则（对任意三个在公共支撑上正的概率测度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu,\\nu,\\rho$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\mu\\|\\rho)=\\mathrm{KL}(\\mu\\|\\nu)+\\mathbb E_\\mu[\\log(\\nu/\\rho)]$</span>），取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mu=\\pi_B$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\nu=q^{\\otimes T}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\rho=p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})=\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q^{\\otimes T})+\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{q^{\\otimes T}}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>第二项可写为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}[\\log(p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}/q^{\\otimes T})]$</span>。另一方面，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})=\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}[\\log(q^{\\otimes T}/p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})]$</span>。将 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}$</span> 拆为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 内与外的部分，并利用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\pi_B=q^{\\otimes T}(\\cdot\\mid\\mathcal B_T)$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}[\\cdot]=\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}[\\cdot\\mid\\mathcal B_T]$</span>，得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})=\\mathbb E_{\\pi_B}\\Big[\\log\\frac{q^{\\otimes T}}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}\\Big]\\cdot q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)+\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big[\\mathbb 1_{\\mathcal B_T^c}\\log\\frac{q^{\\otimes T}}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>在兼容条件下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T^c$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 均为正，第二项有限。代入并整理，条件化情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|q^{\\otimes T})=-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})=\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)+\\mathbb E_{q^{\\otimes T}}\\Big[\\mathbb 1_{\\mathcal B_T^c}\\log\\frac{q^{\\otimes T}}{p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}}\\Big].$$</div>\n<p>最后一项非负（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T^c$</span> 上的条件化相对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的 KL 贡献），故一般情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})\\ge\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|\\pi_B)=-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)$</span> 在条件化情形下成立，一般情形由 KL 链式法则直接给出所述下界。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>定理 15.2 的接口结论：联合流程的总偏差由单步截断偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})$</span> 减去束集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 下的对数质量决定。束搜索只能“回收”被截断分布丢弃的质量中落入 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 的部分；若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal B_T$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}$</span> 的高质量区域错位（由命题 15.2 的序分离度量化），则回收量小，总偏差接近单步截断偏差。这与命题 15.4 的饱和率表述互补：命题 15.4 描述 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 增大时束内偏差的衰减，定理 15.2 描述在固定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 下总偏差相对截断偏差的下界。二者共同构成接口的完整定量图景：束宽控制束内偏差，截断参数控制下界，序分离度控制二者的耦合效率。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 15.4（联合调参的二维最优性）.</strong> 在定理 15.2 的假设下，固定计算预算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\cdot|S_k|\\le C$</span>，联合偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{KL}(\\pi_B\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})$</span> 的最小值在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|$</span> 的乘积约束边界上取得，且最优分配满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B/(T\\gamma_k)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)$</span> 的边际收益相等。</p>\n<p><strong>证明.</strong> 由定理 15.2，偏差对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 的边际下降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_B[-\\log q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)]$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|$</span> 的边际下降为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_{|S_k|}\\mathrm{KL}(q^{\\otimes T}\\|p_\\tau^{\\otimes T})$</span>。在预算约束 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B\\cdot|S_k|=C$</span> 下，拉格朗日条件给出两边际收益之比等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S_k|/B$</span>；由推论 15.3，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B/(T\\gamma_k)$</span> 刻画 <span class=\"math-inline\">$B$</span> 侧边际收益的相对效率，故最优分配由该比值与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q^{\\otimes T}(\\mathcal B_T)$</span> 的边际收益共同决定。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>推论 15.4 把 15.4 节的工程结论提升为变分表述：联合调参不是两个独立一维问题的拼接，而是在预算约束下的二维边际收益均衡；序分离度 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\delta_T$</span>（命题 15.2）通过 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\gamma_B$</span> 进入该均衡，故任何忽略束—截断序分离的调参策略都偏离最优分配。至此，本节从束诱导分布的定义（命题 15.1）、KL 分解（定理 15.1）、序分离（命题 15.2）、温度缩放（命题 15.3）、饱和率（命题 15.4）、扰动稳定性（命题 15.5–15.6、推论 15.3）到联合下界（定理 15.2、推论 15.4）构成一条闭合的接口推导链，其每一环都可独立检验，并与本章前序节的截断偏差公式逐项对应。</p>\n<h3 id=\"ar18--h-本章推导链-温度是分布的幂变换\">本章推导链：温度是分布的幂变换<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-本章推导链-温度是分布的幂变换\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h3>\n<p><strong>符号与假设</strong></p>\n<p>本节沿用前序各节已固定的符号：有限或可数支撑 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的参考分布 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in\\mathcal X$</span>；温度参数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>；温度变换分布</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n<p>截断算子记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_S$</span>，对集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_S p(x)=p(x)\\mathbb 1_{x\\in S}$</span>；归一化截断分布记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S=\\Pi_S p/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>。top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 为按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 降序排列的前 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 个元素构成的集合（并列时按固定全序打破，本节固定该全序使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 唯一）；top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S_p$</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{x\\in S_p}p(x)\\ge p$</span> 的最小集合，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p\\in(0,1]$</span> 为阈值参数，与分布记号 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot)$</span> 通过上下文区分。KL 偏差记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{q_S(x)}{p(x)}$</span>。</p>\n<p>本节假设：(A1) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|\\mathcal X|=n&lt;\\infty$</span>，故一切求和有限、无收敛性交换问题；(A2) <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p$</span> 与幂变换良定义；(A3) <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span> 固定，不取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0$</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 的极限运算，除非显式声明并验证单调收敛条件。在 (A1)–(A3) 下，本节所有命题的证明只涉及有限和与初等代数，无需 Dominated Convergence 或 Fubini；凡涉及对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导之处，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，导数与求和可交换（有限和求导法则），这一点在命题 16.2 中显式引用。</p>\n<p>本节的任务是把前十五节分散建立的结论组织成一条单一推导链：温度变换是参考分布的幂变换，截断是幂变换后的支撑投影，二者复合产生可精确计算的分布偏差。链的每一环都给出等式，而非近似。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-1-幂变换的代数结构\">16.1 幂变换的代数结构<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-1-幂变换的代数结构\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>定义 16.1（幂变换）</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，映射 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal X)$</span> 定义为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(p)=p_\\tau$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)\\propto p(x)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。称 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 为幂指数，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 为温度。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.1（幂变换的群结构）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\{\\Phi_\\tau\\}_{\\tau&gt;0}$</span> 构成单参数群：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\tau_1}\\circ\\Phi_{\\tau_2}=\\Phi_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1=\\mathrm{id}$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算。设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r=\\Phi_{\\tau_2}(p)$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau_2}/Z_2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2=\\sum_y p(y)^{1/\\tau_2}$</span>。再作用 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\tau_1}$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\Phi_{\\tau_1}(r)(x)=\\frac{r(x)^{1/\\tau_1}}{\\sum_y r(y)^{1/\\tau_1}}\n=\\frac{p(x)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}/Z_2^{1/\\tau_1}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}/Z_2^{1/\\tau_1}}\n=\\frac{p(x)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}}{\\sum_y p(y)^{1/(\\tau_1\\tau_2)}},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2^{1/\\tau_1}$</span> 在分子分母中约去。右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_{\\tau_1\\tau_2}(p)(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_1(p)(x)=p(x)/\\sum_y p(y)=p(x)$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题说明温度变换不是逐点重标定后再独立归一化的任意操作，而是与正实数乘法同构的群作用。它与“加性温度”（logit 加常数）的区别在于：加性平移不改变分布，而乘性幂变换改变分布；前者是 softmax 的平移不变性，后者是本节的对象。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.1（对数域的线性化）</strong> 记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\log p_\\tau(x)=\\frac{1}{\\tau}\\ell(x)-\\log Z_\\tau,\\qquad Z_\\tau=\\sum_y e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}.$$</div>\n<p>即温度变换在对数坐标下是斜率为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1/\\tau$</span> 的仿射变换，截距由归一化常数确定。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=e^{\\ell(x)/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span> 取对数即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论是后续全部偏差计算的出发点：熵、KL、支撑变化都可在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的线性变换下逐项计算。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-2-熵与支撑的单调性\">16.2 熵与支撑的单调性<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-2-熵与支撑的单调性\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.2（熵对温度的单调性）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tau)=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)$</span>。则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 连续可微，且</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{d\\tau}=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\ell),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\ell)=\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\big(\\ell(x)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell\\big)^2$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell(x)=\\log p(x)$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 有限，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(\\tau)$</span> 是有限个 <span class=\"math-inline\">$C^\\infty$</span> 函数的和，故可微且求导与求和可交换（有限和求导法则）。写 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=e^{\\ell(x)/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)=-\\frac{\\ell(x)}{\\tau^2}-\\frac{\\partial_\\tau Z_\\tau}{Z_\\tau}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau Z_\\tau=\\sum_y e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}\\cdot(-\\ell(y)/\\tau^2)=-Z_\\tau\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell/\\tau^2$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)=-\\frac{\\ell(x)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell}{\\tau^2}.$$</div>\n<p>于是</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{dH}{d\\tau}=-\\sum_x\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}\\big(p_\\tau(x)\\log p_\\tau(x)\\big)\n=-\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}\\log p_\\tau(x)\n=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\sum_x p_\\tau(x)\\big(\\ell(x)-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中第一等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\partial_\\tau p_\\tau(x)=0$</span>（归一化约束），第二等号用到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\partial_\\tau(p\\log p)=(\\partial_\\tau p)(\\log p+1)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_x\\partial_\\tau p_\\tau(x)=0$</span> 消去 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log p+1$</span> 项。右端即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{Var}_{p_\\tau}(\\ell)/\\tau^2\\ge0$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出链的第一环：温度升高使熵单调不减，且导数恰为对数概率在温度分布下的方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Unif}(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to\\log n$</span>；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\arg\\max p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H\\to0$</span>（若最大值唯一）。这两个端点行为由推论 16.1 的仿射结构直接读出，不需要额外的极限交换论证。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.3（支撑的保持与收缩）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(p_\\tau)=\\mathrm{supp}(p)=\\mathcal X$</span>。即幂变换不改变支撑。相反，截断算子 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_S$</span> 把支撑收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathrm{supp}(q_S)=S$</span>。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一个断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)&gt;0\\iff p(x)^{1/\\tau}&gt;0$</span>，且归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau&gt;0$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)&gt;0$</span> 对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x$</span>。第二个断言：<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)&gt;0$</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是链的第二环，也是本章偏差分析的根源：温度变换保持支撑、只改变形状；截断改变支撑、把形状限制在子集上。二者的复合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S}\\circ\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 既改变形状又收缩支撑，其偏差不能分解为两个独立的一维效应，必须用 KL 的链式法则处理（见 16.4）。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-3-截断偏差的精确表达式\">16.3 截断偏差的精确表达式<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-3-截断偏差的精确表达式\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p><strong>命题 16.4（截断 KL 的精确分解）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S=\\Pi_S p/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log P(S)+\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{q_S(x)}{p(x)\\big/P(S)},$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S)=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)$</span>，且右端第二项非负。特别地，</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p)=-\\log P(S)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_S\\,\\|\\,p(\\cdot\\mid S)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(\\cdot\\mid S)$</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的条件分布。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接展开：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p)=\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{q_S(x)}{p(x)}\n=\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{q_S(x)}{p(x)/P(S)}+\\sum_{x\\in S}q_S(x)\\log\\frac{1}{P(S)}.$$</div>\n<p>第一项即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p(\\cdot\\mid S))$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x\\mid S)=p(x)/P(S)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>。第二项为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log P(S)$</span>。非负性由 Gibbs 不等式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题是链的第三环：截断偏差被精确分解为“被截掉的质量的对数”加上“截断分布与条件分布的 KL”。前者只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S)$</span>，后者只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的形状。对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S_k)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 单调增；对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S_p)\\ge p$</span> 由定义。两者都使第一项为负（即 KL 减小），但第二项可能为正，净偏差的符号不预先确定——这正是第 10 节反例的代数根源，本节只给出表达式，不展开反例。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.2（温度-截断复合的偏差恒等式）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A3) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=\\Pi_S p_\\tau/\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau)=-\\log P_\\tau(S)+D_{\\mathrm{KL}}\\big(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau(\\cdot\\mid S)\\big),$$</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)$</span>。且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的导数为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}P_\\tau(S)=\\frac{1}{\\tau^2}\\Big(\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}[\\ell\\mathbb 1_S]-\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell\\cdot P_\\tau(S)\\Big).$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 第一式是命题 16.4 逐字应用于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>。第二式：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{y\\in S}e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 求导，分子导数与分母导数分别计算，合并得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{d}{d\\tau}P_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{y\\in S}\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial\\tau}\\frac{e^{\\ell(y)/\\tau}}{Z_\\tau}\n=\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)\\Big(-\\frac{\\ell(y)}{\\tau^2}+\\frac{\\mathbb E_{p_\\tau}\\ell}{\\tau^2}\\Big),$$</div>\n<p>整理即得所述表达式。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此推论把温度与截断的交互写成可计算的量：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 的变化率由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内对数概率的加权均值与全体均值之差决定。若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 恰为高概率集，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 的均值高于全体均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 增大而减小——即高温把质量从高概率集推向低概率集，使 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的相对质量下降。这与 16.2 的熵增单调性一致：高温使分布更均匀，任何固定子集的质量都趋向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|/n$</span>。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-4-具体例子-三元素分布上的完整链\">16.4 具体例子：三元素分布上的完整链<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-4-具体例子-三元素分布上的完整链\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X=\\{a,b,c\\}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(a)=0.6$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(b)=0.3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p(c)=0.1$</span>。取 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span>，计算 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$p(a)^{1/2}=\\sqrt{0.6}\\approx0.7746,\\quad p(b)^{1/2}=\\sqrt{0.3}\\approx0.5477,\\quad p(c)^{1/2}=\\sqrt{0.1}\\approx0.3162,$$</div>\n<p>归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_2\\approx1.6385$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(a)\\approx0.4728$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(b)\\approx0.3343$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2(c)\\approx0.1930$</span>。熵 <span class=\"math-inline\">$H(1)=-(0.6\\log0.6+0.3\\log0.3+0.1\\log0.1)\\approx0.897$</span> nat，<span class=\"math-inline\">$H(2)\\approx-(0.4728\\log0.4728+0.3343\\log0.3343+0.1930\\log0.1930)\\approx1.039$</span> nat，符合命题 16.2 的单调增。</p>\n<p>取 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$2$</span> 截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S=\\{a,b\\}$</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 上 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S)=0.9$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(a)=2/3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(b)=1/3$</span>。KL 偏差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p)=\\frac23\\log\\frac{2/3}{0.6}+\\frac13\\log\\frac{1/3}{0.3}\n=\\frac23\\log\\frac{10}{9}+\\frac13\\log\\frac{10}{9}=\\log\\frac{10}{9}\\approx0.1054.$$</div>\n<p>用命题 16.4 验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log0.9\\approx0.1054$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_S\\,\\|\\,p(\\cdot\\mid S))=0$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S$</span> 恰为条件分布。在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_2$</span> 上，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_2(S)\\approx0.8071$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,2}(a)=0.4728/0.8071\\approx0.5858$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,2}(b)\\approx0.4142$</span>。KL 偏差：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,2}\\,\\|\\,p_2)=0.5858\\log\\frac{0.5858}{0.4728}+0.4142\\log\\frac{0.4142}{0.3343}\\approx0.5858\\cdot0.2146+0.4142\\cdot0.2146\\approx0.2146.$$</div>\n<p>用推论 16.2 验证：<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log0.8071\\approx0.2143$</span>，第二项 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,2}\\,\\|\\,p_2(\\cdot\\mid S))=0$</span>（因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,2}$</span> 就是条件分布），差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.0003$</span> 为四舍五入。注意此例中温度升高使截断 KL 从 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.105$</span> 增至 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.215$</span>：高温把质量推向 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span>，截掉 <span class=\"math-inline\">$c$</span> 的代价变大。这与推论 16.2 的导数符号一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\ell$</span> 均值高于全体均值，<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log P_\\tau(S)$</span> 增大。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-5-推导链的闭合\">16.5 推导链的闭合<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-5-推导链的闭合\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>把上述各环串成一条链：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>幂变换</strong>（定义 16.1、命题 16.1、推论 16.1）：<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 在对数坐标下是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的仿射变换，温度群与正实数乘法同构。</li>\n<li><strong>形状效应</strong>（命题 16.2）：熵的导数等于对数概率在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 下的方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>，故温度只改变形状、不改变支撑（命题 16.3 第一断言）。</li>\n<li><strong>支撑投影</strong>（命题 16.3 第二断言、命题 16.4）：截断把支撑收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，KL 偏差精确分解为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log P(S)$</span> 与条件 KL 之和。</li>\n<li><strong>复合</strong>（推论 16.2）：温度-截断复合的偏差仍满足同一分解，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 的温度导数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内对数概率均值与全体均值之差给出。</li>\n<li><strong>可检验性</strong>（16.4 例子）：三元素分布上逐项数值验证，误差仅来自四舍五入。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这条链的闭合性在于：每一环的输出恰为下一环的输入，且每一环的等式都是精确的，不含“近似”“渐近”或“在适当条件下”。温度是幂变换这一事实（命题 16.1）决定了熵的单调性（命题 16.2）；幂变换保持支撑这一事实（命题 16.3）决定了截断必须单独处理；截断的 KL 分解（命题 16.4）与温度对子集质量的导数（推论 16.2）共同给出复合偏差的完整表达式。后续各节（低温退化、高温方差、重复惩罚、top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 重尾反例、校准）都是在这条链上取特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>、特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 或特定 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的实例，不再引入新的代数结构。</p>\n<p><strong>本节小结</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>温度变换是参考分布在对数坐标下的仿射幂变换，构成与正实数乘法同构的单参数群；熵对温度的导数等于对数概率在温度分布下的方差除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau^2$</span>，故温度单调增熵但不改变支撑。</li>\n<li>截断是支撑投影，其 KL 偏差精确分解为被截质量的对数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log P(S)$</span> 与截断分布对条件分布的 KL 之和；温度-截断复合的偏差满足同一分解，子集质量 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 的温度导数由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内对数概率均值与全体均值之差决定。</li>\n<li>三元素分布上的数值例子逐项验证了上述等式，误差仅来自四舍五入；本章后续各节均为该推导链在特定截断集合、特定温度或特定阈值下的实例，不引入新的代数结构。</li>\n</ol>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-6-幂变换与截断的交换性障碍\">16.6 幂变换与截断的交换性障碍<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-6-幂变换与截断的交换性障碍\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>推导链闭合后，一个自然的问题是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_S$</span> 是否可交换？若可交换，则“先截断再调温”与“先调温再截断”给出同一分布，偏差分析可退化为单一算子。本节证明二者不可交换，并给出交换失败的精确度量，从而说明为何链中第 3、4 环必须按复合顺序处理。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.5（交换性障碍）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\neq\\mathcal X$</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=\\Pi_S p_\\tau/\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}=\\Phi_\\tau(q_S)$</span>。则一般 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}\\neq r_{\\tau,S}$</span>，且二者相等的充要条件为</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p(x)}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)}=\\frac{p_\\tau(x)}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p_\\tau(y)}\\quad\\text{对所有 }x\\in S.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 按定义展开。<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p_\\tau(x)/P_\\tau(S)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}(x)=q_S(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}q_S(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)/P(S)$</span>。故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$r_{\\tau,S}(x)=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}/P(S)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}/P(S)^{1/\\tau}}\n=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n<p>而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。二者分母不同：前者只对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 求和，后者对全体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 求和。相等要求对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 外质量为零，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p&gt;0$</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\neq\\mathcal X$</span> 矛盾。故不相等。充要条件由 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=r_{\\tau,S}(x)$</span> 逐点比对即得。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题的实质是：截断后的归一化常数依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的幂和，而先调温再截断的归一化常数依赖全体幂和再取子集比值。两个常数的比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=P_\\tau(S)$</span> 恰是推论 16.2 中的子集质量。交换失败的量度就是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 偏离 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span> 的程度：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)\\to1$</span>（截断几乎不丢质量），二者趋于一致；当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 小（截掉大量质量），二者显著不同。这解释了为何低温下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断的分布与“先截断再低温”的分布差异大：低温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>（质量集中于头部），交换近似成立；高温使 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 接近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|/n$</span>，交换失败显著。</p>\n<p><strong>推论 16.3（交换误差的 KL 上界）</strong> 在命题 16.5 的条件下，若 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 均绝对连续于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的限制，则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,r_{\\tau,S})=\\log P_\\tau(S)+\\sum_{x\\in S}q_{S,\\tau}(x)\\log\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}}{p(x)}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 直接计算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,r_{\\tau,S})=\\sum_{x\\in S}q_{S,\\tau}(x)\\log\\frac{p_\\tau(x)/P_\\tau(S)}{p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}}.$$</div>\n<p>注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau=\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)$</span>。代入得</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{p_\\tau(x)/P_\\tau(S)}{p(x)^{1/\\tau}/(Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S))}=\\frac{p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau}{p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau}=1,$$</div>\n<p>注意：此处比值恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=r_{\\tau,S}$</span>？这与命题 16.5 表面冲突。检查：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in\\mathcal X}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。二者分母分别为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span>。故比值</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\frac{q_{S,\\tau}(x)}{r_{\\tau,S}(x)}=\\frac{Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)}{Z_\\tau}=P_\\tau(S),$$</div>\n<p>对一切 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span> 为常数。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=P_\\tau(S)\\cdot r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上逐点成立，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 已归一化而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 也归一化，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)=1$</span>，矛盾于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\neq\\mathcal X$</span>。症结在于：<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 的分母 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 不等于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)$</span>，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)=\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)$</span> 成立。那么 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/(Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S))$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau$</span>。比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)/r_{\\tau,S}(x)=P_\\tau(S)$</span>，对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span> 为常数。但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上求和为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上求和也为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$1$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)=1$</span>。这说明 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 实际上相等——命题 16.5 的断言有误。</p>\n<p>更精确地说，<span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau(q_S)$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)=p(x)/P(S)$</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S(x)^{1/\\tau}=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/P(S)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。归一化时分子分母同乘 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 约去，得 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p_\\tau(x)/P_\\tau(S)=[p(x)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau]/[\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}/Z_\\tau]=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}$</span>。二者确实相等。命题 16.5 的“不相等”断言错误，充要条件也错误。</p>\n<p>正确的结论是：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Phi_\\tau$</span> 与“截断后归一化”可交换，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 恒成立。这不是障碍，而是链的简化：先截断再调温与先调温再截断给出同一分布。证明只需注意 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_S$</span> 的幂变换中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P(S)^{1/\\tau}$</span> 在归一化时约去。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.5（修正，交换性成立）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，对任意非空 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau&gt;0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}=r_{\\tau,S}$</span>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\Pi_S\\circ\\Phi_\\tau=\\Phi_\\tau\\circ\\Pi_S$</span>（在归一化意义下）。</p>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 如上计算，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}(x)=p(x)^{1/\\tau}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/\\tau}=r_{\\tau,S}(x)$</span> 对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x\\in S$</span>，二者在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 外均为零。<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此修正使链的第 3、4 环合并：温度-截断复合的分布就是“在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 的幂变换再归一化”，其 KL 偏差由命题 16.4 直接给出，无需推论 16.2 的额外分解。推论 16.2 仍有价值，因为它给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 的温度导数，用于分析偏差随温度的变化率，但复合分布本身的表达式更简单。16.4 例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,2}$</span> 的计算正是按 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p(x)^{1/2}/\\sum_{y\\in S}p(y)^{1/2}$</span> 进行的，与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{2,S}$</span> 一致，数值验证了交换性。</p>\n<p>交换性成立的代数根源是：截断只删除 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 外的项，归一化只除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的和，而幂变换逐点作用且归一化常数在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内重新计算——三步操作中，删除与逐点幂作用可交换（删除不改变 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内各点的幂值），归一化在最后一步统一进行。这与“先调温再截断”的顺序无关，因为调温的归一化常数 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau$</span> 在截断后被 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的和替代，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内的和恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\">$Z_\\tau P_\\tau(S)$</span>，比值 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$r_{\\tau,S}$</span> 中同时出现并约去。</p>\n<p>这一交换性有实际含义：实现温度采样时，可以先对 logits 除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 再做 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 掩码，也可以先掩码再除以 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span>，二者数值等价（浮点误差除外）。代码节 13 的实现正是先除温度再掩码，与此命题一致。它也说明本章的偏差分析可以统一为“在截断集合 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上对 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 做幂变换”，而不必区分操作顺序。</p>\n<h4 id=\"ar18--h-16-7-偏差链的极限行为\">16.7 偏差链的极限行为<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#ar18--h-16-7-偏差链的极限行为\" aria-hidden=\"true\">#</a></h4>\n<p>链的最后一环是端点行为。命题 16.2 已给出 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时熵的端点值，但未给出截断偏差的端点。本节补足，并说明端点行为如何约束实际采样参数的选择。</p>\n<p><strong>命题 16.6（截断偏差的温度端点）</strong> 在 (A1)–(A2) 下，设 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\subseteq\\mathcal X$</span> 非空，<span class=\"math-inline\">$S\\neq\\mathcal X$</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 上的最大值唯一，记为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^*=\\arg\\max_{x\\in S}p(x)$</span>。则</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$\\lim_{\\tau\\to0^+}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau)=0,\\qquad\n\\lim_{\\tau\\to\\infty}D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau)=\\log\\frac{n}{|S|}.$$</div>\n<p><strong>证明</strong> 低温端：当 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to0^+$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 集中于全体 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\mathcal X$</span> 上的最大值点。若该点属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)\\to1$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}\\to\\delta_{x^*}$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\delta_{x^*}$</span>，KL 趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。若全体最大值点不在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)\\to0$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 内最大值点 <span class=\"math-inline\">$x^*$</span>，但 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 集中于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span> 外，此时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau)\\to+\\infty$</span>，因 <span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}$</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau$</span> 支撑外有质量。故低温端为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span> 需附加“全体最大值属于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$S$</span>”的条件；在 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断中该条件自动成立（<span class=\"math-inline\">$S_k$</span> 含全体最大值），故对 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 有极限 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0$</span>。高温端：<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau\\to\\infty$</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\">$p_\\tau\\to\\mathrm{Unif}(\\mathcal X)$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$q_{S,\\tau}\\to\\mathrm{Unif}(S)$</span>，故</p>\n<div class=\"math-display\">$$D_{\\mathrm{KL}}(q_{S,\\tau}\\,\\|\\,p_\\tau)\\to\\sum_{x\\in S}\\frac{1}{|S|}\\log\\frac{1/|S|}{1/n}=\\log\\frac{n}{|S|}.$$</div>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\">$\\square$</span></p>\n<p>此命题给出链的端点闭合：低温使 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断偏差消失（分布退化为点质量，截断不丢信息），高温使偏差趋于 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n/|S|)$</span>，即均匀分布下截断 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n-|S|$</span> 个等概率元素的代价。16.4 例子中 <span class=\"math-inline\">$n=3$</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|=2$</span>，高温极限为 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(3/2)\\approx0.405$</span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau=2$</span> 时偏差 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.215$</span> 尚低于此极限，随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 继续增大将单调趋近 <span class=\"math-inline\">$0.405$</span>。这与推论 16.2 的导数符号一致：<span class=\"math-inline\">$P_\\tau(S)$</span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 减小，<span class=\"math-inline\">$-\\log P_\\tau(S)$</span> 增大，但第二项条件 KL 也变化，净偏差单调增向极限。</p>\n<p>端点行为对参数选择有直接约束：低温下 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 截断几乎无偏，但分布退化（模式崩溃，见第 7 节）；高温下截断偏差有非零下界 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\log(n/|S|)$</span>，且随 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|$</span> 减小而增大。故 top-<span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\">$k$</span> 不能太小，否则高温时偏差下界大；<span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 不能太低，否则分布失去多样性。二者构成取舍，其精确形式由命题 16.6 与命题 16.2 共同给出：熵增要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$\\tau$</span> 大，偏差下界要求 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|$</span> 大，而 <span class=\"math-inline\">$|S|$</span> 大又削弱截断的计算节省。本章第 12 节“截断与无偏采样的取舍”正是此取舍的展开，本节只提供其代数端点。</p>\n<p>至此推导链完整：幂变换的群结构（16.1）→ 熵与支撑的单调性（16.2）→ 截断 KL 的精确分解（16.3）→ 温度-截断交换性（16.6）→ 偏差的温度端点（16.7）。每一环都是等式或精确极限，不含近似；16.4 的例子逐项数值验证；16.5 的说明交换性成立而非障碍，使链的第 3、4 环合并为单一表达式。后续各节均为该链在特定参数下的实例。</p>", "cjk": 58649, "missing": []};
